{"num|Hvor mange kilo vejer en Oscarstatuette?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Academy_Awards","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"it is 13.5 in (34.3 cm) tall, weighs 8.5 lb (3.9 kg) and depicts a knight","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.uapcompany.com/projects/oscar-statuette","d":"uapcompany.com","q":"The completed gold-plated statuette on its base is 13.5 inches tall and weighs about 8.5 pounds.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.azom.com/article.aspx?ArticleID=8218","d":"azom.com","q":"The prestigious Oscar award stands at 13.5 in. (34 cm) and weighs 8.5 lb (3.85 kg).","ok":true}],"note":"Statuetten vejer 8,5 lb, svarende til ca. 3,85 kg (Wikipedia afrunder til 3,9 kg)."},"num|Hvor mange procent peanuts skal peanutsmør minimum indeholde i USA?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/21/164.150","d":"law.cornell.edu","q":"such seasoning and stabilizing ingredients do not in the aggregate exceed 10 percent of the weight of the finished food","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/histories-product-regulation/food-standard-innovations-peanut-butters-sticky-standard","d":"fda.gov","q":"setting standards for peanut butter at no less than 90 percent for peanuts and no more than 55 percent fat","ok":true}],"note":"FDA's standard (21 CFR 164.150) tillader højst 10 % tilsætninger, dvs. mindst 90 % peanuts."},"num|Hvor mange hjerter har en blæksprutte?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Octopuses have a closed circulatory system, in which the blood remains inside blood vessels. They have three hearts;","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nhm.ac.uk/discover/octopuses-keep-surprising-us-here-are-eight-examples-how.html","d":"nhm.ac.uk","q":"Octopuses have blue blood, three hearts and a doughnut-shaped brain.","ok":true}],"note":"Blæksprutter (octopus) har tre hjerter."},"num|Hvor mange måneder er en afrikansk elefant cirka drægtig?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/African_bush_elephant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"and gestation around 22 months, the longest of any mammal.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbcearth.com/news/elephant-gestation-period-longer-than-any-living-mammal","d":"bbcearth.com","q":"African elephants are pregnant for an average of 22 months","ok":true}],"note":"Afrikanske elefanter er gennemsnitligt drægtige ca. 22 måneder."},"num|Hvor mange knogler har en haj?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"have skeletons made of cartilage and connective tissue","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nhm.ac.uk/discover/quick-questions/do-sharks-have-bones.html","d":"nhm.ac.uk","q":"Shark skeletons don’t include any bones at all.","ok":true}],"note":"Hajers skelet består udelukkende af brusk, så de har 0 knogler."},"num|Hvor mange øjne har en bi?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bee","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A pair of large compound eyes which cover much of the surface of the head. Between and above these are three small simple eyes","ok":true},{"u":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3928595","d":"pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov","q":"Honeybees have a visual system composed of three ocelli (simple eyes) located on the top of the head, in addition to two large compound eyes.","ok":true}],"note":"Bier har to store facetøjne og tre punktøjne (ocelli), i alt fem."},"num|Hvor mange procent af en vandmand er vand?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://oceanservice.noaa.gov/facts/jellyfish.html","d":"oceanservice.noaa.gov","q":"Only about five percent of the body of a jellyfish is solid matter; the rest is water","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jellyfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The mesoglea is 95% or more composed of water","ok":true}],"note":"Vandmænd er ca. 95 % vand (NOAA: kun ca. 5 % fast stof; mesogloea er 95 % eller mere vand)."},"num|Hvor mange km/t kan en struds løbe?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_ostrich","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"with short bursts up to about 70 km/h (43 mph)","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/ostrich","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"Ostriches can sprint in short bursts up to 43 miles per hour (70 kilometers per hour)","ok":true}],"note":"Strudsen kan sprinte op til ca. 70 km/t."},"num|Hvor mange procent af en agurk er vand?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cucumber","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Cucumber fruits consist of 95% water","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.webmd.com/food-recipes/cucumber-health-benefits","d":"webmd.com","q":"are about 95% water","ok":true}],"note":"Kilderne angiver ca. 95 % (ikke 96 %); tallet varierer lidt mellem kilder, så spørgsmålet gøres til 'cirka' og svaret rettes til 95."},"num|Hvor mange øer har Sverige ifølge Statistiska centralbyrån (SCB)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.scb.se/hitta-statistik/statistik-efter-amne/boende-bebyggelse-och-mark/markanvandning/strandnara-markanvandning/pong/statistiknyhet/kust-strander-och-oar-2013","d":"scb.se","q":"Antal öar 267 570 Areal, hektar 1 211 243","ok":true},{"u":"https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sveriges_geografi","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Totalt finns det 267 570 insjö- och havsöar i Sverige.","ok":true}],"note":"SCB's statistik for 2013 angiver 267.570 øer; samme tal i svensk Wikipedia."},"num|Hvor mange kilo vejer Big Bens store klokke (Great Bell) cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Ben","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"weighs 13.5 long tons (13.7 tonnes","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.parliament.uk/about/living-heritage/building/palace/big-ben/facts-figures/great-bell","d":"","q":"Weight: 13.7 tonnes","ok":false}],"note":"Great Bell vejer ca. 13,7 tons (13,5 long tons), dvs. ca. 13.700 kg."},"num|Hvor mange centimeter måler den længste tunge hos en mand ifølge Guinness World Records (Nick Stoeberl, 2012)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/longest-tongue","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The longest tongue measures 10.1 cm (3.97 in) from its tip to the middle of the closed top lip and belongs to Nick Stoeberl (USA).","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Longest_tongue","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"whose tongue measures 10.1 centimetres (3.98 in)","ok":true}],"note":"Guinness: Nick Stoeberls tunge måler 10,1 cm, verificeret 27. november 2012."},"num|Hvor mange gange i sekundet slår en honningbi med vingerne cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://ucanr.edu/blog/bug-squad/article/how-fast-can-honey-bee-fly","d":"","q":"Its wings beat 230 times every second, according to Douglas Altshuler","ok":false},{"u":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC1312389","d":"pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov","q":"hovering with relatively low stroke amplitude (≈90°) and high wingbeat frequency (≈230 Hz)","ok":true}],"note":"Honningbiers vingeslag er ca. 230 pr. sekund (Altshuler et al., PNAS 2005)."},"num|Hvor mange halshvirvler har en giraf?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.nhm.ac.uk/discover/how-is-a-mouse-like-a-giraffe.html","d":"nhm.ac.uk","q":"the neck of a giraffe is made up of just seven large bones known as cervical vertebrae","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.clevelandzoosociety.org/z/2021/03/02/truth-or-tail-giraffe-have-more-neck-bones-than-a-human","d":"clevelandzoosociety.org","q":"they only have seven neck vertebrae - the same number of neck bones that humans have!","ok":true}],"note":"Giraffer har syv halshvirvler, ligesom mennesker."},"num|Hvor mange km/t var den hurtigste tennisserv ifølge Guinness World Records (Sam Groth, 2012)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/fastest-serve-of-a-tennis-ball-(male)","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"Samuel Groth (Australia) served an ace recorded at 263 km/h (163.4 mph) during an ATP Challenger event in Busan","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sam_Groth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"He holds the record for the world's fastest serve at 263 km/h (163.4 mph)","ok":true}],"note":"Guinness World Records angiver 263 km/t (Sam Groth, Busan, 9. maj 2012)."},"num|Hvor mange typer farvereceptorer har en mantisreje cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/invertebrates/facts/mantis-shrimp","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"With a staggering 12 photoreceptors, mantis shrimp can see 12 different wavelengths of light","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mantis_shrimp","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the eyes of a mantis shrimp have between 12 and 16 types of photoreceptor cells","ok":true}],"note":"Mantisrejer har ca. 12 typer fotoreceptorer (Wikipedia: 12-16); mennesker har tre farvereceptorer (tappe)."},"num|Hvor mange nakkehvirvler har en giraf?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/giraf","d":"lex.dk","q":"Som langt de fleste andre pattedyr har girafferne kun syv halshvirvler.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/giraffe","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"Just like humans, giraffes have seven neck vertebrae.","ok":true}],"note":"Giraffer har syv halshvirvler, ligesom mennesker."},"num|Hvor mange tænder har en voksen (med visdomstænder)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/tænder","d":"lex.dk","q":"Et normalt tandsæt hos et voksent menneske består af 32 tænder, fordelt med 16 i overkæben og 16 i underkæben.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_tooth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"and 32 permanent (adult) teeth.","ok":true}],"note":"Et fuldt voksent tandsæt har 32 tænder."},"num|Hvor mange knogler har en voksen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/skelet","d":"lex.dk","q":"Et menneske har 206 knogler i skelettet.","ok":true},{"u":"https://health.clevelandclinic.org/how-many-bones-does-a-baby-have","d":"health.clevelandclinic.org","q":"A newborn has 275 to 300 bones, while most adults have 206.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_skeleton","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"composed of around 270 bones at birth","ok":true}],"note":"206 er korrekt. Noten 'omkring 300' er den høje ende; kilderne angiver ca. 270-300 hos nyfødte, så noten rettes til intervallet."},"num|Hvor mange knogler er der i en menneskehånd (inkl. håndled)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hand","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Each human hand has 27 bones, not including the sesamoid bone","ok":true},{"u":"https://emedicine.medscape.com/article/1285060-overview","d":"emedicine.medscape.com","q":"A total of 27 bones constitute the basic skeleton of the wrist and hand.","ok":true}],"note":"Hånd inkl. håndled: 8 håndrodsknogler + 5 mellemhåndsknogler + 14 fingerled = 27."},"num|Hvor mange knogler er der i en menneskefod?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foot","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The human foot is a strong and complex mechanical structure containing 26","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.arthritis.org/health-wellness/about-arthritis/where-it-hurts/anatomy-of-the-foot","d":"arthritis.org","q":"in part by how many bones are in a foot: 26 bones","ok":true}],"note":"Standardtallet for foden er 26 knogler."},"num|Hvor mange kromosomer har et menneske?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.genome.gov/genetics-glossary/Chromosome","d":"genome.gov","q":"Humans have 22 pairs of numbered chromosomes (autosomes) and one pair of sex chromosomes (XX or XY), for a total of 46.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/kromosom","d":"lex.dk","q":"Mennesket har normalt 46 kromosomer, der er ordnet som 22 autosomale kromosompar og et kønskromosompar","ok":true}],"note":"46 kromosomer = 23 par."},"num|Hvor mange ribben har et menneske i alt?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/ribben","d":"lex.dk","q":"Mennesker har 12 par ribben.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rib_cage","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A typical human thoracic cage consists of 12 pairs of ribs","ok":true}],"note":"12 par ribben = 24."},"num|Hvor mange procent af kroppens energi bruger hjernen cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.brainfacts.org/brain-anatomy-and-function/anatomy/2019/how-much-energy-does-the-brain-use-020119","d":"brainfacts.org","q":"the brain consumes about 20 percent of the body","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_brain","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The brain consumes up to 20% of the energy used by the human body, more than any other organ.","ok":true}],"note":"Hjernen bruger ca. 20 % af kroppens energi."},"num|Hvor mange minutter tager lyset fra Solen cirka om at nå Jorden?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.skyatnightmagazine.com/space-science/how-take-light-from-sun-reach-earth","d":"skyatnightmagazine.com","q":"It takes light from the Sun 8 minutes and 20 seconds to reach us on Earth – on average.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Speed_of_light","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"modern figure 8 minutes 19 seconds on average","ok":true}],"note":"Gennemsnitligt ca. 8 min 19-20 sek, dvs. ca. 8,3 minutter."},"num|Hvor langt er der cirka fra Jorden til Månen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/moon/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"The Moon is an average of 238,855 miles (384,400 kilometers) away.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.rmg.co.uk/stories/space-astronomy/how-far-away-moon","d":"rmg.co.uk","q":"The average distance between the Earth and the Moon is 384 400 km (238 855 miles)","ok":true}],"note":"Gennemsnitsafstand ca. 384.400 km."},"num|Hvor mange jorddage varer en dag på Venus (én omdrejning)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/venus/venus-facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"your “day” would be 243 Earth days long — longer even than a Venus year (one trip around the Sun), which takes only 225 Earth days.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Venus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Venusian sidereal day , 243 Earth days, lasts longer than a Venusian year, 224.7 Earth days.","ok":true}],"note":"Siderisk rotation 243 jorddage, længere end Venus' år (ca. 225 dage)."},"num|Hvor mange dage tager Merkur om at kredse om Solen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/mercury/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"It speeds around the Sun every 88 days","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercury_(planet)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Mercury's sidereal year (88.0 Earth days)","ok":true}],"note":"Merkurs omløbstid er ca. 88 jorddage."},"num|Hvor mange dage varer et år på Mars?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/mars/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"A year on Mars lasts 669.6 sols, which is the same as 687 Earth days.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mars","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"its orbital period is 687 (Earth) days","ok":true}],"note":"Et marsår er 687 jorddage."},"num|Hvor mange timer varer en dag på Jupiter cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/jupiter/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"it has the shortest day in the solar system, taking about 9.9 hours to spin around once on its axis","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jupiter","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Jupiter's rotation is the fastest of all the Solar System's planets","ok":true}],"note":"Ca. 10 timer (9,9 t) er korrekt. Noten 'den hurtigste planet' er tvetydig (NASA kalder Merkur 'the fastest planet' i kredsløb); præciseret til hurtigst roterende."},"num|Hvor mange jordår tager Neptun om at kredse om Solen cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/neptune/neptune-facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"in about 165 Earth years (60,190 Earth days)","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neptune","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Neptune's 164-year orbital period","ok":true}],"note":"Ca. 165 jordår (164,8)."},"num|Hvilket år blev Pluto opdaget?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/dwarf-planets/pluto/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"Discovered in 1930, Pluto was long considered our solar system","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pluto","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Pluto was discovered in 1930 by Clyde W. Tombaugh","ok":true}],"note":"Pluto blev opdaget i 1930 af Clyde Tombaugh."},"num|Hvor mange mennesker har gået på Månen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/moon/moon-walkers/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"were the first of 12 human beings to walk on the Moon.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Apollo_astronauts","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"twelve men walked on the lunar surface","ok":true}],"note":"Tolv Apollo-astronauter har gået på Månen (1969-1972)."},"num|Hvor mange kilometer er afstanden fra Jorden til Solen cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/sun/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"It’s about 93 million miles (150 million kilometers) from Earth","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sun","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"One astronomical unit (about 150 million kilometres; 93 million miles)","ok":true}],"note":"Ca. 150 millioner km (1 AU)."},"num|Hvor mange kilometer i sekundet bevæger lys sig cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.nist.gov/si-redefinition/meet-constants","d":"nist.gov","q":"c is equal to 299,792,458 meters per second.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/lysets_hastighed","d":"lex.dk","q":"c = 299.792.458,0 ± 1,2 m/s dvs. ca 300.000 km/s","ok":true}],"note":"Lysets hastighed i vakuum er 299.792.458 m/s, dvs. cirka 299.792 km/s."},"num|Hvor lang er Jordens omkreds ved ækvator cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth%27s_circumference","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The equatorial circumference equals 40,075.017 km (24,901.461 mi)","ok":true},{"u":"https://education.nationalgeographic.org/resource/equator/","d":"education.nationalgeographic.org","q":"The distance around Earth at the Equator, its circumference , is 40,075 kilometers (24,901 miles).","ok":true}],"note":"Ækvatorial omkreds er ca. 40.075 km."},"num|Hvor høj er Mount Everest?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-asia-55218443","d":"bbc.com","q":"The new height is 8,848.86m (29,032 ft).","ok":true},{"u":"http://english.scio.gov.cn/in-depth/2020-12/09/content_76993252.htm","d":"english.scio.gov.cn","q":"is 8,848.86 meters, according to a joint announcement by China and Nepal on Tuesday","ok":true}],"note":"8848,86 m ifølge den fælles kinesisk-nepalesiske måling 2020 (rundet 8849); ældre kilder siger 8848, så spørgsmålet præciseres."},"num|Hvor høj er K2?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/K2","d":"lex.dk","q":"med sine 8611 m er K2 verdens næsthøjeste bjerg efter Mount Everest","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.voanews.com/a/east-asia-pacific_china-nepal-agree-mt-everests-height/6199311.html","d":"voanews.com","q":"the second highest, Mount K2, is 8,611 meters tall","ok":true}],"note":"K2 er 8611 m (verdens næsthøjeste)."},"num|Hvor høj er Mont Blanc cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2023/oct/05/mont-blanc-height-peak-shrinks","d":"theguardian.com","q":"the new official height of Mont Blanc is 4,805.59 metres","ok":true},{"u":"https://english.news.cn/20231006/7cd34a5ad6cb45a1a31e1884d9d9889b/c.html","d":"english.news.cn","q":"its new official height is 4,805.59 meters","ok":true}],"note":"Højden varierer fra år til år (4807,81 m i 2021, 4805,59 m i 2023); lex.dk angiver 4810. Spørgsmålet knyttes til målingen fra 2023."},"num|Hvor høj er Kilimanjaro cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Kilimanjaro","d":"lex.dk","q":"hæver sig 5895 meter over havets overflade","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Kilimanjaro","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the highest free-standing mountain above sea level in the world, at 5,895 m (19,341 ft) above sea level","ok":true}],"note":"Kilimanjaro (Uhuru Peak) er 5895 m."},"num|Hvor høj er Himmelbjerget i Jylland cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Himmelbjerget","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Himmelbjerget er en 147 meter høj bakke mellem Ry og Silkeborg","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Himmelbjerget","d":"lex.dk","q":"Himmelbjerget er en lyng- og skovklædt bakke på sydsiden af Julsø 10 km sydøst for Silkeborg ; 147 m.o.h.","ok":true}],"note":"Himmelbjerget er 147 m."},"num|Hvor høj er Møllehøj, Danmarks højeste naturlige punkt, cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/M%C3%B8llehøj","d":"lex.dk","q":"Møllehøj, som ligger 170,86 m.o.h., Yding Skovhøj (170,77 m.o.h.) og Ejer Bavnehøj (170,35 m.o.h.) er Danmarks højeste terrænpunkter.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%B8llehøj","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Møllehøj er Danmarks højeste naturlige jordpunkt.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Eiffelt%C3%A5rnet","d":"lex.dk","q":"hvilket har forøget højden til 330 meter","ok":true}],"note":"Højden 170,86 m er korrekt, men noten er forkert: 170,86 m er lidt over halvdelen af Eiffeltårnets 330 m, ikke mindre end en tredjedel."},"num|Hvor høj er Burj Khalifa?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/tallest-building","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The tallest building is the Burj Khalifa (Khalifa Tower) which measures 828 m","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Burj_Khalifa","d":"lex.dk","q":"828 m høj skryskraber i Dubai","ok":true}],"note":"Burj Khalifa er 828 m."},"num|Hvor høj er Eiffeltårnet (med antenner) cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The tower is 330 metres (1,083 ft) tall","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Eiffelt%C3%A5rnet","d":"lex.dk","q":"hvilket har forøget højden til 330 meter","ok":true}],"note":"Eiffeltårnet er 330 m med antenner."},"num|Hvor mange trin er der cirka op til toppen af Eiffeltårnet?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.wral.com/archive/21522017","d":"wral.com","q":"There are 1,665 steps to the top of the tower.","ok":true},{"u":"https://paris.travel/eiffel-tower","d":"paris.travel","q":"The Eiffel Tower has a total of 1,665 steps to the top","ok":true}],"note":"1665 trin i alt fra bunden til toppen (kun 674 er åbne for publikum)."},"num|Hvor høj er Angel Falls i Venezuela, verdens højeste vandfald?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/highest-waterfall","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"with a total drop of 979 m (3,212 ft)","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angel_Falls","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is the world's tallest uninterrupted waterfall , with a height of 979 metres (3,212 ft)","ok":true}],"note":"Angel Falls er 979 m høj."},"num|Hvor dybt er Bajkalsøen på det dybeste cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/deepest-lake","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"Soundings taken from the lake's Central Basin revealed it to be 1,642 metres (5,387 feet) deep.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Baikal","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is the deepest lake in the world at 1,642 metres (5,387 feet; 898 fathoms)","ok":true}],"note":"Maksimal dybde 1642 m (ældre kilder 1620-1637 m, derfor \"cirka\")."},"num|Hvor lang er Amazonfloden cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amazonfloden","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Den har en længde på 6.400 kilometer","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/environment/article/amazon-river","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"currently measured at about 4,000 miles (6,437 kilometers) by the U.S. Geological Survey","ok":true}],"note":"Amazonfloden angives almindeligvis til ca. 6400 km (omtrent 4000 miles); eksakt længde er omdiskuteret, men \"cirka\" dækker det."},"num|Hvor stort er Danmarks areal (uden Grønland og Færøerne) cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.dst.dk/da/Statistik/emner/geografi-miljoe-og-energi/areal/areal","d":"dst.dk","q":"Danmarks areal 42.957 km2","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denmark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The metropolitan part occupies a total area of 42,957 square kilometres","ok":true}],"note":"Danmarks areal er ca. 42.957 km², dvs. cirka 43.000."},"num|Hvor stor er Grønland cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-18249474","d":"bbc.com","q":"Area: 2,166,086 sq km","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greenland","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Area • Total 2,166,086 km 2 (836,330 sq mi)","ok":true}],"note":"Grønlands areal er 2.166.086 km²."},"num|Hvor mange øer har Danmark (navngivne)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danmark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"mens resten fordeler sig på 1419 øer, heraf 443 navngivne","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/%C3%B8","d":"lex.dk","q":"Danmark har 1.419 øer, hvoraf 581 er navngivne","ok":true}],"note":"Antallet af navngivne øer er uenigt (443 i Wikipedia/Trap, 581 i lex.dk); det stabile tal er 1419 øer over 100 m². Spørgsmålet ændres."},"num|Hvor lang er Gudenåen, Danmarks længste å, cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://naturstyrelsen.dk/find-et-naturomraade/naturguider/soehoejlandet-og-oestjylland/gudenaaens-og-skjernaaens-kilder/historie","d":"naturstyrelsen.dk","q":"Gudenåen er med sine 158 kilometer Danmarks længste vandløb","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Guden%C3%A5en","d":"lex.dk","q":"Gudenåen, Danmarks længste vandløb; 158 km.","ok":true}],"note":"Gudenåen angives til 158 km af Naturstyrelsen og Lex (andre kilder 149-160 km, derfor \"cirka\")."},"num|Hvor mange medlemmer har Folketinget?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Folketinget","d":"lex.dk","q":"Folketinget består af 179 medlemmer, heraf to fra Færøerne og to fra Grønland","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Folketing","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Folketing consists of 179 members","ok":true}],"note":"Folketinget har 179 medlemmer."},"num|Hvor mange kommuner er der i Danmark?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.skim.dk/indenrigs-ressortomlagt/kommunal-og-regionaloekonomi/kommunale-opgaver-og-struktur","d":"skim.dk","q":"Strukturen med 98 kommuner og 5 regioner blev ligeledes fastlagt med kommunalreformen.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dst.dk/da/Statistik/dokumentation/nomenklaturer/nuts","d":"dst.dk","q":"Derudover blev der dannet 98 kommuner, som afløste de hidtidige 271.","ok":true}],"note":"Siden strukturreformen 1.1.2007 er der 98 kommuner."},"num|Hvor mange regioner er der i Danmark?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.regioner.dk/om-os/om-de-fem-regioner/undervisningsmateriale/om-de-fem-regioner/","d":"regioner.dk","q":"Danmarks 14 amter nedlagt og erstattet af fem regioner","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.skim.dk/indenrigs-ressortomlagt/kommunal-og-regionaloekonomi/kommunale-opgaver-og-struktur","d":"skim.dk","q":"Strukturen med 98 kommuner og 5 regioner blev ligeledes fastlagt med kommunalreformen.","ok":true}],"note":"Fem regioner siden 2007 (Nordjylland, Midtjylland, Syddanmark, Sjælland, Hovedstaden)."},"num|Hvilket år blev Øresundsbroen åbnet?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.oresundsbron.com/da/om-oresundsbron/om-os/fakta-om-oresundsbron","d":"oresundsbron.com","q":"Øresundsbron har forbundet Danmark med Sverige siden indvielsen den 1. juli 2000.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dr.dk/nyheder/indland/saa-er-broen-over-oeresund-aabnet","d":"dr.dk","q":"Øresundsbroen er nu åbnet.","ok":true},{"u":"http://news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/europe/815002.stm","d":"news.bbc.co.uk","q":"King Carl Gustav of Sweden and Queen Margrethe of Denmark have opened a new bridge and tunnel","ok":true}],"note":"Øresundsbroen blev indviet og åbnet for trafik 1. juli 2000."},"num|Hvilket år åbnede Storebæltsbroen for biltrafik?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Storeb%C3%A6ltsbroen","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"vejforbindelsen åbnede 14. juni 1998","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Storeb%C3%A6ltsforbindelsen","d":"lex.dk","q":"vejen over Storebælt kunne derfor indvies den 14.6.1998, godt ét år efter jernbaneforbindelsens åbning","ok":true}],"note":"Vejforbindelsen (biltrafik) åbnede 14. juni 1998; jernbanen allerede i 1997, men spørgsmålet gælder biltrafik."},"num|Hvilket år åbnede Tivoli?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Tivoli","d":"lex.dk","q":"Tivoli er en forlystelsespark i København, der blev anlagt i 1843","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tivoli_Gardens","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The park opened on 15 August 1843 and is the second-oldest operating amusement park in the world","ok":true}],"note":"Tivoli åbnede 15. august 1843."},"num|Hvor mange år var Margrethe II dronning af Danmark?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margrethe_II","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Having reigned for exactly 52 years","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/longest-reigning-queen-living","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"remained in place for exactly 52 years","ok":true}],"note":"14. januar 1972 til 14. januar 2024 = nøjagtigt 52 år."},"num|Hvor mange stjerner er der på EU's flag?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://european-union.europa.eu/principles-countries-history/symbols/european-flag_en","d":"european-union.europa.eu","q":"The number of stars has nothing to do with the number of EU countries","ok":true},{"u":"https://euo.magenta.dk/euo_en/spsv/all/55/","d":"euo.magenta.dk","q":"The number of stars is fixed without regard to the number of Member States, since the number twelve is","ok":true}],"note":"12 stjerner, uafhængigt af antallet af medlemslande."},"num|Hvor mange stjerner er der på det amerikanske flag?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.usa.gov/flag","d":"usa.gov","q":"Its 50 white stars on a blue background represent the 50 states.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_of_the_United_States","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"representing the 50 U.S. states united","ok":true}],"note":"50 stjerner, én for hver stat (siden 1960)."},"num|Hvor mange tidszoner har Rusland?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time_in_Russia","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"There are 11 time zones in Russia","ok":true},{"u":"http://en.kremlin.ru/events/president/news/46279","d":"en.kremlin.ru","q":"The Law establishes 11 time zones on the territory of the Russian Federation","ok":true}],"note":"Rusland har 11 tidszoner (siden 2014-loven, UTC+2 til UTC+12)."},"num|Hvor mange lande er medlem af FN?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.un.org/en/about-us","d":"un.org","q":"Currently made up of 193 Member States","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Member_states_of_the_United_Nations","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"193 member states","ok":true}],"note":"193 medlemsstater (Sydsudan som nr. 193 i 2011)."},"num|Hvor mange bogstaver har det danske alfabet?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/det_danske_alfabet","d":"lex.dk","q":"Det danske alfabet består af 29 bogstaver i denne rækkefølge","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Det_dansk-norske_alfabet","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Det består af 29 bogstaver","ok":true}],"note":"Det danske alfabet har 29 bogstaver (A-Z samt Æ, Ø, Å)."},"num|Hvor mange tangenter har et klaver?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.classicfm.com/discover-music/instruments/piano/why-88-keys/","d":"classicfm.com","q":"A standard piano has 88 keys: 52 white and 36 black.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.fosterpianos.co.uk/pianofaq0004.html","d":"fosterpianos.co.uk","q":"There are 88 keys on a standard piano.","ok":true}],"note":"Et standardklaver har 88 tangenter (52 hvide, 36 sorte)."},"num|Hvor mange felter er der på et skakbræt?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chessboard","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It consists of 64 squares, 8 rows by 8 columns, on which the chess pieces are placed.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.chess.com/terms/chessboard","d":"chess.com","q":"The chessboard is an 8x8 grid of alternating colored squares. Half of the 64 squares are called light squares","ok":true}],"note":"8×8 = 64 felter."},"num|Hvor mange felter er der på et Monopol-bræt?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monopoly_(game)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Monopoly game board consists of forty spaces containing twenty-eight properties","ok":true},{"u":"https://edition.cnn.com/2015/02/03/living/feat-monopoly-real-money-facts/index.html","d":"edition.cnn.com","q":"A Monopoly board has 40 spaces, including 28 properties.","ok":true}],"note":"Det klassiske Monopoly-bræt har 40 felter.","rechecked":"2026-11-13"},"num|Hvor mange kort er der i et almindeligt spil kort (uden jokere)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/spillekort","d":"lex.dk","q":"Nu består et almindeligt sæt spillekort af 52 kort","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standard_52-card_deck","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A standard 52-card French-suited deck comprises 13 ranks in each of the four suits","ok":true}],"note":"Et standardspil har 52 kort (4 kulører × 13)."},"num|Hvor mange brikker er der i et sæt dominobrikker (dobbelt-seks)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"http://www.domino-games.com/domino-rules/double-six.html","d":"domino-games.com","q":"With 28 tiles, a double-six set is easier to manage","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dominoes","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The traditional European domino set consists of 28 tiles","ok":true}],"note":"Et dobbelt-seks-sæt har 28 brikker."},"num|Hvor mange kegler er der i bowling?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tenpin_bowling","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"toward ten pins positioned evenly in four rows","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theworldgames.org/sports/Bowling-25","d":"theworldgames.org","q":"toward ten pins positioned evenly in four rows","ok":true}],"note":"Almindelig (tenpin) bowling spilles med 10 kegler."},"num|Hvor mange kugler er der i alt på et snookerbord (røde, farver og hvid)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/sport/snooker/68854304","d":"bbc.com","q":"Snooker is played with 22 balls.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snooker","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the game is played with 22 balls: a white","ok":true}],"note":"15 røde + 6 farver + 1 hvid = 22 kugler."},"num|Hvor mange point er den maksimale break i snooker?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/sport/snooker/68854304","d":"bbc.com","q":"A maximum break (a 147) is made up of 15 reds, 15 blacks, then each","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maximum_break","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is the highest possible break in snooker under normal circumstances","ok":true}],"note":"Maksimum break er 147 (15×(1+7)+27); 155 er kun mulig efter free ball, men 147 er den gængse maksimumbreak."},"num|Hvad er det højeste checkout i dart (tre pile)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darts","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the highest possible finish with three darts is 170 (T20, T20, inner bull)","ok":true},{"u":"https://whatchan.co.uk/darts/pages/guide-checkout.html","d":"whatchan.co.uk","q":"The highest possible checkout in a single visit of three darts is 170: treble 20 (60), treble 20 (60), and inner bullseye (50).","ok":true}],"note":"170 = T20 + T20 + inner bull (50)."},"num|Hvor mange point kan man højst score med tre pile i dart?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darts","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The highest score possible with three darts is 180, commonly known as a \"ton 80\" (100 points is called a ton), obtained when all three darts land in the triple 20.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/articles/2nl4ntyBsRrFyDyP6TT8rBx/a-beginners-guide-to-darts","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"the highest possible score in darts made by hitting 3 treble 20","ok":true}],"note":"Højeste score med tre pile er 3 × treble 20 = 180."},"num|Hvor lang er et maraton?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/maratonløb","d":"lex.dk","q":"Distancen er 42,195 km.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marathon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The marathon is a long-distance foot race with a distance of 42.195 kilometres","ok":true}],"note":"Maratondistancen er 42,195 km."},"num|Hvor høj er et fodboldmål?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.theifab.com/laws/latest/the-field-of-play/","d":"theifab.com","q":"the distance from the lower edge of the crossbar to the ground is 2.44 m (8 ft)","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Association_football","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the lower edge of the horizontal crossbar supported by the goal posts must be 2.44 m (8 ft) above the ground","ok":true}],"note":"IFAB's regler: 2,44 m fra underkant af overligger til jorden."},"num|Hvor bredt er et fodboldmål?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.theifab.com/laws/latest/the-field-of-play/","d":"theifab.com","q":"The distance between the inside of the posts is 7.32 m (8 yds)","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Football_pitch","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the width of the goal, unchanged since 1863, is 8 yards (7.32 metres)","ok":true}],"note":"IFAB's regler: 7,32 m mellem indersiderne af stolperne."},"num|Hvor højt hænger en basketballkurv?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://official.nba.com/rule-no-1-court-dimensions-equipment","d":"official.nba.com","q":"Each basket ring shall be securely attached to the backboard with its upper edge 10","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basketball_court","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The baskets are always 10 feet (3.05 m) above the floor","ok":true}],"note":"Ringens overkant er 10 fod = 3,05 m over gulvet."},"num|Hvor mange spillere er der på et rugby union-hold?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rugby_union","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the game is played between two teams of 15 players each","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/rugby","d":"lex.dk","q":"Rugby er et holdboldspil, hvor det ene holds 15 spillere","ok":true}],"note":"15 spillere på banen i rugby union."},"num|Hvor mange ringe er der i OL-logoet?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/de_olympiske_ringe","d":"lex.dk","q":"Symbolet består af fem ringe i hver sin farve","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olympic_symbols","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The five rings on the flag represent the inhabited continents of the world","ok":true}],"note":"Fem sammenslyngede ringe."},"num|Hvor mange ben har en hummer?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.fisheries.noaa.gov/species/american-lobster","d":"fisheries.noaa.gov","q":"American lobster is a crustacean with a large shrimp-like body and 10 legs","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/hummer","d":"lex.dk","q":"Hummeren er et tibenet krebsdyr","ok":true}],"note":"Hummeren er tibenet (10 ben, inkl. klosakse)."},"num|Hvor mange ben har en bi?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://askabiologist.asu.edu/honey-bee-anatomy","d":"askabiologist.asu.edu","q":"They have three pairs of legs used for walking.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.univ.ox.ac.uk/news/bee-news-march-18/","d":"univ.ox.ac.uk","q":"The honey bee has three pairs of legs, six legs in total.","ok":true}],"note":"Bier er insekter med tre par ben = 6."},"num|Hvor mange maver har en ko (rum)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cattle","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Cattle have one large stomach with four compartments","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/drøvtygger","d":"lex.dk","q":"Koen hører til de egentlige drøvtyggere og har fire mavekamre.","ok":true}],"note":"Koen har fire mavekamre (vom, nettemave, bladmave, løbemave)."},"num|Hvor mange måneder er en elefant drægtig cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/elefanter","d":"lex.dk","q":"Elefanthunner er drægtige i 22 måneder","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/African_elephant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Calves are normally born after a gestation period of 22 months","ok":true}],"note":"Drægtighed er ca. 22 måneder."},"num|Hvor mange kilometer i timen kan en gepard maksimalt løbe cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheetah","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The highest reliably reported running speed is 104 km/h (65 mph).","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/gepard","d":"lex.dk","q":"har en tophastighed på 104 km/t","ok":true}],"note":"112 km/t er forældet (baseret på en fejlbehæftet måling). Højeste pålideligt målte hastighed er 104 km/t."},"num|Hvor mange procent af Jordens overflade er dækket af vand cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.usgs.gov/special-topics/water-science-school/science/how-much-water-there-earth","d":"usgs.gov","q":"About 71 percent of the Earth's surface is water-covered","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jorden","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Omkring 71 % af overfladen er dækket af oceaner af saltvand","ok":true}],"note":"Ca. 71 % af Jordens overflade er vanddækket."},"num|Hvor mange sprog tales der i verden cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Language","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The exact number of known living languages varies from 6,000 to 7,000","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/sprog","d":"lex.dk","q":"Tallene ligger dog typisk mellem 5000 og 7000.","ok":true}],"note":"Cirka 7000 er rimeligt (Ethnologue 7.170; kilder angiver 5.000-7.000)."},"num|Hvor mange passagerer kan en Airbus A380 maksimalt rumme?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Airbus_A380","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"with a maximum certified capacity for 853 passengers","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.airbus.com/en/products-services/commercial-aircraft/passenger-aircraft/a380","d":"airbus.com","q":"certified to a maximum seating capacity of 853","ok":true}],"note":"Maksimalt certificeret kapacitet er 853."},"num|Hvor mange omkom ved Titanic-forliset cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Titanic","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"approximately 1,500 died (estimates vary)","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/history/article/titanic","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"disappeared beneath the waves, taking with her 1,500 souls","ok":true}],"note":"Cirka 1.500 omkom."},"num|Hvor mange redningsbåde havde Titanic?":{"pool":"num","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.encyclopedia-titanica.org/titanic-lifeboats/","d":"","q":"the Titanic carried only 20 lifeboats","ok":false},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Titanic","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Lifeboats: 20 (sufficient for 1,178 people)","ok":true}],"note":"Titanic havde 20 redningsbåde."},"num|Hvilket år sank Titanic?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Titanic","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"RMS Titanic was a British ocean liner that sank in the early hours of 15 April 1912","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/history/article/titanic","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"on April 15, 1912, the","ok":true}],"note":"Titanic sank 15. april 1912."},"num|Hvilket år landede mennesker først på Månen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Apollo_11","d":"lex.dk","q":"Landingen skete den 20. juli 1969 under den kolde krigs rumkapløb.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nasa.gov/mission/apollo-11/","d":"nasa.gov","q":"Astronaut Buzz Aldrin stands on the Moon facing a U.S. flag during the Apollo 11 mission in July 1969.","ok":true}],"note":"Apollo 11 landede 20. juli 1969."},"num|Hvilket år faldt Berlinmuren?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berlin_Wall","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the East German government announced on 9 November 1989 that all GDR citizens could visit the FRG and West Berlin","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Berlinmuren","d":"lex.dk","q":"Berlinmuren var en mur, der i perioden fra 1961 til 1989 adskilte Østberlin fra Vestberlin","ok":true}],"note":"Muren faldt 9. november 1989."},"num|Hvilket år fik Danmark sin første grundlov?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://danmarkshistorien.lex.dk/Junigrundloven_Danmarks_Riges_Grundlov,_5._juni_1849","d":"danmarkshistorien.lex.dk","q":"Den 5. juni 1849 underskrev Frederik 7. Danmarks første grundlov.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danmarks_Riges_Grundlov","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"blev underskrevet den 5. juni 1849 af Frederik 7.","ok":true}],"note":"Junigrundloven blev underskrevet 5. juni 1849."},"num|Hvilket år vandt Danmark EM i fodbold?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://danmarkshistorien.lex.dk/EM-finalen_i_fodbold_26._juni_1992","d":"danmarkshistorien.lex.dk","q":"Danmark vandt mesterskabet meget overraskende efter en sejr over Tyskland i finalen (2-0).","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UEFA_Euro_1992","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Denmark won the title, having been invited as qualifiers runners-up only after Yugoslavia was disqualified","ok":true}],"note":"Danmark vandt EM i 1992 (finale 26. juni 1992 mod Tyskland, 2-0)."},"num|Hvor mange øer har Færøerne?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/F%C3%A6r%C3%B8erne","d":"lex.dk","q":"Færøerne består af 18 øer, som er adskilt af smalle sunde og fjorde.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/F%C3%A6r%C3%B8erne","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Øgruppen består af 18 øer af vulkansk oprindelse","ok":true}],"note":"Færøerne består af 18 øer."},"num|Hvor stort er Monaco cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-17615784","d":"bbc.com","q":"Area: 2.02 sq km","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monaco","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It has an area of 2.1 km","ok":true}],"note":"Svaret 2 km² er korrekt afrundet, men kilderne varierer mellem 2,02 km² (BBC) og 2,1 km² (Wikipedia); noten er rettet til interval."},"num|Hvor mange kilometer er Den Kinesiske Mur officielt?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-asia-china-18337039","d":"bbc.com","q":"The wall measures 21,196.18km (13,170.6956 miles) long based on the latest state survey results","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Wall_of_China","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"spanning 21,196.18 km (13,170.70 mi) in total","ok":true}],"note":"Officiel kinesisk opmåling fra 2012: 21.196,18 km i alt inkl. grene m.m."},"num|Hvor mange sten er der cirka i Cheops-pyramiden (i millioner)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Pyramid_of_Giza","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Great Pyramid was built by quarrying an estimated 2.3 million large blocks","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/history/article/giza-pyramids","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"Its estimated 2.3 million stone blocks each weigh an average of 2.5 to 15 tons.","ok":true}],"note":"Cirka 2,3 millioner blokke er det gængse skøn."},"num|Hvor mange nitter er der cirka i Eiffeltårnet (i millioner)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In all, 18,038 pieces were joined using 2.5 million rivets.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.toureiffel.paris/en/news/130-years/eiffel-towers-historic-rivets-true-collectors-item-offer","d":"","q":"2.5 million rivets hold together 12,000 metallic pieces","ok":false},{"u":"https://www.designingbuildings.co.uk/wiki/Eiffel%20Tower","d":"designingbuildings.co.uk","q":"18,038 pieces of iron were fitted together with 2.5 million rivets","ok":true}],"note":"Cirka 2,5 millioner nitter angives af Wikipedia og tårnets officielle side."},"num|Hvor mange hvirvler har en menneskelig rygsøjle?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spinal_column","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In a human spinal column, there are normally 33 vertebrae.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.cedars-sinai.org/health-topics/anatomy-of-the-spine","d":"cedars-sinai.org","q":"is made up of 33 vertebrae separated by spongy disks","ok":true},{"u":"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/body/10040-spine-structure-and-function","d":"my.clevelandclinic.org","q":"Your spine has 33 stacked vertebrae","ok":true}],"note":"33 hvirvler (7+12+5+5+4)."},"num|Hvor dyb er Marianergraven (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://oceanservice.noaa.gov/facts/oceandepth.html","d":"oceanservice.noaa.gov","q":"Challenger Deep is approximately 10,935 meters (35,876 feet) deep","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mariana_Trench","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"10,935 ± 6 meters","ok":true}],"note":"Største kendte dybde (Challenger Deep) ca. 10.935 m."},"num|Hvor langt er der til Månen (gennemsnit)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/moon/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"The Moon is an average of 238,855 miles (384,400 kilometers) away.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.rmg.co.uk/stories/space-astronomy/how-far-away-moon","d":"rmg.co.uk","q":"The average distance between the Earth and the Moon is 384 400 km","ok":true}],"note":"Gennemsnit 384.400 km."},"num|Hvor langt er der fra Jorden til Solen (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"From an average distance of 93 million miles (150 million kilometers), Earth is exactly one astronomical unit away from the Sun","ok":true},{"u":"https://coolcosmos.ipac.caltech.edu/ask/8-How-far-away-is-the-Sun-","d":"coolcosmos.ipac.caltech.edu","q":"The Sun is at an average distance of about 93,000,000 miles (150 million kilometers) away from Earth.","ok":true}],"note":"Ca. 150 mio. km (1 AE)."},"num|Hvor lang er Jordens omkreds ved ækvator?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth%27s_circumference","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The equatorial circumference equals 40,075.017 km (24,901.461 mi)","ok":true},{"u":"https://coolcosmos.ipac.caltech.edu/ask/57-How-large-is-Earth-","d":"coolcosmos.ipac.caltech.edu","q":"Earth's circumference (the distance all the way around the equator) is 24,901 miles (40,075 kilometers).","ok":true}],"note":"Ækvatorial omkreds 40.075 km."},"num|Hvor hurtigt bevæger lys sig i vakuum (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.nist.gov/si-redefinition/meter","d":"nist.gov","q":"This definition also locked the speed of light at 299,792,458 meters per second in a vacuum.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Speed_of_light","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The value 299,792,458 metres per second is approximately 1 billion kilometres per hour","ok":true}],"note":"299.792.458 m/s ≈ 299.792 km/s."},"num|Hvor mange lande er medlem af EU?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://european-union.europa.eu/principles-countries-history/eu-enlargement_en","d":"european-union.europa.eu","q":"Today there are 27 countries in the EU.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.gov.uk/eu-eea","d":"gov.uk","q":"The EU countries are: Austria, Belgium, Bulgaria, Croatia, Republic of Cyprus","ok":true}],"note":"27 medlemslande (efter Brexit)."},"num|Hvor mange lande er der i Afrika?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.worldometers.info/geography/how-many-countries-in-africa/","d":"worldometers.info","q":"There are 54 countries in Africa today, according to the United Nations.","ok":true},{"u":"https://ask.un.org/faq/22882","d":"ask.un.org","q":"54 countries belong to the African Group and are Members of the United Nations.","ok":true}],"note":"54 anerkendte lande (FN-medlemmer)."},"num|Hvor mange tidszoner dækker Rusland?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time_in_Russia","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"There are 11 time zones in Russia","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.worldatlas.com/articles/how-many-time-zones-are-in-russia.html","d":"worldatlas.com","q":"Russia has 11 time zones","ok":true}],"note":"11 tidszoner (UTC+2 til UTC+12)."},"num|Hvor mange mennesker bor der på Jorden (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.un.org/en/global-issues/population","d":"un.org","q":"On 15 November 2022, the world’s population reached 8 billion people","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2023/11/world-population-estimated-eight-billion.html","d":"census.gov","q":"reached 8 billion on November 15, 2022","ok":true}],"note":"Verdensbefolkningen nåede 8 mia. i nov. 2022 og vokser; tilføjet årstal i noten for at gøre svaret stabilt."},"num|Hvor mange grundstoffer er der i det periodiske system?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Periodic_table","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Today, 118 elements are known, the first 94 of which are known to occur naturally on Earth.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/oganesson","d":"lex.dk","q":"Oganesson, grundstof nr. 118, atomtegn Og","ok":true}],"note":"118 grundstoffer (til og med oganesson)."},"num|Hvad er atomnummeret for guld?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gold","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Chemical element with atomic number 79","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/guld","d":"lex.dk","q":"Guld er grundstof nr. 79.","ok":true}],"note":"Guld har atomnummer 79 (Au)."},"num|Hvad er atomnummeret for jern?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iron","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Chemical element with atomic number 26","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/jern","d":"lex.dk","q":"Jern er grundstof nummer 26.","ok":true}],"note":"Jern har atomnummer 26 (Fe)."},"num|Hvad er atomnummeret for ilt?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oxygen","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Chemical element with atomic number 8","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/oxygen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Oxygen er grundstof nr. 8 og placeret i det periodiske systems 16. gruppe.","ok":true}],"note":"Ilt (oxygen) har atomnummer 8."},"num|Hvad er det absolutte nulpunkt (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Absolut_nulpunkt","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Pr. definition er den teoretisk lavest mulige temperatur 0 K og −273,15 °C","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nist.gov/si-redefinition/kelvin","d":"nist.gov","q":"0 K = -273.15 degrees C = -459.67 degrees F","ok":true}],"note":"Absolut nulpunkt er 0 K = −273,15 °C, så ca. -273 °C er korrekt."},"num|Hvor mange symfonier skrev Beethoven?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ludwig_van_Beethoven","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Hans værker for symfoniorkester omfatter ni symfonier","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/symfoni","d":"lex.dk","q":"Beethoven næsten konsekvent i sine ni symfonier, skrevet i tidsrummet 1799-1824.","ok":true}],"note":"Beethoven skrev ni symfonier."},"num|Hvor mange symfonier skrev Mozart (nummereret)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Wolfgang_Amadeus_Mozart","d":"lex.dk","q":"Fra denne tid stammer hans sidste tre symfonier, nr. 39-41 i Es-dur K 543, g-mol K 550 og C-dur K 551.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_symphonies_by_Wolfgang_Amadeus_Mozart","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The symphony numbers in the range 42 to 56 are sometimes used for symphonic works that were not numbered in the 1-41 sequence.","ok":true}],"note":"Mozarts symfonier nummereres traditionelt 1-41, men der findes også værker nummereret 42-56 og unummererede symfonier; spørgsmålet præciseres til den traditionelle nummer"},"num|Hvor mange tangenter har et standardklaver?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piano","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Modern pianos have a row of 88 black and white keys","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/klaver","d":"lex.dk","q":"Moderne klaverer har 88 tangenter som standard.","ok":true}],"note":"Et standardklaver har 88 tangenter."},"num|Hvor mange strenge har en violin?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Most violins have a hollow wooden body, and commonly have four strings","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/violin","d":"lex.dk","q":"En violin er et strygeinstrument med fire strenge","ok":true}],"note":"En violin har fire strenge."},"num|Hvor mange huller er der på en standard golfbane?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golf","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In 1764, the standard 18-hole golf course was created at St Andrews","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/golf","d":"lex.dk","q":"En golfbane med internationale mål har 18 huller","ok":true}],"note":"En standard golfbane har 18 huller."},"num|Hvor høj er den maksimale score med tre darts?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darts","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The highest score possible with three darts is 180","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dazn.com/en-US/news/darts/what-are-the-rules-of-darts-what-is-the-bullseye-what-is-the-most-you-can-score-in-a-single-throw-or-visit/13jmpblx3vrkj144rnk6wdsujm","d":"dazn.com","q":"By hitting three treble 20s you can score 180.","ok":true}],"note":"Maksimum er 180 (tre gange triple 20)."},"num|Hvad er den maksimale score i bowling?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perfect_game_(bowling)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the highest possible score is 300, achieved by bowling 12 strikes in a row","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.playerssports.net/page/bowling-rules","d":"playerssports.net","q":"a maximum score of 300 points, a perfect game.","ok":true}],"note":"Perfekt spil i tenpin bowling er 300 point (12 strikes i træk). Kilde 2 er en ligasidens regelsæt (ikke en stor autoritet), men faktum er entydigt."},"num|Hvad er det maksimale break i snooker?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maximum_break","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is the highest possible break in snooker under normal circumstances.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dazn.com/en-US/news/snooker/what-is-a-maximum-break-in-snooker-who-scored-the-first-who-has-scored-the-most-147s/1n2jkrxvmzg871fhxdyr9kl110","d":"dazn.com","q":"Mark Selby became the first player to make a maximum break of 147 in a World Championship final.","ok":true}],"note":"147 er det maksimale break under normale omstændigheder; teoretisk kan et break med frit bold give 155, så spørgsmålet præciseres."},"num|Hvor lang er et marathonløb?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marathon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The marathon is a long-distance foot race with a distance of 42.195 kilometres","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/maratonløb","d":"lex.dk","q":"Distancen er 42,195 km.","ok":true},{"u":"https://worldathletics.org/disciplines/road-running/marathon","d":"worldathletics.org","q":"This distance was standardised at 26 miles 385 yards (42.195km) in 1921.","ok":true}],"note":"Et maratonløb er 42,195 km."},"num|Hvor mange spillere er der på banen for ét håndboldhold?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Handball","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"two teams of seven players each","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/håndbold","d":"lex.dk","q":"Håndbold er et indendørs boldspil mellem to hold a syv spillere inklusive målvogter.","ok":true}],"note":"Syv spillere på banen (inkl. målvogter)."},"num|Hvor mange spillere er der på banen for ét rugbyhold (rugby union)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rugby_union","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the game is played between two teams of 15 players each","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/rugby","d":"lex.dk","q":"Rugby er et holdboldspil, hvor det ene holds 15 spillere","ok":true}],"note":"Rugby union spilles med 15 spillere pr. hold."},"num|Hvor mange kort er der i et standard kortspil uden jokere?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Playing_card","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"standard 52-card deck","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/spillekort","d":"lex.dk","q":"Nu består et almindeligt sæt spillekort af 52 kort, evt. med tilføjelse af en eller to jokere","ok":true}],"note":"Et standardspil har 52 kort, evt. med jokere som tilføjelse."},"num|Hvor mange felter har et skakbræt?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chessboard","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It consists of 64 squares, 8 rows by 8 columns","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/skak","d":"lex.dk","q":"Skak er et brætspil, som udkæmpes på et kvadratisk bræt med 64 lige store felter.","ok":true}],"note":"Skakbræt har 64 felter."},"num|Hvor mange ringe har det olympiske flag?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/de_olympiske_ringe","d":"lex.dk","q":"Symbolet består af fem ringe i hver sin farve: blå, gul, sort, grøn, rød.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olympic_symbols","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Olympic rings consist of five interlocking rings","ok":true}],"note":"Det olympiske symbol/flag har fem ringe."},"num|Hvor højt ligger Møllehøj, Danmarks højeste naturlige punkt (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Møllehøj","d":"lex.dk","q":"Møllehøj, som ligger 170,86 m.o.h., Yding Skovhøj (170,77 m.o.h.) og Ejer Bavnehøj (170,35 m.o.h.) er Danmarks højeste terrænpunkter.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Møllehøj","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Møllehøj er 170,86 meter høj (DVR90), og ligger i Ejer Bjerge i Skanderborg Kommune","ok":true}],"note":"Møllehøj er 170,86 m, dvs. ca. 171 m."},"num|Hvor mange bogstaver har det engelske alfabet?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_alphabet","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Modern English is written with a Latin-script alphabet consisting of 26 letters, with each having both uppercase and lowercase forms.","ok":true},{"u":"https://cordis.europa.eu/article/id/443711-why-does-the-english-alphabet-have-26-letters","d":"cordis.europa.eu","q":"the English alphabet ended up with 26 letters because that reflected the number of phonemes in the Latin alphabet.","ok":true}],"note":"Det engelske alfabet har 26 bogstaver."},"num|Hvor mange ben har en edderkop?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edderkopper","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"er karakteriseret ved at have en todelt krop, otte ben, spindevorter og giftkirtler.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/edderkopper","d":"lex.dk","q":"De fire par ganglemmer er syvleddede og meget forskelligt udformet til gang, spring eller klatring.","ok":true}],"note":"Edderkopper har otte ben (fire par ganglemmer)."},"num|Hvor hurtigt kan en gepard løbe (topfart, ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/gepard","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den er verdens hurtigste landdyr med en topfart på omkring 100 km/t","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheetah","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"capable of running at 93–104 km/h (58–65 mph)","ok":true}],"note":"110 km/t er en forældet/modbevist måling (Wikipedia og DR-kilder: 93–104 km/t; Lex: omkring 100 km/t). Rettet til ca. 100 km/t."},"num|Hvor mange måneder er en elefants drægtighed (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/elefanter","d":"lex.dk","q":"Elefanthunner er drægtige i 22 måneder og føder en unge","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/African_bush_elephant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"gestation around 22 months, the longest of any mammal.","ok":true}],"note":"Elefanters drægtighed er ca. 22 måneder."},"num|Hvor mange Harry Potter-romaner findes der i hovedserien?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Harry_Potter","d":"lex.dk","q":"Forfatteren meddelte fra begyndelsen af sit projekt, at der ville komme i alt syv bøger.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Each of the seven books is set over the course of one school year.","ok":true}],"note":"Hovedserien består af syv bøger."},"num|Hvor mange medlemmer var der i The Beatles?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Beatles","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Gruppen bestod i sin mest kendte form af de fire medlemmer Paul McCartney, John Lennon, George Harrison og Ringo Starr.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/The_Beatles","d":"lex.dk","q":"Alle gruppens fire medlemmer skulle vise sig ikke bare at være dygtige sangere og musikere.","ok":true}],"note":"Spørgsmålet er tvetydigt, da gruppen historisk også havde andre medlemmer (fx Stuart Sutcliffe og Pete Best). Præciseret til den mest kendte besætning med fire medlemmer."},"num|Hvor mange stater har USA?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/USA","d":"lex.dk","q":"USA består af 50 delstater og strækker sig over fire tidszoner.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/USA's_delstater","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Amerikas Forenede Stater, eller USA, består af 50 delstater.","ok":true}],"note":"USA består af 50 delstater."},"num|Hvor mange stater har Australien (uden territorier)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australiens_delstater_og_territorier","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"er en forbundsstat bestående af seks delstater og ti territorier.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Australien","d":"lex.dk","q":"Derudover har alle seks delstater og to territorier egne parlamenter med relativt store beføjelser","ok":true}],"note":"Australien har seks delstater."},"num|Hvor mange lande er der i Sydamerika?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sydamerika","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Sydamerika består af tolv lande:","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.worldatlas.com/geography/how-many-countries-are-in-south-america.html","d":"worldatlas.com","q":"Consisting of 12 separate countries, South America hosts dozens of nationalities, languages, cultures, and faiths.","ok":true}],"note":"Sydamerika har 12 suveræne lande (afhængige territorier ikke medregnet)."},"num|Hvor stor er Grønlands areal (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-18249474","d":"bbc.com","q":"Area: 2,166,086 sq km","ok":true},{"u":"https://kids.nationalgeographic.com/geography/countries/article/greenland","d":"kids.nationalgeographic.com","q":"AREA: 836,330 square miles (2,166,086 square kilometers)","ok":true}],"note":"Grønlands areal er 2.166.086 km², dvs. ca. 2,17 mio. km²."},"num|Hvor lang er Volga?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volga","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"er med længden 3530 km","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Volga","d":"lex.dk","q":"Volga er Europas længste flod. Den er 3500 km lang","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volga","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Volga has a length of 3,531 km (2,194 mi)","ok":true}],"note":"Kilderne angiver 3500 km (Lex), 3530 km (da.wikipedia) og 3531 km (en.wikipedia); gjort til 'ca.' så svaret er robust."},"num|Hvor mange indbyggere har Danmark (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danmark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Ifølge Danmarks Statistik havde Danmark 1. maj 2025 en befolkning på 6.001.008 indbyggere","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Danmark","d":"lex.dk","q":"Befolkningstallet er på 6,0 mio. (2026)","ok":true}],"note":"5,9 mio. er forældet; Danmarks Statistik: over 6 mio. fra maj 2025, Lex: 6,0 mio. (2026). Rettet med årstal."},"num|Hvor mange medlemmer har et fodboldhold på banen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/fodbold","d":"lex.dk","q":"Fodbold spilles af to hold a 11 spillere, som forsøger at få bolden ind i modstandernes mål.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fodbold","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Fodbold er en holdsport spillet af to hold á 11 spillere og 1 dommer","ok":true}],"note":"Hver side har 11 spillere på banen."},"num|Hvilket år blev Lego grundlagt?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.lego.com/en-us/aboutus/lego-group/the-lego-group-history","d":"lego.com","q":"The LEGO Group was founded in 1932 by Ole Kirk Kristiansen.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lego","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"legetøjskoncern grundlagt 10. august 1932 af Ole Kirk Christiansen","ok":true}],"note":"Lego blev grundlagt i 1932."},"num|Hvilket år blev Carlsberg grundlagt?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Carlsberg","d":"lex.dk","q":"Carlsberg blev grundlagt i 1847 af J.C. Jacobsen","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carlsberg","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Carlsberg Group er et dansk bryggeriselskab grundlagt i 1847 af J.C. Jacobsen.","ok":true}],"note":"Carlsberg blev grundlagt i 1847."},"num|Hvilket år blev Danmarks Grundlov underskrevet første gang?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danmarks_Riges_Grundlov","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Den første demokratiske grundlov, Junigrundloven, blev underskrevet den 5. juni 1849 af Frederik 7.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Danmarks_Riges_Grundlov","d":"lex.dk","q":"den første danske grundlov (Junigrundloven), der blev stadfæstet af Frederik 7. den 5. juni 1849","ok":true}],"note":"Junigrundloven blev underskrevet af Frederik 7. den 5. juni 1849."},"num|Hvilket år begyndte Reformationen (Luthers 95 teser)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Martin_Luther","d":"lex.dk","q":"Luther protesterede imod kirkens handel med aflad i sine 95 teser, der blev offentliggjort i Wittenberg 31.10. 1517.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/martin-luther-posts-95-theses","d":"history.com","q":"On October 31, 1517, legend has it that the priest and scholar Martin Luther approaches the door of the Castle Church","ok":true}],"note":"Luthers 95 teser blev offentliggjort 31. oktober 1517."},"num|Hvilket år opdagede Columbus Amerika?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/columbus-reaches-the-new-world","d":"history.com","q":"After sailing across the Atlantic Ocean, Italian explorer Christopher Columbus sights a Bahamian island on October 12, 1492","ok":true},{"u":"https://education.nationalgeographic.org/resource/columbus-makes-landfall-caribbean/","d":"education.nationalgeographic.org","q":"This marked the first known European contact with the Americas.","ok":true}],"note":"Columbus nåede Amerika (Bahamas) 12. oktober 1492, den første kendte europæiske kontakt i denne periode."},"num|Hvilket år var første menneske på Månen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Apollo_11","d":"lex.dk","q":"Landingen skete den 20. juli 1969","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_11","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Armstrong became the first human to walk on the Moon approximately six hours after landing","ok":true}],"note":"Apollo 11 landede 20. juli 1969, og Armstrong var første menneske på Månen."},"num|Hvilket år brød Første Verdenskrig ud?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/1._Verdenskrig","d":"lex.dk","q":"1. Verdenskrig var en krig, der brød ud den 28. juli 1914","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"(28 July 1914 – 11 November 1918), also known as the Great War, was a global conflict","ok":true}],"note":"Krigen brød ud 28. juli 1914."},"num|Hvilket år sluttede Anden Verdenskrig i Europa?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/2._Verdenskrig","d":"lex.dk","q":"Krigen sluttede med Tysklands kapitulation den 8. maj 1945 og Japans kapitulation den 15. august 1945.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/End_of_World_War_II_in_Europe","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"World War II ended in Europe in May 1945.","ok":true}],"note":"Krigen i Europa sluttede med Tysklands kapitulation 8. maj 1945."},"num|Hvilket år blev Danmark medlem af EF (EU's forgænger)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://european-union.europa.eu/principles-countries-history/country-profiles/denmark_en","d":"european-union.europa.eu","q":"EU Member State: since 1 January 1973","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/det_danske_EU-medlemskab","d":"lex.dk","q":"Det danske medlemskab af EU begyndte med Danmarks indtræden i EF, som blev besluttet i 1972 og trådte i kraft den 1. januar 1973.","ok":true}],"note":"Danmark blev medlem 1. januar 1973."},"num|Hvilket år var Genforeningen med Sønderjylland?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Genforeningen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Genforeningen er de sønderjyske landsdeles genforening med Danmark 9. juli 1920.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genforeningen_i_1920","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Sønderjylland var blevet genforenet med Danmark den 15. juni 1920","ok":true}],"note":"Genforeningen fandt sted i 1920 (formelt 15. juni, markeret 9./10. juli 1920)."},"num|Hvilket år blev Frederik X konge?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frederik_10.","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Han blev konge den 14. januar 2024 efter sin mor Dronning Margrethe 2.s abdikation.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Frederik_10._-_konge_af_Danmark","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den 14. januar 2024 blev kronprins Frederik udråbt som kong Frederik 10.","ok":true}],"note":"Frederik X blev konge 14. januar 2024."},"num|Hvilket år stemte Danmark nej til euroen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2000_Danish_euro_referendum","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A referendum on joining the Eurozone was held in Denmark on 28 September 2000.[1] It was rejected by 53.2% of voters","ok":true},{"u":"https://danmarkshistorien.lex.dk/Danmarks_medlemskab_af_EF_og_EU,_efter_1972","d":"danmarkshistorien.lex.dk","q":"Det forsøgte man med euroen i 2000, men danskerne sagde med et flertal på 53,1 % nej.","ok":true}],"note":"Folkeafstemningen var 28. september 2000 med flertal for nej."},"num|Hvilket år åbnede Øresundsbroen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Øresundsforbindelsen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Øresundsforbindelsen, fast forbindelse over Øresund mellem Amager og Skåne; indviet 1.7.2000.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Øresundsbroen","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"der blev indviet 1. juli 2000","ok":true}],"note":"Øresundsforbindelsen blev indviet 1. juli 2000."},"num|Hvilket år udkom den første iPhone?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/iPhone","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den første iPhone blev lanceret af Apple i 2007","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPhone","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"blev præsenteret af Apples direktør Steve Jobs i januar 2007 og sendt i handelen i juni 2007.","ok":true}],"note":"Præsenteret januar 2007, i handelen juni 2007."},"num|Hvilket år blev Google grundlagt?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Google","d":"lex.dk","q":"grundlagt i Mountain View, Silicon Valley, Californien, i 1998 af Larry Page","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Founded September 4, 1998","ok":true}],"note":"Google blev grundlagt i 1998."},"num|Hvilket år blev Facebook lanceret?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Facebook","d":"lex.dk","q":"Facebook blev grundlagt i 2004 af Mark Zuckerberg","ok":true},{"u":"https://about.meta.com/company-info/","d":"about.meta.com","q":"Da Facebook blev lanceret i 2004, ændrede det den måde, mennesker skaber forbindelser på.","ok":true}],"note":"Facebook blev lanceret/grundlagt i 2004 (4. februar)."},"num|Hvilket år udkom den første Harry Potter-bog i Storbritannien?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_and_the_Philosopher%27s_Stone","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The book was first published in the United Kingdom on 26 June 1997 by Bloomsbury.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sothebys.com/en/articles/the-very-first-appearance-of-harry-potter","d":"sothebys.com","q":"when 26 June 1997 arrived the first edition was finally published.","ok":true}],"note":"Udkom i UK 26. juni 1997."},"num|Hvilket år udkom den første Star Wars-film?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Star_Wars_(film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It was released in a small number of theaters in the United States on May 25, 1977","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Star_Wars","d":"lex.dk","q":"De tre oprindelige film, senere omdøbt til Star Wars: Episode IV: A New Hope (1977)","ok":true}],"note":"Premiere 25. maj 1977."},"num|Hvilket år blev Eiffeltårnet åbnet?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Eiffeltårnet","d":"lex.dk","q":"Tårnet blev opført til verdensudstillingen i 1889","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"it was constructed as the centrepiece of the 1889 World's Fair, and to crown the centennial anniversary of the French Revolution","ok":true}],"note":"Bygget til verdensudstillingen 1889, åbnet 1889."},"num|Hvilket år brød Den Franske Revolution ud?":{"pool":"num","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://kids.britannica.com/kids/article/French-Revolution/353712","d":"","q":"In 1789 the people of France began the French Revolution.","ok":false},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Den_franske_revolution","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"periode med politiske omvæltninger, som fandt sted i Frankrig 1789-1799","ok":true}],"note":"Revolutionen begyndte i 1789."},"num|Hvor mange minutter er en halvleg i håndbold?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/håndbold","d":"lex.dk","q":"Spilletiden er for både dame- og herrehold med spillere over 18 år 2×30 minutter","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Handball","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A standard match consists of two periods of 30 minutes","ok":true}],"note":"Standardkamp er 2×30 minutter."},"num|Hvor mange minutter varer en ishockeykamp (netto)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/ishockey","d":"lex.dk","q":"består af tre perioder a 20 minutters effektiv spilletid","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ice_hockey","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A professional ice hockey game consists of three periods of twenty minutes","ok":true}],"note":"3 perioder à 20 minutters effektiv spilletid = 60 min."},"num|Hvor mange sekunder har en time?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/time","d":"lex.dk","q":"1 h = 60 min = 3600 s","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hour","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"defined contemporarily as exactly 3,600 seconds","ok":true}],"note":"1 time = 3600 sekunder."},"num|Hvor mange dage går der på Jorden om at kredse om Solen (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"It takes 365.25 days to complete one trip around the Sun.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jorden","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"svarer til 365,256 dage i soltid","ok":true}],"note":"Omkring 365 dage (365,25 / 365,256)."},"num|Hvor mange måner har Mars?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/mars/moons/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"Mars has two moons, Phobos and Deimos.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Mars","d":"lex.dk","q":"Mars har to måner, Phobos og Deimos","ok":true}],"note":"Mars har to måner: Phobos og Deimos."},"num|Hvor mange måner har Jorden?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Moon is the only natural satellite of Earth","ok":true},{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/moon/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"only natural satellite. It goes around the Earth at a distance of about","ok":true}],"note":"Jorden har én naturlig måne (Månen)."},"num|Hvor mange procent af Jorden er dækket af hav (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ocean","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The ocean is the body of salt water that covers approximately 70.8% of Earth","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.noaa.gov/jetstream/ocean","d":"","q":"because nearly 71% of the Earth","ok":false},{"u":"https://oceanservice.noaa.gov/facts/oceanwater.html","d":"oceanservice.noaa.gov","q":"The ocean covers more than 70 percent of the surface of our planet.","ok":true}],"note":"Havet dækker ca. 70,8 % af Jordens overflade, dvs. ca. 71 %."},"num|Hvor mange procent af kroppen er vand (voksen, ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.usgs.gov/special-topics/water-science-school/science/water-you-water-and-human-body","d":"usgs.gov","q":"Up to 60% of the human adult body is water.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Body_water","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"By weight, the average adult human is approximately 60% water","ok":true}],"note":"En voksen krop består af ca. 60 % vand."},"num|Hvor mange liter blod har en voksen (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diagnostics/16793-blood-volume-testing","d":"my.clevelandclinic.org","q":"The average blood volume of an adult is about 5 liters.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blood","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The average adult has a blood volume of roughly 5 litres","ok":true}],"note":"En voksen har ca. 5 liter blod."},"num|Hvor mange kilo vejer en hjerne (voksen, ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_brain","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The adult human brain weighs on average about 1.2–1.4 kg","ok":true},{"u":"https://faculty.washington.edu/chudler/ffacts.html","d":"faculty.washington.edu","q":"The adult human brain weighs about 3 pounds (1,300-1,400 g).","ok":true}],"note":"Kilderne angiver et spænd på 1,2–1,4 kg / 1.300–1.400 g; 1,4 er den øvre grænse, ikke et gennemsnit. 1,3 kg er et mere retvisende 'ca.'-svar."},"num|Hvor mange timer sover en kat i døgnet (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bluecross.org.uk/advice/cat/behaviour-and-training/why-do-cats-sleep-so-much","d":"","q":"On average, cats sleep for around 15 hours per day.","ok":false},{"u":"https://www.petmd.com/cat/behavior/why-do-cats-sleep-so-much","d":"petmd.com","q":"Cats sleep between 12–16 hours a day.","ok":true}],"note":"Katte sover typisk 12–16 timer i døgnet; ca. 15 timer er et gængs gennemsnit (Blue Cross)."},"num|Hvor mange år kan en galapagos-kæmpeskildpadde blive (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.philadelphiazoo.org/animals/galapagos-tortoise","d":"philadelphiazoo.org","q":"In the wild, Galapagos tortoises can live for over 100 years","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Galápagos_tortoise","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"With lifespans in the wild of over 100 years","ok":true}],"note":"150 år understøttes ikke; kilderne siger over 100 år i naturen (og op til 177 i fangenskab). Rettet til en formulering med 100 år som minimum."},"num|Hvor mange meter er Frihedsgudinden inklusive piedestal (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Statue_of_Liberty","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Foundation of pedestal (ground level) to tip of torch 305 ft 1 in 93 m","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nps.gov/stli/learn/historyculture/statue-statistics.htm","d":"nps.gov","q":"Ground to tip of torch 305'1\" 92.99m","ok":true}],"note":"Fra fundamentets/piedestalens jordniveau til fakkelens spids er der 305 fod 1 tomme, ca. 93 m."},"num|Hvor mange Grand Slam-turneringer er der årligt i tennis?":{"pool":"num","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Slam_(tennis)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The individual Grand Slam tournaments consist of the four majors","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.atptour.com/en/news/grand-slams-tournaments-records-stats","d":"","q":"A Career Grand Slam is when a player wins all four Grand Slam tournaments at least once.","ok":false}],"note":"Der er fire Grand Slam-turneringer: Australian Open, French Open, Wimbledon og US Open."},"num|Hvor mange tusinde km er Den Kinesiske Mur officielt (ca.)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Wall_of_China","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"spanning 21,196.18 km (13,170.70 mi) in total","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.cbc.ca/news/world/great-wall-of-china-even-longer-than-previously-thought-1.1263111","d":"cbc.ca","q":"is 21,196 kilometers long, about two and a half times longer than previously thought","ok":true}],"note":"Den officielle kinesiske opmåling fra 2012 giver 21.196 km, dvs. ca. 21 tusinde km."},"num|Hvor ofte males Eiffeltårnet helt om i gennemsnit (hvert hvilket år)?":{"pool":"num","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.toureiffel.paris/en/the-monument/painting-eiffel-tower","d":"","q":"an average of once every 7 years","ok":false},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"applying 60 tons of paint every 7 years","ok":true}],"note":"Tårnet males i gennemsnit hvert 7. år, og hver gang bruges ca. 60 tons maling."},"num|Hvor mange gram vejer en nyfødt kæmpepanda cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://today.duke.edu/2019/12/why-are-giant-pandas-born-so-tiny","d":"today.duke.edu","q":"giant pandas typically weigh about 100 grams at birth","ok":true},{"u":"https://nationalzoo.si.edu/animals/giant-panda","d":"nationalzoo.si.edu","q":"A newborn cub weighs 3-5 ounces and is about the size of a stick of butter.","ok":true},{"u":"https://nationalzoo.si.edu/animals/giant-panda","d":"nationalzoo.si.edu","q":"Pink, hairless, and blind, the cub is 1/900th the size of its mother.","ok":true}],"note":"Svaret ca. 100 g er korrekt, men Smithsonian angiver 3-5 ounces (ca. 85-140 g), ikke gram direkte; noten er rettet så den matcher kilden."},"num|Hvilket år blev Coca-Cola opfundet i Atlanta?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.coca-colacompany.com/about-us/history","d":"coca-colacompany.com","q":"On May 8, 1886, Dr. John Pemberton brought his perfected syrup to Jacobs","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coca-Cola","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Coca-Cola was invented in the late 19th century by John Stith Pemberton in Atlanta","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.toureiffel.paris/en/the-monument/history","d":"","q":"On March 31, 1889, the Tower was completed in record time","ok":false}],"note":"Coca-Cola blev skabt i Atlanta i 1886; Eiffeltårnet stod færdigt/blev indviet 31. marts 1889, altså tre år senere."},"tf|Jordbær er botanisk set bær.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berry","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Fruits commonly considered berries but excluded by the botanical definition include strawberries","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/57477-why-are-bananas-considered-berries.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"But the banana is a berry, scientifically speaking, as are eggplants, grapes and oranges.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/57477-why-are-bananas-considered-berries.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"Tomatoes, peppers, cranberries, eggplants and kiwis come from a flower with one ovary, and so are also berries","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt: jordbær er ikke ægte bær (samlefrugt/skinfrugt), mens banan og tomat botanisk er bær."},"tf|Blæksprutter har blåt blod.":{"pool":"tf","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/science-nature/ten-wild-facts-about-octopuses-they-have-three-hearts-big-brains-and-blue-blood-7625828/","d":"","q":"the copper in octopus blood makes it appear blue","ok":false},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hemocyanin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Oxygenation causes a color change between the colorless Cu(I) deoxygenated form and the blue Cu(II) oxygenated form.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hemocyanin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Hemocyanin was first discovered in Octopus vulgaris by Leon Fredericq in 1878.","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt: hæmocyanin indeholder kobber og gør blodet blåt (gælder blæksprutter/octopus)."},"tf|Honning kan holde sig spiseligt i tusindvis af år.":{"pool":"tf","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honey","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Samples of honey discovered in archaeological contexts have proven edible even after millennia.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/science-nature/the-science-behind-honeys-eternal-shelf-life-1218690","d":"","q":"Through millennia, the archeologists discover, the food remains unspoiled","ok":false}],"note":"Korrekt: velopbevaret honning fordærves ikke; prøver fra arkæologiske fund er spiselige efter årtusinder."},"tf|Vombatter laver terningeformet bæ.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wombat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"As wombats arrange these feces to mark territories and attract mates","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-australia-46258616","d":"bbc.com","q":"they use the piles to mark territory","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wombat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Wombats leave distinctive cube-shaped faeces","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt: vombatters afføring er kubeformet, og den bruges til at markere territorium (og tiltrække mage)."},"tf|Guldfisk har kun 3 sekunders hukommelse.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goldfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Goldfish have a memory span of at least three months","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/goldfish-memory.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"they definitely last longer than 3 seconds","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt falsk: myten er afkræftet; guldfisk husker i uger til måneder."},"tf|Kleopatra levede tættere på månelandingen end på bygningen af Cheops-pyramiden.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.worldatlas.com/articles/so-cleopatra-lived-closer-in-time-to-the-first-lunar-landing-than-the-great-pyramids.html","d":"worldatlas.com","q":"Cleopatra was born ~2,500 years after the Great Pyramid at Giza was built, and ~2,000 years before the first lunar landing.","ok":true},{"u":"https://kids.nationalgeographic.com/history/article/ancient-egypt","d":"kids.nationalgeographic.com","q":"last pharaoh, lived closer to our time than to the building of the Pyramids at Giza.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nasa.gov/mission/apollo-11/","d":"nasa.gov","q":"Astronaut Buzz Aldrin stands on the Moon facing a U.S. flag during the Apollo 11 mission in July 1969.","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt: pyramiden ca. 2560 f.Kr., Kleopatra født 69 f.Kr., månelanding 1969 (ca. 2.500 år vs. ca. 2.000 år)."},"tf|Napoleon var usædvanligt lille.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.napoleon.org/en/history-of-the-two-empires/articles/was-napoleon-small","d":"napoleon.org","q":"Napoleon was therefore of average height for his time","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Napoleon_complex","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"which equals around 1.67 metres or just under 5 feet 6 inches","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Napoleon_complex","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Though Napoleon was close to average height for his era","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt falsk: ca. 1,67-1,69 m, omtrent gennemsnitlig for sin tid (forvekslet fransk/engelsk tomme)."},"tf|Vikinger bar hjelme med horn.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/MYTE_Havde_vikingernes_hjelme_horn%3F","d":"lex.dk","q":"blandt andet ved at bruge hjelme med horn til kostumerne","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carl_Emil_Doepler","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"widely credited with starting the popular myth that Viking warriors wore horned helmets","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.scandinavianarchaeology.com/the-debunked-helmet","d":"scandinavianarchaeology.com","q":"Doepler was commissioned by Wagner himself to create appropriate costumes for the premiere of The Ring in 1876.","ok":true}],"note":"Påstanden er falsk, men 'myte fra 1800-tallets opera' er upræcist: myten stammer fra 1800-tallets kunst/romantik og især Doeplers kostumer til Wagners Nibelungens Ring (1"},"tf|Mennesker bruger kun 10 % af hjernen.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ten-percent-of-the-brain_myth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"all areas of the brain have a function and that they are used nearly all the time","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/do-people-only-use-10-percent-of-their-brains/","d":"scientificamerican.com","q":"is so wrong it is almost laughable, says neurologist Barry Gordon","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt falsk: 10 %-myten er afkræftet; alle hjerneområder har en funktion og bruges næsten hele tiden."},"tf|Flamingoer er lyserøde på grund af deres føde.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flamingo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"adults range from light pink to bright red due to aqueous bacteria and beta-carotene obtained from their food supply","ok":true},{"u":"https://nationalzoo.si.edu/animals/american-flamingo","d":"nationalzoo.si.edu","q":"A pigment in their food gives their feathers their flamboyant pink color.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flamingo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Flamingos are omnivores who filter-feed on brine shrimp","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt: farven kommer fra pigmenter (karotenoider) i føden som rejer og alger/bakterier."},"tf|Lynet slår aldrig ned samme sted to gange.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.weather.gov/safety/lightning-myths","d":"weather.gov","q":"The Empire State Building is hit an average of 23 times a year","ok":true},{"u":"https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/30872/","d":"svs.gsfc.nasa.gov","q":"the Empire State Building is hit approximately 23 times a year","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.csmonitor.com/Science/2013/1031/10-common-scientific-misconceptions/Lightning-never-strikes-the-same-place-twice","d":"csmonitor.com","q":"is actually struck about 25 times per year","ok":true}],"note":"Påstanden er falsk, men '20-25 gange' er upræcist; NWS/NASA angiver gennemsnitligt 23 gange om året, andre kilder ca. 25."},"tf|Venus bruger længere tid på at rotere om sig selv end på at kredse om Solen.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/venus/venus-facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"longer even than a Venus year (one trip around the Sun), which takes only 225 Earth days","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Venus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"lasts longer than a Venusian year, 224.7 Earth days","ok":true},{"u":"https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/planetary/factsheet/venusfact.html","d":"nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov","q":"Sidereal orbit period (days) 224.701","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt: rotation ca. 243 jorddøgn, omløb ca. 225 (224,7) jorddøgn."},"tf|Sommerfugle smager med fødderne.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Butterfly","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Taste receptors are located on the palps and on the feet.","ok":true},{"u":"https://carleton.ca/biology/description/do-butterflies-really-taste-through-their-feet/","d":"carleton.ca","q":"Butterflies do indeed have contact chemoreceptors on their feet","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt: sommerfugle har kemoreceptorer/smagsreceptorer på fødderne (tarsi)."},"tf|Vandmænd har en hjerne.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://oceanservice.noaa.gov/facts/jellyfish.html","d":"oceanservice.noaa.gov","q":"Lacking brains, blood, or even hearts, jellyfish are pretty simple critters.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jellyfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Although they lack a true brain, cnidarian jellyfish have a","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt falsk: vandmænd mangler hjerne og har et nervenet."},"tf|Katte kan ikke smage sødt.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"leaving them with no ability to taste sweetness","ok":true},{"u":"https://journals.plos.org/plosgenetics/article?id=10.1371/journal.pgen.0010003","d":"journals.plos.org","q":"do not prefer and may be unable to detect the sweetness of sugars","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt: en genmutation i søde-smagsreceptoren gør, at katte ikke kan smage sødt."},"tf|Tomater blev engang anset for giftige i Europa.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.uvm.edu/extension/news/history-tomatoes","d":"uvm.edu","q":"Because the tomato was mistakenly considered to be poisonous by many","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.europeana.eu/en/exhibitions/edible-plants-from-the-americas/tomato","d":"europeana.eu","q":"it was initially cultivated as an ornamental plant and was considered to be toxic.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tomato","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"it was understood to be related to the nightshades and assumed to be poisonous","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt: tomater blev mistænkt for at være giftige pga. slægtskabet med natskygge."},"tf|Bævere har orange tænder.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.acs.org/pressroom/presspacs/2024/april/iron-rich-enamel-protects-but-doesnt-color-rodents-orange-brown-incisors.html","d":"","q":"as was previously thought, but from a thin surface layer","ok":false},{"u":"https://www.mpg.de/22034748/rodents-dentistry","d":"mpg.de","q":"Rodent incisors are striking due to their characteristic orange-brown colour.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beaver","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"covered in a thick enamel that is colored orange or reddish-brown by iron compounds","ok":true}],"note":"Påstanden er sand, men forklaringen 'jern i emaljen' er forældet: ny forskning (2024) viser, at jernrig emalje beskytter tænderne, mens den orange farve kommer fra et ove"},"tf|Delfiner kan sove med kun den ene halvdel af hjernen ad gangen.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8742503/","d":"pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov","q":"cetaceans have the slow waves in one half of their brain at a time","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bottlenose_dolphin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"During the sleeping cycle, one brain hemisphere remains active, while the other hemisphere shuts down.","ok":true}],"note":"Korrekt: unihemisfærisk søvn er påvist hos flaskenæsedelfiner."},"tf|Bananer er svagt radioaktive.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.epa.gov/radtown/natural-radioactivity-food","d":"epa.gov","q":"Bananas are a good source of potassium in your diet and a small fraction of all potassium is radioactive.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Banana_equivalent_dose","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bananas contain naturally occurring radioactive isotopes, particularly potassium-40","ok":true}],"note":"Bananer indeholder naturligt radioaktivt kalium-40; dosis er meget lille (ca. 0,1 µSv). Påstand og forklaring er korrekte."},"tf|Isbjørnes pels er egentlig gennemsigtig.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polar_bear","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The transparent guard hairs forward scatter ultraviolet light between the underfur and the skin","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.earthrangers.com/EN/CA/risk/polar-bears-have-clear-hair-so-why-do-they-look-white/","d":"earthrangers.com","q":"Polar bear hair is actually mostly clear and their skin is black!","ok":true}],"note":"Isbjørnens hår er uden pigment/gennemsigtigt og huden er sort; pelsen virker hvid pga. lysspredning."},"tf|Lake Hillier i Western Australia er kendt for sin lyserøde farve.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Hillier","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The pink colour is believed to be due to the presence of the organism","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Hillier","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In recent years, Lake Hillier's iconic pink colour has noticeably faded, partially due to a high volume of rainfall diluting the lake's salt levels.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/environment/article/western-australia-pink-lakes-travel","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"This time the change in color was caused by an unprecedented rainfall event which dropped large amounts of freshwater onto the lake, lowering its salinity","ok":true}],"note":"Søen er kendt for sin lyserøde farve, som tilskrives Dunaliella salina, og farven er blegnet efter kraftig regn i 2022."},"tf|Rød farve gør tyre rasende.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bullfighting","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the bull is incited to charge by the movement of the muleta","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/33700-bulls-charge-red.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"Bulls, along with all other cattle, are color-blind to red","ok":true}],"note":"Myte: tyre er farveblinde for rød og reagerer på kapens bevægelse. Falsk-markering og forklaring er korrekte."},"tf|Tungen har fire afgrænsede smagszoner (sødt, surt, salt, bittert).":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tongue_map","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"every taste sensation can come from all regions of the tongue","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.health.harvard.edu/diet-and-nutrition/the-myth-of-tongue-and-taste","d":"health.harvard.edu","q":"Taste buds that identify each of the five tastes are found all over the tongue","ok":true}],"note":"Tungekortet er en myte; alle smagskvaliteter registreres over hele tungen."},"tf|Mennesker har flere kromosomer end kartofler.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.thetech.org/ask-a-geneticist/articles/2017/chromosome-number-not-correlated-complexity/","d":"thetech.org","q":"Over millions of years, potatoes happened to end up with 48 and we ended up with 46.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Potato","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"tetraploid with 48 chromosomes","ok":true}],"note":"Mennesket har 46 kromosomer, den almindelige dyrkede kartoffel (S. tuberosum) har 48. Påstanden er falsk som markeret."},"tf|Man kan ikke kilde sig selv.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tickling","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"this is why most people cannot effectively tickle themselves","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/notesandqueries/query/0,5753,-13672,00.html","d":"theguardian.com","q":"when you try to tickle yourself, the cerebellum predicts the sensation and this prediction is used to cancel the response of other brain areas to the tickle","ok":true}],"note":"Absolut formulering er upræcis: de fleste kan ikke kilde sig selv effektivt, men fx nogle med skizofreni kan, og forsinkelse kan give kildren. Gjort mere præcis."},"tf|Danmark har flere grise end indbyggere.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.dst.dk/nyt/53927","d":"dst.dk","q":"Den danske svinebestand var 11,6 mio. svin pr. 1. januar 2025.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dyrenesbeskyttelse.dk/artikler/danmark-har-stadig-verdensrekord-i-grise","d":"dyrenesbeskyttelse.dk","q":"Pr. 1. januar 2025 var der 11,6 millioner grise herhjemme.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denmark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Denmark's population is over 6 million","ok":true}],"note":"Grisebestanden er faldet: 11,6 mio. pr. 1. jan. 2025 (ikke 12-13 mio.). Stadig næsten dobbelt så mange som de ca. 6 mio. indbyggere."},"tf|Giraffer sover mere end 10 timer i døgnet.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giraffe","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Studies in captivity found that giraffes sleep intermittently around 4.6 hours per day, mostly at night.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.chesterzoo.org/news/celebrating-world-giraffe-day-how-do-giraffes-sleep","d":"chesterzoo.org","q":"Northern giraffes only sleep for around 30 minutes a day in the wild","ok":true}],"note":"Påstanden er falsk, men forklaringen er upræcis: giraffer sover ca. 4,6 timer i fangenskab og i naturen kun omkring 30 minutter."},"tf|Koalaer har fingeraftryk, der ligner menneskers.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.pbs.org/wgbh/nova/article/koala-fingerprints/","d":"pbs.org","q":"Koalas have fingerprints almost identical to ours","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.mcgill.ca/oss/article/did-you-know/koalas-have-fingerprints-just-humans","d":"mcgill.ca","q":"Koalas have fingerprints just like humans","ok":true}],"note":"Koalaer har fingeraftryk, der næsten er identiske med menneskers, selv under mikroskop (Henneberg, 1996)."},"tf|Et menneskes ører holder helt op med at vokse som voksen.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ear","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"continue to grow steadily in circumference (about 0.5 millimeters a year) throughout life","ok":true},{"u":"https://flushinghospital.org/newsletter/truth-or-myth-our-nose-and-our-ears-never-stop-growing/","d":"flushinghospital.org","q":"our nose and our ears do get bigger, but not because they are growing","ok":true}],"note":"Ører bliver gennemsnitligt større med alderen (ca. 0,5 mm om året i omkreds), men om det er egentlig vækst eller tyngdekraft/hudændringer er omdiskuteret; derfor omformul"},"tf|Strudse stikker hovedet i sandet, når de er bange.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.clevelandzoosociety.org/z/2020/03/11/truth-or-tail-do-ostriches-really-bury-their-head-in-the-sand-when-scared-or-frightened","d":"clevelandzoosociety.org","q":"Contrary to the popular myth, ostriches do not bury their head in the sand when scared or frightened.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.mcgill.ca/oss/article/did-you-know/ostriches-do-not-really-stick-their-heads-sand","d":"mcgill.ca","q":"Despite popular misconception, ostriches do not stick their heads in the sand.","ok":true}],"note":"Veldokumenteret myte; strudse stikker ikke hovedet i sandet."},"tf|Bananer er botanisk set bær.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.mcgill.ca/oss/article/did-you-know/bananas-are-berries-raspberries-are-not","d":"mcgill.ca","q":"Blackberries, mulberries, and raspberries are not berries at all, but bananas, pumpkins, avocados and cucumbers are.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berry_(botany)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"but exclude certain fruits that meet the culinary definition of berries","ok":true}],"note":"Bananer er botanisk set bær, jordbær er ikke (samlenøddefrugt/uægte frugt)."},"tf|Bly er tungere end guld.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/guld","d":"lex.dk","q":"Densitet 19,31 g/cm","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/bly","d":"lex.dk","q":"Densitet 11,35 g/cm","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lead","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"tungsten and gold are both 19.3","ok":true}],"note":"Falsk som markeret, men 'næsten dobbelt så tungt' er overdrevet: guld 19,3 g/cm³ mod bly 11,3 g/cm³ er ca. 1,7 gange."},"tf|Vand koger ved 100 °C på toppen af Mount Everest.":{"pool":"tf","status":"delvist","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boiling_point","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the boiling point of water is 71 °C (160 °F)","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.lpi.usra.edu/education/explore/ice/background/allAboutWater/","d":"","q":"At the lower atmospheric pressure on the top of Mount Everest, pure water boils at about 154 °F (68°C).","ok":false}],"note":"Falsk som markeret, men kilderne giver 68-71 °C; 'omkring 71' er for præcist. Rettet til omkring 70 °C."},"tf|Hajer har eksisteret længere end træer.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.nhm.ac.uk/discover/shark-evolution-a-450-million-year-timeline.html","d":"nhm.ac.uk","q":"The earliest fossil evidence for sharks or their ancestors are a few scales dating to 450 million years ago, during the Late Ordovician Period.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tree","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"(about 385 million years ago)","ok":true}],"note":"Sandt (hajer ca. 450 mio. år, tidligste træer ca. 385 mio. år). Træernes tal rettet fra 380 til 385 iht. kilden."},"tf|Wombatters afføring er kubeformet.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wombat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"it is believed that the cubic shape makes them more stackable and less likely to roll","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-australia-46258616","d":"bbc.com","q":"they use the piles to mark territory","ok":true}],"note":"Wombatter producerer kubeformet afføring, som de bruger til at markere territorium."},"tf|Edderkopper er insekter.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edderkopper","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Edderkopper er ikke insekter, men tilhører spindlerne sammen med bl.a. mider, mejere og skorpioner.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edderkopper","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Edderkopper (latin: Araneae) er karakteriseret ved at have en todelt krop, otte ben, spindevorter og giftkirtler.","ok":true},{"u":"https://fieldofmar-e.schools.nsw.gov.au/fact-sheets/invertebrates/arachnids-fact-sheet","d":"fieldofmar-e.schools.nsw.gov.au","q":"Adult arachnids are not insects. Insects have six legs, antennae and three main body parts. Adult arachnids usually have eight legs, no antennae and no wings.","ok":true}],"note":"Edderkopper er spindlere (arachnider) med otte ben og to kropsdele, ikke insekter."},"tf|Tomater er botanisk set frugter.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berry_(botany)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In botany, a berry is a fleshy fruit produced from a single flower containing one ovary.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berry_(botany)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Berries so defined include grapes, currants, and tomatoes","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/tomat","d":"lex.dk","q":"Frugten er et saftigt, to- eller flerrummet, oftest kuglerundt bær med kødede frugtvægge og frøstole","ok":true}],"note":"Botanisk er tomaten en frugt (nærmere bestemt et bær)."},"tf|Guldfisk har kun tre sekunders hukommelse.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.discoverwildlife.com/animal-facts/fish/goldfish-memory","d":"discoverwildlife.com","q":"goldfish can retain memories for at least three months","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/goldfish-memory.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"Goldfish memories can actually last for weeks, months and even years.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goldfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Goldfish have a memory span of at least three months and can distinguish between different shapes, colors, and sounds.","ok":true}],"note":"Myte; guldfisk kan huske i uger og måneder."},"tf|Napoleon var usædvanlig lille af vækst.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Napoleon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In fact, at about 168 cm (5 ft 6 in), he was of average height.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.napoleon.org/en/history-of-the-two-empires/articles/was-napoleon-small/","d":"napoleon.org","q":"equivalent to 1,686 metres","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.napoleon.org/en/history-of-the-two-empires/articles/was-napoleon-small/","d":"napoleon.org","q":"Napoleon was therefore of average height for his time","ok":true}],"note":"Påstanden er falsk, men kilderne angiver 168 cm (Wikipedia) hhv. 1,686 m (Fondation Napoléon); '1,69' er upræcist, så intervallet 1,68–1,69 m bruges."},"tf|Vikinger havde horn på hjelmene.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viking_Age_arms_and_armour","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"there is no evidence that Vikings used horned helmets in battle","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sciencenorway.no/bronze-age-viking-age/no-the-vikings-didnt-wear-helmets-with-horns/1995364","d":"sciencenorway.no","q":"helmets from the Viking Age with horns on them have never been found","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sciencenorway.no/bronze-age-viking-age/no-the-vikings-didnt-wear-helmets-with-horns/1995364","d":"sciencenorway.no","q":"During the premiere of the opera","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horned_helmet","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"initially popularized by the Norse operas of Richard Wagner","ok":true}],"note":"Myte; ingen fund af hornhjelme fra vikingetiden, billedet stammer fra Wagners opera (1876)."},"tf|Den Kinesiske Mur kan ses fra rummet med det blotte øje.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.nasa.gov/image-article/great-wall/","d":"nasa.gov","q":"Despite myths to the contrary, the wall isn't visible from the moon, and is difficult or impossible to see from Earth orbit","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.skyatnightmagazine.com/space-science/can-you-see-great-wall-china-from-space","d":"skyatnightmagazine.com","q":"The truth is that the Great Wall of China cannot be seen from space.","ok":true}],"note":"Myte ifølge NASA og andre; muren kan ikke let ses med det blotte øje fra rummet."},"tf|Danmark har ingen bjerge over 200 meter.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Møllehøj","d":"lex.dk","q":"er Danmarks højeste terrænpunkter","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dr.dk/nyheder/indland/moellehoej-er-danmarks-hoejeste-punkt","d":"dr.dk","q":"Møllehøj er 170,86 meter høj","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Møllehøj","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Møllehøj er Danmarks højeste naturlige jordpunkt.","ok":true}],"note":"Rigtigt for selve Danmark (højeste naturlige punkt 170,86 m), men forklaringen bør præcisere 'naturlige' (menneskeskabte konstruktioner kan være højere) og ikke omfatte G"},"tf|Månen fjerner sig fra Jorden cirka 3,8 cm om året.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Månen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Månen fjerner sig til stadighed fra Jorden med en hastighed af 3,8 centimeter om året","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Månen","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"en målelig forøgelse af afstanden til Månen på 3,82 cm om året","ok":true}],"note":"Ca. 3,8 cm om året bekræftet af to kilder."},"tf|Lyd bevæger sig hurtigere gennem vand end gennem luft.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Speed_of_sound","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In fresh water, sound travels at about 1481 m/s at 20 °C","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Speed_of_sound","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the speed of sound in air is about 343 m/s","ok":true},{"u":"https://oceanservice.noaa.gov/facts/sound.html","d":"oceanservice.noaa.gov","q":"While sound moves at a much faster speed in the water than in air","ok":true}],"note":"Ca. 1481 m/s i ferskvand mod ca. 343 m/s i luft, altså omkring 4,3 gange hurtigere."},"tf|Chokolade kan være giftigt for hunde.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.merckvetmanual.com/toxicology/food-hazards/chocolate-toxicosis-in-animals","d":"merckvetmanual.com","q":"Chocolate poisoning occurs most commonly in dogs","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.merckvetmanual.com/toxicology/food-hazards/chocolate-toxicosis-in-animals","d":"merckvetmanual.com","q":"The primary toxic principles in chocolate are the methylxanthines theobromine","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theobromin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Theobromin er giftigt for hunde, katte, heste, papegøjer","ok":true}],"note":"Theobromin (og koffein) i chokolade er giftigt for hunde."},"tf|Kakerlakker kan overleve flere dage uden hoved.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/fact-or-fiction-cockroach-can-live-without-head/","d":"scientificamerican.com","q":"Headless roaches are capable of living for weeks.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.discoverwildlife.com/animal-facts/insects-invertebrates/how-long-can-a-cockroach-live-without-its-head","d":"discoverwildlife.com","q":"the cockroach can therefore survive for hours or even days with little or no change to body function","ok":true}],"note":"Hovedløse kakerlakker kan leve fra dage til uger."},"tf|Danmark har kun landgrænse til ét land.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.visitdenmark.com/faq/geography","d":"visitdenmark.com","q":"Apart from the 68km-long border (42 miles) with Germany to the south, Denmark is surrounded entirely by water.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denmark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It shares a border of 68 kilometres (42 mi) with Germany to the south.","ok":true}],"note":"Gælder det egentlige Danmark (Tyskland, 68 km). Siden 2022 har Grønland dog en lille grænse til Canada på Hans Ø, så forklaringen præciseres."},"tf|Dannebrog regnes for verdens ældste flag i kontinuerlig brug.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/oldest-continuously-used-national-flag","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The oldest continuously used national flag is that of Denmark.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_of_Denmark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The flag holds the Guinness world record of being the oldest continuously used national flag","ok":true}],"note":"Guinness World Records anerkender Dannebrog som ældste nationalflag i kontinuerlig brug (formuleringen 'regnes for' dækker den skotske Saltire-diskussion)."},"tf|H.C. Andersens «Den lille Havfrue» udkom i 1837.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Den_lille_Havfrue_(eventyr)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Den lille Havfrue er et eventyr skrevet af H. C. Andersen i 1837.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/H.C._Andersen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den lille Havfrue (1837), Keiserens nye Klæder (1837)","ok":true}],"note":"Udkom 1837 i 'Eventyr, fortalt for Børn'."},"tf|Tivoli er verdens ældste forlystelsespark.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dyrehavsbakken","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Med grundlæggelsen i 1583 er Bakken den ældste fortsat eksisterende forlystelsespark i verden.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bakken.dk/om-bakken/","d":"bakken.dk","q":"ligger Bakken, verdens ældste forlystelsespark","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tivoli_Gardens","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The park opened on 15 August 1843","ok":true}],"note":"Falsk: Dyrehavsbakken (1583) er ældre end Tivoli (1843)."},"tf|En blåhvals tunge kan veje lige så meget som en elefant.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/83817-heaviest-tongue","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"which typically weighs 4 tonnes (8,818 lb) - similar to the total body weight of an adult elephant","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbcearth.com/news/the-anatomy-of-a-whale","d":"bbcearth.com","q":"a tongue alone that can weigh as much as an elephant","ok":true}],"note":"Tungen vejer ca. 4 tons, svarende til en voksen elefant."},"tf|Honningbier kan genkende menneskeansigter.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://phys.org/news/2005-12-bees-human.html","d":"phys.org","q":"The bees learned to distinguish the correct face from the wrong one with better than 80 percent accuracy","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/insects-recognize-faces-using-processing-mechanism-similar-to-that-of-humans/","d":"scientificamerican.com","q":"The bees also learned to select a target face from a group of novel human faces.","ok":true}],"note":"Forsøg (Dyer m.fl., 2005) viste, at honningbier kan trænes til at skelne og genkende menneskeansigter."},"tf|Lakrids kan hæve blodtrykket.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bhf.org.uk/informationsupport/heart-matters-magazine/nutrition/ask-the-expert/liquorice","d":"bhf.org.uk","q":"glycyrrhizin can raise blood pressure and cause fluid retention if you eat too much of it","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.rutgers.edu/news/hidden-risks-black-licorice","d":"rutgers.edu","q":"It contains glycyrrhizic acid, which can cause swelling and high blood pressure","ok":true}],"note":"Glycyrrhizin i lakridsrod kan hæve blodtrykket."},"tf|Kaffebønner er i virkeligheden frø fra en frugt.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee_bean","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A coffee bean is a seed from the Coffea plant and the source for coffee.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.aboutcoffee.org/origins/what-is-coffee","d":"aboutcoffee.org","q":"those are actually seeds found inside the cherries (also called the fruit) of coffee trees","ok":true}],"note":"Kaffebønner er frø fra kaffetræets frugt (kaffekirsebær)."},"tf|Pindsvin kan svømme.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://wwf.dk/kaemper-for/natur-i-danmark/pindsvin/bliv-klogere-paa-pindsvin","d":"wwf.dk","q":"Pindsvin er gode svømmere, men hvis de ikke kan komme op af vandet igen, løber de på et tidspunkt tør for kræfter, og drukner.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.hedgehogstreet.org/hadswimming","d":"hedgehogstreet.org","q":"Did you know that hedgehogs can swim? They are actually pretty good at it too.","ok":true}],"note":"Pindsvin kan svømme, men har svært ved at komme op af vandet igen."},"tf|Elefanter kan hoppe.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elephant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Elephants can move both forward and backward, but are incapable of trotting, jumping, or galloping.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/elephants","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"But did you know elephants can't jump?","ok":true}],"note":"Påstanden er falsk (elefanter kan ikke hoppe), men forklaringen 'eneste store pattedyr' er forkert/omstridt (fx næsehorn, flodheste og dovendyr nævnes også); forklaringen"},"tf|Menneskets øjne bliver større, jo ældre man bliver.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.healthline.com/health/do-your-eyes-grow","d":"healthline.com","q":"eyes stop growing in length by the age of 20 or 21 when they reach about 24 millimeters","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.webmd.com/eye-health/eyes-grow","d":"webmd.com","q":"fully grown at about 24 millimeters, a little larger than a peanut.","ok":true}],"note":"Formuleringen er upræcis (øjnene vokser i barndom/teenageår, og linsen vokser livet igennem). Omformuleret til øjeæblets længde, som stopper omkring 20-årsalderen."},"tf|Der lever vilde kameler i Australien.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/article/feral-camels-australia-outback","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"with estimates from several hundred thousand to as many as a million","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feral_camels_in_Australia","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In 2008, the number of feral camels was estimated to be more than one million","ok":true}],"note":"Påstanden er sand, men tallet 300.000 er forældet (2013-skøn efter bekæmpelse); kilderne er uenige om det nuværende antal (flere hundrede tusinde til over en million). Fo"},"tf|Delfiner sover med den ene halvdel af hjernen ad gangen.":{"pool":"tf","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/dolphins-sleep-with-only-half-their-brain-at-a-time-81426439","d":"","q":"Dolphins sleep with only half of their brains at a time","ok":false},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unihemispheric_slow-wave_sleep","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bottlenose dolphins are one specific species of cetaceans that have been proven experimentally to use USWS in order to maintain both swimming patterns and the surfacing f","ok":true}],"note":"Delfiner udviser unihemisfærisk søvn."},"tf|Flamingoer fødes lyserøde.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flamingo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Young flamingos hatch with greyish-red plumage","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sciencefocus.com/nature/why-are-flamingos-pink","d":"sciencefocus.com","q":"Young flamingos flaunt grey/white colour feathers","ok":true}],"note":"Flamingoer klækkes grålige/grå-hvide; den lyserøde farve kommer fra kosten."},"tf|Det er varmere om sommeren, fordi Jorden er tættere på Solen.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://spaceplace.nasa.gov/seasons","d":"spaceplace.nasa.gov","q":"tilted axis causes the seasons","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nesdis.noaa.gov/about/k-12-education/understanding-our-planet/why-does-earth-have-seasons","d":"nesdis.noaa.gov","q":"distance from the sun is not the cause of the seasons","ok":true}],"note":"Årstiderne skyldes jordaksens hældning; Jorden er længst fra Solen i juli."},"tf|Hunde kan slet ikke se farver.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.akc.org/expert-advice/health/can-dogs-see-color","d":"akc.org","q":"The popular notion that dogs only see in black and white is false","ok":true},{"u":"https://vcahospitals.com/know-your-pet/do-dogs-see-color","d":"vcahospitals.com","q":"Dogs possess only two types of cones and can only discern blue and yellow.","ok":true}],"note":"Hunde har dikromatisk syn (blå og gul)."},"tf|Myg kan flyve i regn.":{"pool":"tf","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://coe.gatech.edu/news/2012/06/mosquitoes-fly-rain-thanks-low-mass","d":"coe.gatech.edu","q":"All the mosquitoes survived the collision.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/science-nature/how-do-mosquitoes-fly-in-the-rain-116626497","d":"","q":"instead of standing strong against the drops, or even trying to dodge them, mosquitoes simply go with the flow.","ok":false}],"note":"Myg overlever regndråber pga. lav masse og stærkt eksoskelet."},"tf|En vandmand har ingen hjerne.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://oceanconservancy.org/blog/2023/08/03/do-jellyfish-have-brains","d":"oceanconservancy.org","q":"The short answer is no, jellyfish do not have brains.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.pbs.org/wnet/nature/blog/no-brain-for-jellyfish-no-problem","d":"pbs.org","q":"Jellyfish have no such central place; in fact, they have two nervous systems.","ok":true}],"note":"Vandmænd har et nervenet, ikke en hjerne."},"tf|En snegl kan have tusindvis af tænder.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://nhm.org/stories/microscopic-look-snail-jaws","d":"nhm.org","q":"Snails and slugs eat with a jaw and a flexible band of thousands of microscopic teeth, called a radula.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snail","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Most snails have thousands of microscopic tooth-like structures located on a banded ribbon-like tongue called a radula.","ok":true}],"note":"Sneglens radula er besat med tusindvis af mikroskopiske tænder."},"tf|Alle isbjørne er venstrehåndede.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.mirror.co.uk/science/polar-bears-left-handed-truth-13063212","d":"mirror.co.uk","q":"There is no evidence to support the notion that all great white bears are left pawed.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/polar-bears-left-handed-thea-bechshoft-bechsh%C3%B8ft-","d":"linkedin.com","q":"polar bears seem to be using their left and right paws equally often when digging, catching prey, etc.","ok":true}],"note":"Myte: isbjørne bruger højre og venstre pote lige meget (påstanden er falsk)."},"tf|Flodheste producerer en slags naturlig solcreme.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hipposudoric_acid","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"hipposudoric acid functions both as a natural sunscreen and as an antimicrobial agent","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sciencenews.org/article/red-sweat-hippo-skin-oozes-antibiotic-sunscreen","d":"sciencenews.org","q":"Hippo skin glands release pigments that may prevent infection and sunburn.","ok":true}],"note":"Påstanden er rigtig, men 'Den røde sekret' er grammatisk forkert og upræcist; rettet til Det røde hudsekret."},"tf|Havoddere holder i hånden, når de sover.":{"pool":"tf","status":"delvist","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.discovermagazine.com/sea-otters-hold-hands-while-sleeping-and-they-even-cuddle-46115","d":"","q":"sea otters cuddling and even holding hands (or rather, paws) while sleeping","ok":false},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sea_otter","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Sleeping sea otters holding paws","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sea_otter","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"To keep themselves from drifting out to sea when resting and eating, sea otters may wrap themselves in kelp.","ok":true}],"note":"Adfærden er dokumenteret, men er ret sjælden, især i naturen; kilderne bekræfter kun 'nogle gange' og at de ellers pakker sig ind i tang for ikke at drive væk. Forklaring"},"tf|En kolibri kan flyve baglæns.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://nationalzoo.si.edu/migratory-birds/hummingbirds","d":"nationalzoo.si.edu","q":"they can fly backward and upside-down as well","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.audubon.org/news/hummingbird-flight-nothing-else-bird-world","d":"audubon.org","q":"These talented fliers can hover, whiz forward and backward, and come to a complete stop in an instant.","ok":true}],"note":"Påstanden er sand, men 'som eneste fugl' er omstridt (andre fugle kan flyve baglæns kortvarigt). Forklaringen ændres til noget, kilderne understøtter."},"tf|Nordpolen ligger på land.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Pole","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the North Pole is located in the middle of the Arctic Ocean amid waters that are almost permanently covered with constantly shifting sea ice","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Nordpolen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Havdybden er her 4.087 m, og farvandet er dækket af drivende pakis.","ok":true}],"note":"Nordpolen ligger midt i Ishavet på drivende havis, ikke på land."},"tf|Sydpolen ligger på et kontinent.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Pole","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Situated on the continent of Antarctica","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Antarktis","d":"lex.dk","q":"Antarktis ligger nogenlunde cirkulært omkring Sydpolen og strækker sig ud til polarcirklen.","ok":true}],"note":"Sydpolen ligger på kontinentet Antarktis."},"tf|Alle planeter i solsystemet har måner.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/mercury/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"Mercury doesn't have moons.","ok":true},{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/venus/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"Venus is one of only two planets in our solar system that doesn't have a moon","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Venus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Venus has no moons and a very slow retrograde rotation about its axis","ok":true}],"note":"Merkur og Venus er de to planeter uden måner."},"tf|Jupiter er mere end 1000 gange større end Jorden i volumen.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/jupiter/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"if it were a hollow shell, 1,000 Earths could fit inside","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jupiter","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"giving it a volume 1,321 times that of the Earth","ok":true}],"note":"Jupiters volumen er ca. 1321 gange Jordens (NASA/Wikipedia), altså over 1000 gange."},"tf|Man kan ikke fise i rummet":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.spacecentre.co.uk/news/space-now-blog/grossology/","d":"spacecentre.co.uk","q":"Astronauts break wind much more in space than they usually would back home","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.npr.org/sections/krulwich/2010/09/16/129908529/space-propulsion-made-easy-eat-beans","d":"npr.org","q":"NASA banned flatulence-inducing foods like beans, cabbage, sprouts and broccoli.","ok":true}],"note":"Astronauter fiser i rummet; det er et kendt problem i rumfart."},"tf|Jorden er rund som en perfekt kugle":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Figure_of_the_Earth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the Earth is flattened at the poles and bulged at the equator","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Jorden","d":"lex.dk","q":"Imidlertid er Jorden på grund af sin rotation fladtrykt ved polerne","ok":true}],"note":"Jorden er en oblat sfæroide, fladtrykt ved polerne."},"tf|En kamæleon skifter primært farve for at camouflere sig":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chameleon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"but most commonly in social signalling and reactions to temperature and other conditions","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/kamæleoner","d":"lex.dk","q":"Kamæleoner kan ikke antage farve efter omgivelserne.","ok":true}],"note":"Farveskift bruges mest til signalering og temperatur, ikke primært camouflage."},"tf|Honning fordærves aldrig":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honey","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"when properly stored, honey therefore does not spoil","ok":true},{"u":"https://askdruniverse.wsu.edu/2022/10/07/honey-last-forever/","d":"askdruniverse.wsu.edu","q":"honey is one of the only foods that never spoils","ok":true}],"note":"Absolut 'aldrig' er upræcist: korrekt opbevaret (tæt låg, intet tilsat vand) fordærves honning ikke."},"tf|Tordenvejr kan ramme samme sted to gange":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lightning","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"lightning can, and often does, strike the same place more than once","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.weather.gov/safety/lightning-myths","d":"weather.gov","q":"Lightning often strikes the same place repeatedly, especially if","ok":true}],"note":"Lynet kan og rammer ofte samme sted flere gange."},"tf|Kæmpeskildpadder kan blive over 100 år":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gal%C3%A1pagos_tortoise","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"With lifespans in the wild of over 100 years","ok":true},{"u":"https://nationalzoo.si.edu/animals/aldabra-tortoise","d":"nationalzoo.si.edu","q":"They can reach ages of more than 100 years.","ok":true}],"note":"Kæmpeskildpadder bliver over 100 år."},"tf|Hajer kan ikke få kræft":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Sharks have been known to get cancer.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.cancerresearchuk.org/about-cancer/treatment/complementary-alternative-therapies/individual-therapies/shark-cartilage","d":"cancerresearchuk.org","q":"But this is not true. Sharks can get cancer.","ok":true}],"note":"Det er en myte; hajer får kræft."},"tf|En guldfisk har kun tre sekunders hukommelse":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goldfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Goldfish have a memory span of at least three months","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.discoverwildlife.com/animal-facts/fish/goldfish-memory","d":"discoverwildlife.com","q":"goldfish can retain memories for at least three months, can be trained, and can also tell the time","ok":true}],"note":"Guldfisk kan huske i uger og måneder."},"tf|Tomater er botanisk set bær":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.uvm.edu/extension/news/history-tomatoes","d":"uvm.edu","q":"While botanically a fruit (actually a berry)","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tomato","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is a plant whose fruit is an edible berry that is eaten as a vegetable","ok":true}],"note":"Tomater er botanisk set bær."},"tf|Bananer vokser på træer":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Banana","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The banana plant is the largest herbaceous flowering plant.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/banan","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den er blandt verdens største urter og er ofte trælignende","ok":true}],"note":"Bananplanten er en stor urt med falsk stamme."},"tf|Pingviner lever på den nordlige halvkugle":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.pbs.org/wnet/nature/blog/penguin-fact-sheet","d":"pbs.org","q":"There are 18 species of penguins that live almost exclusively in the Southern Hemisphere, with only one species, the Galápagos penguin, found north of the Equator.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gal%C3%A1pagos_penguin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is the only penguin found north of the equator.","ok":true}],"note":"Galápagospingvinen lever ved og lidt nord for ækvator, så 'nordlige halvkugle' er ikke entydigt forkert. Rettet til en præcis, sand påstand."},"tf|Mennesket har flere end fem sanser":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/60752-human-senses.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"However, there are other human senses in addition to the basic five.","ok":true},{"u":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11252028/","d":"pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov","q":"Both, the vestibular system and proprioception could be acknowledged as senses six or seven.","ok":true}],"note":"Ud over de fem klassiske sanser regnes bl.a. balance og kropsfornemmelse (proprioception) som sanser."},"tf|Venus roterer den modsatte vej af de fleste planeter":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/venus/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"Venus spins slowly in the opposite direction from most planets.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Venus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"a very slow retrograde rotation about its axis","ok":true}],"note":"Venus har retrograd rotation."},"tf|Saturn har en fast overflade":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/saturn/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"The planet is mostly swirling gases and liquids deeper down.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saturn","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"and lacks a definite surface","ok":true}],"note":"Saturn er en gasplanet uden fast overflade."},"tf|Solen er en planet":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solen","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"er den stjerne, som sammen med sit planetsystem udgør solsystemet","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Solen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Solen er den centrale stjerne i Solsystemet og den stjerne, der er nærmest på Jorden.","ok":true}],"note":"Solen er en stjerne, ikke en planet; påstanden er falsk og forklaringen korrekt."},"tf|Mars kaldes den blå planet":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mars_(planet)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Mars kaldes også \"den røde planet\" på grund af sin karakteristiske farve.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Mars","d":"lex.dk","q":"Også kendt som den røde planet","ok":true}],"note":"Mars kaldes den røde planet; påstanden er falsk."},"tf|Oslo er Danmarks hovedstad":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C3%B8benhavn","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"København er Danmarks hovedstad og","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/K%C3%B8benhavn","d":"lex.dk","q":"København er Danmarks hovedstad og største by, beliggende ved Øresund","ok":true}],"note":"København er Danmarks hovedstad; Oslo er Norges. Påstanden er falsk."},"tf|Danmark har et kongehus":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rigsf%C3%A6llesskabet","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Rigsfællesskabet udgør Kongeriget Danmark, hvor alle tre rigsdele indgår i et konstitutionelt monarki under det danske kongehus","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.kongehuset.dk/monarkiet-i-danmark/monarkiet-i-dag","d":"kongehuset.dk","q":"Det danske monarki er ifølge Grundloven konstitutionelt","ok":true}],"note":"Danmark er et konstitutionelt monarki med et kongehus; påstanden er sand."},"tf|Grønland tilhører Danmark som en del af Rigsfællesskabet":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Gr%C3%B8nland","d":"lex.dk","q":"Grønland er en selvstyrende del af kongeriget Danmark og indgår i rigsfællesskab med Danmark og Færøerne.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rigsf%C3%A6llesskabet","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"omfattende rigsdelene Danmark, Færøerne og Grønland","ok":true}],"note":"Grønland er en selvstyrende del af Rigsfællesskabet sammen med Danmark og Færøerne; 'tilhører Danmark' er upræcist, så ordlyden er rettet."},"tf|Færøerne er en del af EU":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faroe_Islands","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the islands are not part of the European Union (EU) today","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/F%C3%A6r%C3%B8erne","d":"lex.dk","q":"aldrig været medlem af EF/EU","ok":true}],"note":"Færøerne har aldrig været med i EU/EF; påstanden er falsk."},"tf|Bornholm ligger i Nordsøen":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bornholm","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bornholm er en dansk ø beliggende i Østersøen","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Bornholm","d":"lex.dk","q":"Bornholm er en ø i Østersøen","ok":true}],"note":"Bornholm ligger i Østersøen; påstanden er falsk."},"tf|Mælkevejen er vores galakse":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/M%C3%A6lkevejen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Mælkevejsgalaksen, der er den spiralgalakse, som Solsystemet befinder sig i","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%A6lkevejen","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Mælkevejen er den galakse som vi befinder os i.","ok":true}],"note":"Solsystemet ligger i Mælkevejsgalaksen; påstanden er sand."},"tf|Lyd bevæger sig hurtigere end lys":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lysets_hastighed","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"bevæger lyset sig cirka en million gange så hurtigt, som lyd","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/lyd","d":"lex.dk","q":"I luft ved 20 °C og et tryk på 1 atmosfære er lydhastigheden ca. 343 m/s (1235 km/t)","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/lysets_hastighed","d":"lex.dk","q":"dvs. ca 300.000 km/s","ok":true}],"note":"Lys er ca. en million gange hurtigere end lyd; påstanden er falsk."},"tf|Is er tungere end vand":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.usgs.gov/water-science-school/science/water-density","d":"usgs.gov","q":"Ice is less dense than liquid water which is why your ice cubes float in your glass.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ice","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Because ice is less dense than liquid water, it floats","ok":true}],"note":"Is er mindre tæt end flydende vand og flyder; påstanden er falsk."},"tf|Diamant er det hårdeste naturlige materiale":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diamant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Diamant er det hårdeste af alle naturlige mineraler (10 på Mohs' hårdhedsskala)","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/diamant","d":"lex.dk","q":"Diamant er det hårdeste mineral, man kender (hårdhed 10)","ok":true}],"note":"Diamant er det hårdeste kendte naturlige mineral (Mohs 10)."},"tf|Guld ruster let":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gold","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Gold does not react with oxygen at any temperature","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/guld","d":"lex.dk","q":"guld ikke som de fleste andre metaller overtrækkes af en oxidfilm","ok":true}],"note":"Guld reagerer ikke med ilt og får ikke oxidlag; påstanden er falsk."},"tf|Elefanter er bange for mus":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.ifaw.org/international/journal/elephant-faq?form=join-int","d":"ifaw.org","q":"elephants are no more afraid of mice than they are of other animals that might quickly scurry past them","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/of-mice-and-then","d":"snopes.com","q":"Elephants are afraid of mice. Status: False.","ok":true}],"note":"Udbredt myte; elefanter er ikke mere bange for mus end for andre dyr, der pludselig render forbi."},"tf|Kameler lagrer vand i deres pukler":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/camel","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"They store fat, not water.","ok":true},{"u":"https://ielc.libguides.com/sdzg/factsheets/extantcamels/characteristics","d":"ielc.libguides.com","q":"Not used for water storage.","ok":true}],"note":"Pukler lagrer fedt, ikke vand; påstanden er falsk."},"tf|Struds stikker hovedet i sandet":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/ostrich","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"Contrary to the popular myth, ostriches do not bury their heads in the sand!","ok":true},{"u":"https://nationalzoo.si.edu/animals/news/how-fast-ostrich-and-more-fun-facts","d":"nationalzoo.si.edu","q":"Both of these behaviors have led to the myth that ostriches bury their heads in the sand.","ok":true}],"note":"Myte; strudse stikker ikke hovedet i sandet."},"tf|Flagermus er blinde":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flagermus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Flagermus er ikke blinde.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.usgs.gov/faqs/are-bats-blind","d":"usgs.gov","q":"No, bats are not blind.","ok":true}],"note":"Flagermus kan se og bruger desuden ekkolokalisation; påstanden er falsk."},"tf|En blæksprutte har otte arme":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bl%C3%A6ksprutte","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"De ægte blæksprutter deles i ottearmede og tiarmede blæksprutter.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nwf.org/Educational-Resources/Wildlife-Guide/Invertebrates/Octopuses","d":"nwf.org","q":"A ring of eight equally-long arms surround the head.","ok":true}],"note":"'Blæksprutte' dækker også tiarmede blæksprutter (otte arme + to fangarme) og nautiler; kun ottearmede blæksprutter (octopus) har otte arme, så ordlyden er præciseret."},"tf|Napoleon var ualmindeligt lav":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Napoleon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In fact, at about 168 cm (5 ft 6 in), he was of average height.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.napoleon.org/en/history-of-the-two-empires/articles/was-napoleon-small/","d":"napoleon.org","q":"Napoleon was therefore of average height for his time","ok":true}],"note":"Napoleon var ca. 168 cm og gennemsnitlig for sin tid; påstanden er falsk."},"tf|Den Kinesiske Mur kan ses fra Månen med det blotte øje":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://eol.jsc.nasa.gov/faq","d":"eol.jsc.nasa.gov","q":"It is not visible from the Moon.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Wall_of_China","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Great Wall of China cannot be seen by the naked human eye from the Moon","ok":true}],"note":"Myte; muren kan ikke ses fra Månen."},"tf|Titanic sank i Nordatlanten":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/titanic-sinks","d":"history.com","q":"the British ocean liner Titanic sinks into the North Atlantic Ocean about 400 miles south of Newfoundland, Canada.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/history/article/titanic","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"The wreck sleeps in darkness, a puzzlement of corroded steel strewn across a thousand acres of the North Atlantic seabed.","ok":true}],"note":"Titanic sank 15. april 1912 i Nordatlanten efter kollision med isbjerg."},"tf|Eiffeltårnet står i Lyon":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is a lattice tower on the Champ de Mars in Paris, France.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Eiffeltårnet","d":"lex.dk","q":"Eiffeltårnet i Paris med Seinen i forgrunden.","ok":true}],"note":"Eiffeltårnet står i Paris, så påstanden er falsk som markeret."},"tf|Tivoli i København åbnede i 1843":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tivoli","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Tivoli blev grundlagt af Georg Carstensen i 1843.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Tivoli","d":"lex.dk","q":"Tivoli er en forlystelsespark i København, der blev anlagt i 1843 på fæstningsterrænet lige uden for Vesterport på initiativ af Georg Carstensen.","ok":true}],"note":"Tivoli åbnede 15. august 1843."},"tf|Niels Bohr fik Nobelprisen i fysik":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Niels_Bohr","d":"lex.dk","q":"Han fik Nobelprisen i fysik i 1922 for sin teori om atomernes struktur.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Niels_Bohr","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In 1922, Bohr was awarded the Nobel Prize in Physics","ok":true}],"note":"Bohr fik Nobelprisen i fysik i 1922."},"tf|H.C. Andersen skrev «Pippi Langstrømpe»":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pippi_Langstrømpe","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Pippi Langstrømpe (svensk: Pippi Långstrump) er en fiktiv børnebogsfigur skabt af Astrid Lindgren.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Pippi_Langstrømpe","d":"lex.dk","q":"Pippi Langstrømpe er hovedperson i tre romaner skrevet i årene 1945-1948 af den svenske forfatter Astrid Lindgren","ok":true}],"note":"Pippi Langstrømpe er skrevet af Astrid Lindgren."},"tf|H.C. Andersen skrev «Den lille havfrue»":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hans_Christian_Andersen","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Blandt de mest berømte er Fyrtøjet, Prinsessen på ærten (1835), Den lille havfrue, Kejserens nye klæder (1837)","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/H.C._Andersen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Han er særligt kendt for en række eventyr og historier, heriblandt Den lille Havfrue (1837)","ok":true}],"note":"Eventyret er af H.C. Andersen (1837)."},"tf|Smørrebrød er en dansk specialitet":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/smørrebrød","d":"lex.dk","q":"Smørrebrød er en væsentlig del af den danske madkultur.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smørrebrød","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Typisk dansk er det pyntede og højt belagte festsmørrebrød","ok":true}],"note":"Smørrebrød er en del af dansk madkultur."},"tf|Pizza stammer fra Frankrig":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/pizza","d":"lex.dk","q":"Udrullet meldej har oprindelser i oldtiden i Middelhavsområdet, men fik i form af pizza et gennembrud i Napoli i 1800-tallet.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pizza","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Raffaele Esposito is often credited with creating the modern version of pizza in Naples at the end of the 19th century.","ok":true}],"note":"Falsk er rigtigt, men forklaringen er upræcis: pizzaens oprindelse kan ikke fastslås helt; den moderne pizza stammer fra Napoli."},"tf|Kaffe stammer oprindeligt fra Etiopien":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/kaffe","d":"lex.dk","q":"der stammer fra Sydvestetiopien, hvor arten findes vildtvoksende","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaffe","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Dyrkning af kaffe begyndte i Kaffa-provinsen i Etiopien.","ok":true}],"note":"Arabicakaffe stammer fra Etiopien."},"tf|Chokolade laves af kakaobønner":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/chokolade","d":"lex.dk","q":"Chokolade fremstilles af kakaobønner, som gæres, hvorefter de ristes.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chocolate","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Chocolate is a food made from roasted and ground cocoa beans.","ok":true}],"note":"Chokolade fremstilles af kakaobønner."},"tf|Peanuts er egentlig nødder":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peanut","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is a legume crop grown mainly for its edible seeds, contained in underground pods.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/jordnød","d":"lex.dk","q":"Frugten er en uopspringende bælg med 2-3 meget olierige frø.","ok":true}],"note":"Jordnødder er bælgplanter (ærteblomstfamilien), ikke ægte nødder."},"tf|Jordbær er bær i botanisk forstand":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Strawberry","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Botanically, the strawberry is not a berry, but an aggregate accessory fruit.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/jordbær","d":"lex.dk","q":"Ved opsvulmning af frugtbunden dannes en falsk frugt, som bærer mange småfrugter","ok":true}],"note":"Jordbær er botanisk en samlet falsk frugt, ikke et ægte bær."},"tf|Bananer er lidt radioaktive":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Banana_equivalent_dose","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bananas contain naturally occurring radioactive isotopes, particularly potassium-40","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.epa.gov/radtown/natural-radioactivity-food","d":"epa.gov","q":"Bananas and Brazil nuts are the most well known examples of foods that contain radioactivity.","ok":true}],"note":"Bananer indeholder radioaktiv kalium-40."},"tf|Hjertet er en muskel":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/hjerte","d":"lex.dk","q":"Hjertet er en muskel, som pumper blodet rundt i kroppen.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hjerte","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Da hjertet hovedsageligt består af hjertemuskel","ok":true}],"note":"Hjertet er en muskel, der pumper blod."},"tf|Mennesker har 23 par kromosomer":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://medlineplus.gov/genetics/understanding/basics/howmanychromosomes/","d":"medlineplus.gov","q":"In humans, each cell normally contains 23 pairs of chromosomes, for a total of 46.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kromosom","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Et menneske har 2 gange 23 kromosomer.","ok":true}],"note":"23 par = 46 kromosomer."},"tf|Blod er blåt inde i venerne":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blood","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Blood is bright red when its hemoglobin is oxygenated and dark red when it is deoxygenated.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/blod","d":"lex.dk","q":"Mørkerødt venøst (øverste 2 glas) og lyserødt arterielt (nederste 3 glas) blod","ok":true}],"note":"Blod er altid rødt (mørkerødt uden ilt), aldrig blåt."},"tf|Hår og negle fortsætter med at vokse efter døden":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/future/article/20130526-do-your-nails-grow-after-death","d":"bbc.com","q":"It is not that the fingernails are growing, but that the skin around them retracts as it becomes dehydrated, making them appear longer.","ok":true},{"u":"https://uamshealth.com/medical-myths/do-a-persons-hair-and-fingernails-continue-to-grow-after-death/","d":"uamshealth.com","q":"After death, dehydration causes the skin and other soft tissues to shrink. This occurs while the hair and nails remain the same length.","ok":true}],"note":"Myten er falsk: hår og negle vokser ikke efter døden; huden dehydrerer og trækker sig tilbage, så de ser længere ud."},"tf|Vi mister mest varme gennem hovedet":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/science/2008/dec/17/medicalresearch-humanbehaviour","d":"theguardian.com","q":"If this were true, they say, humans would be just as cold if they went without a hat as if they went without trousers.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/34411-body-heat-loss-head.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"a person loses 7 percent to 10 percent of their body heat through their head.","ok":true}],"note":"Myte: hovedet taber ikke uforholdsmæssigt meget varme; højst ca. 7-10 % (BMJ 2008)."},"tf|Man skal vente en time efter mad før man bader":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.redcross.org/take-a-class/resources/articles/eating-before-swimming-myth","d":"redcross.org","q":"Swimming within one hour of eating food in adult and child recreational or competitive swimmers does not increase the risk of drowning.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/future/article/20130401-can-you-swim-just-after-eating","d":"bbc.com","q":"However, eating does not feature as a contributory factor.","ok":true}],"note":"Myte: der er ingen evidens for, at badning efter mad øger risikoen for drukning eller kramper."},"tf|Danmark har en landgrænse til Tyskland":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Danmark","d":"lex.dk","q":"en landegrænse til Tyskland på 68 km","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denmark–Germany_border","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The land border with Germany is 68 kilometres (42 mi) long.","ok":true}],"note":"Danmark har en landgrænse til Tyskland på ca. 68 km."},"tf|Danmark har en landgrænse til Sverige":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denmark–Sweden_border","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The current national border between Denmark and Sweden dates to 1660. It is entirely a maritime border","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Øresundsforbindelsen","d":"lex.dk","q":"en ca. 7,8 km lang bro over Flinterenden til den svenske kyst ved Lernacken syd for Malmø","ok":true}],"note":"Grænsen til Sverige er udelukkende en maritim grænse; landene er forbundet af Øresundsbroen/-tunnelen."},"tf|Island ligger på den Mellematlantiske Ryg":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iceland","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"located on the Mid-Atlantic Ridge between Europe and North America","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Island","d":"lex.dk","q":"Øen ligger på Den Midtatlantiske Ryg","ok":true}],"note":"Island ligger på den Midtatlantiske Ryg (stavemåden 'Mellematlantiske' er dog ikke den gængse; Lex bruger 'Midtatlantiske'), men påstanden er korrekt."},"tf|Sahara er et ørkenområde i Asien":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sahara","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"desert spanning North Africa","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Sahara","d":"lex.dk","q":"Sahara strækker sig tværs over Nordafrika, 6000 km fra Atlanterhavet til Det Røde Hav","ok":true}],"note":"Sahara ligger i Nordafrika, ikke Asien; forklaringen er korrekt."},"tf|Amazonfloden løber gennem Brasilien":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amazon_River","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The portion of the river's drainage basin in Brazil alone is larger than any other river's basin.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Brasilien","d":"lex.dk","q":"Amazonia omfatter de delstater, som afvandes af Amazonas med bifloder. Det er Acre, Amazonas, Rondônia, Roraima, Amapá og Pará.","ok":true}],"note":"Amazonfloden løber gennem Brasilien (og Peru m.fl.); en stor del af afvandingsområdet ligger i Brasilien."},"tf|Australien er både et land og et kontinent":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australia","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is a country comprising the mainland of the Australian continent","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Australien","d":"lex.dk","q":"Landet består af det australske kontinent med Tasmanien og andre omliggende øer.","ok":true}],"note":"Landet Australien omfatter hele det australske kontinent (fastlandet) samt Tasmanien m.fl.; udbredt og accepteret formulering i 7-kontinent-modellen."},"tf|Kilimanjaro ligger i Kenya":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kilimanjaro","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is the highest mountain in Africa and the highest free-standing mountain above sea level in the world","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Kilimanjaro","d":"lex.dk","q":"Kilimanjaro er Afrikas højeste bjerg. Bjerget ligger i Tanzania nær grænsen til Kenya","ok":true}],"note":"Kilimanjaro ligger i Tanzania, nær grænsen til Kenya; påstanden er falsk."},"tf|Rusland har grænse til Norge":{"pool":"tf","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norway–Russia_border","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The border between Norway and Russia consists of a 195.7-kilometer (121.6 mi) land border","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Finnmark","d":"","q":"Finnmark Fylke grænser op til Finland og Rusland og rummer Norges nordligste og østligste punkt","ok":false}],"note":"Norge og Rusland har en ca. 196 km lang landgrænse (Finnmark/Sør-Varanger)."},"tf|Schweiz er medlem af EU":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Switzerland–European_Union_relations","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Switzerland is not a member state of the European Union (EU) or the European Economic Area (EEA)","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Schweiz_-_økonomi","d":"lex.dk","q":"I 2001 stemte vælgerne nej til at optage forhandlinger om EU-medlemskab","ok":true}],"note":"Schweiz er ikke medlem af EU; landet er medlem af EFTA og har bilaterale aftaler."},"tf|Alperne ligger i Europa":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Alperne","d":"lex.dk","q":"Alperne er et fællesnavn for flere bjergkæder i Syd- og Centraleuropa.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alps","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"are some of the highest and most extensive mountain ranges in Europe","ok":true}],"note":"Alperne er en bjergkæde i Syd- og Centraleuropa."},"tf|Himalaya ligger i Sydamerika":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Himalayas","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is a mountain range in Asia separating the plains of the Indian subcontinent from the Tibetan Plateau","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Himalaya","d":"lex.dk","q":"Himalaya ligger, hvor Det Indiske Subkontinent grænser mod Centralasien","ok":true}],"note":"Himalaya ligger i Asien; påstanden er falsk."},"tf|Verdens største ø er Grønland":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Grønland","d":"lex.dk","q":"Grønland er verdens største ø med et areal på","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greenland","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Greenland is the world's largest non-continental island","ok":true}],"note":"Grønland regnes som verdens største ø (Australien regnes som kontinent)."},"tf|Madagaskar er en ø i Det Indiske Ocean":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Madagaskar","d":"lex.dk","q":"Madagaskar er verdens fjerdestørste ø og ligger i Det Indiske Ocean","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Madagascar","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is an island country in the Indian Ocean that includes the island of Madagascar and numerous smaller peripheral islands","ok":true}],"note":"Madagaskar er verdens fjerdestørste ø og ligger i Det Indiske Ocean."},"tf|Mount Everest ligger helt i Indien":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Mount_Everest","d":"lex.dk","q":"Mount Everest ligger på grænsen mellem Nepal og Kina","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Everest","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"og beliggende i bjergkæden Mahalangur Himal i Himalaya, på grænsen mellem Tibet og Nepal","ok":true}],"note":"Everest ligger på grænsen mellem Nepal og Tibet/Kina, ikke i Indien; påstanden er falsk og forklaringen korrekt."},"tf|Aarhus er Danmarks næststørste by":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Aarhus","d":"lex.dk","q":"Aarhus er Jyllands største og Danmarks næststørste by","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aarhus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"er Danmarks næststørste og Jyllands største byområde","ok":true}],"note":"Aarhus er Danmarks næststørste by."},"tf|Odense ligger på Sjælland":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Odense","d":"lex.dk","q":"Odense, Fyns største og Danmarks tredjestørste by","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odense","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"og Fyns største by med","ok":true}],"note":"Odense ligger på Fyn, så påstanden er korrekt markeret som falsk."},"tf|Aalborg ligger i Nordjylland":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Aalborg","d":"lex.dk","q":"Aalborg er Nordjyllands største og Danmarks fjerdestørste by","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aalborg","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"er en by i Region Nordjylland","ok":true}],"note":"Aalborg er Nordjyllands største by."},"tf|Roskilde Domkirke er optaget på UNESCOs verdensarvsliste":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Roskilde_Domkirke","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den blev i 1995 optaget på UNESCOs verdensarvsliste","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roskilde_Domkirke","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Domkirken blev i 1995 optaget på UNESCOs verdensarvsliste","ok":true}],"note":"Optaget i 1995."},"tf|Kronborg ligger i Helsingør":{"pool":"tf","status":"delvist","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Kronborg","d":"lex.dk","q":"Kronborg er et slot i Helsingør i Danmark, bygget i slutningen af 1500-tallet","ok":true},{"u":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/696","d":"","q":"the Royal castle of Kronborg at Helsingør (Elsinore)","ok":false}],"note":"Kronborg er et slot i Helsingør."},"tf|Rundetårn ligger i Aarhus":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rundetårn","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"der ligger i Købmagergade i Indre By","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Rundetårn","d":"lex.dk","q":"Udsmykningen på Rundetaarn i København er en devise","ok":true}],"note":"Rundetårn ligger i København (Købmagergade), ikke Aarhus, så påstanden er falsk som markeret."},"tf|Dannebrog er verdens ældste nationalflag, der stadig bruges":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/oldest-continuously-used-national-flag","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The oldest continuously used national flag is that of Denmark","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dannebrog","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Dannebrog, verdens ældste nationalflag, der stadig er i brug","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dannebrog","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The flag holds the Guinness world record of being the oldest continuously used national flag, that is since 1625","ok":true}],"note":"Påstanden er korrekt (Guinness World Records), men forklaringen 'Ifølge traditionen' er misvisende; rettet til Guinness og årstallet 1625."},"tf|Dannebrog er rødt med et hvidt kors":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Dannebrog","d":"lex.dk","q":"Dannebrog er Danmarks flag, et hvidt, gennemgående kors på rød bund","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dannebrog","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Det er rødt med et hvidt kors, der når til siderne af flaget","ok":true}],"note":"Dannebrog er et hvidt kors på rød bund."},"tf|Folketinget sidder på Christiansborg":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Christiansborg_Slot","d":"lex.dk","q":"Christiansborg Slot på Slotsholmen i Københavns centrum er sæde for Folketinget og Højesteret","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christiansborg_Slot","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"på Slotsholmen i det centrale København er hjemsted for Danmarks parlament","ok":true}],"note":"Folketinget har hjemsted på Christiansborg Slot."},"tf|Dronning Margrethe II abdicerede i 2024":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margrethe_2.","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"frem til sin abdicering 52 år senere, den 14. januar 2024","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/tronskiftet_fra_Margrethe_2._til_Frederik_10.","d":"lex.dk","q":"udråber den nye konge Frederik 10. fra Christiansborg Slots balkon den 14. januar 2024","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/tronskiftet_fra_Margrethe_2._til_Frederik_10.","d":"lex.dk","q":"Hendes Majestæt Dronning Margrethe 2. er abdiceret","ok":true}],"note":"Abdicerede 14. januar 2024."},"tf|Fodbold spilles med elleve spillere på hvert hold":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/fodbold","d":"lex.dk","q":"reglen om, at der kun må være 11 spillere fra hvert hold på banen ad gangen","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Association_football","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Each team consists of a maximum of eleven players","ok":true}],"note":"11 spillere pr. hold på banen."},"tf|Tour de France køres i Italien":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tour_de_France","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Det køres hver sommer i Frankrig i juli","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Tour_de_France","d":"lex.dk","q":"Grand Tour-etapeløb i Frankrig","ok":true}],"note":"Tour de France køres i Frankrig (Giro d'Italia er det italienske løb), så påstanden er falsk som markeret."},"tf|Wimbledon spilles på græs":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wimbledon_Championships","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Wimbledon er den eneste af dem, som fortsat spilles på græs","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Wimbledon","d":"lex.dk","q":"Grand Slam-turnering på græs i London","ok":true}],"note":"Wimbledon spilles på græs."},"tf|Sluger man tyggegummi, skal det bruge 7 år på at blive fordøjet.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://www.healthline.com/health/how-long-does-gum-take-to-digest","d":"healthline.com","q":"Your body can safely pass gum within a few days","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.mcgill.ca/oss/article/health/gum-and-7-year-myth","d":"mcgill.ca","q":"Gum, like most other undigested foods, will pass through you within 24-48 hours","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chewing_gum","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"swallowed gum will pass through the system as quickly as any other food","ok":true}],"note":"Myte; tyggegummi passerer typisk på få dage (24-48 timer ifølge McGill)."},"tf|Bananplanten er botanisk set et træ.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/banan","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den er blandt verdens største urter og er ofte trælignende, da bladskederne danner en falsk stamme","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Banana","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The banana plant is the largest herbaceous flowering plant","ok":true}],"note":"Bananplanten er en kæmpe-urt med falsk stamme af bladskeder."},"tf|Honningbier kan fortælle hinanden retning og afstand til føde ved at danse.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/bier","d":"lex.dk","q":"som videregiver informationer om retning og afstand til nye foderpladser","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/medicine/1973/press-release/","d":"nobelprize.org","q":"By means of a comprehensive series of experiments he elucidated the ways bees use to communicate information to each other","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/medicine/1973/summary/","d":"nobelprize.org","q":"was awarded jointly to Karl von Frisch, Konrad Lorenz and Nikolaas Tinbergen","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waggle_dance","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The duration of the waggle part of the dance signifies the distance","ok":true}],"note":"Waggle-dansen; von Frisch delte Nobelprisen 1973 og er især kendt for sin forskning i biernes 'sprog'."},"odd|Blæksprutter har tre hjerter. | Honning kan holde sig i tusindvis af år. | Lyn er varmere end Solens overflade. | Guldfisk har kun 3 sekunders hukommelse.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They have three hearts; a systemic or main heart that circulates blood around the body and two branchial or gill hearts that pump it through the two gills.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honey","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Samples of honey discovered in archaeological contexts have proven edible even after millennia.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.mcgill.ca/oss/article/did-you-know-history/king-tuts-sweet-tooth","d":"mcgill.ca","q":"Due to its low water content and acidic pH, this bee regurgitation is one of the few foods that does not spoil.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.weather.gov/safety/lightning-temperature","d":"weather.gov","q":"lightning can heat the air it passes through to 50,000 degrees Fahrenheit (5 times hotter than the surface of the sun)","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.discoverwildlife.com/animal-facts/fish/goldfish-memory","d":"discoverwildlife.com","q":"goldfish can retain memories for at least three months, can be trained, and can also tell the time","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goldfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Goldfish have a memory span of at least three months and can distinguish between different shapes, colors, and sounds.","ok":true}],"note":"Tre første påstande er sande (blæksprutter har tre hjerter, arkæologisk honning er stadig spiselig, lyn er ca. 5 gange varmere end Solens overflade). Guldfisk husker i mi"},"odd|Vombatter laver terningeformet bæ. | Flamingoer bliver født lyserøde. | Pingviner har knæ. | Katte kan ikke smage sødt.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wombat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Wombats leave distinctive cube-shaped faeces.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/common-wombat","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"they are the only animal known to have cube-shaped dung","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/birds/facts/flamingos","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"Young flamingos are born gray and white and do not turn pink for two years.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/flamingo","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"At hatching, a flamingo chick has gray down feathers and is the size of a tennis ball.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/bitesize/articles/zt6rh4j","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"knees, along with the rest of their upper leg, are hidden beneath their feathers","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pingviner","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Pingviner har knæ og lår, der er skjult oppe under fjerene sammen med resten af de korte ben.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2005/07/050725065702.htm","d":"sciencedaily.com","q":"the researchers show a defect in the gene encoding the T1R2 protein in domestic cats","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Domestic and wild cats share a taste receptor gene mutation that keeps their sweet taste buds from binding to sugary molecules, leaving them with no ability to taste swee","ok":true}],"note":"Vombatter har kubeformet afføring, pingviner har skjulte knæ, katte mangler sødt-receptoren. Flamingo-unger er grå/hvide, så nr. 2 er løgnen."},"odd|Bananer er bær. | Jordbær er bær. | Græskar er bær. | Tomater er bær.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Banana","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A banana is an elongated, edible fruit that is botanically a berry","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Strawberry","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Botanically, the strawberry is not a berry, but an aggregate accessory fruit.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pumpkin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Pumpkin fruits are a type of berry known as a pepo.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berry","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"such as grapes, tomatoes, cucumbers, eggplants, bananas, and chili peppers","ok":true},{"u":"https://theconversation.com/you-say-tomato-why-some-fruits-are-forever-doomed-to-be-called-veggies-62099","d":"theconversation.com","q":"Tomatoes and grapes are technically berries, as are avocados, watermelons, pumpkins and bananas.","ok":true},{"u":"https://theconversation.com/you-say-tomato-why-some-fruits-are-forever-doomed-to-be-called-veggies-62099","d":"theconversation.com","q":"Oddly, strawberries and raspberries are not really berries at all","ok":true}],"note":"Botanisk er bananer, græskar (pepo) og tomater bær, mens jordbær er en samlefrugt/skinfrugt og ikke et bær."},"odd|Eiffeltårnet er højere om sommeren. | Elizabeth Tower (Big Ben) hælder en smule. | Tårnet i Pisa blev bygget skævt med vilje. | Frihedsgudinden er grøn pga. patina på kobber.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leaning_Tower_of_Pisa","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The tower began to lean during construction in the 12th century, due to soft ground which could not properly support the structure","ok":true},{"u":"https://opapisa.it/en/boc_tipo/tower/","d":"opapisa.it","q":"before they reached the building halfway, it inclined to one side","ok":true},{"u":"https://theconversation.com/the-eiffel-tower-gets-bigger-every-summer-heres-why-261904","d":"theconversation.com","q":"as temperatures rise during the summer months, the Eiffel Tower grows even taller than its original design","ok":true},{"u":"https://engineering.purdue.edu/MSE/aboutus/gotmaterials/Buildings/patel.html","d":"engineering.purdue.edu","q":"The tower expands and contracts 15 cm from the hottest to the coldest day.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elizabeth_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Owing to this soft ground, the tower leans slightly to the north-west by roughly 230 mm (9.1 in) over 55 m height","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nps.gov/stli/faqs.htm","d":"nps.gov","q":"copper has naturally oxidized to form the outer patina or green coating","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Statue_of_Liberty","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"a green patina of verdigris, caused by the oxidation of the copper skin, began to spread","ok":true}],"note":"Eiffeltårnet udvider sig i varmen, Elizabeth Tower hælder ca. 230 mm over 55 m, Frihedsgudinden er grøn af patina. Pisa-tårnet begyndte at hælde under opførelsen pga. blø"},"odd|Der er en vulkan på Mars, der er højere end Mount Everest. | En dag på Venus er længere end et år på Venus. | Månen bevæger sig ca. 3,8 cm væk fra Jorden hvert år. | Mars er tættere på Solen end Jorden.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/mars/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"Mars is home to the largest volcano in the solar system, Olympus Mons. It dwarfs Earth","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olympus_Mons","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"about 2.5 times the elevation of Mount Everest above sea level","ok":true},{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/venus/venus-facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"longer even than a Venus year (one trip around the Sun), which takes only 225 Earth days","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Venus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Venusian sidereal day, 243 Earth days, lasts longer than a Venusian year, 224.7 Earth days","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nasa.gov/missions/apollo/apollo-11/the-apollo-experiment-that-keeps-on-giving/","d":"nasa.gov","q":"the distance between the two increases by 1.5 inches (3.8 centimeters) a year","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nist.gov/history/moon-and-back-25-seconds","d":"nist.gov","q":"the moon is moving away from the Earth at a rate of 3.8 centimeters (1.5 inches) per year","ok":true},{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/mars/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"From an average distance of 142 million miles (228 million kilometers), Mars is 1.5 astronomical units away from the Sun.","ok":true},{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"Earth is exactly one astronomical unit away from the Sun","ok":true}],"note":"Olympus Mons er ca. 2,5 gange Everests højde, et venusdøgn (243 d) er længere end et venusår (225 d), Månen fjerner sig 3,8 cm/år. Mars (1,5 AU, 4. planet) er længere fra"},"odd|Delfiner sover med halvdelen af hjernen. | Giraffer har 7 halshvirvler. | Strudse stikker hovedet i sandet, når de er bange. | Kakerlakker kan leve flere dage uden hoved.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/ostrich","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"Contrary to the popular myth, ostriches do not bury their heads in the sand!","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/birds/facts/ostrich","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"Contrary to popular belief, ostriches do not bury their heads in the sand.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/giraffe","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"Just like humans, giraffes have seven neck vertebrae.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bottlenose_dolphin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"During the sleeping cycle, one brain hemisphere remains active, while the other hemisphere shuts down.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/fact-or-fiction-cockroach-can-live-without-head/","d":"scientificamerican.com","q":"Headless roaches are capable of living for weeks.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.discoverwildlife.com/animal-facts/insects-invertebrates/how-long-can-a-cockroach-live-without-its-head","d":"discoverwildlife.com","q":"survive for hours or even days with little or no change to body function","ok":true}],"note":"Delfiner sover med én hjernehalvdel ad gangen, giraffer har 7 halshvirvler, kakerlakker kan leve uger uden hoved. Strudse stikker ikke hovedet i sandet (myte)."},"odd|Vikinger bar hornhjelme i kamp. | Dannebrog regnes som verdens ældste nationalflag i brug. | Danmark har flere grise end indbyggere. | Jellingestenen nævner Danmark.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vikings","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"there is no evidence that they wore horned helmets, a costume element that first appeared in the 19th century","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_of_Denmark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The flag holds the Guinness world record of being the oldest continuously used national flag, that is since 1625.","ok":true},{"u":"https://dataomdanmark.dk/da_dk/2024/04/23/hvor-mange-grise-er-der-i-danmark/","d":"dataomdanmark.dk","q":"I 2023 var der godt 11 millioner grise. Knap dobbelt så mange som der er mennesker.","ok":true},{"u":"https://via.ritzau.dk/pressemeddelelse/13741502/stigende-eksport-af-grise-pavirker-den-danske-bestand?lang=da&publisherId=3274962","d":"via.ritzau.dk","q":"Siden har der været flere grise end mennesker i Danmark.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jelling_stones","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Both inscriptions mention the name","ok":true}],"note":"Der er ingen evidens for hornhjelme (19. årh.-opfindelse). Dannebrog er Guinness-rekordholder, Danmark har haft flere grise end indbyggere siden 1956, og Jellingestenene "},"odd|Papua Ny Guinea har flere sprog end hele Europa. | Der findes en by i Norge, der hedder Hell. | Vatikanstaten er verdens mindste land. | Grønland er større end Afrika.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Languages_of_Papua_New_Guinea","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Ethnologue, among other sources, state that there are 840 living languages spoken in the country","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.worldbank.org/en/country/png","d":"worldbank.org","q":"is the most linguistically diverse country in the world, with over 850 indigenous languages","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Languages_of_Europe","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"There are over 250 languages indigenous to Europe","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/Hell","d":"snl.no","q":"Hell er en tettbebyggelse i Stjørdal kommune i Trøndelag.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vatikanstaten","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Vatikanstaten er med sine 0,44 km² og 1.000 indbyggere verdens mindste land målt på areal såvel som antal indbyggere.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercator_projection","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Greenland appears the same size as Africa, when in reality Africa","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Africa","d":"","q":"At about 30.3 million km2 (11.7 million square miles)","ok":false},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Gr%C3%B8nland","d":"lex.dk","q":"Areal 2.486.000 km²","ok":true}],"note":"PNG har ca. 840 sprog mod over 250 oprindelige i Europa, Hell findes i Stjørdal, Vatikanstaten er mindst. Afrika (30,3 mio. km²) er ca. 14 gange større end Grønland (ca. "},"odd|Mennesker har færre kromosomer end kartofler. | Bananer er svagt radioaktive. | Vand kan koge og fryse samtidig. | Lyd bevæger sig hurtigere i luft end i vand.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sour