l","d":"oceanservice.noaa.gov","q":"Lacking brains, blood, or even hearts, jellyfish are pretty simple critters.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jellyfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Although they lack a true brain, cnidarian jellyfish have a","ok":true},{"u":"https://aqua.org/stories/03-01-2018-otherworldly-octopus","d":"aqua.org","q":"a copper-rich protein called hemocyanin in octopus blood, which gives it a distinctive blue color","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mosquito","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"By transmitting diseases, mosquitoes cause the deaths of over one million people each year.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shark_attack","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Between 2001 and 2010, an average of 4.3 people per year died from shark attacks.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/malaria","d":"who.int","q":"Globally in 2024, there were an estimated 282 million malaria cases and 610 000 malaria deaths in 80 countries.","ok":true}],"note":"Nr. 3 er omstridt: søstjerner har et hæmalt kredsløbssystem med 'blod' (Wikipedia), så den kan forsvares som forkert. Erstattet med den veldokumenterede 'Blæksprutter har"},"odd|Der findes en lyserød sø i Australien. | Man flyder i Det Døde Hav. | Antarktis er teknisk set en ørken. | Mount Everest er det sted på Jorden, der er længst fra jordens centrum.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://oceanservice.noaa.gov/facts/highestpoint.html","d":"oceanservice.noaa.gov","q":"The top of Mount Chimborazo is farther from the Earth","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Everest","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The summit of Chimborazo in Ecuador is 2,168 m (7,113 ft) farther from Earth","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Hillier","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is particularly notable for its pink colour.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dead_Sea","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"has a density of 1.24 kg/L, which makes swimming similar to floating","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antarctica","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Antarctica is the coldest, driest, and windiest continent on average, and has the highest average elevation. It is mainly a polar desert","ok":true}],"note":"Lake Hillier er lyserød, Det Døde Hav har så høj densitet at man flyder, Antarktis er en polarørken. Det punkt der er længst fra jordens centrum er Chimborazo, ikke Evere"},"odd|En blæksprutte har tre hjerter | Honning kan holde sig spiselig i tusinder af år | Kameler lagrer fedt i deres pukler | Bananer er blå, før de modner":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/how-many-hearts-does-an-octopus-have","d":"livescience.com","q":"It turns out that an octopus has three hearts","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honey","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Samples of honey discovered in archaeological contexts have proven edible even after millennia.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.mcgill.ca/oss/article/did-you-know-history/king-tuts-sweet-tooth","d":"mcgill.ca","q":"Due to its low water content and acidic pH, this bee regurgitation is one of the few foods that does not spoil.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/camel","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"They store fat, not water.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/dromedary-camel","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"The hump stores up to 80 pounds of fat","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Banana","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In many tropical countries, the main cultivars produce green (unripe) bananas used for cooking.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.itfnet.org/contents/fruit/fruitInfo/html/trdLevel1351.html","d":"itfnet.org","q":"Commercial banana are harvested when they have become plump, but are still green.","ok":true}],"note":"Blæksprutter har tre hjerter, arkæologisk honning er spiselig efter årtusinder, k