st email program on the ARPANET system, the precursor to the Internet, in 1971","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.computinghistory.org.uk/det/6116/first-e-mail-sent-by-ray-tomlinson","d":"computinghistory.org.uk","q":"1971 Ray Tomlinson sends the first email","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/technology-65112048","d":"bbc.com","q":"On 3 April 1973, Marty Cooper stood on a corner of Sixth Avenue in New York","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Martin_Cooper_(inventor)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"On April 3, 1973, Cooper placed the first public call from a prototype handheld portable phone","ok":true}],"note":"Årstallene er rigtige (Tomlinson 1971, Cooper 3. april 1973), men 'første mobiltelefon-samtale' er upræcist; Coopers opkald var det første fra en håndholdt mobiltelefon. "},"tl|Den første Star Wars-film udkommer (1977) | Det første mobilopkald (1973)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Star_Wars_(film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is a 1977 American epic space opera film written and directed by George Lucas","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Star_Wars","d":"lex.dk","q":"Star Wars: Episode IV: A New Hope (1977)","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/technology-65112048","d":"bbc.com","q":"On 3 April 1973, Marty Cooper stood on a corner of Sixth Avenue in New York","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Martin_Cooper_(inventor)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"On April 3, 1973, Cooper placed the first public call from a prototype handheld portable phone","ok":true}],"note":"Rækkefølgen er rigtig (B først), men 'det første mobilopkald' er upræcist; Cooper foretog 3. april 1973 det første opkald fra en håndholdt mobiltelefon. Rettet ordlyd."},"tl|Rubiks terning opfindes (1974) | Apple grundlægges (1976)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.museumofplay.org/toys/rubiks-cube","d":"museumofplay.org","q":"assembled his first cube puzzle in 1974 and called it the Magic Cube","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubik%27s_Cube","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is a 3D combination puzzle invented in 1974","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Apple","d":"lex.dk","q":"grundlagt i Cupertino, i 1976 af Steve Jobs og Steve Wozniak","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apple_Inc.","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Apple Computer Company was founded as a partnership on April 1, 1976","ok":true}],"note":"Rubik opfandt terningen i 1974; Apple grundlagt 1. april 1976."},"tl|Facebook lanceres (2004) | YouTube lanceres (2005)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Facebook","d":"lex.dk","q":"Facebook blev grundlagt i 2004 af Mark Zuckerberg","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Facebook","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Founded February 4, 2004","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/YouTube","d":"lex.dk","q":"Året efter lanceringen i 2005 blev tjenesten købt af Google","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/YouTube","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"YouTube was founded on February 14, 2005","ok":true}],"note":"Facebook 4. februar 2004; YouTube grundlagt 14. februar 2005."},"tl|iPhone lanceres (2007) | Instagram lanceres (2010)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/iPhone","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den første iPhone blev lanceret af Apple i 2007","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2007/06/28iPhone-Premieres-This-Friday-Night-at-Apple-Retail-Stores/","d":"apple.com","q":"will go on sale this Friday, June 29 at 6:00 p.m. local time","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Instagram","d":"lex.dk","q":"Platformen blev lanceret i 2010 af to softwareingeniører","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Instagram","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Instagram was launched for iOS in October 2010 by Kevin Systrom","ok":true}],"note":"iPhone kom i salg 29. juni 2007; Instagram lanceret oktober 2010."},"tl|Titanic sænkes (1912) | Første verd