lliams, and was launched in July of that year","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/iPhone","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den første iPhone blev lanceret af Apple i 2007","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPhone_(1st_generation)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"officially announced on January 9, 2007, and was released in the United States on June 29, 2007","ok":true}],"note":"Twitter blev lanceret i juli 2006; iPhone blev udgivet 29. juni 2007."},"tl|Bitcoin lanceres (2009) | Instagram lanceres (2010)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/bitcoin","d":"lex.dk","q":"Bitcoin blev udviklet i 2009 af en person, der lyder pseudonymet Satoshi Nakamoto","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitcoin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Use of bitcoin as a currency began in 2009","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Instagram","d":"lex.dk","q":"Platformen blev lanceret i 2010 af to softwareingeniører med base i San Francisco","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Instagram","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Instagram was launched for iOS in October 2010 by Kevin Systrom and the Brazilian software engineer Mike Krieger","ok":true}],"note":"Bitcoin kom i brug i 2009 (genesis-blok 3. januar 2009); Instagram blev lanceret i oktober 2010."},"tl|Frederik X bliver konge (2024) | Rusland invaderer Ukraine (2022)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Danmarks_kongehus","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den kongelige familie på balkonen på Christiansborg Slot ved tronskiftet den 14. januar 2024.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frederik_X","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is King of Denmark, reigning since 14 January 2024","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Ukraine","d":"lex.dk","q":"siden Rusland invaderede landet i 2022","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Russian_invasion_of_Ukraine","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"On 24 February 2022, during the Russo-Ukrainian war, Russia launched a full-scale invasion of Ukraine","ok":true}],"note":"Rusland invaderede 24. februar 2022; Frederik X blev konge 14. januar 2024."},"tl|Gutenberg trykker bibelen (ca.) (1455) | Konstantinopel falder (1453)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/bibelh%C3%A5ndskrifter_og_bibeludgaver","d":"lex.dk","q":"Gutenbergs 42-linjede Bibel på latin, trykt ca. 1454-55","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gutenberg_Bible","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the first finished copies were available in 1454 or 1455","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Konstantinopel","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den 29. maj 1453 blev byen erobret af osmannerne.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fall_of_Constantinople","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Constantinople, the capital city of the Byzantine Empire, was captured by the Ottoman Empire on 29 May 1453","ok":true}],"note":"Konstantinopel faldt 29. maj 1453; Gutenbergbibelen blev trykt ca. 1454-55, altså efter."},"tl|Columbus' første rejse (1492) | Gutenbergs bibel (ca.) (1455)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christopher_Columbus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Columbus left the Port of Palos in August 1492 with three ships","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Christoffer_Columbus","d":"lex.dk","q":"besluttede dronningen og kongen i 1492 at gennemføre rejsen som et eksperiment","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/bibelh%C3%A5ndskrifter_og_bibeludgaver","d":"lex.dk","q":"Gutenbergs 42-linjede Bibel på latin, trykt ca. 1454-55","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gutenberg_Bible","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the first finished copies were available in 1454 or 1455","ok":true}],"note":"Gutenbergbibelen ca. 1454-55 kom før Columbus' første rejse i 1492."},"tl|Magellan-ekspeditionen afsejler (1519) | Reformationen begynder (1517)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Fernando_de_Magellan","d":"lex.dk","q":"den forlod Spanien i 1519","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ferdinand_Magellan","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The fleet left Spain on 20 September 1519, sailing west across the Atlantic toward South America.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Reformationen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Begyndelsen til Reformationen var Martin Luthers offentliggørelse af sine 95 teser om aflad i 1517.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reformation","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Reformation is usually dated from Martin Luther's publication of the Ninety-five Theses in 1517","ok":true}],"note":"Reformationen begyndte 1517 (95 teser); Magellans flåde forlod Spanien 20. september 1519."},"tl|Reformationen indføres i Danmark (1536) | Reformationen begynder (1517)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Reformationen_i_Danmark","d":"lex.dk","q":"Efter Grevens Fejde blev Reformationen indført ved lov, som blev skrevet i recessen af 30. oktober 1536.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reformation_in_Denmark-Norway","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"30 October 1536: The official implementation of the reformation in Denmark.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Reformationen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Begyndelsen til Reformationen var Martin Luthers offentliggørelse af sine 95 teser om aflad i 1517.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reformation","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Reformation is usually dated from Martin Luther's publication of the Ninety-five Theses in 1517","ok":true}],"note":"Reformationen begyndte 1517 og blev indført i Danmark ved recessen 30. oktober 1536."},"tl|Slaget ved Lepanto (1571) | Shakespeares Hamlet (ca.) (1600)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Slaget_ved_Lepanto","d":"lex.dk","q":"Slaget ved Lepanto var et søslag den 7. oktober 1571 i Korinthbugten","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Lepanto","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Battle of Lepanto was a naval engagement that took place on 7 October 1571","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Hamlet_-_tragedie_af_William_Shakespeare","d":"lex.dk","q":"Hamlet, Prince of Denmark (ca. 1600-1601), er et af verdens mest kendte og indflydelsesrige skuespil","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hamlet","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is a tragedy written by William Shakespeare sometime between 1599 and 1601","ok":true}],"note":"Lepanto 7. oktober 1571; Hamlet skrevet ca. 1599-1601."},"tl|Trediveårskrigen begynder (1618) | Rundetårn påbegyndes (1637)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Tredive%C3%A5rskrigen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Trediveårskrigen er en sammenfattende betegnelse for flere indbyrdes sammenhængende krige i Det Tysk-romerske Rige i perioden 1618-1648","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thirty_Years%27_War","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"fought primarily in Central Europe between 1618 and 1648, was one of the most destructive conflicts in European history","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rundet%C3%A5rn","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Byggeriet af tårnet blev påbegyndt i 1637, og i 1642 stod det færdigt","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Rundet%C3%A5rn","d":"lex.dk","q":"Komplekset blev bygget i 1637-1642.","ok":true}],"note":"Trediveårskrigen startede 1618; byggeriet af Rundetårn blev påbegyndt 1637."},"tl|Newtons Principia (1687) | Trediveårskrigen slutter (1648)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Principia","d":"lex.dk","q":"Principia er fysikeren Isaac Newtons hovedværk fra 1687","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philosophi%C3%A6_Naturalis_Principia_Mathematica","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"then-president of the Royal Society on 5 July 1686 and first published in 1687.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Tredive%C3%A5rskrigen","d":"lex.dk","q":"Trediveårskrigen er en sammenfattende betegnelse for flere indbyrdes sammenhængende krige i Det Tysk-romerske Rige i perioden 1618-1648","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peace_of_Westphalia","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"1648 treaties ending the Thirty Years' War and Eighty Years' War","ok":true}],"note":"Trediveårskrigen sluttede 1648 (Westfalske Fred); Principia udkom 1687."},"tl|Københavns brand (1728) | Københavns bombardement (1807)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C3%B8benhavns_brand_1728","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Københavns brand 1728 var den største brand i Københavns historie. Den rasede ca. 60 timer","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/K%C3%B8benhavns_Domkirke_(Vor_Frue_Kirke)","d":"lex.dk","q":"Før Københavns brand i 1728, hvor kirken brændte","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/K%C3%B8benhavns_bombardement","d":"lex.dk","q":"Københavns bombardement er betegnelsen for englændernes bombardement af København 2.-5. september 1807.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_Battle_of_Copenhagen","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"occurred between 16 August and 7 September 1807 during the Napoleonic Wars","ok":true}],"note":"Branden var oktober 1728; bombardementet 2.-5. september 1807."},"tl|Slaget på Reden (1801) | Napoleon kroner sig (1804)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Slaget_p%C3%A5_Reden","d":"lex.dk","q":"Slaget på Reden var et søslag, der fandt sted skærtorsdag den 2. april 1801","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Copenhagen_(1801)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"a British naval fleet defeated a smaller force of the Royal Dano-Norwegian Navy anchored near Copenhagen on 2 April 1801","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Napoleon_Bonaparte","d":"lex.dk","q":"de franskes kejser i årene 1804-1814 og 1815","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Napoleon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In December 1804 Napoleon crowned himself Emperor of the French","ok":true}],"note":"Slaget på Reden var 2. april 1801; Napoleon kronede sig selv i december 1804."},"tl|Stavnsbåndets ophævelse (1788) | Den franske revolution (1789)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/stavnsb%C3%A5nd","d":"lex.dk","q":"skete ved forordning d. 20. juni 1788. Afviklingen skete dog ikke med det samme","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stavnsb%C3%A5ndet","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Det blev ophævet i 1788 med forordningen om afskaffelsen af stavnsbåndet","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Den_Franske_Revolution","d":"lex.dk","q":"Stormen på Bastillen den 14. juli 1789 indledte Den Franske Revolution","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Den_franske_revolution","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"en periode med politiske omvæltninger, som fandt sted i Frankrig 1789-1799","ok":true}],"note":"Stavnsbåndet ophævet ved forordning 20. juni 1788; revolutionen begyndte 1789. A først er korrekt."},"tl|Darwins Arternes oprindelse (1859) | Grundloven (1849)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Charles_Darwin","d":"lex.dk","q":"On the Origin of Species by Means of Natural Selection (udgivet 1859, på dansk Arternes oprindelse","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/On_the_Origin_of_Species","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It was published on 24 November 1859.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Danmarks_Riges_Grundlov","d":"lex.dk","q":"der blev stadfæstet af Frederik 7. den 5. juni 1849 og trådte i kraft samme dag","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danmarks_Riges_Grundlov","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"blev underskrevet den 5. juni 1849 af Frederik 7. og afløste enevældens forfatning","ok":true}],"note":"Grundloven 5. juni 1849, Darwins bog udgivet 1859. B først er korrekt."},"tl|Abraham Lincoln skydes (1865) | Slaget ved Dybbøl (1864)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://fords.org/lincolns-assassination/","d":"fords.org","q":"On the morning of April 14, 1865 (Good Friday), actor John Wilkes Booth learned President Abraham Lincoln would attend a performance","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nps.gov/foth/learn/historyculture/faq-the-assassination.htm","d":"nps.gov","q":"famous actor and Confederate sympathizer John Wilkes Booth assassinated President Abraham Lincoln","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Krigen_i_1864","d":"lex.dk","q":"den 18. april 1864, stormede de preussiske styrker den danske stilling ved Dybbøl","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Dybb%C3%B8l","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The battle was fought on the morning of 18 April 1864, following a siege that began on 2 April.","ok":true}],"note":"Dybbøl 18. april 1864; Lincoln skudt 14. april 1865. B først er korrekt."},"tl|Edison demonstrerer pæren (1879) | Bells telefon (1876)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/gl%C3%B8delampe","d":"lex.dk","q":"hans første brugbare lampe blev præsenteret i 1879 og vist i Europa på Paris-udstillingen i 1881","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Edison","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"first successful model of light bulb, used in public demonstrations at Menlo Park, December 1879","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Alexander_Graham_Bell","d":"lex.dk","q":"som han patenterede i 1876, og dannelsen af Bell Telephone Co. i 1877","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alexander_Graham_Bell","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"awarded the first U.S. patent for the telephone, on March 7, 1876.","ok":true}],"note":"Bells telefonpatent 1876; Edisons første brugbare pære præsenteret/demonstreret i 1879. B først er korrekt."},"tl|Eiffeltårnet åbner (1889) | Frihedsgudinden indvies (1886)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Eiffelt%C3%A5rnet","d":"lex.dk","q":"Tårnet blev opført til verdensudstillingen i 1889, hundredåret for Den Franske Revolution","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The main structural work was completed at the end of March 1889","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Fr%C3%A9d%C3%A9ric_Auguste_Bartholdi","d":"lex.dk","q":"opstillet i 1886 ved indsejlingen til New Yorks havn","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Statue_of_Liberty","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The statue was dedicated on October 28, 1886.","ok":true}],"note":"Frihedsgudinden indviet 28. oktober 1886; Eiffeltårnet færdigt/åbnet 1889. B først er korrekt."},"tl|Første moderne OL (1896) | Eiffeltårnet åbner (1889)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/sportsmedaljer","d":"lex.dk","q":"hvilket også var tilfældet ved de første moderne Olympiske Lege i Athen 1896","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1896_Summer_Olympics","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"were the first international Olympic Games held in modern history","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Eiffelt%C3%A5rnet","d":"lex.dk","q":"Tårnet blev opført til verdensudstillingen i 1889, hundredåret for Den Franske Revolution","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The main structural work was completed at the end of March 1889","ok":true}],"note":"Eiffeltårnet 1889, første moderne OL i Athen 1896. B først er korrekt."},"tl|Wright-brødrenes første flyvning (1903) | Einsteins relativitetsteori (1905)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Wilbur_Wright","d":"lex.dk","q":"var i luften første gang den 17. december 1903, og denne dato regnes for flyvningens fødselsdag","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wright_brothers","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the Wrights finally took to the air on December 17, 1903, making two flights each from level ground","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/relativitetsteori","d":"lex.dk","q":"den specielle relativitetsteori fra 1905 og den almene relativitetsteori fra 1915","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special_relativity","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the year his paper on special relativity was published","ok":true}],"note":"Første flyvning 17. december 1903; den specielle relativitetsteori 1905. A først er korrekt."},"tl|Første Ford Model T (1908) | Titanic sænkes (1912)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/fordisme","d":"lex.dk","q":"I 1908 introducerede Ford Motor Company i Detroit en ny bil under navnet Ford model T.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ford_Model_T","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"produced by the Ford Motor Company from October 1, 1908, to May 26, 1927.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Titanic_-_britisk_passagerskib","d":"lex.dk","q":"i april 1912 kolliderede med et isbjerg og totalforliste","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Titanic","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"sank in the early hours of 15 April 1912 after striking an iceberg","ok":true}],"note":"Model T 1908, Titanic forliste 15. april 1912. A først er korrekt."},"tl|Penicillin opdages (1928) | Wall Street-krakket (1929)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/penicillin","d":"lex.dk","q":"I 1928 fandt og beskrev den skotske bakteriolog","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Discovery_of_penicillin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Hospital in London in 1928, Scottish physician","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/New_York_Citys_historie","d":"lex.dk","q":"igangsatte Wall Street-krakket i 1929 en","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wall_Street_crash_of_1929","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"which began in October 1929 with a sharp decline in prices on the New York Stock Exchange","ok":true}],"note":"Fleming opdagede penicillin i 1928; krakket kom i oktober 1929. A først er korrekt."},"tl|Første VM i fodbold (1930) | Wall Street-krakket (1929)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/verdensmestre_i_fodbold_for_m%C3%A6nd","d":"lex.dk","q":"Turneringen har været afholdt siden 1930, bortset fra i 1942 og 1946","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1930_FIFA_World_Cup","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The 1930 FIFA World Cup was the first FIFA World Cup","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/New_York_Citys_historie","d":"lex.dk","q":"igangsatte Wall Street-krakket i 1929 en","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wall_Street_crash_of_1929","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"which began in October 1929 with a sharp decline in prices on the New York Stock Exchange","ok":true}],"note":"Wall Street-krakket 1929, første VM 1930. B først er korrekt."},"tl|Danmark besættes (1940) | Danmark befris (1945)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Danmarks_historie_1940-1945","d":"lex.dk","q":"Tysklands besættelse af Danmark fra 9. april 1940 til 5. maj 1945","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_occupation_of_Denmark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"On 9 April 1940, Germany invaded Denmark","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_occupation_of_Denmark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"which lasted until the Allied victory on 5 May 1945.","ok":true}],"note":"Besættelsen 9. april 1940 til 5. maj 1945. A først er korrekt."},"tl|Cheops-pyramiden bygges (ca. 2560 f.Kr.) | De sidste uldhårsmammutter dør ud på Wrangel Island (ca. 2000 f.Kr.)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.worldhistory.org/Khufu/","d":"worldhistory.org","q":"Built around 2560 BCE, it is the largest of the pyramids","ok":true},{"u":"https://egymonuments.gov.eg/en/monuments/the-great-pyramid/","d":"egymonuments.gov.eg","q":"the tomb of King Khufu (c.2589–2566 BC)","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.helsinki.fi/en/luomus/news/last-mammoths-died-remote-island","d":"helsinki.fi","q":"The last woolly mammoths lived on Wrangel Island in the Arctic Ocean; they died out 4,000 years ago","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wrangel_Island","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"with radiocarbon dating suggesting they persisted on the island until around 4,000 years ago","ok":true}],"note":"Pyramiden bygget ca. 2560 f.Kr. (Khufus regeringstid ca. 2589–2566 f.Kr.); de sidste mammutter på Wrangel døde for ca. 4.000 år siden (ca. 2000 f.Kr.), dvs. ca. 560 år se"},"tl|Coca-Cola opfindes (1886) | Eiffeltårnet indvies (1889)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/The_Coca-Cola_Company","d":"lex.dk","q":"baseret på en opfindelse, der blev gjort i 1886 af farmaceuten","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coca-Cola","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Pharmacy in Atlanta, Georgia, on May 8, 1886","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Eiffelt%C3%A5rnet","d":"lex.dk","q":"Tårnet blev opført til verdensudstillingen i 1889, hundredåret for Den Franske Revolution","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The main structural work was completed at the end of March 1889","ok":true}],"note":"Coca-Cola opfundet/solgt første gang 1886; Eiffeltårnet 1889. A først er korrekt."},"tl|Marita Koch sætter 400 m-verdensrekord (1985) | Florence Griffith-Joyner sætter 100 m-verdensrekord (1988)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marita_Koch","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Her record of 47.60 in the 400 metres","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marita_Koch","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"set on 6 October 1985, still stands.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/fastest-run-100-metres-(female)","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"On 16 July 1988, Florence Griffith-Joyner (USA) ran the 100 m in 10.49 seconds at the University Stadium in Indianapolis","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Florence_Griffith_Joyner","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"At the 1988 U.S. Olympic trials, Griffith set a new world record in the 100 m.","ok":true}],"note":"Koch 47,60 den 6. oktober 1985; Griffith-Joyner 10,49 den 16. juli 1988. A først er korrekt."},"tl|Danmark bliver medlem af EF (1973) | Berlinmuren falder (1989)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/det_danske_EU-medlemskab","d":"lex.dk","q":"med Danmarks indtræden i EF, som blev besluttet i 1972 og trådte i kraft den 1. januar 1973.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denmark_and_the_European_Union","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"joined the European Communities on 1 January 1973.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Berlinmuren","d":"lex.dk","q":"Om aftenen den 9. november 1989 lod de østtyske grænsevagter Berlinmuren åbne","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fall_of_the_Berlin_Wall","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"a Politburo press conference on 9 November 1989 prematurely announced that East Germans could travel without restrictions","ok":true}],"note":"EF-medlemskab 1. januar 1973; Berlinmurens fald 9. november 1989. Noten er korrekt."},"rec|Hvor høj var verdens højeste mand nogensinde, Robert Wadlow?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/tallest-man-ever","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"was found to be 2.72 m (8 ft 11.1 in) tall","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Wadlow","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"er berømt for at være den højeste mand nogensinde, da han ved sit livs sidste måling havde en højde på 272 cm.","ok":true}],"note":"Wadlow målte 2,72 m (8 ft 11,1 in) ved sidste måling i 1940; ingen højere person er verificeret."},"rec|Hvor mange timer er den længste dokumenterede tid uden søvn (Randy Gardner, 1964)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.sleepfoundation.org/sleep-deprivation","d":"sleepfoundation.org","q":"Randy Gardner, who conducted a supervised experiment where he stayed awake for 264 hours (11 days)","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sleep_deprivation","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Gardner stayed awake for 264 hours (11 days), breaking the previous record of 260 hours held by Tom Rounds of Honolulu","ok":true}],"note":"Gardners 264 timer er korrekt, men han er ikke den længste dokumenterede (Guinness nævner 449 timer, Maureen Weston 1977, i et rocking-chair-maraton). Formuleret om Gardn"},"rec|Hvor lang er verdens længste samlede fingernegle (Shridhar Chillal)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/67701-longest-fingernails-single-hand-ever","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The longest fingernails on a single hand - ever measure an aggregate length of 909.6 cm (358.1 in)","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shridhar_Chillal","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"with a combined length of 909.6 centimeters (358.1 inches)","ok":true}],"note":"909,6 cm er Guinness-rekorden for længste fingernegle på én hånd nogensinde, men Chillals negle blev klippet i 2018, og andre rekorder gælder for begge hænder. Spørgsmåle"},"rec|Hvor langt er verdens længste hår (Xie Qiuping)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/longest-hair-(female)","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The world's longest documented hair belongs to Xie Qiuping (China) at 5.627 m (18 ft 5.54 in) when measured on 8 May 2004.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Longest_hair","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Xie Qiuping had the longest documented hair in the world, measuring 5.627 metres","ok":true}],"note":"Guinness: længste dokumenterede hår er Xie Qiupings 5,627 m (2004), afrundet 5,63 m."},"rec|Hvor hurtigt løb Usain Bolt 100 meter?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Usain_Bolt","d":"lex.dk","q":"Usain Bolt satte i 2009 ny verdensrekord i 100-meterløb i tiden 9,58 sekunder.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Usain_Bolt","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bolt improved upon his second 100 m world record of 9.69 with 9.58 seconds in 2009","ok":true}],"note":"Verdensrekord 9,58 s fra Berlin 2009, stadig gældende."},"rec|Hvor dybt dykkede Herbert Nitsch på én indånding (no-limits)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/freediving-no-limit-(men)","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The deepest no-limit freedive by a male is 214 m (702 ft 1.18 in), by Herbert Nitsch (Austria) in Spetses, Greece, on 14 June 2007.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herbert_Nitsch","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Nitsch set the No Limit world record","ok":true}],"note":"Nitsch har to rekorder: 214 m (AIDA-godkendt, 2007) og 253 m (Guinness, 2012, uden for forbundenes regi). Uden præcisering er svaret tvetydigt, så spørgsmålet knyttes til"},"rec|Hvor gammel blev Jeanne Calment, verdens ældste dokumenterede person?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/oldest-person","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The greatest fully authenticated age to which any human has ever lived is 122 years 164 days by Jeanne Louise Calment (France).","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jeanne_Calment","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"med sine 122 år og 164 dage har rekorden som personen med den længste levetid i historien","ok":true}],"note":"122 år og 164 dage; ingen verificeret person har overgået det."},"rec|Hvor høj er verdens højeste bygning, Burj Khalifa?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/tallest-building","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The tallest building is the Burj Khalifa (Khalifa Tower) which measures 828 m (2,716 ft 6 in) tall.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Burj_Khalifa","d":"lex.dk","q":"828 m høj skryskraber i Dubai, opført 2004-09","ok":true}],"note":"Burj Khalifa er 828 m og verdens højeste bygning."},"rec|Hvor højt sprang Javier Sotomayor i højdespring?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/højdespring","d":"lex.dk","q":"er verdensrekorden blevet hævet med 85 cm til 2,45 meter, sat af cubaneren Javier Sotomayor (f. 1967) i 1993.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/High_jump","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Javier Sotomayor (Cuba) is the world record holder with a jump of 2.45 m","ok":true}],"note":"Verdensrekord 2,45 m fra 1993, stadig gældende."},"rec|Hvor langt sprang Mike Powell i længdespring?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/længdespring","d":"lex.dk","q":"Mike Powells verdensrekord på 8,95 meter er stadig gældende.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mike_Powell_(athlete)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"He set his world record of 8.95 m","ok":true}],"note":"Verdensrekord 8,95 m fra Tokyo 1991, stadig gældende."},"rec|Hvor lang er verdens længste tunge (Nick Stoeberl)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/longest-tongue","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The longest tongue measures 10.1 cm (3.97 in) from its tip to the middle of the closed top lip and belongs to Nick Stoeberl (USA).","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Largest_body_parts","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The person with the longest tongue is Nick Stoeberl of Salinas","ok":true}],"note":"Guinness: 10,1 cm (3,97 in), målt 2012; bekræftes af Wikipedia."},"rec|Hvor mange hotdogs spiste Joey Chestnut på 10 minutter?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/546576-most-hot-dogs-eaten-at-a-nathans-hot-dog-eating-contest-male","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The most hot dogs eaten at a Nathan's Hot Dog Eating Contest (male) is 76 and was achieved by Joey Chestnut (USA)","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joey_Chestnut","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"eating 76 hot dogs and buns in 10 minutes, a new record.","ok":true}],"note":"76 hotdogs med boller i Nathan's-konkurrencen 4. juli 2021 er Guinness-rekorden."},"rec|Hvor langt fløj verdens længste papirflyver?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/farthest-flight-by-a-paper-aircraft","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The farthest flight by a paper aircraft is 98.43 m (322 ft 11 in) and was achieved by Liu Liwen (China)","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paper_plane","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the record was broken again when Liu Liwen threw a paper airplane 98.43 metres","ok":true}],"note":"69,14 m (2012) er overgået; nuværende Guinness-rekord er 98,43 m (28. december 2025)."},"rec|Hvor længe fløj verdens længst flyvende papirflyver?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/longest-time-flying-a-paper-aircraft","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The longest time flying a paper aircraft is 31.2 seconds and was achieved by","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paper_plane","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"keeping their paper plane aloft for 31.2 seconds.","ok":true}],"note":"29,2 s (Takuo Toda, 2010) er overgået; nuværende Guinness-rekord er 31,2 s (11. februar 2026)."},"rec|Hvor høj er verdens højeste hund, Zeus (skulderhøjde)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/tallest-dog-ever","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"a Great Dane, who measured 1.118 m (44 in) tall on 4 October 2011","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.npr.org/sections/thetwo-way/2014/09/12/348005043/zeus-the-great-dane-worlds-tallest-dog-dies","d":"npr.org","q":"Measuring an incredible 111.8 cm (44 in) from foot to withers","ok":true}],"note":"Zeus målte 111,8 cm (1,118 m), ikke 112; han døde i 2014, så formuleringen rettes til 'var' og 'nogensinde'."},"rec|Hvor høj er Mount Everest?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Mount_Everest","d":"lex.dk","q":"I 2020 udsendte Nepal og Kina en fælles erklæring, hvor de satte højden af Everest til 8848,86 meter.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Everest","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"was most recently measured in 2020 through a joint survey by Nepalese and Chinese authorities as 8,848.86 m","ok":true}],"note":"Højden er forskellig i kilder (lex.dk 8848 m i indledningen, 8850 i 1999). Officiel højde fra 2020 er 8848,86 m ≈ 8849; spørgsmålet præciseres med årstal."},"rec|Hvor høj er K2, verdens næsthøjeste bjerg?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/K2","d":"lex.dk","q":"med sine 8611 m er K2 verdens næsthøjeste bjerg efter Mount Everest","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K2","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"at 8,611 metres (28,251 ft) above sea level","ok":true}],"note":"8611 m er den gængse angivelse; K2 er næsthøjeste bjerg."},"rec|Hvor høj er Kilimanjaro?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Kilimanjaro","d":"lex.dk","q":"hæver sig 5895 meter over havets overflade","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Kilimanjaro","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"highest mountain in Africa and the highest free-standing mountain above sea level in the world, at 5,895 m","ok":true}],"note":"5895 m er den officielt anvendte højde for Uhuru Peak."},"rec|Hvor dyb er Marianergraven (ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Marianergraven","d":"lex.dk","q":"der findes angivelser for den maksimale vanddybde på mellem 11.034 m og 10.991 m","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mariana_Trench","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The maximum known depth is 10,935 ± 6 meters","ok":true}],"note":"Kilderne angiver forskellige dybder (10.935 m ifølge Wikipedia, 10.991–11.034 m ifølge lex.dk). Spørgsmålet ændres til afrundet svar i km, som begge understøtter."},"rec|Hvor høj er Angel Falls i Venezuela, verdens højeste vandfald?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angel_Falls","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is the world's tallest uninterrupted waterfall","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/highest-waterfall","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"with a total drop of 979 m (3,212 ft)","ok":true}],"note":"979 m samlet fald (807 m længste frie fald) bekræftes af Wikipedia og Guinness World Records."},"rec|Hvor dyb er Bajkalsøen, verdens dybeste sø?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/deepest-lake","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"Soundings taken from the lake's Central Basin revealed it to be 1,642 metres (5,387 feet) deep.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Baikal","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is the deepest lake in the world at 1,642 metres","ok":true}],"note":"1.642 m er Guinness-rekorden og Wikipedias tal (nogle leksika runder til 1.620/1.700)."},"rec|Hvor stort er Det Kaspiske Hav (ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caspian_Sea","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It covers a surface area of 371,000 km","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Det_Kaspiske_Hav","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den er verdens største sø med et areal på ca. 370.000 km","ok":true}],"note":"Ca. 371.000 km² (lex.dk: ca. 370.000 km²); spørgsmålet er \"ca.\"."},"rec|Hvor stort er Rusland, verdens største land (ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Rusland","d":"lex.dk","q":"Areal 17,1 millioner km","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russia","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Total 17,098,246 km","ok":true}],"note":"Ca. 17,1 mio. km² (17.098.246 km²), verdens største land."},"rec|Hvor høj er Shanghai Tower?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shanghai_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"632-meter-tall (2,073-foot) megatall skyscraper","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.skyscrapercenter.com/building/shanghai-tower/56","d":"skyscrapercenter.com","q":"Height 632 m / 2,073 ft Floors 128","ok":true}],"note":"632 m bekræftes af Wikipedia og Skyscraper Center (CTBUH)."},"rec|Hvor høj er Taipei 101?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taipei_101","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"give the height of Taipei 101 as 508 m (1,667 ft)","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.skyscrapercenter.com/building/taipei-101/117","d":"skyscrapercenter.com","q":"Height 508 m / 1,667 ft Floors 101","ok":true}],"note":"508 m bekræftes af Wikipedia og Skyscraper Center."},"rec|Hvor høj er Petronas Towers i Kuala Lumpur?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Petronas_Towers","d":"lex.dk","q":"De to identiske tårne har 88 etager og en højde på 452 m","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Petronas_Towers","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"standing at 451.9 m (1,483 ft)","ok":true}],"note":"451,9 m afrundet til 452 m (lex.dk angiver 452 m)."},"rec|Hvor høj er Empire State Building (inkl. antenne, ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.esbnyc.com/about/facts-figures","d":"esbnyc.com","q":"1,454 feet (Or 443 meters) Height including antenna.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Empire_State_Building","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"stands a total of 1,454 feet (443.2 m) tall including its antenna","ok":true}],"note":"1.454 fod = 443 m inkl. antenne (tag 381 m)."},"rec|Hvor høj er Eiffeltårnet (ca., inkl. antenne)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Eiffelt%C3%A5rnet","d":"lex.dk","q":"hvilket har forøget højden til 330 meter","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The tower is 330 metres (1,083 ft) tall","ok":true}],"note":"330 m inkl. antenner bekræftes af lex.dk og Wikipedia."},"rec|Hvor højt er Rundetårn i København (ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.rundetaarn.dk/article/maal-og-vaegt/","d":"rundetaarn.dk","q":"Gade til platform: 34,8 m","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rundetaarn","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"34.8 meters above ground","ok":true}],"note":"Højden varierer efter målemetode (34,8 m til platformen; 41,55 m inkl. observatorium). Spørgsmålet præciseres til platformen, ca. 35 m."},"rec|Hvor høj er Himmelbjerget?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Himmelbjerget","d":"lex.dk","q":"147 m.o.h. Det har fra sidste del af 1800-tallet","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Himmelbjerget","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Himmelbjerget er en 147 meter høj bakke mellem Ry og Silkeborg","ok":true}],"note":"147 m bekræftes af lex.dk og da.wikipedia."},"rec|Hvor høj er København Rådhustårn (ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/K%C3%B8benhavns_R%C3%A5dhus","d":"lex.dk","q":"det 105,6 meter høje rådhustårn","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C3%B8benhavns_R%C3%A5dhus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Rådhustårnet er en af de højeste bygninger i København (105,6 m)","ok":true}],"note":"105,6 m ≈ 106 m (spørgsmålet er \"ca.\")."},"rec|Hvor lang er en blåhval (op til ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_whale","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Reaching a maximum confirmed length of 29.9–30.5 m","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/blue-whale","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"at up to 100 feet long and upwards of 200 tons","ok":true}],"note":"Bekræftet maks. ca. 30 m (100 fod); lex.dk nævner op til 33 m, men \"ca. 30\" er dækkende for bekræftede målinger."},"rec|Hvor tung kan en blåhval blive (op til ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/bl%C3%A5hval","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den kan nå en længde på 33 m og en vægt på 200 tons","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/blue-whale","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"at up to 100 feet long and upwards of 200 tons","ok":true}],"note":"Op til ca. 200 tons bekræftes af lex.dk og National Geographic."},"rec|Hvor hurtigt kan en pilgrimsfalk dykke (målt, ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/70929-fastest-bird-diving","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"estimated at reaching a terminal velocity in ideal conditions of approximately 320 km/h (200 mph)","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peregrine_falcon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Some sources state that the peregrine falcon can reach over 320 km/h (200 mph) during its stoop","ok":true}],"note":"389 km/t er kun et omdiskuteret eksperimentelt tal; Guinness angiver estimeret ca. 320 km/t i dyk. Rettet til 320 km/t (anslået)."},"rec|Hvor gammel er Jorden (ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Age_of_Earth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The age of Earth is estimated to be 4.54 ± 0.05 billion years.","ok":true},{"u":"https://pubs.usgs.gov/gip/geotime/age.html","d":"pubs.usgs.gov","q":"The best age for the Earth (4.54 Ga)","ok":true}],"note":"Ca. 4,54 mia. år."},"rec|Hvor gammelt er universet (ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/universe/overview/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"Around 13.8 billion years ago, the universe expanded faster than the speed of light","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Age_of_the_universe","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the age of the universe is 13.8 billion years.","ok":true}],"note":"Ca. 13,8 mia. år (Planck)."},"rec|Hvor bred er Jordens diameter (ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"fast enough to travel a distance equal to Earth's diameter, about 12,742 km","ok":true},{"u":"https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/planetary/factsheet/earthfact.html","d":"nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov","q":"Volumetric mean radius (km) 6371.000","ok":true}],"note":"Jordens gennemsnitlige diameter er ca. 12.742 km (middelradius 6371 km); 'ca.' dækker over ækvatordiameter 12.756 km."},"rec|Hvor bred er Månens diameter?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"its diameter is 3,474 km (2,159 mi)","ok":true},{"u":"https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/planetary/factsheet/moonfact.html","d":"nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov","q":"Volumetric mean radius (km) 1737.4","ok":true}],"note":"Månens diameter er 3474 km (middelradius 1737,4 km)."},"rec|Hvor langt er der til nærmeste stjerne uden for solsystemet (Proxima Centauri)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","fixed":true,"date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proxima_Centauri","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Proxima Centauri is 4.2465 light-years","ok":true},{"u":"https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/vis/a010000/a014100/a014142/script_32675_00.html","d":"svs.gsfc.nasa.gov","q":"4.2465 light-years away, or 25 trillion miles.","ok":true}],"note":"Afstanden er 4,2465 lysår, hvilket afrundet til to decimaler er 4,25 (ikke 4,24)."},"rec|Hvor varm er Solens overflade (ca.)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/sun/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"is a relatively cool 10,000 °F (5,500 °C)","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Solen","d":"lex.dk","q":"overfladetemperatur 5778 K","ok":true}],"note":"Solens overflade (fotosfæren) er ca. 5500 °C (effektiv temperatur 5772-5778 K)."},"rec|Hvor hurtigt bevæger lyd sig i luft ved 20 °C?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Speed_of_sound","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the speed of sound in air is about 343 m/s","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/lyd","d":"lex.dk","q":"I luft ved 20 °C og et tryk på 1 atmosfære er lydhastigheden ca. 343 m/s","ok":true}],"note":"Lydens hastighed i luft ved 20 °C er ca. 343 m/s."},"rec|Hvad er den højeste lufttemperatur, der nogensinde er målt (Death Valley, 1913)?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://www.nps.gov/deva/planyourvisit/weather.htm","d":"nps.gov","q":"The world record highest air temperature of 134°F (57°C) was recorded at Furnace Creek on July 10, 1913.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Valley","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The hottest air temperature ever recorded in Death Valley was 134 °F (56.7 °C)","ok":true}],"note":"Rekorden er 56,7 °C (134 °F) ved Furnace Creek, Death Valley, 10. juli 1913 (WMO-anerkendt, om end nogle meteorologer anfægter målingen)."},"rec|Hvor mange guldmedaljer vandt Michael Phelps ved OL?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michael_Phelps","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Phelps also holds the all-time records for Olympic gold medals (23)","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Michael_Phelps","d":"lex.dk","q":"vandt i alt 23 guldmedaljer, 3 sølvmedaljer og 2 bronzemedaljer","ok":true}],"note":"Phelps vandt 23 OL-guldmedaljer (28 medaljer i alt); det er rekord."},"rec|Hvor hurtigt løb Usain Bolt 200 meter?":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-08","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.