ng to be slapped","ok":true}],"note":"Backpfeifengesicht = et ansigt, der 'beder om en lussing'. De andre muligheder er forkerte."},"weird|Hvad betyder «Schadenfreude» (tysk)?":{"pool":"weird","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schadenfreude","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is the experience of pleasure, joy, or self-satisfaction that comes from learning of the troubles, failures, pain, suffering, or humiliation of another","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.duden.de/rechtschreibung/Schadenfreude","d":"duden.de","q":"boshafte Freude über das Missgeschick, Unglück eines andern","ok":true}],"note":"Schadenfreude = glæde over andres ulykke/uheld."},"weird|Hvad betyder «Torschlusspanik» (tysk)?":{"pool":"weird","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Torschlusspanik","d":"en.wiktionary.org","q":"the fear that time to act is running out","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dwds.de/wb/Torschlusspanik","d":"dwds.de","q":"Angst, eine wichtige Angelegenheit nicht mehr oder zu spät zu erledigen","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.duden.de/rechtschreibung/Torschlusspanik","d":"duden.de","q":"Angst, etwas Entscheidendes zu versäumen","ok":true}],"note":"Torschlusspanik = frygt/panik for at tiden løber ud eller for at komme for sent."},"weird|Hvad betyder «Fingerspitzengefühl» (tysk)?":{"pool":"weird","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fingerspitzengef%C3%BChl","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"tact, diplomacy and a certain amount of sensitivity to the feelings of others","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.duden.de/rechtschreibung/Fingerspitzengefuehl","d":"duden.de","q":"Feingefühl; Einfühlungsgabe im Umgang mit Menschen und Dingen","ok":true}],"note":"Fingerspitzengefühl = fintfølelse, takt og sensitivitet. Den forkerte mulighed om computer er forkert."},"weird|Hvad betyder «Weltschmerz» (tysk)?":{"pool":"weird","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","sources":[{