5 ting, der er gule\",\"r\":\"Alle fem skal være forskellige og gule.\"}":{"pool":"sm","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-09","daily":true,"sources":[]},"sm|{\"k\":\"flest\",\"m\":45,\"t\":\"Nævn så mange frugter som muligt\",\"r\":\"Tæl kun frugter, som de andre accepterer.\"}":{"pool":"sm","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-09","daily":true,"sources":[]},"sm|{\"k\":\"flest\",\"m\":45,\"t\":\"Nævn så mange dyr som muligt\",\"r\":\"Kun dyr, som de andre accepterer, tæller.\"}":{"pool":"sm","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[]},"sm|{\"k\":\"hurtigst\",\"m\":30,\"t\":\"Byg det højeste tårn af 10 klodser\",\"r\":\"Tårnet skal stå selv i 5 sekunder.\"}":{"pool":"sm","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[]},"sm|{\"k\":\"flest\",\"m\":45,\"t\":\"Nævn så mange ting som muligt, der findes i en skoletaske\",\"r\":\"Kun ting, de andre accepterer, tæller. Ingen gentagelser.\"}":{"pool":"sm","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[]},"sm|{\"k\":\"hurtigst\",\"m\":0,\"t\":\"Find fem ting i rummet, der alle starter med bogstavet M\",\"r\":\"Hurtigst med fem godkendte ting vinder. Stormesteren godkender.\"}":{"pool":"sm","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[]},"sm|{\"k\":\"flest\",\"m\":60,\"t\":\"Nævn så mange ting som muligt, der findes i et køleskab\",\"r\":\"Kun ting, de andre accepterer, tæller. Ingen gentagelser.\"}":{"pool":"sm","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[]},"sm|{\"k\":\"hurtigst\",\"m\":0,\"t\":\"Find tre ting i rummet, der alle er blå\",\"r\":\"Hurtigst med tre godkendte ting vinder. Stormesteren godkender.\"}":{"pool":"sm","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[]},"num|Hvor mange kamre har et menneskehjerte?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heart","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In humans, the heart is divided into four chambers: upper left and right atria and lower left and right ventricles.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/hjertet","d":"lex.dk","q":"Højre og venstre hjertehalvdel er adskilt af en muskelvæg (septum), som både adskiller de to forkamre (septum interatriale) og de to hjertekamre (septum interventriculare","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange sonetter skrev William Shakespeare?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shakespeare%27s_sonnets","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"it is almost always a reference to the 154 sonnets that were first published all together in a quarto in 1609","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.lex.dk/William_Shakespeare","d":"lex.dk","q":"Eftertidens vedholdende interesse for de ca. 30 skuespil og den ikke-dramatiske digtning (først og fremmest 154 sonetter)","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange millioner år siden uddøde dinosaurerne (bortset fra fuglene) cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dinosaur","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Cretaceous–Paleogene extinction event, which occurred approximately 66 million years ago at the end of the Cretaceous, caused the extinction of all dinosaur groups ex","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.lex.dk/dinosaurer","d":"lex.dk","q":"Alle dinosaurer — undtagen fuglene — forsvandt ved slutningen af Kridt for 66 millioner år siden","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange officielle sprog har FN?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.un.org/en/our-work/official-languages","d":"un.org","q":"There are six official languages of the UN. These are Arabic, Chinese, English, French, Russian and Spanish.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Official_languages_of_the_United_Nations","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"There are six official languages used in United Nations (UN) meetings and in which the UN writes and publishes all its official documents.","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange officielle sprog har EU?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://european-union.europa.eu/principles-countries-history/languages_en","d":"european-union.europa.eu","q":"The EU has 24 official languages","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Languages_of_the_European_Union","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The European Union (EU) has 24 official languages","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange jorddage tager Venus om at kredse om Solen cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/planetary/factsheet/venusfact.html","d":"nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov","q":"Sidereal orbit period (days) 224.701","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Venus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"completes an orbit every 224.7 days","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange smagsløg har en kat cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Cats have about 470 taste buds, compared to more than 9,000 on the human tongue.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.petmd.com/cat/nutrition/can-cats-eat-dog-food","d":"petmd.com","q":"Cats have a measly 470 taste buds, while dogs have 1700—for reference, humans have","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange hår har et menneske på hovedet cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hair","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"An average blonde person has 150,000 hairs, a brown-haired person has 110,000, a black-haired person has 100,000, and a redhead has 90,000.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.healthline.com/health/how-many-hairs-on-a-human-head","d":"healthline.com","q":"The average person has about 100,000 hairs with a similar number of hair follicles, which can help protect us from the elements, regulate our body temperature, and percei","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange tænder kan en haj miste i løbet af livet?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"some sharks lose 30,000 or more teeth in their lifetime.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/65009-animal-with-most-teeth.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"estimates suggest some species of requiem sharks may grow and shed 30,000 teeth","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange ben har det dyr i verden med flest ben?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eumillipes","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"This millipede can have as many as 1,306 legs","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/76269-most-legs","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The most legs possessed by any species of animal, living or extinct, is 1,306","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange tænder har en voksen kat?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Felidae","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They have 30 teeth","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.petmd.com/dog/general-health/5-interesting-facts-about-your-dogs-teeth","d":"petmd.com","q":"adult cats have 30 teeth","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange tænder har en voksen gris?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pig","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"giving a total of 44 teeth","ok":true},{"u":"https://a-z-animals.com/blog/pig-teeth-everything-you-could-possibly-want-to-know/","d":"a-z-animals.com","q":"Adult pigs have 44 teeth","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange tænder producerer en paraplysnegl (Umbraculum umbraculum) i løbet af sit liv?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/773112-most-teeth-lifetime","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"It produces approximately 750,000 tiny teeth during its lifetime, which is up to 10 years.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Umbrella_slug","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It has roughly 10,000 teeth in its mouth at any one time and will go through approximately 750,000 teeth during its lifetime of up to ten years.","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange horn kan en Jacob-får (Jacob sheep) maksimalt have?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/76665-most-horns","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The record for the most horns found on any species of mammal is six and belongs to a rare breed of sheep called Jacob sheep, bred in the USA and UK.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jacob_sheep","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The most distinguishing features of the Jacob are their four horns, although they may have as few as two or as many as six.","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange unger føder en ni-bæltet bæltedyr (Dasypus novemcinctus) normalt ad gangen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nine-banded_armadillo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Once the blastocyst does implant in the uterus it splits into four identical embryos","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/73559-most-fertile-animal-for-quadruplets","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"A close relative of the anteater, the nine-banded armadillo (Dasypus novemcinctus) is the only mammal known to bear identical quadruplets routinely.","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange tænder har en kravehaj (frilled shark, Chlamydoselachus anguineus)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frilled_shark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The jaws contain 300 trident-shaped teeth, each needle-tooth has a cusp and two cusplets","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/article/prehistoric-frilled-shark-bycatch-deep-sea-spd","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"The frilled shark—a roughly five-foot long fish with 300 teeth—was plucked by a trawler from more than 2,000 feet below the surface.","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange tænder har det landdyr med flest tænder, en leaf-tailed gecko (Uroplatus fimbriatus)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/107578-most-teeth-in-a-living-land-animal","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"It possesses a total of 169 teeth in its upper jaw and 148 in its lower jaw, making for a grand total of 317.","ok":true},{"u":"https://newsukraine.rbc.ua/news/most-toothy-creature-of-planet-it-s-not-shark-1736248779.html","d":"newsukraine.rbc.ua","q":"it has 169 teeth on its upper jaw and 148 on its lower jaw which makes a total of 317 teeth","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange segmenter har en igle (Hirudinea)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leech","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"All leech species, however, have 32 segments, called somites, (34 if two head segments, which have different organization, are counted).","ok":true},{"u":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11418187/","d":"pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov","q":"The leech body plan arises from 32 segmental primordia","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange 'hjerner' har en blæksprutte?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://oceanconservancy.org/blog/2019/07/11/baby-octopuses-inkredible/","d":"oceanconservancy.org","q":"Because of its nine brains and more than half of its neurons being in its arms, individual arms can solve problems—like opening a jar—independently from the rest of the b","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.pbs.org/video/deep-thinkers-spy-in-the-ocean-feoqz5/","d":"pbs.org","q":"All nine brains can think for themselves or even think as one when required.","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange øjne kan en kammusling maksimalt have?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mollusc_eye","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Scallops can have up to 200 pallial eyes arranged along the exposed surface of the mantle.","ok":true},{"u":"https://carnegiemnh.org/scallop-eyes-relate-human-uniqueness","d":"carnegiemnh.org","q":"They have up to 200 eyes along the mantle margin","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange muskler har en kat i hvert øre?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.petmd.com/cat/general-health/cat-ear-facts","d":"petmd.com","q":"Humans have six muscles in our outer ear (pinna). Cats have 32.","ok":true},{"u":"https://vcahospitals.com/resources/lifestyle/seven-fun-facts-about-your-pet-s-ears","d":"vcahospitals.com","q":"Dogs have at least 18 muscles to control each ear, and cats have 32! Humans have 3.","ok":true}]},"num|Hvor mange halsvirvler har en giraf?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.clevelandzoosociety.org/z/2021/03/02/truth-or-tail-giraffe-have-more-neck-bones-than-a-human","d":"clevelandzoosociety.org","q":"they only have seven neck vertebrae - the same number of neck bones that humans have!","ok":true},{"u":"https://savegiraffesnow.org/how-many-vertebrae-do-giraffes-have","d":"savegiraffesnow.org","q":"Giraffes have seven cervical vertebrae, the same number of neck bones as humans and most other mammals.","ok":true}]},"tf|Et voksent menneske har normalt 206 knogler i kroppen.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-09","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_skeleton","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The human skeleton is the internal framework of the human body. It is composed of around 270 bones at birth – this total decreases to around 206 bones by adulthood after ","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/skelet","d":"lex.dk","q":"Skelettet er kroppens bærende rammeværk af knogler, som er forbundet ved led. Et menneske har 206 knogler i skelettet.","ok":true}]},"tf|Lysets hastighed i vakuum er 299.792.458 meter i sekundet.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/cuu/Value?c","d":"physics.nist.gov","q":"speed of light in vacuum numerical value 299 792 458 m s -1","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Speed_of_light","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the value 299,792,458 metres per second is approximately 1 billion kilometres per hour","ok":true}]},"tf|Tør luft i Jordens atmosfære består hovedsageligt af ilt.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atmosphere_of_Earth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"by mole fraction (i.e., by quantity of molecules), dry air contains 78.08% nitrogen, 20.95% oxygen, 0.93% argon, 0.04% carbon dioxide","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/atmosf%C3%A6ren","d":"lex.dk","q":"de 78 procent, som er kvælstof, findes helt overvejende i molekylær form","ok":true}]},"tf|Et døgn på Mars varer cirka 24,6 timer.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/mars/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"it completes one rotation every 24.6 hours, which is very similar to one day on earth (23.9 hours)","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Mars","d":"lex.dk","q":"rotationsperiode 24,6229 h","ok":true}]},"tf|Et lyn kan opvarme luften omkring sig til cirka 30.000 °C.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/lyn","d":"lex.dk","q":"opvarmer lynkanalen til ca. 30.000 °C","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lightning","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the air around the lightning flash rapidly heats to temperatures of about 30,000 °C (54,000 °F)","ok":true}]},"tf|Jorden er omkring 4,5 milliarder år gammel.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"when the solar system settled into its current layout about 4.5 billion years ago, earth formed when gravity pulled swirling gas and dust in to become the third planet fr","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"By 4.54 ± 0.04 Ga, the primordial Earth had formed.","ok":true}]},"tf|En dag på Venus varer længere end et år på Venus.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/venus/venus-facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"your “day” would be 243 Earth days long — longer even than a Venus year (one trip around the Sun), which takes only 225 Earth days.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Venus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"sidereal day, 243 Earth days, lasts longer than a Venusian year, 224.7 Earth days.","ok":true}]},"tf|Flamingoer er lyserøde på grund af deres mad.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flamingo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The pink or reddish colour of flamingos comes from carotenoids in their diet of animal and plant plankton.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/flamingo","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"The flamingo’s pink or reddish color comes from the rich sources of carotenoid pigments (like the pigments of carrots) in the algae and small crustaceans the birds eat.","ok":true}]},"tf|En kejserpingvin kan holde vejret i over 20 minutter.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emperor_penguin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"While hunting, the species can remain submerged around 20 minutes, diving to a depth of 535 m (1,755 ft).","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/article/emperor-penguins-behavior-adaptation-diving","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"They also can remain submerged for over 20 minutes.","ok":true}]},"tf|Blåhvalen er det største dyr, der nogensinde har levet.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_whale","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"it is the largest animal known to have ever existed.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.fisheries.noaa.gov/species/blue-whale","d":"fisheries.noaa.gov","q":"Blue whales are the largest animals ever to live on our planet.","ok":true}]},"tf|En kakerlak kan holde vejret i 40 minutter.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cockroach","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"By doing this, cockroaches can remain submerged for up to 40 minutes.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www3.epa.gov/pesticides/kids/roaches/english/facts/index.html","d":"www3.epa.gov","q":"A roach can hold its breath for 40 minutes.","ok":true}]},"tf|Flagermus er de eneste pattedyr, der kan flyve.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the only mammals capable of true and sustained flight.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/bats","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"They are the only mammals in the world that can fly","ok":true}]},"tf|En struds har kun to tæer på hver fod.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_ostrich","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"having just two toes on each foot (most birds have four)","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/ostrich","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"Ostriches are the only birds that have only two toes: all other birds have three or more.","ok":true}]},"tf|En blæksprutte har tre hjerter – to gællehjerter og ét systemisk hjerte.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Octopuses have a closed circulatory system, in which the blood remains inside blood vessels. They have three hearts; a systemic or main heart that circulates blood around","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Octopuses have three hearts. Two pump blood to the gills, while the third pumps it to the rest of the body.","ok":true}]},"tf|Mantisrejen har mindst 16 forskellige typer lysfølsomme celler i øjet, mens mennesket har 4.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mantis_shrimp","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Compared with the four types of photoreceptor cell that humans possess in their eyes, the eyes of a mantis shrimp have between 12 and 16 types of photoreceptor cells.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mantis_shrimp","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Some species have at least 16 different photoreceptor types, 12 of them for colour analysis in the different wavelengths (including four which are sensitive to ultraviole","ok":true}]},"tf|En teskefuld stof fra en neutronstjerne vejer over 5.000 milliarder kilogram.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neutron_star","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A neutron star is so dense that one teaspoon (4.929 milliliters) of its material would have a mass over 5.5×1012 kg, about 900 times the mass of the Great Pyramid of Giza","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neutron_star","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"one teaspoon of matter from the neutron star would weigh 6 billion tons.","ok":true}]},"tf|Den korteste krig i historien, Anglo-Zanzibar-krigen, varede mellem 38 og 45 minutter.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anglo-Zanzibar_War","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The conflict lasted between 38 and 45 minutes, marking it as the shortest recorded war in history.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anglo-Zanzibar_War","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Lasting between 38 and 45 minutes, it is the shortest recorded war in history.","ok":true}]},"tf|Bjørnedyr (tardigrader) overlevede 10 dage i det ydre rum i 2007.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tardigrade","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They have survived exposure to outer space.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tardigrade","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"In 2007, scientists discovered that some Tardigrades were able to survive 10 days in outer space.","ok":true}]},"tf|Eiffeltårnet kan skubbes op til 18 cm bort fra solen ved varmeudvidelse af metallet.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_Tower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Depending on the ambient temperature, the top of the tower may shift away from the sun by up to 18 cm (7 in) due to thermal expansion of the metal on the side facing the ","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_Tower","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"The top of the tower leans away from the sun as the metal facing the sun heats up and expands; it can move as much as 18 cm (7 inches) and grow 15 cm (6 inches) taller.","ok":true}]},"tf|En neutronstjernes massefylde svarer til massen af en atomkerne.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neutron_star","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"which is comparable to the approximate density of an atomic nucleus","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neutron_star","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"The density of the star is like that of the nucleus of an atom.","ok":true}]},"tf|Krokodiller kan ikke række tungen ud.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crocodile","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Their tongues are not free, but held in place by a membrane that limits movement; as a result, crocodiles are unable to stick out their tongues.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crocodile","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Crocodile tongues are not free. They are held in place by a membrane that can not move. Crocodiles are unable to stick out their tongues.","ok":true}]},"tf|Pandaer er teknisk set rovdyr.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giant_panda","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Despite its taxonomic classification as a carnivoran, the giant panda's diet is primarily herbivorous, with approximately 99% of its diet consisting of bamboo.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giant_panda","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Although it belongs to the order Carnivora, the panda's diet is almost 99% bamboo.","ok":true}]},"tf|En blækspruttes blod er blåt.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The haemocyanin is dissolved in the blood plasma instead of carried within blood cells and gives the blood a bluish colour.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cephalopod","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"As a result, their blood is colourless when deoxygenated and turns blue when placed in air.","ok":true}]},"tf|Bananer vokser opad.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Banana","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It grows upward in clusters near the top of the plant.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.australianbananas.com.au/pages/all-about-bananas/mind-bending-facts","d":"australianbananas.com.au","q":"Once developed, instead of growing towards the ground, bananas turn towards the sun.","ok":true}]},"odd|Kaskelotten er den største nulevende tandhval. | Kaskelotten kan dykke ned til omkring 2 kilometers dybde. | Kaskelotten har den største hjerne af alle nulevende dyr. | Kaskelotten er en bardehval, der filtrerer sin føde gennem barder.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sperm_whale","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It has the largest brain on Earth , more than five times heavier than a human's.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sperm_whale","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Plunging to 2,250 metres (7,380 ft) , it is the third deepest diving mammal","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/kaskelotter","d":"lex.dk","q":"Kaskelotten ( Physeter macrocephalus ) er den største nulevende tandhval .","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/hvaler","d":"lex.dk","q":"fx kaskelothvalen kan dykke 2000 m","ok":true}]},"odd|Ozonlaget ligger i stratosfæren. | Ozonlaget findes ca. 15-35 km over Jordens overflade. | Ozonlaget absorberer det meste af Solens ultraviolette stråling. | Ozonlaget beskytter Jorden mod infrarød stråling.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ozone_layer","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The ozone layer or ozone shield is a region of Earth 's stratosphere that absorbs most of the Sun 's ultraviolet radiation.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ozone_layer","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The ozone layer is mainly found in the lower portion of the stratosphere, from approximately 15 to 35 kilometers (9 to 22 mi) above Earth","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/ozonlag","d":"lex.dk","q":"Ozonlag er et lag af ozon i atmosfæren, som absorberer ultraviolet stråling fra Solen","ok":true}]},"odd|Den Internationale Rumstation kredser om Jorden på cirka 93 minutter. | Rumstationen flyver ca. 400 km over Jordens overflade. | Forskere om bord på ISS kan udnytte vægtløsheden i deres forsøg. | Astronauterne på ISS er vægtløse, fordi Jordens tyngdekraft ikke når ud til stationen.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Space_Station","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Gravity at the altitude of the ISS is approximately 90% as strong as on Earth's surface, but objects in orbit are in continuous freefall","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Space_Station","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"roughly every 93 minutes around Earth","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Den_Internationale_Rumstation","d":"lex.dk","q":"Rumstationen er i omløb 350-400 km over Jorden","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Den_Internationale_Rumstation","d":"lex.dk","q":"den foretager en omkredsning af Jorden på cirka 93 minutter","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Den_Internationale_Rumstation","d":"lex.dk","q":"hvor forskere igennem længere tid kan udnytte vægtløsheden som et redskab i deres forskning","ok":true}]},"odd|Geparden er verdens hurtigste landdyr. | Geparden kan accelerere fra 0 til ca. 100 km/t på under 3 sekunder. | Geparder har sorte tårestriber i ansigtet. | Geparden kan trække kløerne helt ind som de fleste andre katte.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheetah","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The cheetah is a pursuit predator and the fastest land animal, capable of running at 93–104 km/h (58–65 mph)","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheetah","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the cheetah has an exceptional acceleration, from 0 to 97 km/h (0 to 60 mph) in less than 3 seconds","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheetah","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The slightly curved claws are shorter and straighter than those of other cats, lack a protective sheath and are partly retractile.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/gepard","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den er verdens hurtigste landdyr med en topfart på omkring 100 km/t","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/gepard","d":"lex.dk","q":"geparden kan kun trække kløerne delvist ind og bruger dem som piggene på pigsko","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/gepard","d":"lex.dk","q":"Arten kendes bl.a. på sine sorte \"tårestriber\", der løber mellem øjenkrogen og mundvigen.","ok":true}]},"odd|Vandbjørne kan overleve i det ydre rum. | Vandbjørne har 8 ben. | Vandbjørne kan overleve vakuum. | Vandbjørne er insekter.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tardigrade","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They have survived exposure to outer space.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bj%C3%B8rnedyr","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bjørnedyr er små dyr, som for de fleste arters vedkommende har 4 par ben.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bj%C3%B8rnedyr","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"De kan overleve vakuum","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/bj%C3%B8rnedyr","d":"lex.dk","q":"De har fire par leddelte ben","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/bj%C3%B8rnedyr","d":"lex.dk","q":"radioaktiv stråling, vakuum og organiske opløsningsmidler","ok":true}]},"odd|Axolotlen kan gendanne tabte lemmer. | Axolotlen beholder sine gæller hele livet. | Axolotlen lever naturligt kun i søerne omkring Mexico City. | Axolotlen er en fisk.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/axolotl","d":"lex.dk","q":"Axolotlen er en vandlevende, neoten halepadde fra Mexico.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/axolotl","d":"lex.dk","q":"Tidligere fandtes axolotlen i de ferske Xochimilco- og Chalcosøer","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Axolotl","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Axolotler har distinkte \"bregne-lignende\" gællestrukturer","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Axolotl","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Axolotler har en særlig egenskab: de heler ikke deres skader med sårdannelse som andre dyr gør, men har en exce