iske effekt. | Einstein udgav den generelle relativitetsteori i 1915. | Einstein modtog nobelprisen i fysik for relativitetsteorien.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albert_Einstein","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In 1905, sometimes described as his annus mirabilis (miracle year), he published four groundbreaking papers","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albert_Einstein","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In 1915, he proposed a general theory of relativity","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albert_Einstein","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"He received the 1921 Nobel Prize in Physics for \"his services to Theoretical Physics, and especially for his discovery of the law of the photoelectric effect\".","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/physics/1921/einstein/facts/","d":"nobelprize.org","q":"Prize motivation: “for his services to Theoretical Physics, and especially for his discovery of the law of the photoelectric effect”","ok":true}]},"odd|Marie Curie vandt nobelprisen i fysik i 1903. | Marie Curie vandt nobelprisen i kemi i 1911. | Marie Curie er den eneste, der har vundet nobelpriser i to forskellige videnskaber. | Marie Curie vandt to nobelpriser i samme videnskab.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marie_Curie","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"She shared the 1903 Nobel Prize in Physics","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marie_Curie","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"She won the 1911 Nobel Prize in Chemistry","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marie_Curie","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the only person to win a Nobel Prize in two different scientific fields","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/physics/1903/marie-curie/facts/","d":"nobelprize.org","q":"the first person ever to be awarded two Nobel Prizes","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/chemistry/1911/marie-curie/facts/","d":"nobelprize.org","q":"Prize motivation: “in recognition of her services to the advancement of chemistry by the discovery of the elements radium and polonium, by the isolation of radium and the","ok":true}]},"odd|Blæksprutten har tre hjerter. | Blækspruttens blod er blåt pga. hæmocyanin. | Blæksprutten kan ændre farve via chromatoforer. | Blæksprutten har ti hjerter.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They have three hearts; a systemic or main heart that circulates blood around the body and two branchial or gill hearts that pump it through the two gills.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The haemocyanin is dissolved in the blood plasma instead of carried within blood cells and gives the blood a bluish colour.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"chromatophores in the skin can respond to light independently of the eyes.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/magazine/article/octopus-anatomy-cephalopod-disguise-evolution","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"For starters, they have three hearts and blue blood.","ok":true}]},"odd|Den kinesiske mur er ikke synlig fra Månen med det blotte øje. | Den kinesiske mur strækker sig over 21.000 km inklusive alle sektioner. | Muren blev bygget over flere dynastier, bl.a. Qin og Ming. | Den kinesiske mur er den eneste menneskeskabte struktur, der kan ses fra rummet.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Wall_of_China","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Great Wall of China cannot be seen by the naked human eye from the Moon","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Wall_of_China","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"spanning 21,196.18 km (13,170.70 mi) in total","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Wall_of_China","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The first walls date to the 7th century BC; these were joined together in the Qin dynasty","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Wall_of_China","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the best-known sections were built by the Ming dynasty (1368–1644)","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nasa.gov/image-article/great-wall/","d":"nasa.gov","q":"the wall isn't visible from the moon, and is difficult or impossible to see from Earth orbit without the high-powered lenses used for this photo","ok":true}]},"odd|Guldfisk har en hukommelse på mindst tre måneder. | Guldfisk kan skelne mellem farver, former og lyde. | Guldfisk bruges som modelorganisme i hukommelsesforskning. | Guldfisk har en hukommelse på 3 sekunder.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goldfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Goldfish have a memory span of at least three months and can distinguish between different shapes, colors, and sounds.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/goldfish-memory.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"Goldfish memories can actually last for weeks, months and even years.","ok":true}]},"odd|Honning har en ekstremt lang holdbarhed og kan holde sig i årtusinder under rette forhold. | Honning er hygroskopisk og har lavt vandindhold, hvilket hæmmer bakterievækst. | Honning har en sur pH, som hæmmer mikroorganismer. | Honning fordærves efter 2 år, selv uåbnet.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honey","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Honey, and objects immersed in honey, have been preserved for centuries.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honey","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Due to honey's high sugar concentration and acidic pH level many microorganisms cannot grow in it","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.ars.usda.gov/research/publications/publication/?seqNo115=126568","d":"ars.usda.gov","q":"Glucose oxidase results in the formation of gluconic acid and hydrogen peroxide. The former is the major acid in honey and the latter stabilizes honey against bacteria.","ok":true}]},"odd|Bananer er svagt radioaktive pga. kalium-40. | En banan giver en strålingsdosis på ca. 0,1 mikrosievert (BED). | Menneskekroppen er også svagt radioaktiv pga. kalium-40. | En banan er mere radioaktiv end en flyvetur over Atlanten.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Banana_equivalent_dose","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bananas contain naturally occurring radioactive isotopes, particularly potassium-40","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.epa.gov/radtown/natural-radioactivity-food","d":"epa.gov","q":"Consuming one banana would deliver a total dose of 0.01 millirem (0.1 microsieverts) of radiation.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.epa.gov/radtown/natural-radioactivity-food","d":"epa.gov","q":"Bananas are a good source of potassium in your diet and a small fraction of all potassium is radioactive.","ok":true}]},"odd|Strudsen er verdens største nulevende fugl. | Strudsen kan løbe op til 70 km/t. | Strudsen stikker hovedet i sandet, når den er bange. | Strudsens øjne har en diameter på ca. 5 cm og er blandt de største hos nulevende landhvirveldyr.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/strudse","d":"lex.dk","q":"De er verdens største nulevende fugle, og kan blive op til 2,75 m høje og veje 150 kg.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/strudse","d":"lex.dk","q":"Strudse kan holde en fart på 50 km/t i op til en halv time og kan kortvarigt nå op på 70 km/t.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_ostrich","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Contrary to a popular assumption, ostriches do not bury their heads in sand to avoid danger.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/strudse","d":"lex.dk","q":"Øjnene er store, med en diameter på 5 cm blandt de største hos nulevende landhvirveldyr.","ok":true}]},"odd|Giraffen er verdens højeste nulevende landdyr. | Giraffen har syv halshvirvler – det samme som mennesket. | Giraffens hjerte er det største af alle pattedyrs hjerter. | Giraffens tunge er ca. 45 cm lang.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/giraf","d":"lex.dk","q":"Girafferne er verdens højeste nulevende dyr.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/giraf","d":"lex.dk","q":"Som langt de fleste andre pattedyr har girafferne kun syv halshvirvler.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/giraf","d":"lex.dk","q":"Girafferne har ikke, som man tidligere troede, et særligt stort hjerte sammenlignet med andre pattedyr.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giraffe","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A giraffe's tongue is about 45 cm (18 in) long.","ok":true}]},"odd|Tomaten er botanisk set en frugt (et bær). | I 1893 afgjorde USA's højesteret, at tomater er en grøntsag. | I 1500-tallet troede mange europæere, at tomater var giftige. | Tomater vokser på træer.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tomato","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the tomato is a plant whose fruit is an edible berry","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tomato","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In Nix v. Hedden, the U.S. Supreme Court settled the controversy on 10 May 1893, by declaring that for the purposes of the Tariff of 1883 only, the tomato is a vegetable","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tomato","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"it was understood to be related to the nightshades and assumed to be poisonous.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tomato","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Tomato plants are vines, largely annual, and vulnerable to frost","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/tomat","d":"lex.dk","q":"Det er en varme-, nærings- og vandkrævende, en- eller flerårig, opstigende til klatrende, håret urt","ok":true}]},"odd|Flagermus er de eneste pattedyr, der kan flyve aktivt. | Flagermus er blinde. | Flagermus bruger ekkolokalisering til at orientere sig. | Ca. 20 % af alle pattedyrarter er flagermus.":{"pool":"odd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/flagermus","d":"lex.dk","q":"Flagermus er en orden, som omfatter de eneste pattedyr, der har vinger og kan flyve aktivt.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/flagermus","d":"lex.dk","q":"Næsten alle arter har små øjne og moderat eller ringe syn.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/flagermus","d":"lex.dk","q":"Alle arter finder primært føde vha. ekkolokalisering.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/flagermus","d":"lex.dk","q":"Der kendes over 1.400 arter, hvilket betyder, at ca. 20 % af alle kendte pattedyrarter er flagermus.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bats are the only mammals capable of sustained flight","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Microbats tend to have small eyes but are still sensitive to light, and no species is truly blind.","ok":true}]},"taboo|Sommer":{"pool":"taboo","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[]},"taboo|Musik":{"pool":"taboo","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[]},"taboo|Mad":{"pool":"taboo","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[]},"taboo|Frisbee":{"pool":"taboo","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[]},"taboo|Tandtråd":{"pool":"taboo","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[]},"taboo|Vaffeljern":{"pool":"taboo","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[]},"taboo|Papirsaks":{"pool":"taboo","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[]},"taboo|Plastikpose":{"pool":"taboo","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[]},"taboo|Gummistøvle":{"pool":"taboo","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-1