dia.org/wiki/Email","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In 1971 the first ARPANET network mail was sent, introducing the now-familiar address syntax with the '@' symbol designating the user's system address.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/december-3/first-sms-text-message-sent","d":"history.com","q":"On December 3, 1992, the first SMS text message in history is sent: Neil Papworth, a 22-year-old engineer, uses a personal computer to send the text message “Merry Christ","ok":true}]},"tl|Første kunstige satellit Sputnik 1 (1957) | Første menneske i rummet (Gagarin, 1961)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sputnik_1","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"was the first artificial Earth satellite. It was launched into an elliptical low Earth orbit by the Soviet Union on 4 October 1957","ok":true},{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/resource/yuri-gagarin-first-human-in-space","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"On April 12, 1961, the era of human spaceflight began when the Cosmonaut Yuri Gagarin became the first human to orbit the Earth","ok":true}]},"tl|Første menneskelige hjertetransplantation (Barnard, 1967) | Første menneske på Månen (Apollo 11, 1969)":{"pool":"tl","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heart_transplantation","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Patient Louis Washkansky received this transplant on December 3, 1967, at the Groote Schuur Hospital in Cape Town, South Africa.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/july-20/nixon-watches-first-lunar-landing","d":"history.com","q":"On July 20, 1969, President Richard Nixon, along with millions of others, watches as two American astronauts walk on the moon.","ok":true}]},"rec|Hvor lang var verdens længste skæg (Hans Langseth)? (Guinness)":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/longest-beard-male","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The longest natural beard locks ever (male) belonged to Hans N. Langseth (Norway, b. 1846) and measured 5.33 m (17 ft 6 in) at the time of his burial in Kensett, Iowa in ","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hans_Langseth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"When he died, his beard measured 5.33 meters (17.5 ft).","ok":true}]},"rec|Hvor langt er verdens længste overskæg (Ram Singh Chauhan)? (Guinness)":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/news/2012/8/happy-independence-day-our-top-10-records-from-india-44243","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The longest moustache measures 4.29 m (14 ft) and belongs to Ram Singh Chauhan (India). It was measured on the set of Lo Show dei Record in Rome, Italy, on 4 March 2010.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/magazine-17819632","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"Ram Singh Chauhan of India is the proud owner of the world's longest moustache, officially recorded by Guinness World Records as 4.29m (14ft) long.","ok":true}]},"rec|Hvor lang var verdens længste fingernegle på en kvinde (Lee Redmond)? (Guinness)":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/news/2015/8/60/2008-longest-fingernails-392858","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"After nearly 30 years of growth, her nails measure a total of 8.65 m (28 ft 4.5 in); the longest nail is that on her right thumb, which alone is 90 cm (2 ft 11 in).","ok":true},{"u":"http://news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/americas/7889890.stm","d":"news.bbc.co.uk","q":"Their combined length was more than 28ft (8.5m), with the longest nail - on her right thumb - measuring 2ft 11in (89cm), Guinness said.","ok":true}]},"rec|Hvor tungt kan man løfte med skægget (Antanas Kontrimas)? (Guinness)":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnesswo