d Olympia in","ok":true}]},"rec|Hvor dybt i havet er verdens dybeste fisk nogensinde set (snailfish, 2022)? (Guinness)":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/deepest-fish","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The current record holder is a specimen of Pseudoliparis (species unknown) observed at a depth of 8,336 metres (27,349 feet) in the western Pacific's Izu-Ogasawara Trench","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pseudoliparis_(fish)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They have been observed swimming at extreme depths of 8,336 metres (27,349 ft; 5.180 mi), in very deep ocean trenches of the Pacific Ocean","ok":true}]},"rec|Hvor høj var verdens korteste hund, chihuahuaen Pearl (2022)? (Guinness)":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/smallest-dog-living-(height)","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The shortest dog living is Pearl (USA), who measures 9.14 cm (3.59 in), as verified in Orlando, Florida, USA, on 23 August 2022.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/newsround/65250491","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"Pearl is a two-year-old Chihuahua from Florida in the US, who has just broken the Guinness World Record for the shortest living dog. She measures in at a tiny 9.14cm tall","ok":true}]},"rec|Hvor høj var verdens korteste mand nogensinde, Chandra Bahadur Dangi? (Guinness)":{"pool":"rec","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/news/2012/2/worlds-shortest-man-all-you-need-to-know-about-chandra-bahadur-dangi/","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"Chandra measures 54.6cm (21.5 in), making him the same size of six stacked cans of baked beans.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chandra_Bahadur_Dangi","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Measuring 54.6 cm (1 ft 9+1⁄2 in), he was recognized by Guinness World Records 