ol":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angkor_Wat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is the largest religious complex in the world.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Angkor_Archaeological_Park","d":"en.wikivoyage.org","q":"Angkor Archaeological Park was declared a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1992.","ok":true}]},"dx|{\"a\":\"Taj Mahal, Indien\",\"c\":[\"Bygningen er et elfenbenshvidt marmormausoleum i Agra.\",\"Den blev bestilt i 1631 af mogulkejseren Shah Jahan.\",\"~Den er bygget til minde om hans kone Mumtaz Mahal.\",\"Den står på bredden af floden Yamuna.\",\"~Den er et af de nye 7 verdensundere.\",\"Den er på UNESCOs verdensarvsliste.\"],\"e\":\"Snydesporene er sande: Taj Mahal er bygget til minde om Mumtaz Mahal og er et af de nye 7 verdensundere, men begge dele kan pege på andre monumenter. Det afgørende er beliggenheden i Agra ved Yamuna.\"}":{"pool":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taj_Mahal","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Taj Mahal is an ivory-white marble mausoleum on the right bank of the river Yamuna in Agra, Uttar Pradesh, India.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.tajmahal.gov.in/","d":"tajmahal.gov.in","q":"upto the mausoleum crafted in soft & pure marble and jewelled with semi precious stones","ok":true}]},"dx|{\"a\":\"Chichén Itzá, Mexico\",\"c\":[\"Byen var en mayaby på Yucatán-halvøen.\",\"Det mest berømte bygningsværk er pyramiden El Castillo.\",\"~Ved jævndøgn kaster pyramiden en skygge, der ligner en slange.\",\"Byen har en hellig cenote (vandhul).\",\"~Byen er et af de nye 7 verdensundere.\",\"Den er på UNESCOs verdensarvsliste.\"],\"e\":\"Snydesporene er sande: skyggeslangen ses ved jævndøgn, og byen er et af de nye 7 verdensundere, men begge dele kan pege på andre steder i Mexico og verden. Det afgørende er mayakulturen og Yucatán.\"}":{"pool":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chichen_Itza","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Chichen Itza is located in the eastern portion of the Mexican state of Yucatán .","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.chichenitza.com/","d":"chichenitza.com","q":"The ancient city of Chichen Itza is located in the state of Yucatan, eastern Mexico.","ok":true}]},"dx|{\"a\":\"Barcelona, Spanien\",\"c\":[\"Byen er hovedstad og største by i Catalonien.\",\"Byen er kendt for Antoni Gaudís arkitektur.\",\"~Byen ligger ved Middelhavet.\",\"Byen huser kirken Sagrada Família.\",\"~Byen er hjemsted for en af Europas største fodboldklubber.\",\"Byen er Spaniens næststørste by.\"],\"e\":\"Snydesporene er sande: Barcelona ligger ved Middelhavet og har FC Barcelona, men begge dele kan pege på andre byer. Det afgørende er Catalonien og Gaudí/Sagrada Família.\"}":{"pool":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barcelona","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"capital and largest city of the autonomous community of Catalonia","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Barcelona","d":"en.wikivoyage.org","q":"capital of Catalonia a major port on the northeastern Mediterranean coast of Spain","ok":true}]},"dx|{\"a\":\"Rom, Italien\",\"c\":[\"Byen er Italiens hovedstad.\",\"Byen huser Vatikanstaten.\",\"~Byen ligger ved floden Tiberen.\",\"Byen har Colosseum.\",\"~Byen er kendt for sin antikke historie.\",\"Byen er bygget på syv høje.\"],\"e\":\"Snydesporene er sande: Rom ligger ved Tiberen og er kendt for sin antikke historie, men begge dele kan pege på andre byer. Det afgørende er Italiens hovedstad, Vatikanstaten og Colosseum.\"}":{"pool":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rome","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Rome is often referred to as the city of seven hills due to its geography","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Rome","d":"en.wikivoyage.org","q":"Rome became the capital of Italy and has remained such ever since","ok":true}]},"dx|{\"a\":\"Kairo, Egypten\",\"c\":[\"Byen er Egyptens hovedstad.\",\"Byen ligger ved floden Nil.\",\"~Byen ligger nær pyramiderne i Giza.\",\"Byen huser det Egyptiske Museum.\",\"~Byen er en af Afrikas største byer.\",\"~Byen er kendt for sin islamiske arkitektur.\"],\"e\":\"Snydesporene er sande: Kairo ligger nær pyramiderne i Giza, er en af Afrikas største byer og er kendt for islamisk arkitektur, men alle tre kan pege på andre steder. Det afgørende er Egyptens hovedstad, Nil og det Egyptiske Museum.\"}":{"pool":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-15","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cairo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"capital and largest city of Egypt","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Cairo","d":"en.wikivoyage.org","q":"is the capital of Egypt until the new administrative capital is completed","ok":true}]},"dx|{\"a\":\"Brugge, Belgien\",\"c\":[\"Kendt som 'Venedig i Nord' med kanaler\",\"~Ligger i den nordlige del af et land\",\"Har et 13. århundredes klokketårn med 47 klokker (UNESCO)\",\"Hjemsted for et begijnhof fra 1200-tallet (UNESCO)\",\"~Har en havn\",\"Historisk centrum på UNESCO's verdensarvsliste\"],\"e\":\"Snydesporene er sande, men vildledende: mange byer ligger i en nordlig del af et land, og mange byer har en havn.\"}":{"pool":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bruges","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Along with a few other canal-based northern cities, such as Amsterdam and Saint Petersburg, it is sometimes referred to as the Venice of the North.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Brugge","d":"lex.dk","q":"Endvidere er den historiske bykerne optaget på UNESCOs Verdensarvsliste.","ok":true}]},"dx|{\"a\":\"Pompeji, Italien\",\"c\":[\"Blev begravet under vulkansk aske i år 79 e.v.t.\",\"~Har et amfiteater\",\"Ligger nær Napoli ved Vesuv\",\"UNESCO-verdensarv med romerske ruiner\",\"~Var en havneby\",\"Bevaret under 4-6 meter aske og pimpsten\"],\"e\":\"Snydesporene er sande, men vildledende: mange romerske byer havde amfiteater, og mange antikke byer var havnebyer.\"}":{"pool":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pompeii","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"it was buried under 4 to 6 m (13 to 20 ft) of volcanic ash and pumice in the eruption of Mount Vesuvius in 79 AD.","ok":true},{"u":"https://pompeiisites.org/en/","d":"pompeiisites.org","q":"during the final hours of the eruption of AD 79","ok":true}]},"dx|{\"a\":\"Påskeøen, Chile\",\"c\":[\"Kendt for næsten 1.000 moai-stenstatuer\",\"~Er en ø\",\"Ligger i det sydøstlige Stillehav\",\"Tilhører Chile siden 1888\",\"~Har en lufthavn\",\"UNESCO-verdensarv (Rapa Nui Nationalpark)\"],\"e\":\"Snydesporene er sande, men vildledende: mange steder er øer, og mange destinationer har en lufthavn.\"}":{"pool":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Easter_Island","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The island is renowned for its nearly 1,000 extant monumental statues, called moai","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Easter_Island","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"In 1888, Chile annexed Easter Island, leasing much of the land for sheep raising.","ok":true}]},"dx|{\"a\":\"Stonehenge, England\",\"c\":[\"Ligger på Salisbury Plain i Wiltshire\",\"~Er på UNESCOs verdensarvsliste\",\"Består af en ring af store stående sarsen-sten\",\"Stenene er omkring 4 meter høje og vejer op til 25 tons\",\"~Blev bygget i stenalderen og bronzealderen\",\"Er orienteret mod solopgangen ved sommersolhverv\"],\"e\":\"Snydesporene er sande, men vildledende: UNESCO-status og byggeperiode gælder for mange steder. Det afgørende er Salisbury Plain, sarsen-stenene og solhvervsorienteringen.\"}":{"pool":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-17","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stonehenge","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Stonehenge is a prehistoric megalithic structure on Salisbury Plain in Wiltshire, England","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.english-heritage.org.uk/visit/places/stonehenge/","d":"english-heritage.org.uk","q":"Stonehenge was built to align with the sun on the solstices.","ok":true}]},"dx|{\"a\":\"Grand Canyon, USA\",\"c\":[\"Ligger i Arizona, USA, og er gravet af Colorado River\",\"~Er en nationalpark\",\"Er 277 miles (446 km) lang og over en mile dyb\",\"~Er på UNESCOs verdensarvsliste\",\"Eksponerer næsten to milliarder års geologisk historie\",\"~Har været beboet af oprindelige folk i årtusinder\"],\"e\":\"Snydesporene er sande, men vildledende: nationalpark-status, UNESCO-status og bosættelseshistorie gælder for mange steder. Det afgørende er Arizona/Colorado River, dimensionerne og den geologiske historie.\"}":{"pool":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-17","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Canyon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Grand Canyon is 277 miles (446 km) long, up to 18 miles (29 km) wide and attains a depth of over a mile","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nps.gov/grca/index.htm","d":"nps.gov","q":"Entirely within the state of Arizona, the park encompasses 278 miles (447 km) of the Colorado River and adjacent uplands.","ok":true}]},"dx|{\"a\":\"Uluru, Australien\",\"c\":[\"Er et stort sandstensmonolit i det centrale Australien\",\"~Er på UNESCOs verdensarvsliste\",\"Er helligt for aboriginal-folket Pitjantjatjara (Anangu)\",\"Skifter farve og gløder rødt ved solopgang og solnedgang\",\"~Er over 300 meter høj\",\"Klatring på monolitten blev forbudt i oktober 2019\"],\"e\":\"Snydesporene er sande, men vildledende: UNESCO-status og højde gælder for mange steder. Det afgørende er beliggenheden i det centrale Australien, den hellige status og farveskiftet.\"}":{"pool":"dx","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-17","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uluru","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is a large sandstone monolith. It crops out near the centre of Australia","ok":true},{"u":"https://uluru.gov.au/discover/history/uluru-climb-closure/","d":"uluru.gov.au","q":"Uluṟu has been sacred to Aṉangu for tens of thousands of years","ok":true},{"u":"https://uluru.gov.au/discover/history/uluru-climb-closure/","d":"uluru.gov.au","q":"The Uluṟu climb closed permanently from 26 October 2019.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr laver terningeformet afføring?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wombat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Wombats leave distinctive cube-shaped faeces.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/wombat","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"they are the only animal known to have cube-shaped dung","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr har tre hjerter?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They have three hearts; a systemic or main heart that circulates blood around the body and two branchial or gill hearts that pump it through the two gills.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/magazine/article/octopus-anatomy-cephalopod-disguise-evolution","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"they have three hearts and blue blood","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad er en hajs skelet lavet af?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Sharks are a group of elasmobranch cartilaginous fishes characterized by a ribless endoskeleton","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/fish/facts/sharks-1","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"Species in this subclass have skeletons made from cartilage, not bone","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange halsvirvler har en voksen giraf?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/science/article/how-giraffes-became-winners-by-a-neck","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"giraffes have the standard number of neck vertebrae shared by most mammals – seven","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okapi","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"both have seven cervical vertebrae","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket af disse dyr kan ikke hoppe?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elephant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Elephants can move both forward and backward, but are incapable of trotting, jumping, or galloping.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/african-elephant","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"did you know elephants can't jump?","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en panda?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giant_panda","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"its diet consisting almost entirely of bamboo","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giant_panda","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Ninety-nine percent of the food they eat is bamboo.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en koala?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Koala","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Koalas typically inhabit open Eucalyptus woodland, as the leaves of these trees make up most of their diet.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Koala","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Koalas live in the eucalyptus forests of eastern Australia.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr kan ikke gå baglæns?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Macropodidae/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"Curiously, they can't walk backwards.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kangaroo","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"They cannot walk in any direction and cannot hop backwards.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr kan ikke flyve, men svømmer godt?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penguin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Penguins are a group of flightless semi-aquatic sea birds which live almost exclusively in the Southern Hemisphere.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penguin","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Penguins cannot fly, but they can swim very well.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr har en lang hals?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giraffe","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The distinguishing characteristics of giraffes are their extremely long neck and legs, horn-like ossicones, and spotted coat patterns.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giraffe","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Giraffes have a very long neck and long legs.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad laver bier?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bee","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bees are best known for their ecological roles as pollinators and, in the case of the best-known species, the western honey bee, for producing honey.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bee","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"The European honey bee (called Apis mellifera by biologists), is kept by humans for honey.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad giver køer?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cattle","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Cattle are commonly raised for meat, for dairy products, and for leather.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cattle","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"They are used for milk, meat, a source of money, transport, and companions.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr kan ikke flyve?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ostrich","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Ostriches are large flightless birds.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ostrich","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Ostriches do not fly, but can run faster than any other bird.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange vinger har en bi?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bee","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The thorax has three segments, each with a pair of robust legs, and a pair of membranous wings on the hind two segments.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bee","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Like other insects, bees have three pairs of legs and two pairs of wings.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange maver har en ko?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cattle","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Cattle have one large stomach with four compartments; the rumen, reticulum, omasum, and abomasum.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cattle","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Cattle are large grazing animals with two-toed or cloven hooves and a four-chambered stomach.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange arme har en blæksprutte?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"An octopus (pl.: octopuses or octopodes) is a soft-bodied, eight-limbed mollusc of the order Octopoda.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"They have two, large eyes and eight limbs with suckers.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr har sorte og hvide striber?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zebra","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Zebras are African equines with distinctive black-and-white striped coats.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zebra","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Their fur has black and white stripes.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr er det største på land?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/African_bush_elephant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The African bush elephant is the largest and heaviest living land animal.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/African_bush_elephant","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"It is the largest living terrestrial animal.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr er det største i havet?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_whale","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"it is the largest animal known to have ever existed.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_whale","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"This makes blue whales the largest animals to ever live on Earth.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad hedder vores planet?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Earth is the third planet from the Sun and the only astronomical object known to harbor life.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Earth is the third planet from the Sun and the only known place where life exists.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr har 8 ben?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spider","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Spiders are air-breathing arthropods that have eight limbs, chelicerae with fangs generally able to inject venom, and spinnerets that extrude silk.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spider","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"They ha