les","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket af disse dyr kan ikke stikke tungen ud?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crocodile","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Their tongues are not free, but held in place by a membrane that limits movement; as a result, crocodiles are unable to stick out their tongues.","ok":true},{"u":"https://interestingfacts.com/fact/crocodiles-cant-stick-out-their-tongues","d":"interestingfacts.com","q":"Their tongues are incapable of getting between those devastating jaws thanks to being permanently rooted to the floor of their mouths.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr har fingeraftryk, der næsten er identiske med menneskers?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/14007-koalas-human-fingerprints.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"koalas, doll-sized marsupials that climb trees with babies on their backs, have fingerprints that are almost identical to human ones.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.pbs.org/wgbh/nova/article/koala-fingerprints","d":"pbs.org","q":"Henneberg’s research indicated that not even careful analysis under a microscope could help distinguish the loopy, whirling ridges on koalas' fingers from our own.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange hjerter har en regnorm?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earthworm","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In segments seven through eleven, a pair of aortic arches ring the coelom and acts as hearts","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sciencing.com/many-hearts-earthworm-have-4597386","d":"sciencing.com","q":"Earthworms can have five pairs of heart-like structures called aortic arches","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad er farven på en blækspruttes blod?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The haemocyanin is dissolved in the blood plasma instead of carried within blood cells and gives the blood a bluish colour.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/55478-octopus-facts.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"Octopus blood is blue.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange muskler har den menneskelige tunge?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tongue","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The eight muscles of the human tongue are classified as either intrinsic or extrinsic.","ok":true},{"u":"https://study.com/academy/lesson/intrinsic-extrinsic-muscles-of-the-tongue.html","d":"study.com","q":"The tongue contains eight separate muscles","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange muskler er der i menneskets ansigt?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.bodymusclematters.com/how-many-muscles-does-it-take-to-frown/","d":"bodymusclematters.com","q":"The human face contains roughly 43 muscles total","ok":true},{"u":"https://cyvigor.com/article/how-many-are-facial-muscles","d":"cyvigor.com","q":"The human face has around 30 muscles on each side, or 43 in total","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange gange sin egen kropslængde kan en loppe springe?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://news.bbc.co.uk/earth/hi/earth_news/newsid_9391000/9391478.stm","d":"news.bbc.co.uk","q":"catapult a flea over a distance up to 200 times its body length","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.health.vic.gov.au/environmental-health/fleas-pest-control","d":"health.vic.gov.au","q":"Fleas are able to jump more than 200 times their body length","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange ben har det dyr, der har flest ben?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eumillipes","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"This millipede can have as many as 1,306 legs, which makes this species the anima