te buds in their mouths","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange knogler er der i en menneskehånd?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hand","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"each human hand has 27 bones","ok":true},{"u":"https://wedigskulls.com/stories/how-many-bones-in-the-human-body","d":"wedigskulls.com","q":"each hand including wrist bones 27","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange gange i minuttet slår et menneskehjerte (ca.)?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heart","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The adult heart beats at a resting rate close to 72 beats per minute","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.pbs.org/wgbh/nova/heart/heartfacts.html","d":"pbs.org","q":"As an adult, your pulse rate slows to an average of 72 beats per minute.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange knogler har en voksen (ca.)?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_skeleton","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"of around 270 bones at birth this total decreases to around 206 bones by adulthood","ok":true},{"u":"https://wedigskulls.com/stories/how-many-bones-in-the-human-body","d":"wedigskulls.com","q":"adult skeleton standard count bones 206","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange mælketænder har et barn (fuldt sæt)?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_tooth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Humans usually have 20 primary (deciduous, \"baby\" or \"milk\") teeth and 32 permanent (adult) teeth.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.healthline.com/health/how-many-teeth-do-adults-have","d":"healthline.com","q":"A full set of baby teeth is 20 teeth","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr kaldes «den udødelige gople»?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turritopsis_dohr