x.dk","q":"Som det eneste pattedyr har hannen giftsporer.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvordan finder næbdyret bytte, når det dykker med lukkede øjne og ører?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Platypus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Digging in the bottom of streams with its bill, its electroreceptors detect tiny electric currents generated by the muscular contractions of its prey.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/n%C3%A6bdyr","d":"lex.dk","q":"I disse gruber sidder der to forskellige typer af sanseceller: mekanoreceptorer, som er særligt følsomme over for berøring, og elektroreceptorer, der er i stand til at re","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvordan får et næbdyr-unge sin mælk?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Platypus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"With no teats, the milk is released through pores in the skin from which the young lap it up in her fur.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/n%C3%A6bdyr","d":"lex.dk","q":"Kirtlerne udskiller mælk over huden, så ungerne kan slikke den i sig.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad kan en søstjerne gøre, hvis den mister en arm?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Most can regenerate damaged parts or lost arms and they can shed arms as a means of defense.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Asteroidea/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"Asteroids can lose arms to predators and regenerate the arms later.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvordan spiser en søstjerne en musling, der er lukket?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Grasping the shellfish, the starfish slowly pries open the prey's shell, overcoming the clam's adductor muscle, and inserts its everted stomach into the crack to digest t","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Asteroidea/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"They feed by grasping the prey, then everting their stomach and secreting primary enzymes on the prey.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor sidder en søstjernes øjne?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"There are eyespots at the ends of the arms, each one made of 80–200 simple ocelli composed of pigmented epithelial cells.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Asteroidea/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"Red pigmented eye spots are found on the end of each arm.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange unger får et ni-bæltet bæltedyr normalt ad gangen?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nine-banded_armadillo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Once the blastocyst does implant in the uterus it splits into four identical embryos via collapse of the common amnion and subsequent division of the embryonic shield.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Dasypus_novemcinctus/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"This embryonic process almost always results in the birth of four identical quadruplets.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket lille dyr kan overleve at blive tørret helt ud i årevis?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tardigrade","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In this state, they can go without food or water for several years.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Tardigrada/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"Encystment is a type of anabiosis, a state of dormancy in which metabolic activity is greatly reduced; it is common in freshwater tardigrades, while in this state, the an","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket bjerg på Mars er solsystemets største vulkan?":{"pool":"kquiz","