er.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvem er sandwichen opkaldt efter?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sandwich","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The sandwich is named after John Montagu, 4th Earl of Sandwich, an eighteenth-century English aristocrat.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/sandwich","d":"lex.dk","q":"jarl af Sandwich, kunne ikke løsrive sig fra kortspil og lod sig servere denne form for mad under spillet.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvordan finder flagermus vej og bytte i mørke?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Microbats use echolocation for navigation and finding prey, but megabats, apart from those in the genus Rousettus, do not.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Chiroptera/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"Microchiropterans use highly sophisticated echolocation for orientation; megachiropterans orient primarily using their eyes, although members of one genus, Rousettus, are","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad gør en kolibri om natten for at spare på energien?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hummingbird","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The metabolism of hummingbirds can slow at night or at any time when food is not readily available; the birds enter a deep-sleep state (known as torpor) to prevent energy","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Trochilidae/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"In order to save energy during cold nights, hummingbirds will go into torpor.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken fugl flyver hvert år fra Arktis til Antarktis og tilbage?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arctic_tern","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Arctic tern is famous for its migration; it flies from its Arctic breeding grounds to the Antarctic and back again each year.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Sterna_paradisaea/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"Many migrate from the Arctic summer breeding grounds to Antarctica for a \"second summer\", making them the animal that sees the most sun.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket pattedyr er dækket af store skæl af keratin?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pangolin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Pangolins have large protective keratin scales covering their skin.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Manidae/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"Species in Manidae are covered in keratinous scales that protect them from the elements and predators.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvordan forsvarer en søpølse sig mod en fjende?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sea_cucumber","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"When startled, these cucumbers may expel some of them through a tear in the wall of the cloaca in an autotomic process known as evisceration.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Holothuroidea/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"When expelling organs, sea cucumbers usually release one or both respiratory trees, the gut and the gonads.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvordan holder en gekko øjnene rene, når den ikke kan blinke?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gecko","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Since they cannot blink, species without eyelids generally lick their own brilles when they need to clear them of dust and dirt, in order to keep them clean and moist.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/gekkoer","d":"lex.dk","q":"Selve øjet er dækket af gennemsigtige, sammenvoksede øjenlåg ligesom hos slanger.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken farve har en isbjørns hud under den hvide pels?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polar_bear","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The skin, including the nose and lips, is black and absorbs heat.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/isbj%C3%B8rn","d":"lex.dk","q":"Isbjørnen har sort hud, hvilket er mere effektivt til at absorbere varme end lys hud.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken fisk forsvarer sig med en kæmpe klat slim?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hagfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Hagfish are marine predators and scavengers that can defend themselves against other larger predators by releasing copious amounts of slime from mucous glands in their sk","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/slim%C3%A5l","d":"lex.dk","q":"Slimål er en familie af blinde, åleagtige fisk, der især er kendt for at producere store mængder slim som forsvarsmekanisme.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad gør spættens lange tungeben inde i hovedet?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woodpecker","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Furthermore, the tongue bone (or hyoid bone) of the woodpecker is very long, and winds around outside the skull through a special cavity, thereby cushioning the brain.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/sp%C3%A6tter","d":"lex.dk","q":"Når tungen er i sin sædvanlige hvileposition, går de lange tungebenshorn langs kraniets overflade op omkring baghovedet og frem til næbroden, hvorfra de hos nogle arter f","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr er giraffens nærmeste nulevende slægtning?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okapi","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"På trods af, at den visuelt er nærmest sammenlignelig med zebraen , er okapien af giraf-familien, der sammen med giraffen udgør familien giraffer .","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/giraffamilien","d":"lex.dk","q":"Giraffamilien indbefatter fire arter af giraffer (slægten Giraffa) samt okapien (Okapia johnstoni).","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket lille rovdyr har relativt de største ører?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/fennek","d":"lex.dk","q":"Fenneken er det mindste medlem af hundefamilien (Canidae) og har de relativt største ører af alle rovdyr .","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/fennec-fox","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"The fennecs are most recognizable by their large ears, reaching 4 to 6 inches in length.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor gammel bliver en grønlandshaj kønsmoden (ca.)?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/gr%C3%B8nlandshaj","d":"lex.dk","q":"grønlandshajen først bliver kønsmoden i en alder af ca. 150 år","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greenland_shark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They reach sexual maturity around 150 years of age","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange år går der, før en kanelsnegl (cikade) kryber op af jorden?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/cikader","d":"lex.dk","q":"den 17-årige cikade, lever i 17 år som nymfe i jorden","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cicada","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"which spend most of their lives as underground nymphs, emerge in predictable intervals of 13 or 17 years, depending on the species and the location.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket lille krybdyr kan løbe på overfladen af vand?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/basilisker_-_%C3%B8gler","d":"lex.dk","q":"især unge dyr er i stand til at løbe korte distancer på vandoverfladen, hvilket har givet dem tilnavnet Jesus-Kristus-øgler","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Basiliscus_vittatus/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"They are able to run over still water when they are startled.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor langt er et lysår (ca.)?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lys%C3%A5r","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"1 lysår er den afstand lyset tilbagelægger på et år , dvs. cirka 9,46 × 10 12 km","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/lys%C3%A5r","d":"lex.dk","q":"dvs. ca. 9,46∙10 12 km","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken fugl har et vingespænd på op til 3,5 meter?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/albatrosser","d":"lex.dk","q":"Vingefanget er typisk mellem 2,5 og 3,5 meter, hvilket gør den til en af de fugle i verden med det største vingefang.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albatross","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Great albatrosses are among the largest of flying birds , with wingspans reaching up to 2.5-3.5 metres (8.2-11.5 ft)","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvorfor fanger nogle planter insekter?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/k%C3%B8d%C3%A6dende_planter","d":"lex.dk","q":"Fælles for planterne er, at de får et tilskud af kvælstof og fosfor ved at fange insekter","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnivorous_plant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Carnivorous plants are plants that derive some or most of their nutrients from trapping and consuming animals or protozoans , typically insects and other arthropods","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor lang tid bruger Solen om at dreje sig rundt om sin egen akse ved ækvator (ca.)?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/sun/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"At its equator, the Sun completes one rotation in 25 Earth days.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sun","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the rotational period is approximately 25.6 days at the equator and 33.5 days at the poles","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor lang tid tager lyset fra Solen at nå Jorden?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"One Way Light Time to Sun 8.350022 minutes","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sun","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"At its average distance, light travels from the Sun's horizon to Earth's horizon in about 8 minutes and 20 seconds.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor langt er der fra Jorden til Månen (ca.)?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"The Moon is an average of 238,855 miles (384,400 kilometers) away from Earth.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%A5nen","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"den halve storakse - er 384.400 kilometer","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken fugl er verdens mindste?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolibri","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Verdens mindste fugl er bikolibrien , der blot vejer 2 gram, hannen helt ned til 1,6 gram, og er 5-6 cm lang.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Mellisuga_helenae/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"Bee hummingbirds are the smallest birds in the world.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken satellit var den første i kredsløb om Jorden?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sputnik_1","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"blev som den første satellit sendt i kredsløb om Jorden d. 4. oktober 1957","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Sputnik","d":"lex.dk","q":"Verdens første satellit, Sputnik, der blev sendt i kredsløb om Jorden i 1957.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket rumfartøj har været ved både Uranus og Neptun?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/voyager-2/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"Voyager 2 is the only spacecraft to visit Uranus and Neptune.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voyager_2","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Efter Jupiter fortsatte Voyager 2 til Saturn , Uranus og Neptun og det er det eneste rumfartøj der har besøgt de sidste to planeter.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket menneskeskabte objekt er længst væk fra Jorden?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/voyager-1/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"No spacecraft has gone farther than NASA's Voyager 1.","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voyager_1","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Voyager 1 er det fjerneste menneskeskabte objekt, med en afstand på 22,2 milliarder kilometer","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor højt ligger Danmarks højeste naturlige jordpunkt (ca.)?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%B8lleh%C3%B8j","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Møllehøj er 170,86 meter høj","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/M%C3%B8lleh%C3%B8j","d":"lex.dk","q":"Møllehøj, som ligger 170,86 m.o.h., Yding Skovhøj (170,77 m.o.h.) og Ejer Bavnehøj (170,35 m.o.h.) er Danmarks højeste terrænpunkter.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken ø er verdens største?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gr%C3%B8nland","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Øen Grønland er verdens største ø, hvoraf 3/4 er dækket af en iskappe","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Gr%C3%B8nland","d":"lex.dk","q":"Grønland er verdens største ø med et areal på 2.486.000 km 2","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken ø er Danmarks største, når Grønland ikke tælles med?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sj%C3%A6lland","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"er med sine 7.031 km² den største ø i det egentlige Danmark , altså bortset fra 