rs caused three Olympiads to pass without a celebration of the Games","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.history.co.uk/articles/history-of-the-modern-olympics","d":"history.co.uk","q":"Since 1896, only three Olympics have been cancelled, all due to the World Wars (1916, 1940 and 1944).","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange gange har Danmark vundet Eurovision (pr. 2025)?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denmark_in_the_Eurovision_Song_Contest","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Denmark has won the contest three times: in 1963, 2000 and 2013.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dr.dk/om-dr/nyheder/billeder-i-denne-uge-er-det-55-aar-siden-danmark-holdt-sit-foerste-eurovision-i-tivoli","d":"dr.dk","q":"Danmark har vundet Eurovisionens Melodi Grand Prix tre gange - nemlig i 1963, 2000 og 2013.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange lande består Centralamerika af?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Central_America","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Central America is usually defined as consisting of seven countries","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/article/plan-the-ultimate-central-american-adventure","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"The region eventually split into the seven countries known as Central America today: Belize, Guatemala, El Salvador, Honduras, Nicaragua, Costa Rica and Panama.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange planeter kan man se med det blotte øje fra Jorden?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naked_eye","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Five planets can be recognized as planets from Earth with the naked eye: Mercury, Venus, Mars, Jupiter, and Saturn.","ok":true},{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/solar-system/skywatching/planetary-alignments-and-planet-parades","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"Five planets are visible without optical aid: Mercury, Venus, Mars, Jupiter, and Saturn.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange små knogler har et menneske i håndleddet?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carpal_bones","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The carpal bones are the eight small bones that make up the wrist (carpus) that connects the hand to the forearm.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.kenhub.com/en/library/anatomy/carpal-bones","d":"kenhub.com","q":"The eight bones of the wrist, known as the carpal bones, and related bony landmarks.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor mange knogler har et menneske i næsen?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasal_bone","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The nasal bones are two small oblong bones","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.kenhub.com/en/library/anatomy/the-nasal-bone","d":"kenhub.com","q":"The two nasal bones are connected medially via the internasal suture.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr kan sprøjte en ildelugtende væske, når det er bange?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stinkdyr","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"stinkdyrene er kendt for deres evne til at udsondre en ildelugtende væske, når de føler sig truet.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/stinkdyr","d":"lex.dk","q":"stinkdyr og stinkgrævlinger kan forsvare sig mod rovdyr og andre potentielle fjender ved at beskyde dem med en stærkt ildelugtende, olieagtig væske","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken haj har et hoved, der ligner en hammer?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hammerhaj","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"den har ikke de andre hajers spidse hoved, men derimod et fladere, bredt hoved. derved kommer den til at minde om en hammer.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/hammerhajer","d":"lex.dk","q":"de kendetegnes ved, at hovedet er forlænget på tværs med øjnene placeret yderst på forlængelsen.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken fugl bygger rede højt oppe på tage og skorstene?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stork","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"de bygger en platformslignende rede på tage, skorstene eller på stynede træer.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/storke","d":"lex.dk","q":"storken bygger altid rede højt over jorden.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvorfor slår påfuglen sin store hale ud?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/P%C3%A5fugl","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"arten er mest kendt for hannens storslåede hale, et resultat af seksuel udvælgelse.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/p%C3%A5fugle","d":"lex.dk","q":"hanner intimiderer hinanden og tiltrækker hunner ved at rejse og sprede halen","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken fugl kan efterligne menneskers stemmer?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Papeg%C3%B8je","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"enkelte arter er i stand til at efterligne mennesketale.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/papeg%C3%B8je","d":"lex.dk","q":"nogle arters evne til at efterligne menneskelig tale.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad sidder i spidsen af en skorpions hale?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skorpioner","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"skorpioner kan kendes på deres hale, hvor der i enden sidder en giftbrod som kan bruges til forsvar og nedlæggelse af bytte","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/skorpioner","d":"lex.dk","q":"de kendes på deres lange bagkrop, som er tydeligt leddelt og ender i en giftkrog.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr bor i et tomt sneglehus?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eremitkrebs","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"den benytter sig af sneglehuset fra en række sneglearter til beskyttelse af deres nøgne og bløde bagkrop.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/eremitkrebs","d":"lex.dk","q":"flertallet bærer rundt på et tomt sneglehus, der skjuler deres bløde, sækformede bagkrop.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvem er det, der stikker, når en myg bider?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Myg","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"det er dog kun hunmyggen der suger blod fra mennesker og dyr, da proteinerne bruges til at producere myggens æg.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/myg","d":"lex.dk","q":"hannerne suger ikke blod men tager nektar fra blomster.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad hedder arret midt på maven?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Navle","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"et rundt ar på bughulen hos pattedyr, der er særligt tydelig hos mennesket.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/navle","d":"lex.dk","q":"navle er en arlignende indtrækning midt på bugen hos pattedyr, særlig tydelig hos mennesket.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvornår bliver fregner tydeligere?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fregner","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"selve fregnerne opstår ved udsættelse for sollys.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/fregner","d":"lex.dk","q":"de bliver hurtigt brune ved solbadning, og den brune farve aftager når solbadning ophører.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvorfor har vi øjenvipper?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%98jenvipper","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"øjenvipperne er en af de ting der er til for at beskytte øjet.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/%C3%B8jenvipper","d":"lex.dk","q":"øjenvipper hindrer fremmedlegemer i at ramme det følsomme øjeæble.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad hedder en varm kilde, der sprøjter vand op i luften?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gejser","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"en gejser eller springkilde er en speciel form for varm kilde, som periodisk kommer i udbrud og sender en søjle af varmt vand og vanddamp op i luften.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/gejser","d":"lex.dk","q":"presses vand og damp med stor voldsomhed frem til overfladen, hvor jetstrålen kan nå en højde af 70 m.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad hedder et himmellegeme af is og støv med en lang hale?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/komet","d":"lex.dk","q":"en komet er et lille himmellegeme af is og støv, der bevæger sig i stærkt elliptiske baner om solen. når kometen er tæt nok på solen, kan den ses som en lysende central s","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Komet","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"op til 10 millioner km lang, består af fine støvpartikler på størrelse med røg, der er løsrevne fra kernen på grund af presset fra flygtige gasser.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad hedder et tog, der kører under jorden i en storby?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metro","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"undergrundsbane - en underjordisk jernbane for nærtrafik i en storby.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/metro","d":"lex.dk","q":"metro, storbybane, delvis bygget som undergrundsbane.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad bruger man til at måle, hvor varmt det er?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Termometer","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"et termometer er et måleinstrument til måling af temperatur.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/termometer","d":"lex.dk","q":"et termometer er et instrument til måling af temperatur.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad hedder den gule blomst, der også kaldes løvetand?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%A6lkeb%C3%B8tte","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"mælkebøtte (taraxacum) eller løvetand er en slægt af stauder med pælerod","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/l%C3%B8vetand","d":"lex.dk","q":"løvetand, andet navn for planten mælkebøtte.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvor vokser en kartoffel?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kartoffel","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"kartoffelplanten danner store, stivelsesholdige knolde på de underjordiske stængler.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/kartoffel","d":"lex.dk","q":"på underjordiske stængler sidder stivelsesholdige knolde, kartofler","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad er chokolade lavet af?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chokolade","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"det første skridt i fremstillingen er at skære kakaobønnerne med det omgivende frugtkød ud af kakaofrugterne.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/chokolade","d":"lex.dk","q":"chokolade er et nydelsesmiddel baseret på bønner fra kakaotræet","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad hedder det spidse i bagenden af en hveps?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hveps","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"stikkebrodden er glat, så hvepsen kan trække den ud efter stikket.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/gedehamse","d":"lex.dk","q":"hunnerne har i bagenden en giftbrod, der hos de sociale gedehamse benyttes ved forsvar af det fælles bo.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad hedder resterne af et dyr fra fortiden, der er blevet til sten?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fossil","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"er bevarede rester eller spor af organismer fra en fjern fortid.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/fossiler","d":"lex.dk","q":"fossiler er rester, aftryk eller spor efter fortidens organismer.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad hedder de små vanddråber på græsset om morgenen?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dugpunkt","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"hvis afkølingen sker ved kontakt med en overflade, dug.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/dug","d":"lex.dk","q":"dug er vanddråber, som er afsat på græs, blade, grene og lignende ved fortætning af luftens vanddamp.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr graver gange under jorden?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muldvarp","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"den skaber gange under jorden, hvor den især lever af regnorme.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/muldvarp","d":"lex.dk","q":"muldvarpen er en insektæder, der lever underjordisk i et udstrakt gangsystem.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken frugt har en stor sten i midten?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fersken","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"i centrum af frugten er en stor sten.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/fersken","d":"lex.dk","q":"det omgiver en 3-4 cm lang, dybt furet, tykskallet sten.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad hedder en roterende hvirvelvind, der ligner en tragt?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tornado","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"en tornado er en voldsomt roterende luftsøjle (hvirvelvind), der er i kontakt med både jordens overflade og en cumulonimbussky","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/tornado","d":"lex.dk","q":"tornado er en roterende hvirvelsky, der fra undersiden af en cumulonimbus strækker sig ned mod hav- eller jordoverfladen.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad bruger man til at se ting, der er meget langt væk?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kikkert","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"en kikkert eller et teleskop er et optisk apparat, der kan hjælpe med at se ting over længere afstande ved at give et forstørret billede af dem.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/kikkert","d":"lex.dk","q":"en kikkert er et optisk instrument, der benyttes til at iagttage fjerne objekter for at give en større synsfeltvinkel og dermed et forstørret nethindebillede.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvilken hvid grøntsag består af små blomster?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/blomk%C3%A5l","d":"lex.dk","q":"blomkål er en mild kål, hvoraf selve blomsterstanden spises.","ok":true},{"u":"https://ordnet.dk/ddo/ordbog?query=blomk%C3%A5l","d":"ordnet.dk","q":"grøntsag bestående af et fast hoved af tætsiddende, hvidgule blomsterstande (buketter) omgivet af grønne blade","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en pingvin?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/pingviner","d":"lex.dk","q":"Føden er fisk, blæksprutter og krebsdyr ( krill ).","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penguin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Most penguins feed on krill , fish, squid and other forms of sea life which they catch with their bills and swallow whole while swimming.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en isbjørn?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/bjørne","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den ernærer sig især af sæler.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polar_bear","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They are mostly carnivorous and specialized for preying on seals , particularly ringed seals .","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en flagermus?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/flagermus","d":"lex.dk","q":"Gruppen udviser mange fødespecialiseringer spændende fra insekter (de fleste), edderkopper og skorpioner over mindre hvirveldyr som mus, firben og fisk","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Most bats, especially in temperate areas, prey on insects.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en næbdyr?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/næbdyr","d":"lex.dk","q":"Næbdyrets føde består næsten udelukkende af bundlevende hvirvelløse dyr , især vandlevende insektlarver og nymfer af vårfluer , døgnfluer , guldsmede og slørvinger .","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Platypus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It feeds on insect larvae , annelid worms, shrimp , crayfish, bivalves, tadpoles and fish eggs.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en delfin?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/delfiner","d":"lex.dk","q":"Delfinfamilien kan groft opdeles i fiskespisende arter, som har tydeligt næb og mange tænder, og blækspruttespisende arter, der er næbløse og har færre tænder.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dolphin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Like most nektonic animals, dolphins are carnivorous , feed largely on fish and squid","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en blåhval?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/blåhval","d":"lex.dk","q":"Dens foretrukne føde er krill ( lyskrebs ), der sies fra vandet ved hjælp af de op til 1 m lange, sorte barder","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_whale","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Blue whales are filter feeders ; their diet consists almost exclusively of krill .","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en papegøje?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/papegøjer","d":"lex.dk","q":"Praktisk taget alle arter æder plantefrø, men mange er derudover mere eller mindre specialiserede i en kost bestående af frugter, rødder og rodknolde, pollen , nektar ell","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parrot","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The most important components of most parrots' diets are seeds, nuts, fruit, buds, and other plant material.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser et vildsvin?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/svinefamilien","d":"lex.dk","q":"Dette suppleres med animalsk kost som ådsler, fugle og deres æg, småpattedyr, krybdyr, fisk, snegle, regnorme, insekter og insektlarver.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wild_boar","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In warm periods, it eats earthworms , insects , mollusks , fish , rodents , insectivores , bird eggs , lizards, snakes, frogs and carrion .","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en abe?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/aber","d":"lex.dk","q":"De fleste aber er altædende, men med overvægt af planteføde.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monkey","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Some are arboreal (living in trees) while others live on the savanna ; diets differ among the various species but may contain any of the following: fruit, leaves, seeds, ","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en mus?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/husmus","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den er nærmest altædende og har et meget lille vandbehov.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/House_mouse","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"House mice primarily feed on plant matter, but are omnivorous .","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en kænguru?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/kænguruer","d":"lex.dk","q":"De største arter, kæmpekænguruerne og bjergkænguruerne, er specialiserede græsædere, og mindst 70 % af deres kost udgøres af græsser og halvgræsser .","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kangaroo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Different species of kangaroos have different diets, although all are strict herbivores. The eastern grey kangaroo is predominantly a grazer, and eats a wide variety of g","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en gås?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/gæs","d":"lex.dk","q":"Ægte gæs lever af planteføde, overvejende forskellige græsser og halvgræsser .","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canada_goose","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Canada goose eats a variety of grasses when on land.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad spiser en ugle?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/ugler","d":"lex.dk","q":"De fleste ugler lever hovedsagelig af småpattedyr, fx gnavere og spidsmus, men supplerer gerne med fugle, krybdyr og insekter","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Owl","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"All owls are carnivorous birds of prey and live on diets of insects, small rodents and lagomorphs.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad kalder man en gris' baby?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/svin","d":"lex.dk","q":"En so har 10-14 patter, og normalt er kuldet på 10-12 pattegrise, men over 20 forekommer også.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pig","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Archeological evidence indicates that medieval European pigs farrowed, or bore a litter of piglets, once per year.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad kalder man en hønes baby?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/kylling","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den nyklækkede kyllings vægt er 2 / 3 af rugeægget.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chicken","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Fertile chicken eggs hatch at the end of the incubation period, about 21 days; the chick uses its egg tooth to break out of the shell.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad kalder man en baby-kænguru?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/kænguruer","d":"lex.dk","q":"Ungen i pungen kaldes på engelsk for en joey .","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kangaroo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the young ones are joeys","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad er ost lavet af?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/ost","d":"lex.dk","q":"Ost er et mælkeprodukt, der fremstilles ved konservering af mælk fra ko, ged eller får.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheese","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Cheese is a type of dairy product produced in a range of flavors, textures , and forms by curdling of milk , usually from cows , goats or sheep , and sometimes of water b","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad er brød lavet af?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/brød","d":"lex.dk","q":"Hævede brød fremstilles først og fremmest af hvedemel eller rugmel som stivelseskilde.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bread","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bread is a baked food product made from water, flour , and often yeast .","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad er en regnbue lavet af?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/regnbue","d":"lex.dk","q":"Regnbuer forekommer, når sollyset tilbagekastes og brydes i vanddråber, idet hver dråbe virker som et prisme.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rainbow","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A rainbow is an optical phenomenon caused by refraction , internal reflection and dispersion of light in water droplets resulting in a continuous spectrum of light appear","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad er sne lavet af?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/sne","d":"lex.dk","q":"Sne er iskrystaller, som klumper sammen til større fnug.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snow","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Snow is a form of solid atmospheric precipitation consisting of individual ice crystals","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad er en sky lavet af?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/skyer","d":"lex.dk","q":"Skyer er synlige formationer på himlen, som består af små vanddråber og/eller iskrystaller.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cloud","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In meteorology, a cloud is an aerosol consisting of a visible mass of miniature liquid droplets, ice crystals, or other particles, suspended in the atmosphere of a planet","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad er et lyn lavet af?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/lyn","d":"lex.dk","q":"Lyn er en udladning af elektrisk energi i atmosfæren .","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lightning","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Lightning is a natural phenomenon consisting of electrostatic discharges occurring through the atmosphere between two electrically charged regions.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad er en mumie?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/mumie","d":"lex.dk","q":"En mumie er et naturligt eller kunstigt udtørret legeme af menneske eller dyr især kendt fra den oldegyptiske kultur.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mummy","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A mummy is a dead human or an animal whose soft tissues and organs have been preserved","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad kommer ud af en vulkan?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/vulkaner","d":"lex.dk","q":"Her ses den letflydende basaltiske lava strømme ud fra de vulkanske sprækker","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volcano","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A volcano is a vent or fissure in the crust of a planetary-mass object that allows hot lava, volcanic ash, and gases to escape from a magma chamber below the surface.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad bruger en elefant snablen til?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/elefanter","d":"lex.dk","q":"Næseborene er ført frem som to parallelle rør, og snablen bruges både til at snuse med, føle med, gribe med, slå med og drikke med.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elephant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"With its trunk, an elephant can reach items up to 7 m (23 ft) high and dig for water in the mud or sand below.","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad er et fossil?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/fossiler","d":"lex.dk","q":"Fossiler er rester, aftryk eller spor efter fortidens organismer.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fossil","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is any preserved remains, impression, or trace of any once-living thing from a past geological age","ok":true}]},"kquiz|Hvad måler et termometer?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/termometer","d":"lex.dk","q":"Et termometer er et instrument til måling af temperatur .","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thermometer","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A thermometer is a device that measures temperature (the hotness or coldness of an object).","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Elefanter kan ikke hoppe.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Elefanter kan gå frem og tilbage, men kan hverken trave, hoppe eller galopere.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elephant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Elephants can move both forward and backward, but are incapable of trotting, jumping, or galloping.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/magazine-12069136","d":"bbc.com","q":"It also means they cannot jump, which rules out the pirouette.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Bier har fem øjne.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Bier har to store fasetøjne og tre små punktøjne (ocelli).\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bee","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A pair of large compound eyes which cover much of the surface of the head. Between and above these are three small simple eyes","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.pbs.org/wgbh/nova/bees/buzz.html","d":"pbs.org","q":"Bees possess five eyes. The three ocelli are simple eyes that discern light intensity,","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Koalaer har fingeraftryk ligesom mennesker.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Koalaers fingeraftryk ligner menneskers så meget, at de kan forveksles.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fingerprint","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"According to one study, even with an electron microscope, it can be quite difficult to distinguish between the fingerprints of a koala and a human.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.mcgill.ca/oss/article/did-you-know/koalas-have-fingerprints-just-humans","d":"mcgill.ca","q":"it is possible that koala fingerprints could be found incidentally at a crime scene and be mistaken for a human's, making it pretty difficult to find a match.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Heste kan ikke kaste op.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Hestens muskel ved mavesækken er for stram til, at den kan kaste op.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horse","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Horses cannot vomit, so digestion problems can quickly cause colic, a leading cause of death.","ok":true},{"u":"https://ceh.vetmed.ucdavis.edu/sites/g/files/dgvnsk4536/files/local_resources/pdfs/pubs-March2013-sec.pdf","d":"ceh.vetmed.ucdavis.edu","q":"Since horses cannot vomit, this poses a serious problem.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Fisk sover med åbne øjne.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":4,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/bitesize/articles/zybrp9q","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"Most fish sleep with their eyes open because they don't have eyelids.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sleep_in_fish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"fish lack eyelids and a neocortex.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Pingviner kan ikke flyve.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":4,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penguin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Penguins are a group of flightless semi-aquatic sea birds which live almost exclusively in the Southern Hemisphere.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/birds/facts/penguins","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"Penguins are flightless seabirds that live almost exclusively below the equator.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Katte kan ikke smage sødt.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":5,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Domestic and wild cats share a taste receptor gene mutation that keeps their sweet taste buds from binding to sugary molecules, leaving them with no ability to taste swee","ok":true},{"u":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2063449/","d":"pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov","q":"Domestic cats (Felis silvestris catus) (herein referred to as “cats”) are neither attracted to, nor show avoidance of the taste of sweet carbohydrates and high-intensity ","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Heste kan sove stående.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":4,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horse","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"horses are able to sleep both standing up and lying down, with younger horses tending to sleep significantly more than adults.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.petmd.com/horse/do-horses-sleep-standing","d":"petmd.com","q":"A special anatomical feature of horses called the stay apparatus allows them to sleep standing up.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En snegl har tusindvis af tænder.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":5,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snail","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Most snails have thousands of microscopic tooth-like structures located on a banded ribbon-like tongue called a radula.","ok":true},{"u":"https://nhm.org/stories/microscopic-look-snail-jaws","d":"nhm.org","q":"Snail teeth are called radula—thousands of microscopic spikes set on a flexible band.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En giraf har en blå tunge.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":4,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.sciencefocus.com/nature/why-do-giraffes-have-purple-tongues","d":"sciencefocus.com","q":"their 50cm-long tongues can appear purple, bluish or almost black in colour.","ok":true},{"u":"https://giraffeconservation.org/facts-about-giraffe/how-long-is-a-giraffes-tongue-what-color-is-it/","d":"giraffeconservation.org","q":"and a startling blue-black-purple","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En hval er ikke en fisk.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":4,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whale","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Whales are a widely distributed and diverse group of fully aquatic placental marine mammals.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/whale","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"Whales are warm-blooded creatures that nurse their young.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En hund kan se i farver.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":5,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dog","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Dogs' vision is dichromatic; their visual world consists of yellows, blues, and grays.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.akc.org/expert-advice/health/can-dogs-see-color/","d":"akc.org","q":"Dogs can make out yellow and blue, and combinations of those colors.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Alle fugle kan flyve.\",\"t\":false,\"age\":4,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flightless_bird","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Flightless birds are birds that cannot fly, as they have, through evolution, lost the ability.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/birds/facts/ostrich","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"Though they cannot fly, ostriches are fleet, strong runners.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En sommerfugl lever kun én dag.\",\"t\":false,\"age\":5,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Butterfly","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Heliconius butterflies also use their proboscis to feed on pollen; in these species only 20% of the amino acids used in reproduction come from larval feeding, which allow","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.pbs.org/wnet/nature/blog/monarch-butterfly-fact-sheet/","d":"pbs.org","q":"Each adult butterfly lives only about four to five weeks.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Katte har ni liv.\",\"t\":false,\"age\":4,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-14","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"According to a myth in many cultures, cats have nine lives.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.newsweek.com/cats-nine-lives-myth-explained-1643381","d":"newsweek.com","q":"It has been suggested that the idea of cats having nine lives has its roots in Ancient Egypt.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En hval kan synge.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":4,\"e\":\"\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":