ward compared to Earth. While you’","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"På Pluto findes en stor hjerteformet lys flade, der kaldes Tombaugh Regio.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Rummet blev opdaget af rumsonde New Horizons i 2015.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-18","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pluto","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Notable geographical features include Tombaugh Regio, or the \"Heart\" (a large bright area on the side opposite Charon), Belton Regio , [ 8 ] or the \"Whale\" (a large dark ","ok":true},{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/dwarf-planets/pluto/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"This image showing Pluto's \"heart\" was taken by NASA’s New Horizons spacecraft on July 13, 2015, when the spacecraft was 476,000 miles (768,000 kilometers) from the surfa","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Der er taget et billede af et sort hul – det første blev offentliggjort i 2019.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Billedet viser det supermassive sorte hul i midten af galaksen M87.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-18","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_hole","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"On 10 April 2019, the first direct image of a black hole and its vicinity was published, following observations made by the Event Horizon Telescope (EHT) of the supermass","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/sort_hul","d":"lex.dk","q":"Det første billede af et sort hul. Billedet viser det supermassive sorte hul i midten af ​​galaksen M87. Glødende gas lyser op omkring det sorte hul. Billedet blev offent","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Den første “computerbug” var en rigtig møl, der sad fast i en relæ i Harvard Mark II.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Møllen blev klæbet fast i computerens logbog, og derfra stammer navnet på en fejl i et program.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-18","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_bug","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"operators tr