n kan vride sig rundt og bide den, der griber den.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Huden er tyk og løs, så den kan vride sig fri.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honey_badger","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Its skin is remarkably loose, and allows the animal to turn and twist freely","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/honey-badger-ratel","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"allowing it to twist around and bite an opponent that has grabbed it","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Goliath-frøen er verdens største frø.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":9,\"e\":\"Den kan blive over 30 cm lang, når benene er strakt ud.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goliath_frog","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The goliath frog is the largest living frog.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/goliath-frog","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"the goliath frog is the largest frog in the world","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Der findes en musling, der har levet i over 500 år.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":11,\"e\":\"Muslingen Ming blev 507 år gammel.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arctica_islandica","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"reported to have lived 507 years, making it the longest-lived non-clonal metazoan","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/oldest-mollusc","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The longest-lived mollusc - and indeed the longest-lived non-colonial animal ever discovered","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"I Læsø er der huse, hvis tag er lavet af tang.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":9,\"e\":\"Taget er af bændeltang, som faktisk er en blomsterplante.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Læsø","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Gårde med tangtage - de såkaldte tanggårde - bliver også ofte fremhævet","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Læsø","d":"lex.dk","q":"selv om ålegræs også kaldes for almindelig bændeltang","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Solen roterer hurtigere ved ækvator end ved polerne.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Solen er plasma, der roterer forskelligt fra pol til pol.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sun","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Sun rotates faster at its equator than at its poles.","ok":true},{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/sun/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"At its equator, the Sun completes one rotation in 25 Earth days.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"På Jupiter er et døgn kortere end et år.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Jupiter roterer på 10 timer, men bruger 12 år på en omkredsning.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jupiter","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"completing a rotation on its axis in slightly less than ten hours","ok":true},{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/jupiter/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"One day on Jupiter takes 9.9 hours","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Uranus roterer på siden.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Hældningen er 97,9 grader, så planeten er tipset.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uranus_(planet)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Uranus ligger ned i forhold til de andre planeter, med en hældning på 97,9°.","ok":true},{"u":"https://science.nasa.gov/uranus/facts/","d":"science.nasa.gov","q":"Uranus appears to spin sideways.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Latterfuglens sang lyder som latter.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":9,\"e\":\"Familien kalder den bushman's alarm clock, fordi den råber højt i morgenstunden.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laughing_kookaburra","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The territorial call is a distinctive laugh","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/laughing-kookaburra","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"a laughing kookaburra vocalizes in its family group at dawn and dusk","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Tuataraen er det eneste levende medlem af sin orden.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":11,\"e\":\"Den er en levende fossil og lever kun på små øer i New Zealand.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tuatara","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The single extant species of tuatara is the only surviving member of its order","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/tuatara","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"tuataras survive on just 37 tiny offshore and mainland islands in New Zealand","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En arctic tern flyver hvert år fra Arktis helt til Antarktis og tilbage.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Det er den længste trækning i dyrenes verden.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arctic_tern","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"it flies from its Arctic breeding grounds to the Antarctic and back again each year","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.rspb.org.uk/birds-and-wildlife/arctic-tern","d":"rspb.org.uk","q":"flying between the UK and the Antarctic every year","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Spermhvaler sover stående på hovedet.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":11,\"e\":\"De sover lodret i vandet med hovedet lige under overfladen.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sperm_whale","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"sleep for short periods, assuming a vertical position with their heads just below or at the surface","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/newsround/articles/c8jn9r1nw7ro","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"use bubbles to help them sleep while floating in a heads-up vertical position","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Toyota Corolla er den mest producerede bil i verdens historie.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Der er bygget over 50 millioner Corollaer siden 1966.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toyota_Corolla","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the Corolla has remained the best-selling automobile nameplate of all time","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/first-car-to-sell-30-million-units","d":"guinnessworldrecords.com","q":"The Toyota Corolla was the first automobile in history to reach sales of 30 million.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En regneorm har fem par hjerter.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"De hedder hjertekurve og pumper blodet rundt.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earthworm","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"a pair of aortic arches ring the coelom and acts as hearts","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sciencelearn.org.nz/image_maps/24-inside-of-an-earthworm","d":"sciencelearn.org.nz","q":"Most earthworm species have five aortic arches or hearts that move blood around the body","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En bæver har orange fortænder, fordi tænderne indeholder jern.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Jernet i emaljen gør tænderne stærke og orange.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beaver","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The incisors are covered in a thick enamel that is colored orange or reddish-brown by iron compounds.","ok":true},{"u":"https://nationalzoo.si.edu/animals/beaver","d":"nationalzoo.si.edu","q":"Beavers' incisors appear dark orange due to the high amount of iron contained in the enamel, which is the hard outer layer of the teeth.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En kiwi har næseborene helt ude på spidsen af næbbet.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Derfor kan den lugte føde nede i jorden.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiwi_(bird)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"they are the only birds with nostrils at the end of their long beaks","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.doc.govt.nz/documents/science-and-technical/tsrp60.pdf","d":"doc.govt.nz","q":"Unlike most birds, kiwi have an exceptional sense of smell, with nostrils uniquely placed near the tip of their long (65–155 mm) bill.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En elefant kan mærke rystelser i jorden med sine fødder.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Elefanter »lytter« med fødderne, når de kommunikerer over lange afstande.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elephant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"elephants use infrasound and seismic communication over long distances","ok":true},{"u":"https://med.stanford.edu/news/all-news/2007/05/caller-id-in-the-wild-african-elephants-communicate-by-ground-vibration-stanford-researcher-finds.html","d":"med.stanford.edu","q":"wild herds of elephants have learned to communicate with each other by listening with their feet to vibrations in the ground","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En gepard kan ikke brøle som en løve – den laver en lyd, der ligner en fugls.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Geparder kvidrer og kurrede i stedet for at brøle.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheetah","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"an intense bird-like call and lasts less than a second","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/cheetah","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"but cheetahs cannot roar like lions or tigers do","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En mariehøne kan sprøjte en grim væske ud af knæene, når den bliver forstyrret.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Væsken smager dårligt, så rovdyr slipper den igen.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coccinellidae","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"exuding drops from their tibio-femoral (knee) joints","ok":true},{"u":"https://entomology.ca.uky.edu/ef702","d":"entomology.ca.uky.edu","q":"they are protected by an odorous, noxious fluid that seeps out of their joints when the insects are disturbed","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Edderkopsilke er et af de stærkeste materialer, vi kender.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Forholdsmæssigt er den stærkere end stål.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spider_silk","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Weight for weight, silk is stronger than steel","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nhm.ac.uk/discover/the-worlds-most-extreme-spiders.html","d":"nhm.ac.uk","q":"Spider silk is the strongest known natural or human-made fibre in the world.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En søstjerne kan skubbe sin mave ud af munden for at spise.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Den fordøjer byttet uden for sin egen krop og trækker maven ind igen.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Several species have specialized feeding behaviours including eversion of their stomachs","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/sj%C3%B8stjerner","d":"snl.no","q":"kan noen sjøstjerner vrenge ut den nedre del av magesekken gjennom munnåpningen og dekke byttet med den","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Flagermus bruger lyd til at »se« i mørket.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"De sender lyde ud og lytter til, hvordan de kastes tilbage.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"By comparing the outgoing pulse with the returning echoes, bats can learn about their environment and detect prey in darkness.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nps.gov/subjects/bats/echolocation.htm","d":"nps.gov","q":"Bats navigate and find insect prey using echolocation. They produce sound waves at frequencies above human hearing, called ultrasound.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En nyfødt kænguru er meget lille – den kan være på størrelse med en bønne.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Den kravler selv op i morens pung.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kangaroo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"When the joey is born, it is about the size of a lima bean","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/kenguru","d":"snl.no","q":"Denne nyfødte kenguru-ungen kan få plass i fingerbølet.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En søhest har en stor mave, så den kan gemme mad til senere.\",\"t\":false,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Søhester har slet ingen mave og skal spise næsten hele tiden.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seahorse","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"they are slow to consume their food and have extremely simple digestive systems that lack a stomach","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.ifaw.org/animals/seahorses","d":"ifaw.org","q":"Seahorses eat so regularly because they don’t have a stomach in which to store food.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Myrer »melker« bladlus for at få en sød væske.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Bladlusene giver en sukkerholdig væske, som myrerne samler.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Aphids and other hemipteran insects secrete a sweet liquid called honeydew","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/maur","d":"snl.no","q":"Noen grupper vokter bladlus, og ved å stryke dem med antennene henter de ut dråper av bladlussukker.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Fårekyllinger hører med ørerne på hovedet.\",\"t\":false,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Deres ører sidder på forbenene.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cricket_(insect)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The singing species have good hearing, via the tympana on the tibiae of the front legs.","ok":true},{"u":"https://genent.cals.ncsu.edu/insect-identification/order-orthoptera","d":"genent.cals.ncsu.edu","q":"In crickets and katydids, these “ears” are on the tibia of the front legs.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En ananas er mange små bær, der er vokset sammen til én frugt.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Hver blomst bliver til et lille bær, og de smelter sammen.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pineapple","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The ovaries develop into berries , which coalesce into a large, compact, multiple fruit.","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/ananas","d":"snl.no","q":"Når frukta til kvar blome modnar, veks den saman med frukta til naboblomen og med aksen til ein stor kongleliknande fruktstand","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Tåge er en sky, der ligger nede ved jorden.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Det er de samme små vanddråber som i en sky.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fog","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Fog can be considered a type of low-lying cloud usually resembling stratus","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/t%C3%A5ke","d":"snl.no","q":"I prinsippet er tåke det samme som en sky omkring oss.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Et snefnug har seks arme.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Det kommer af iskrystallernes sekskantede form.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snowflake","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the growth of a non-aggregated snowflake often approximates six-fold radial symmetry","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/sn%C3%B8","d":"snl.no","q":"Snøfnugg har en grunnleggende sekskantet form","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Stillehavet er større end alt land på Jorden tilsammen.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Det dækker mere end alle kontinenter og øer tilsammen.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacific_Ocean","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"larger than its entire land area combined","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/Stillehavet","d":"snl.no","q":"Det tilsvarer mer enn den samlete landflaten på Jorden","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Månen bevæger sig tættere og tættere på Jorden.\",\"t\":false,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Den bevæger sig langsomt væk – omtrent lige så hurtigt som negle gror.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the Moon's distance increases by 38 mm (1.5 in) per year (roughly the rate at which human fingernails grow).","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/science-environment-12311119","d":"bbc.com","q":"The Moon continues to spin away from the Earth, at the rate of 3.78cm (1.48in) per year, at about the same speed at which our fingernails grow.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Den største knogle i kroppen sidder i øret.\",\"t\":false,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Den mindste knogle, stigbøjlen, sidder i øret. Den største er lårbenet.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stapes","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The stapes is the smallest and lightest bone in the human body","ok":true},{"u":"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/body/ossicles","d":"my.clevelandclinic.org","q":"It’s the smallest bone in the human body, measuring only a few millimeters in both width and height.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Dine fingeraftryk blev dannet, før du blev født.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"De dannes allerede i morens mave og ændrer sig ikke.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fingerprint","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"These unique features are formed at around the 15th week of fetal development","ok":true},{"u":"https://medlineplus.gov/genetics/understanding/traits/fingerprints","d":"medlineplus.gov","q":"Dermatoglyphs develop before birth and remain the same throughout life.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"LEGO betyder »leg godt«.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Navnet kommer fra de danske ord »leg godt«.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lego","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"derived from the Danish phrase leg godt","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.lego.com/en-us/aboutus/lego-group/the-lego-group-history","d":"lego.com","q":"The name ‘LEGO’ is an abbreviation of the two Danish words “leg godt”, meaning “play well”.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Glas laves af smeltet plastik.\",\"t\":false,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Glas laves mest af smeltet sand.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glass","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Quartz sand (silica) is the main raw material in commercial glass production","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/glass","d":"snl.no","q":"Hovedråstoffene for dette er mest mulig jernfri kvartssand","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Gekkoer kan løbe på undersiden af loftet.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"De har små hår på tæerne, som gør dem klæbrige.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gecko","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"which enable them to grab and climb onto smooth and vertical surfaces, and even cross indoor ceilings with ease.","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/gekkoer","d":"snl.no","q":"De fleste artene har rue hefteskiver på undersiden av tærne, som gjør at de kan løpe på glatte vegger, vindusruter og på undersiden av tak.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En pelikan gemmer sine unger i strupesækken.\",\"t\":false,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Strupesækken bruges til at fange fisk.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pelican","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"characterized by a long beak and a large throat pouch used for catching prey","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/pelikaner","d":"snl.no","q":"Særlig karakteristisk er strupesekken som brukes ved fiskefangst.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Antarktis er en ørken, fordi det er så varmt der.\",\"t\":false,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Det er en ørken, fordi der næsten ikke falder regn eller sne.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antarctica","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is mainly a polar desert","ok":true},{"u":"https://spaceplace.nasa.gov/antarctica/","d":"spaceplace.nasa.gov","q":"it is considered a desert because it receives very little rain or snowfall.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Bamsen er opkaldt efter en dansk konge.\",\"t\":false,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Den er opkaldt efter den amerikanske præsident Theodore Roosevelt.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teddy_bear","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The teddy bear was named by Morris Michtom after the 26th president of the United States, Theodore Roosevelt","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nps.gov/articles/teddybear.htm","d":"nps.gov","q":"they decided to create a stuffed toy bear to sell in their store and dedicate it to Roosevelt.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Hvalrossen bruger sine store stødtænder, når den finder føde og kæmper om magten.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Stødtænderne kan blive næsten en meter lange.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walrus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They are slightly longer and thicker in males, who use them for fighting, dominance, and display.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.fisheries.noaa.gov/feature-story/14-seal-secrets","d":"fisheries.noaa.gov","q":"Walruses are the third type of pinniped and are well known for their large tusks that they use for foraging and fighting for dominance.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En bæver har gennemsigtige øjenlåg, der virker som svømmebriller.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"De lukker dem, når den svømmer under vand.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://nationalzoo.si.edu/animals/beaver","d":"nationalzoo.si.edu","q":"The beaver's eyes have a thin, transparent membrane, called a nictitating membrane, which is pulled over the eyeball for underwater work.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nwf.org/Educational-Resources/Wildlife-Guide/Mammals/American-Beaver","d":"nwf.org","q":"They have transparent eyelids that act as goggles so they can see as they swim.","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En pufferfisk kan puste sig op som en bold, når den bliver bange.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Den fylder sin meget elastiske mave med vand eller luft, så kroppen bliver rund og svær at æde.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pufferfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"fill its extremely elastic stomach with water or air when outside the water until it is much larger and almost spherical in shape","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/fish/facts/pufferfish","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"pufferfish use their highly elastic stomachs and the ability to quickly ingest huge amounts of water and even air when necessary to turn themselves into a virtually inedi","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Fisken under isen i Antarktis har farveløst blod.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Isfiskene har mistet hemoglobinet, som er det, der giver blodet rød farve.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antarctic_icefish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the loss of hemoglobin in the family channichthyidae","ok":true},{"u":"https://sciencedaily.com/releases/2023/04/230405090438.htm","d":"sciencedaily.com","q":"icefishes also are the only vertebrate that has adapted to live without hemoglobin in their blood cells causing their cells and tissues to be translucent white in color","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En mimosa lukker sine blade, når man rører ved den.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Planten hedder også 'den følsomme plante', fordi den reagerer på berøring.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mimosa_pudica","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the sensitive compound leaves quickly fold inward and droop when touched or shaken","ok":true},{"u":"https://phys.org/news/2022-11-fluorescence-caught-video-reveal-sensitive.html","d":"phys.org","q":"mimosa pudica commonly called touch me not shame or sensitive plant moves its leaves by bending the motor organ pulvinus immediately in response to touch and wounds","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En myre kan løfte og slæbe ting, der vejer mange gange mere end myren selv.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Myren bærer byttet hjem til boet – og kan slæbe flere gange sin egen vægt.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://phys.org/news/2020-10-flight-huge-benefits-ants.html","d":"phys.org","q":"ants are famously able to lift or drag objects many times their own weight and transport these objects back to their colony","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2020/10/201019082912.htm","d":"sciencedaily.com","q":"ants are famously able to lift or drag objects many times their own weight and transport these objects back to their colony","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Grønland hedder Grønland, fordi de første fiskere så grønt land ved kysten.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Erik Røde gav landet navnet – og ville gerne have flere bosættere.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greenland","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the early norse settlers named the island greenland in the icelandic sagas","ok":true},{"u":"https://nationalgeographic.com/science/article/iceland-greenland-name-swap","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"its grass was probably greener back in the summer of a d 982 when erik the red first landed in the southwest of the island","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En vaskebjørn vasker sin mad, før den spiser den.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Derfor hedder den på latin procyon lotor, som betyder 'vaskeren'.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raccoon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"dousing captive raccoons often douse their food before eating","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/raccoon","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"raccoons are known for washing their food before consuming it","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En ged har firkantede pupiller.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Så kan den se skarpt både foroven og fra siden.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"goats have horizontal slit shaped pupils allowing them to see well in both well lit and dark conditions","ok":true},{"u":"https://nationalzoo.si.edu/animals/goat","d":"nationalzoo.si.edu","q":"goats eyes have rectangular pupils","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Du kan lugte regn, før det begynder at regne.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Jorden afgiver en duft af geosmin, som kommer fra bakterier i jorden.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Petrichor","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the earthy scent often associated with rain falling on dry soil or rock","ok":true},{"u":"https://phys.org/news/2018-08-why-you-can-smell-rain.html","d":"phys.org","q":"moments before a rain event an earthy smell known as petrichor does permeate the air","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En italiensk læge så engang, at en død kyllingelegs muskler trak sig sammen, da han rørte den med metal.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Luigi Galvani lavede forsøget – sådan kom vi frem til elektricitet og batterier.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luigi_Galvani","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"using a frog he discovered that the muscles of dead frogs legs twitched when struck by an electrical spark","ok":true},{"u":"https://library.si.edu/exhibition/fantastic-worlds/body-electric","d":"library.si.edu","q":"italian physician and anatomist luigi galvani watched as a scalpel touched a dissected frog on a metal mount and the frog s leg kicked","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Baikal i Rusland er verdens dybeste sø.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Den er over 1.600 meter dyb – dybere end mange bjergtoppe er høje.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Baikal","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"it is a rift lake and the deepest lake in the world","ok":true},{"u":"https://phys.org/news/2017-08-russia-lake-baikal-extremely-polluted.html","d":"phys.org","q":"lake baikal is a unesco world heritage site the world s deepest lake at 1 700 metres 5 580 feet","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Opskriften på Coca-Cola er en hemmelighed.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Originalen lå i en borgbank i Atlanta – kun få ansatte kender den.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coca-Cola","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the formula of coca cola remains a trade secret","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2011/feb/16/coca-cola-secret-recipe-discovered","d":"theguardian.com","q":"the original of which is still supposedly held in a burglar proof vault at the sun trust bank in atlanta georgia","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Når du kløer dig, føles det dejligt.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Kløen dæmpes, og hjernen belønner dig for det med en god følelse.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Itch","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"there are hedonic aspects to scratching as one would find noxious scratching highly pleasurable","ok":true},{"u":"https://sciencedaily.com/releases/2008/01/080131121804.htm","d":"sciencedaily.com","q":"we know scratching is pleasurable but we haven t known why","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Dine ører vokser hele livet.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Ørerne bliver næsten en centimeter større over 50 år.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ear","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"ears grow quickly until about the age of nine then continue to grow steadily in circumference about 0 5 millimeters a year throughout life","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/av/health-27277582","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"they measured the ears of 200 patients over the age of 30 and found that ears increased in size by an average of 0 22mm per year around 1cm over 50 years","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En due drikker vand ved at suge det ind med næbbet – andre fugle må tippe hovedet bagover.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Duer trækker vandet op som gennem et sugestraw.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rock_dove","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"pigeons are able to dip their bills into the water and drink continuously without having to tilt their heads back","ok":true},{"u":"https://countrylife.co.uk/nature/whos-coos-are-whose-the-five-types-of-pigeon-youll-see-in-britain-253911","d":"countrylife.co.uk","q":"pigeons and doves are unique in being able to drink water without tipping their heads back to swallow and use their beaks to pull fluid up as if through a straw","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Blodet er rødt, fordi jernet i blodet binder ilt.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Når ilten sidder på jernet, bliver blodet lyst rødt – ellers er det mørkere.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blood","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"arterial blood and capillary blood are bright red as oxygen imparts a strong red color to the heme group","ok":true},{"u":"https://theconversation.com/blood-in-your-veins-is-not-blue-heres-why-its-always-red-97064","d":"theconversation.com","q":"human blood is red because of the protein hemoglobin which contains a red colored compound called heme that s crucial for carrying oxygen through your bloodstream heme co","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Mennesker har stadig en lille haleben – en rest af en hale.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Den sidder lige under lænden og kan godt gøre ondt, hvis man sidder på den.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coccyx","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the coccyx is the remnant of a vestigial tail","ok":true},{"u":"https://phys.org/news/2024-02-gene-code-human-ancestors-lost.pdf","d":"phys.org","q":"giving rise to the coccyx","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En kasuar har en 'hjelm' på hovedet, som er lavet af samme stof som negle.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Den er lavet af keratin og vokser, mens fuglen bliver ældre.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cassowary","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"all three species have a keratinous skin covered casque on their heads that grows with age","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/cassowary","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"the casque is made of a sponge like material and covered with a thick layer of keratin the same thing our fingernails are made of","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Et bæltedyr kan rulle sig sammen som en bold, når det er bange.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Kun den trebæltede art kan lukke helt sammen, så hovedpladen dækker åbningen.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Armadillo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"tolypeutes species frequently roll up into a ball they are the only species of armadillo capable of this","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/armadillo","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"the three banded armadillo is the only type of armadillo that can roll up into a ball for protection","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En Galápagos-skildpadde kan leve et helt år uden mad og vand.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Den kan gemme både fedt og vand i kroppen, og lever af det, når det mangler.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gal%C3%A1pagos_tortoise","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"they can endure up to a year when deprived of all food and water","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/galapagos-tortoise","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"they can go without eating or drinking for up to a year because they can store food and water so well","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Huden er kroppens største organ.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Den holder vand inde, regulerer temperaturen og mærker, hvad der rører dig.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_skin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the human skin is the outer covering of the body and is the largest organ of the integumentary system","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.healthdirect.gov.au/skin","d":"healthdirect.gov.au","q":"your skin is your body s largest organ it works as a protective covering for your body","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En sukkerflyver kan glide fra træ til træ med en fold mellem for- og bagbenene.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Folden hedder en patagium – den virker ligesom en faldskærm.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sugar_glider","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the sugar glider is characterised by its pair of gliding membranes known as patagia which extend from its forelegs to its hindlegs","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/sugar-glider","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"the sugar glider s main distinguishing feature is a soft membrane between its wrists and ankles called a patagium which allows it to glide from tree to tree as though usi","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En tarsier har øjne, der er større end hjernen.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Hvert øje er større end hjernen – de er de største øjne i forhold til kroppen hos alle pattedyr.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tarsier","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"each eyeball is approximately 16 millimetres 0 63 in in diameter and is as large as or in some cases larger than its entire brain","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Tarsius_syrichta/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"their eyes are the largest among mammals","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Ring-tailed lemurer dufter-kamp: Hannerne vifter hinanden i luften med duftende haler.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"De dufter med kirtler ved øjnene og bag, og holder 'stink battles' om terrasserne.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ring-tailed_lemur","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the males perform a unique scent marking behavior called spur marking and will participate in stink fights by dousing their tails with their pheromones and wafting","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Lemur_catta/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"ring tailed lemurs are known to use scent marking and even to engage in stink battles with one another where secretions from scent glands are rubbed onto the tail then wa","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En grøn havskildpadde vender tilbage til den strand, hvor den selv blev født.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Den har et magnetisk kompas i hjernen, så den kan finde vej hjem over tusindvis af kilometer.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Green_sea_turtle","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the sea turtles also contain an internal magnetic compass they can detect magnetic information by using magnetic forces acting on the magnetic crystals in their brains","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/reptiles/facts/green-sea-turtle","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"females leave the sea and choose an area often on the same beach used by their mothers to lay their eggs","ok":true}]},"ktf|{\"s\":\"Sikkerhedsselen blev opfundet af en svensk ingeniør, som delte patentet med hele bilindustrien.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Nils Bohlin fandt på den i 1959 – Volvo ville have, at alle bilproducenter kunne bruge den gratis.\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seat_belt","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the three point seat belt was developed to its modern form by swedish inventor nils bohlin for volvo which introduced it in 1959 as standard equipment","ok":true},{"u":"https://volvocars.com/intl/safety/legacy","d":"volvocars.com","q":"by sharing patent for this three point safety belt with the entire industry we ve contributed to saving over a million lives","ok":true}]},"kest|Hvor mange øjne har de fleste edderkopper?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-13","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spider","d":"wikipedia.