et","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/%C3%A6kvator","d":"lex.dk","q":"Ækvator er en tænkt cirkel, der deler Jorden – eller et andet himmellegeme – i to lige store dele: den nordlige og den sydlige halvkugle.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equator","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The equator is the circle of latitude that divides Earth into the Northern and Southern Hemispheres.","ok":true}]},"kest|Hvor mange knogler har en næse?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/n%C3%A6seben","d":"lex.dk","q":"Næseben er to små, aflange knogler, der ligger ved siden af hinanden og danner den inderste, øverste del af næseryggen.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasal_bone","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The nasal bones are two small oblong bones","ok":true}]},"kest|Hvor mange hjul har en gokart?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Go-kart","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A go-kart, also written as go-cart and often referred to as simply a kart, is a type of small four-wheeled vehicle.","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/gokart","d":"snl.no","q":"en rørramme med fire hjul","ok":true}]},"kest|Hvor mange lunger har en haj?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.submon.org/en/how-do-sharks-and-rays-breathe","d":"submon.org","q":"sharks and rays do not have lungs","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.lung.org/blog/sharks-need-oxygen-too","d":"lung.org","q":"Sharks don't have lungs","ok":true}]},"kest|Hvor mange horn har en triceratops?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Triceratops","d":"lex.dk","q":"Navnet har den fået, fordi den har tre store horn i ansigtet.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Triceratops","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bearing a large bony frill, three horns o