 unicykel er en ethjulet cykel","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unicycle","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A unicycle (also monocycle) is a vehicle that touches the ground with only one wheel.","ok":true}]},"kest|Hvor mange sider har en ottekant?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/oktagon","d":"lex.dk","q":"En oktagon, eller oktogon, er en polygon med otte sider.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octagon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is an eight-sided polygon or 8-gon","ok":true}]},"kest|Hvor mange ventiler har en trompet?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://snl.no/trompet","d":"snl.no","q":"denne trompettypen med tre ventiler","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trumpet","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"These three valves provide eight possible valve combinations","ok":true}]},"kest|Hvor mange hjul har en traditionel rulleskøjte?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/rullesk%C3%B8jter","d":"lex.dk","q":"basismodellen for de traditionelle firehjulede rulleskøjter","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roller_skates","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"used a four-wheel configuration for stability","ok":true}]},"kest|Hvor mange æg lægger en albatros ad gangen?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albatross","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"with a single egg laid in each breeding attempt","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/albatrosser","d":"snl.no","q":"legger da ett egg","ok":true}]},"kest|Hvor mange verdenshjørner er der?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/verdenshj%C3%B8rner","d":"lex.dk","q":"Verdenshjørner er de fire hovedretninger i horisontens plan, nord, syd, øst og vest.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Car