\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":12,\"e\":\"Titan er en måne – de andre er planeter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Titan_(m%C3%A5ne)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Titan er planeten Saturns største måne","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercury_(planet)","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Mercury is the first planet from the Sun.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Koala\",\"Panda\",\"Isbjørn\",\"Brunbjørn\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Koalaen er et pungdyr – de andre er bjørne.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Koala","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"er et trælevende planteædende pungdyr","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giant_panda","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"The giant panda, Ailuropoda melanoleuca, is a bear.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Kviksølv\",\"Jern\",\"Kobber\",\"Guld\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Kviksølv er flydende ved stuetemperatur – de andre er faste metaller.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercury_(element)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"mercury is the only metallic element that is known to be liquid at standard temperature and pressure","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/kviks%C3%B8lv","d":"lex.dk","q":"Det er et sølvglinsende, flydende metal.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Næbdyr\",\"Koala\",\"Kænguru\",\"Vombat\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Næbdyret er et kloakdyr, der lægger æg – de andre er pungdyr.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Platypus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Together with the four species of echidna, it is one of the five extant species of monotremes, mammals that lay eggs instead of giving birth to live young.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/n%C3%A6bdyr","d":"lex.dk","q":"Det er et såkaldt kl