lesbetegnelse for tre meget forskellige klasser af dyr: benfisk , bruskfisk og rundmunde .","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Æble\",\"Banan\",\"Kartoffel\",\"Pære\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":9,\"e\":\"Kartoflen er en knold – de andre er frugter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apple_(fruit)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"An apple is the round, edible fruit of an apple tree ( Malus spp.).","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/kartoffel","d":"lex.dk","q":"På underjordiske stængler sidder stivelsesholdige knolde, kartofler , som tjener planten til vegetativ formering","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Mus\",\"Rotte\",\"Hamster\",\"Fugl\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":9,\"e\":\"Fuglen er ikke en gnaver – de andre er gnavere.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rodent","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Rodents (from Latin rodens ' gnawing ' ) are a group of mammals belonging to the order Rodentia","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/gnavere","d":"lex.dk","q":"Gnavere er overvejende små dyr; den mindste, en nordamerikansk dværgmus, vejer blot 5 g","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Mælk\",\"Ost\",\"Yoghurt\",\"Æble\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":9,\"e\":\"Æblet er en frugt – de andre er mælkeprodukter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/ost","d":"lex.dk","q":"Ost er et mælkeprodukt, der fremstilles ved konservering af mælk fra ko, ged eller får.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apple_(fruit)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"An apple is the round, edible fruit of an apple tree ( Malus spp.).","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Fisk\",\"Mus\",\"Fugl\",\"Sten\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":9,\"e\":\"En sten er ikke et dyr – de andre er dyr.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/fisk","d":"lex.dk","q":"Fisk er en fællesbetegnelse for tre meget forskellige klasser af dyr: benfisk , bruskfisk og rundmunde .","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rock_(geology)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In geology , a rock (also called a stone ) is any naturally occurring solid mass or aggregate of minerals or mineraloid matter.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Tirsdag\",\"Onsdag\",\"Torsdag\",\"April\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":9,\"e\":\"April er en måned – de andre er ugedage.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tuesday","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Tuesday is the day of the week between Monday and Wednesday .","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/april","d":"lex.dk","q":"April er årets 4. måned (30 dage) i den julianske og den i vesten nugældende gregorianske kalender.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Fløjte\",\"Clarinet\",\"Saxofon\",\"Violin\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Violinen er et strygeinstrument – de andre er blæseinstrumenter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/violin","d":"lex.dk","q":"En violin er et strygeinstrument med fire strenge, som spilles ved at stryge en bue mod strengene","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bowed string instrument","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Bil\",\"Cykel\",\"Bus\",\"Hund\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Hunden er ikke et køretøj – de andre er køretøjer.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/cykel","d":"lex.dk","q":"En cykel er et sædvanligvis tohjulet køretøj fremdrevet ved pedalkraft.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dog","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The dog is a domestic animal that likely travelled a commensal pathway into domestication","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Elefant\",\"Giraf\",\"Løve\",\"Pingvin\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Pingvinen er en fugl – de andre er pattedyr.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/pingviner","d":"lex.dk","q":"Pingviner er en familie med 18 arter af ikke-flyvende havfugle","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penguin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Family of aquatic flightless birds","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"København\",\"Aarhus\",\"Odense\",\"Oslo\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Oslo er ikke en dansk by – de andre er danske byer.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Copenhagen","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"became the capital of Denmark in the early 15th century.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Oslo","d":"lex.dk","q":"Oslo er Norges hovedstad og landets største by med 700.000 indbyggere i Oslo Kommune (2023).","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Europa\",\"Asien\",\"Afrika\",\"Danmark\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Danmark er et land – de andre er kontinenter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Continent","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A continent is any of several large terrestrial geographical regions .","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Danmark","d":"lex.dk","q":"Danmark er en nation og stat, der ligger mellem 54° og 58° nordlig bredde","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Atlanterhavet\",\"Indiske Ocean\",\"Middelhavet\",\"Amazonas\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Amazonas er en flod – de andre er have.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Amazonas","d":"lex.dk","q":"Amazonas er en flod i Sydamerika og en af verdens længste floder.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_Ocean","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Indian Ocean is the third-largest of the world's five oceanic divisions","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Jern\",\"Guld\",\"Sølv\",\"Vand\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Vand er ikke et metal – de andre er metaller.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/vand","d":"lex.dk","q":"Vand er et simpelt opbygget molekyle der består af to brintatomer og ét iltatom.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iron","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Iron is a chemical element ; it has symbol Fe ( from Latin ferrum ) and atomic number 26.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Vinter\",\"Sommer\",\"Forår\",\"Mandag\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":10,\"e\":\"Mandag er en ugedag – de andre er årstider.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/årstider","d":"lex.dk","q":"Årstider er de fire perioder, forår , sommer , efterår og vinter , som året t","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monday","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Monday is the day of the week that takes place between Sunday and Tuesday .","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Guld\",\"Sølv\",\"Jern\",\"Rust\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":11,\"e\":\"Rust er ikke et metal – de andre er metaller.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rust","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Rust is a mixture of iron oxides formed by the reaction of iron and oxygen in the catalytic presence of water or air moisture","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/jern","d":"lex.dk","q":"Jern er grundstof nummer 26. Det er placeret i det periodiske systems 8. gruppe","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Fotosyntese\",\"Respiration\",\"Fordøjelse\",\"Gravitation\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":11,\"e\":\"Gravitation er en fysisk kraft – de andre er biologiske processer.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gravitation","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is a fundamental interaction , which may be described as the force that draws material objects towards each other.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/fotosyntese","d":"lex.dk","q":"Fotosyntese er en af de vigtigste biologiske processer på Jorden","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Kvælstof\",\"Ilt\",\"Brint\",\"Luft\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":11,\"e\":\"Luft er en blanding – de andre er grundstoffer.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Air","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The atmosphere of Earth consists of a multi-layered gas mixture (commonly referred to as air ) surrounding the Earth 's planetary surface , which is retained by gravity .","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/kvælstof","d":"lex.dk","q":"Kvælstof er det danske navn for grundstoffet nitrogen .","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Trekant\",\"Firkant\",\"Cirkel\",\"Rød\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":11,\"e\":\"Rød er en farve – de andre er geometriske figurer.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/trekant","d":"lex.dk","q":"En trekant er i euklidisk geometri en plan figur sammensat af tre linjestykker","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Red is the color at the long wavelength end of the visible spectrum of light, next to orange .","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Bæver\",\"Egern\",\"Grævling\",\"Græshoppe\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Græshoppen er et insekt – de andre er gnavere.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/gr%C3%A6shopper","d":"lex.dk","q":"Græshopper er en gruppe af forholdsvis små til meget store insekter, hvis bageste benpar er udviklet til lange springben.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rodent","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Rodents (from Latin rodens 'gnawing') are a group of mammals belonging to the order Rodentia","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Laks\",\"Ørred\",\"Karpe\",\"Blæksprutte\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Blæksprutten er et bløddyr – de andre er fisk.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/bl%C3%A6ksprutter","d":"lex.dk","q":"Blæksprutter er en klasse af fritsvømmende bløddyr med samme bygningsplan som muslinger og snegle.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A fish is an aquatic, anamniotic, gill-bearing vertebrate with a tough cranium to protect the brain.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Svane\",\"Gås\",\"And\",\"Hummer\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Hummeren er et krebsdyr – de andre er fugle.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/hummer","d":"lex.dk","q":"Hummeren er et tibenet krebsdyr med en aflang, stærkt pansret krop.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bird","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Birds are vertebrate animals constituting the class Aves, characterised by feathers, toothless beaked jaws, the laying of hard-shelled eggs, a high metabolic rate, a four","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Ugle\",\"Falk\",\"Høg\",\"Marke\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Marken er et insekt – de andre er fugle.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/ugler","d":"lex.dk","q":"Ugler er en orden af fugle, der normalt inddeles i to nærtstående familier: slørugler (tytonidae) med 18 arter og egentlige ugler (strigidae) med 228 arter.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Butterfly","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Butterflies are winged insects from the lepidopteran superfamily Papilionoidea, characterised by large, often brightly coloured wings that often fold together when at res","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Hjort\",\"Rådyr\",\"Elg\",\"Ål\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Ålen er en fisk – de andre er pattedyr.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/%C3%A5l","d":"lex.dk","q":"Ål er en familie af meget langstrakte benfisk, som er udbredt i tempererede og tropiske dele af det meste af verden; de mangler dog i det østlige stillehav og sydlige atl","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deer","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"A deer is a even-toed ungulate mammal in the family Cervidae.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Næsehorn\",\"Zebra\",\"Flodhest\",\"Krokodille\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Krokodillen er et krybdyr – de andre er pattedyr.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/krokodiller","d":"lex.dk","q":"Krokodiller er en orden af krybdyr, der omfatter de egentlige krokodiller (crocodylidae), alligatorer og kaimaner (alligatoridae) samt gavialen (gavialidae).","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mammal","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"mammals are characterized by the presence of milk-producing mammary glands for feeding their young","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Gorilla\",\"Chimpans\",\"Orangutang\",\"Vildsvin\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Vildsvinet er ikke en abe – de andre er aber.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wild_boar","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The wild boar (Sus scrofa), also known as the wild swine","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ape","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Apes are simians belonging to the primate family Hominoidea.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Ananas\",\"Mango\",\"Fersken\",\"Blomkål\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Blomkålen er en grøntsag – de andre er frugter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cauliflower","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Cauliflower (Brassica oleracea var. botrytis) is a vegetable belonging to the species Brassica oleracea in the family Brassicaceae (the mustard or cabbage family).","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/ananas","d":"lex.dk","q":"Den ene art, A. comosus, dyrkes for sin frugt i tropiske og subtropiske egne over hele verden.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Bønner\",\"Ærter\",\"Linser\",\"Majs\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Majs er et græs (korn) – de andre er bælgfrugter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/majs","d":"lex.dk","q":"Majs er en slægt af høje, enårige græsser.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Legume","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Legumes are plants in the pea family Fabaceae (or Leguminosae), or the fruit or seeds of such plants.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Smør\",\"Fløde\",\"Hytteost\",\"Rugbrød\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Rugbrødet er brød – de andre er mælkeprodukter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/rugbr%C3%B8d","d":"lex.dk","q":"Rugbrød er danskernes nationalspise, og det har været det daglige brød i danmark i mere end 1000 år siden vikingetiden og op til 1950'erne.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dairy_product","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Dairy products or milk products are foods made from (or containing) milk","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Kaffe\",\"Te\",\"Kakao\",\"Cola\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Cola er en læskedrik – de andre er varme drikke.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/l%C3%A6skedrik","d":"lex.dk","q":"Læskedrikke er alkoholfrie drikke, der læsker, dvs. slukker tørsten.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Coffee is brewed from the ground roasted beans, which are typically steeped in hot water before being filtered out.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Spidskål\",\"Salat\",\"Agurk\",\"Hindbær\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Hindbæret er en frugt – de andre er grøntsager.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/hindb%C3%A6r","d":"lex.dk","q":"hindbær er en halvbusk i rosenfamilien, der dyrkes for sine velsmagende frugter.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vegetable","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Vegetables are edible parts of plants that are consumed by humans or other animals as food","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Hjerte\",\"Lever\",\"Nyre\",\"Knæ\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Knæet er et led – de andre er organer.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/nyrerne","d":"lex.dk","q":"Nyrerne er organet i kroppen, der danner urin.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Knee","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The knee is a modified hinge joint, which permits flexion and extension as well as slight internal and external rotation.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Øje\",\"Øre\",\"Næse\",\"Albue\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Albuen er et led – de andre er sanseorganer.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/albue","d":"lex.dk","q":"Albuen er forbindelsen mellem over- og underarm.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sense","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A sense is a biological system used by an organism for sensation, the process of gathering information about the surroundings through the detection of stimuli.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Hånd\",\"Fod\",\"Ankel\",\"Mave\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Maven er et organ – de andre er lemmer.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/h%C3%A5nden","d":"lex.dk","q":"Hånden er armens yderste og mest bevægelige del, formet som et gribeværktøj.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stomach","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The stomach is a muscular, hollow organ in the upper gastrointestinal tract of humans and many other animals, including several invertebrates.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Regn\",\"Sne\",\"Hagl\",\"Solskin\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Solskin er ikke nedbør – de andre er det.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/regn","d":"lex.dk","q":"Regn er nedbør, som består af vanddråber, der kondenserer på små kerner af sand, salt, støv eller lignende.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Precipitation","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In meteorology, precipitation is any product of the condensation of atmospheric water vapor that falls from clouds due to gravitational pull.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Bjerg\",\"Dal\",\"Sø\",\"Sky\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Skyen er en sky – de andre er former på jorden.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/bjerg","d":"lex.dk","q":"Bjerg, højtliggende område, der hæver sig tydeligt (mindst 200 m) over det omliggende terræn.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cloud","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In meteorology, a cloud is an aerosol consisting of a visible mass of miniature liquid droplets, ice crystals, or other particles, suspended in the atmosphere of a planet","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Stjerne\",\"Planet\",\"Meteor\",\"Regnbue\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Regnbuen er et lysfænomen – de andre er himmellegemer.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/regnbue","d":"lex.dk","q":"En regnbue er et lysfænomen i atmosfæren, hvor det hvide sollys ved brydning og refleksion i vanddråber spaltes i spektralfarverne og fremtræder som en eller flere koncen","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astronomical_object","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"An astronomical object, celestial object, stellar object or heavenly object is a naturally occurring physical entity, association, or structure that exists within the uni","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Italien\",\"Grækenland\",\"Tyrkiet\",\"Japan\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":7,\"e\":\"Japan ligger i Asien – de andre ligger i Europa.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Japan","d":"lex.dk","q":"Japan er et kejserrige i Østasien.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Italy","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Italy (Italian: Italia [iˈtaːlja]) is a country in southern Europe with small island territories in North Africa.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Wien\",\"Prag\",\"Budapest\",\"Tokyo\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Tokyo er ikke en europæisk hovedstad – de andre er det.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/Tokyo","d":"lex.dk","q":"Tokyo er Japans hovedstad.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vienna","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is the capital, most populous city, and one of the nine states of Austria","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Gudenå\",\"Skjernå\",\"Suså\",\"Ørken\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":8,\"e\":\"Ørkenen er ikke en flod – de andre er floder.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/%C3%B8rken","d":"lex.dk","q":"Ørkener findes i de dele af jorden, der årlig modtager mindre end 250 mm nedbør, og hvor den potentielle fordampning samtidig overstiger nedbørsmængden.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/River","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A river is a natural stream of fresh water that flows on land or inside caves towards another body of water at a lower elevation, such as an ocean, lake, or another river","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Gul\",\"Lilla\",\"Orange\",\"Oval\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":6,\"e\":\"Oval er en form – de andre er farver.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-16","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/oval","d":"lex.dk","q":"En oval er i plangeometri en lukket, strengt konveks kurve, som kan indeholde knæk, men ikke rette linjestykker.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Color","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Color (or colour in Commonwealth English) is the visual perception produced by the activation of the different types of cone cells in the eye caused by light.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Trekant\",\"Rød\",\"Blå\",\"Grøn\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":4,\"e\":\"Trekanten er en form – de andre er farver.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-17","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/trekant","d":"lex.dk","q":"En trekant er i euklidisk geometri en plan figur sammensat af tre linjestykker","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Color","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Color (or colour in Commonwealth English) is the visual perception produced by the activation of the different types of cone cells in the eye caused by light.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Løve\",\"Haj\",\"Torsk\",\"Sild\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":5,\"e\":\"Løven er ikke en fisk – de andre er fisk.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-17","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/l%C3%B8ve","d":"lex.dk","q":"Løven færdes fortrinsvis i åbne savanneområder","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A fish is an aquatic, anamniotic, gill-bearing vertebrate with a tough cranium to protect the brain.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Vand\",\"Ilt\",\"Kulstof\",\"Kvælstof\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":12,\"e\":\"Vand er en forbindelse – de andre er grundstoffer.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-17","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://lex.dk/vand","d":"lex.dk","q":"Vand er et simpelt opbygget molekyle der består af to brintatomer og ét iltatom.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Water","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Water is an inorganic compound with the chemical formula H2O.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Phobos\",\"Merkur\",\"Venus\",\"Mars\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":12,\"e\":\"Phobos er en måne – de andre er planeter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-17","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phobos_(moon)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is the innermost and larger of the two natural satellites of Mars","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Merkur","d":"lex.dk","q":"Merkur er den inderste og mindste planet i Solsystemet.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Saturn\",\"Io\",\"Europa\",\"Ganymedes\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Saturn er en planet – de andre er måner om Jupiter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-17","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Io_(moon)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Io is the innermost and second smallest of the four Galilean moons of Jupiter.","ok":true},{"u":"https://solarsystem.nasa.gov/planets/saturn/overview/","d":"solarsystem.nasa.gov","q":"Saturn is the sixth planet from the Sun, and the second largest in the solar system.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Uranus\",\"Titan\",\"Enceladus\",\"Mimas\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Uranus er en planet – de andre er måner om Saturn.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-17","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Titan_(moon)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Titan is the largest moon of Saturn and the second largest in the Solar System.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Uranus","d":"lex.dk","q":"Uranus er den tredjestørste planet i Solsystemet, opdaget i 1781 af William Herschel.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Andromeda\",\"Merkur\",\"Venus\",\"Mars\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Andromeda er en galakse – de andre er planeter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-17","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andromeda_Galaxy","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Andromeda Galaxy is a barred spiral galaxy and is the nearest major galaxy to the Milky Way.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Merkur","d":"lex.dk","q":"Merkur er den inderste og mindste planet i Solsystemet.","ok":true}]},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Polarstjernen\",\"Merkur\",\"Venus\",\"Mars\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Polarstjernen er en stjerne – de andre er planeter.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-17","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polaris","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Polaris is a yellow supergiant star in the northern circumpolar constellation of Ursa Minor.","ok":true},{"u":"h