11:HØJSKOLE":{"pool":"t1bog","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[]},"t1bog|BM11-1:RUMREJSE/RUMDRAGT/RUMSKIB":{"pool":"t1bog","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[]},"t1bog|BM11-2:TEKNIKUM/RUMFART/RUMHELM":{"pool":"t1bog","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[]},"t1bog|BL11-1:RUMKAPSEL":{"pool":"t1bog","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[]},"t1bog|BL11-2:SOLSYSTEM":{"pool":"t1bog","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[]},"mus80|Hvorfor tabte New Order penge på hver solgt kopi af «Blue Monday» i 1983?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Monday_(New_Order_song)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It cost so much to produce that Factory Records actually lost money on each copy sold.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2019/jul/19/peter-saville-blue-monday-new-order-joy-division","d":"theguardian.com","q":"The sleeves reportedly cost so much to print that Factory Records lost money on the biggest-selling 12-inch ever.","ok":true}]},"mus80|Hvad skete der med Frankie Goes to Hollywoods «Relax», efter BBC bandlyste den i januar 1984?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Relax_(Frankie_Goes_to_Hollywood_song)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The now-banned \"Relax\" rose to no. 2 on the charts by 17 January, and hit the number-one spot on 24 January.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/music/2011/jun/11/frankie-hollywood-banned-bbc","d":"theguardian.com","q":"Relax duly climbed to No 1, staying there for five weeks.","ok":true}]},"mus80|Hvem sagsøgte Ray Parker Jr. for at have kopieret melodien i «Ghostbusters»?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghostbusters_(song)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Huey Lewis sued Ray Parker Jr. for plagiarism, alleging that Parker had copied the melody from Lewis's 1983 song","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.mprnews.org/story/2016/08/11/ghostbusters-theme-song-subject-of-a-lawsuit","d":"mprnews.org","q":"Lewis sued Parker and they settled out of court in 1985.","ok":true}]},"mus80|Hvad inspirerede Nena til teksten i «99 Luftballons»?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/99_Luftballons","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"While at a June 1982 concert by the Rolling Stones in West Berlin, Nena's guitarist Carlo Karges noticed that balloons were being released.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.berliner-zeitung.de/article/40-jahre-99-luftballons-von-nena-310053","d":"berliner-zeitung.de","q":"Die Idee zum Liedtext kam dem Band-Gitarristen Carlo Karges 1982 bei einem Rolling-Stones-Konzert in West-Berlin, als Mick Jagger am Ende der Show Ballons hochsteigen lie","ok":true}]},"mus80|Hvad handlede The Polices «Every Breath You Take» ifølge Sting om?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Every_Breath_You_Take","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"He started writing the song at Ian Fleming's writing desk on the Goldeneye estate in Oracabessa Bay, Jamaica.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.udiscovermusic.com/stories/every-breath-you-take-sting-police-song","d":"udiscovermusic.com","q":"I think I was thinking of Big Brother, surveillance and control.","ok":true}]},"mus80|Under hvilket navn skrev Prince The Bangles-hittet «Manic Monday»?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manic_Monday","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The song was written by Prince, under the pseudonym \"Christopher\".","ok":true},{"u":"https://americansongwriter.com/38-years-ago-princes-songwriting-landed-him-the-top-2-spots-on-the-billboard-hot-100/","d":"americansongwriter.com","q":"Prince originally wrote \"Manic Monday\" in 1984 for Apollonia 6","ok":true}]},"mus80|Hvad var særligt ved Bobby McFerrins «Don't Worry, Be Happy», da den toppede Billboard Hot 100 i 1988?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don%27t_Worry,_Be_Happy","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It was the first a cappella song to reach number-one on the Billboard Hot 100 chart, a position it held for two weeks.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.grammy.com/news/dont-worry-give-bobby-a-call","d":"grammy.com","q":"Don't Worry Be Happy became the first a cappella song to top the Billboard Hot 100","ok":true}]},"mus80|Hvor lang tid tog det at indspille Band Aids «Do They Know It's Christmas?» i 1984?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Do_They_Know_It%27s_Christmas%3F","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It was first recorded by Band Aid, a supergroup consisting of popular British and Irish musicians, in a single day at Sarm West Studios in Notting Hill, London, in Novemb","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/mediacentre/2024/bbc-to-mark-the-40th-anniversary-of-band-aid","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"The song was recorded over the course of one day at SARM Studios in Notting Hill, and was filmed by director Nigel Dick.","ok":true}]},"mus80|Hvad troede Steve «Silk» Hurley, da hans manager fortalte, at «Jack Your Body» var nr. 1 i Storbritannien?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jack_Your_Body","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"He did not know that the track had reached number one on the UK Singles Chart","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/music/2017/jan/19/how-jack-your-body-began-house-musics-squelching-electronic-revolution","d":"theguardian.com","q":"that Jack Your Body was No 1 in the UK; Hurley assumed that meant the dance chart No 1.","ok":true}]},"mus80|Hvad betyder «dutchie» i Musical Youths «Pass the Dutchie»?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pass_the_Dutchie","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the new word being a patois term for a Dutch oven, a type of cooking pot.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2018/aug/20/how-we-made-musical-youth-pass-the-dutchie","d":"theguardian.com","q":"We changed kouchie to dutchie, which is a West Indian cooking pot","ok":true}]},"mus80|Hvorfor blev «We Are the World» indspillet om natten den 28. januar 1985?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/We_Are_the_World","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Many of the participants came from an American Music Awards ceremony held that night.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-news/we-are-the-world-record-usa-africa-785832","d":"rollingstone.com","q":"many coming straight from the American Music Awards happening across town that same night.","ok":true}]},"mus80|Hvor længe lå Soft Cells «Tainted Love» på Billboard Hot 100 i 1982?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://www.udiscovermusic.com/stories/soft-cell-tainted-love-song","d":"udiscovermusic.com","q":"created a new chart longevity record at the time by spending an incredible 43 weeks on the Hot 100.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.soundonsound.com/techniques/classic-tracks-soft-cell-tainted-love","d":"soundonsound.com","q":"went on to spend a record-breaking 43 weeks on the American Billboard Hot 100 chart.","ok":true}]},"mus80|Hvilken musikvideo åbnede MTV Europe, da kanalen gik i luften 1. august 1987?":{"pool":"mus80","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","daily":true,"sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Money_for_Nothing","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"was the first to be aired on MTV Europe when the 