å spilles.","ok":true},{"u":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/dictionary/english/offside","d":"dictionary.cambridge.org","q":"( US also offsides ) (in particular sports , especially football and ice hockey ) in a position that is not allowed by the rules of the game , often in front of the ball","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Free_kick","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A free kick is an action used in several codes of football to restart play with the kicking of a ball into the field of play .","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Langrend\",\"Curling\",\"Ishockey\",\"Skøjteløb\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Langrend er en disciplin i skiløb – de andre er hver sit navn på en hel sport.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cross-country_skiing","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Cross-country skiing is a form of skiing whereby skiers traverse snow-covered terrain without use of ski lifts or other assistance.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/langrend","d":"lex.dk","q":"Langrend er skiløb på langrendsski.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Curling","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Two teams, each with four players, take turns sliding heavy, polished granite stones, also called rocks , across the ice curling sheet towards the house , a circular targ","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Backgammon\",\"Poker\",\"Bridge\",\"Baccarat\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Backgammon spilles med terninger – de andre er kortspil.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Backgammon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Backgammon involves a combination of strategy and luck from rolling of the dice.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/backgammon","d":"lex.dk","q":"Backgammon er et ældgammelt brætspil , hvor to spillere flytter hver deres 15 brikker i hver sin retning på et bræt med 24 spidser.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/poker","d":"lex.dk","q":"Poker er en familie af kortspil, der kombinerer strategisk væddemål, psykologi og sandsynlighedsberegning.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Luxemburg\",\"Nederland\",\"Belgien\",\"Tyskland\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":14,\"e\":\"Luxemburg er det eneste land uden kystlinje – de andre grænser til havet.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luxembourg","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Luxembourg , [ a ] officially the Grand Duchy of Luxembourg , [ b ] is a landlocked country in Western Europe .","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/Luxembourg","d":"snl.no","q":"Luxembourg er en liten innlandsstat som grenser til Belgia i vest og nord, Tyskland i øst og Frankrike i sør.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Netherlands","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It shares maritime borders with the United Kingdom , Germany, and Belgium in the North Sea .","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Nordirland\",\"England\",\"Skotland\",\"Wales\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Nordirland ligger på øen Irland – de andre ligger alle på Storbritannien.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","sources":[{"u":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/dictionary/english/northern-ireland","d":"dictionary.cambridge.org","q":"the northeast part of Ireland that is part of the United Kingdom","ok":true},{"u":"https://snl.no/Nord-Irland","d":"snl.no","q":"Nord-Irland utgjør den nordøstlige delen av øya Irland.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scotland","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The mainland of Scotland comprises the northern third of the land mass of the island of Great Britain, which lies off the northwest coast of Continental Europe .","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Ben Nevis\",\"Matterhorn\",\"Jungfrau\",\"Zugspitze\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":12,\"e\":\"Ben Nevis er Storbritanniens højeste bjerg – de andre ligger på fastlandet i Europa.\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-19","sources":[{"u":"