harry-potter-filmmakers-who-almost-directed-the-movies/","d":"movieweb.com","q":"Chris Columbus helmed the first two films, Harry Potter and the Sorcerer's Stone and The Chamber of Secrets.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"harry|Hvilken Harry Potter-film blev IKKE skrevet af Steve Kloves?":{"pool":"harry","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_and_the_Order_of_the_Phoenix_(film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Steve Kloves, the screenwriter of the first four Potter films, had other commitments.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/harry_potter_and_the_order_of_the_phoenix","d":"rottentomatoes.com","q":"Michael Goldenberg","ok":true}],"daily":true},"harry|Hvem komponerede musikken til de tre første Harry Potter-film?":{"pool":"harry","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_the_Harry_Potter_films","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"John Williams, composer of the first three films","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.musicnotes.com/blog/behind-the-music-of-harry-potter/","d":"musicnotes.com","q":"Williams scored the first three films of the Harry Potter series","ok":true}],"daily":true},"harry|Hvem spillede Lord Voldemort i Harry Potter-filmene?":{"pool":"harry","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_(film_series)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Lord Voldemort (Ralph Fiennes)","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/harry_potter_and_the_goblet_of_fire","d":"rottentomatoes.com","q":"Ralph Fiennes","ok":true}],"daily":true},"harry|Hvor mange år varede optagelserne til Harry Potter-filmserien?":{"pool":"harry","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_(film_series)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Production took place over ten years","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/film/2011/jul/07/harry-potter-making-the-films-cast-and-crew","d":"theguardian.com","q":"Ten years of making Harry Potter films","ok":true}],"daily":true},"harry|Hvor mange instruktører arbejdede på Harry Potter-filmserien?":{"pool":"harry","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_(film_series)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Four directors worked on the series: Chris Columbus, Alfonso Cuarón, Mike Newell, and David Yates.","ok":true},{"u":"https://filmhounds.co.uk/2021/07/16/four-unique-visions-harry-potter-and-the-decade-of-change/","d":"filmhounds.co.uk","q":"The four directors of the Harry Potter series have vastly different styles","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvornår blev den første trykte julekalender (adventskalender) udgivet?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.knauf-museum.de/sonderausstellung/archiv/sonderausstellungen/123-adventskalender-im-wandel-der-zeit-11-november-2007-06-januar-2008","d":"knauf-museum.de","q":"Der erste gedruckte Adventskalender wurde 1908 von dem Münchner Verleger Gerhard Lang aus Maulbronn auf den Markt gebracht.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/bitesize/articles/z469ywx","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"but it was in 1908 that a German printer called Gerhard Lang created what is thought to be the first commercial Advent calendar.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvornår stammer den ældste kendte hjemmelavede julekalender fra?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.knauf-museum.de/sonderausstellung/archiv/sonderausstellungen/123-adventskalender-im-wandel-der-zeit-11-november-2007-06-januar-2008","d":"knauf-museum.de","q":"das erste selbst gebastelte Exemplar stammt aus dem Jahr 1851.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/bitesize/articles/z469ywx","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"The German Christmas Museum states that there was evidence of a type of Advent calendar in a children’s book by Elise Averdieck dated 1851","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvornår kom den første julekalender med låger (døre) på markedet?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.knauf-museum.de/sonderausstellung/archiv/sonderausstellungen/123-adventskalender-im-wandel-der-zeit-11-november-2007-06-januar-2008","d":"knauf-museum.de","q":"Nach 1920 verbreiteten sich Kalender, deren Fensterchen man öffnen konnte.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dw.com/en/the-advent-calendars-sweet-history/g-17256886","d":"dw.com","q":"The first Advent calendars with little doors made their debut on the market in 1920.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvad skete der med julekalenderen under nazismen i Tyskland?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/bitesize/articles/z469ywx","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"paper and cardboard rationing, along with a Nazi ban on picture calendars, forced Lang's business to close; the Nazis instead produced a propaganda filled pamphlet to mar","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/culture/article/advent-is-a-season-of-candlelight-reflection-and-expectation","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"Nazi Germany’s secular rebranding of Christmas almost killed off the printed Advent calendar.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvilken amerikansk præsident blev fotograferet med en julekalender og gjorde traditionen populær i USA?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advent_calendar","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"After the magazine Newsweek showed a picture of Eisenhower's grandson on an Advent calendar in December 1953, demand rose massively.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/bitesize/articles/z469ywx","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"In 1953, US President Dwight D. Eisenhower and his family were pictured in Newsweek with a Sellmer calendar, and the German tradition soon took off in America.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvornår producerede Cadbury sin første chokolade-julekalender?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/bitesize/articles/z469ywx","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"but it wasn't until 1971 that chocolate giant Cadbury joined the Christmas-party and made their own calendars.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.english-heritage.org.uk/members-area/kids/kids-rule-things-to-make-and-do/advent-calendar-craft/","d":"english-heritage.org.uk","q":"Britain's most well-known chocolate company, Cadbury, produced its first chocolate calendar in 1971","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvad betyder ordet 'advent' på latin?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.english-heritage.org.uk/members-area/kids/kids-rule-things-to-make-and-do/advent-calendar-craft/","d":"english-heritage.org.uk","q":"The word 'advent' comes from the Latin word adventus, meaning 'arrival' or 'coming'.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advent","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The name comes from Latin adventus ('coming; arrival')","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvad brugte Johann Hinrich Wichern til at lave den første adventskrans?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advent_wreath","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In 1839, he took a large wooden ring from an old cartwheel and decorated it with 24 small red candles and four large white candles.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.diakonie.at/ueber-uns/geschichte/adventkranz","d":"diakonie.at","q":"entzündete der Gründer der Diakonie Johann Hinrich Wichern im Rauhen Haus der Diakonie 1839 in Hamburg jeden Tag eine Kerze an einem Wagenrad","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvilken farve har det tredje adventslys traditionelt?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advent","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A rose-coloured candle in Western Christianity is referenced as a sign of joy (Gaudete) lit on the third Sunday of Advent.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.uscatholic.org/articles/201511/why-are-advent-candles-pink-and-purple/","d":"uscatholic.org","q":"one pink, the color of rejoicing worn on the third Sunday of Advent","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvornår blev den første danske tv-julekalender sendt?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advent_calendar","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The first julekalender aired in Denmark was Historier fra hele verden in 1962.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dr.dk/event/jul/julekalenderens-historie-fra-dukker-til-moerke-parallelverdner","d":"dr.dk","q":"Den første julekalender havde premiere på DR 1 i 1962.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvor mange afsnit havde Danmarks første tv-julekalender ('Historier fra hele verden')?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.kosmorama.org/kosmorama/artikler/dansk-tv-julekalender-til-tiden-fra-dukker-til-drama","d":"kosmorama.org","q":"Historier fra hele verden består af 23 små, separate fortællinger.","ok":true},{"u":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/272770673/Marie_speciale_vht680.pdf","d":"curis.ku.dk","q":"Historier fra hele verden bestod af 23 afsnit i sort-hvid","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvilket land var inspirationen til Danmarks første tv-julekalender?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advent_calendar","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The first televised show of the genre aired in 1960 in the form of the Swedish program Titteliture.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.kosmorama.org/kosmorama/artikler/dansk-tv-julekalender-til-tiden-fra-dukker-til-drama","d":"kosmorama.org","q":"Idéen til den danske tv-julekalender er et ’rent tyveri’ fra Sverige, hvor den første af slagsen ruller over skærmen allerede i 1960.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvilken julekalender var den første danske tv-julekalender, der kun brugte skuespillere (ingen dukker)?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.kosmorama.org/kosmorama/artikler/dansk-tv-julekalender-til-tiden-fra-dukker-til-drama","d":"kosmorama.org","q":"Dukkerne er langt borte, og Jul i Gammelby bliver den første julekalender kun med skuespillere.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dr.dk/ligetil/kultur/julekalenderen-fylder-50-aar","d":"dr.dk","q":"Det var men først med \"Jul i Gammelby\" fra 1979, at man for alvorlig begyndte at lave julekalendere kun med skuespillere.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvornår opfandt Johann Hinrich Wichern adventskransen?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advent","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The modern Advent wreath, with its candles representing the Sundays of Advent, originated from an 1839 initiative by Johann Hinrich Wichern","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.uscatholic.org/articles/201511/why-are-advent-candles-pink-and-purple/","d":"uscatholic.org","q":"In 1839 students at a school Wichern established for poor boys in Hamburg kept asking him when Christmas would arrive.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"city|I hvilket land ligger Melilla?":{"pool":"city","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melilla","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Melilla is an autonomous city of Spain on the North African coast.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Melilla","d":"lex.dk","q":"Melilla er sammen med Ceuta en spansk enklave","ok":true}],"daily":true},"city|I hvilket land ligger Macau?":{"pool":"city","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macau","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Macau ... is a special administrative region of China.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Macao","d":"lex.dk","q":"derefter en særlig administrativ region i Kina","ok":true}],"daily":true},"city|I hvilket land ligger Kaliningrad?":{"pool":"city","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaliningrad","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"is the largest city and administrative centre of Kaliningrad Oblast, an exclave of Russia","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Kaliningrad","d":"lex.dk","q":"er administrativt center i den russiske Kaliningradregion","ok":true}],"daily":true},"city|I hvilket land ligger Ceuta?":{"pool":"city","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ceuta","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Ceuta is an autonomous city of Spain on the North African coast.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Ceuta_og_Melilla","d":"lex.dk","q":"Ceuta og Melilla er to spanske enklaver","ok":true}],"daily":true},"city|I hvilket land ligger Honiara?":{"pool":"city","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honiara","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Honiara ... is the capital and largest city of Solomon Islands.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Honiara","d":"lex.dk","q":"Honiara er hovedstad i republikken Salomonøerne","ok":true}],"daily":true},"city|I hvilket land ligger Port Vila?":{"pool":"city","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Port_Vila","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Port Vila ... is the capital of Vanuatu and its largest city.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Port_Vila","d":"lex.dk","q":"Port Vila, hovedstaden i øriget Vanuatu","ok":true}],"daily":true},"city|I hvilket land ligger Naypyidaw?":{"pool":"city","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naypyidaw","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Naypyidaw ... is the capital and third-largest city of Myanmar.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Naypyidaw","d":"lex.dk","q":"Naypyidaw har siden 2005 været Myanmars administrative hoveds