dbog/h%C3%B8ne","d":"ordnet.dk","q":"blind høne finder også korn","ok":true},{"u":"https://da.wikiquote.org/wiki/Danske_ordsprog","d":"da.wikiquote.org","q":"Blind høne kan også finde korn.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kquiz|Hvilket mikroskopisk dyr kan overleve i det ydre rum?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tardigrades_in_space","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Tardigrades have survived exposure to space.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nasa.gov/podcasts/houston-we-have-a-podcast/water-bears-in-space/","d":"nasa.gov","q":"they can actually survive in the vacuum of outer space.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr kan vende sin mave udad for at fordøje mad?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In more advanced species of starfish, the cardial stomach can be everted from the organism's body to engulf and digest food, which is passed to the pyloric stomach.","ok":true},{"u":"https://askdruniverse.wsu.edu/2022/12/01/how-do-starfish-eat/","d":"askdruniverse.wsu.edu","q":"they basically spit out their stomach through their mouth. Then the stomach wraps around the food and digests the food outside of its body.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kquiz|Hvilket hval kan holde vejret i op til 90 minutter under vand?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.nhm.ac.uk/discover/quick-questions/how-long-can-whales-hold-their-breath.html","d":"nhm.ac.uk","q":"A sperm whale can spend around 90 minutes hunting underwater before it has to come back to the surface to breathe.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.victoriawhalewatching.com/how-long-can-a-whale-hold-its-breath/","d":"victoriawhalewatching.com","q":"They are able to hold their breath for an impressive 90 minutes.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr kan sprøjte blod ud af øjnene for at forsvare sig?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horned_lizard","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"squirt an aimed stream of blood from the corners of the eyes for a distance up to 5 ft (1.5 m).","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.discoverwildlife.com/animal-facts/reptiles/horned-lizard","d":"discoverwildlife.com","q":"from their eyes, to a distance of up to nine times their body length.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kquiz|Hvilket pattedyr har hornede tyggeplader i stedet for tænder som voksen?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Platypus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Adult platypuses lack teeth and instead have heavily keratinised food-grinding pads.","ok":true},{"u":"https://australian.museum/learn/animals/mammals/platypus/","d":"australian.museum","q":"its functional teeth have been replaced by horny pads","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kquiz|Hvilket dyr har den kraftigste bid af alle nulevende dyr?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saltwater_crocodile","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Saltwater crocodiles have the strongest bite of any living animal.","ok":true},{"u":"https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0031781","d":"journals.plos.org","q":"Our datum for one Crocodylus porosus individual, 16,414 N [3,689 lbs] represents the highest bite force measured in any animal.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kquiz|Hvilket lille blæksprutte er blandt verdens giftigste dyr?":{"pool":"kquiz","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue-ringed_octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The blue-ringed octopus, despite its small size, carries enough venom to kill over 20 adult humans within minutes.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.diversalertnetwork.org/health/hazardous-marine-life/blue-ringed-octopus","d":"diversalertnetwork.org","q":"Theoretically, a little over one-half milligram of this venom—the amount that can be placed on the head of a pin—is enough to kill an adult human.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En skorpion lyser op under ultraviolet lys.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Fluorescerende stoffer i eksoskelettet gør skorpionen synlig under UV-lys.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scorpion","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The exoskeleton contains fluorescent chemicals and glows under ultraviolet light.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/scorpion","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"Scorpions can easily be seen at night with an ultraviolet light due to a fluorescent material found in their hard outer covering, which gives them a \"glow-in-the-dark\" ap","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En panda har en 'ekstra tommelfinger' på forpoten, der i virkeligheden er en forlænget håndrodsknogle.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Den tommelfinger-lignende digit er et modificeret sesamoidben, der hjælper pandaen med at holde bambus.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giant_panda","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The giant panda's paw has a digit similar to a thumb and five fingers; the thumb-like digit is actually a modified sesamoid bone that helps it to hold bamboo while eating","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/giant-panda","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"it hungrily plucks the stalks with elongated wrist bones that function rather like thumbs.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En giraf har præcis syv halsvirvler – ligesom mennesket.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Giraffens lange hals skyldes forlængede halsvirvler, ikke flere virvler.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giraffe","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The long neck results from a disproportionate lengthening of the cervical vertebrae, not from the addition of more vertebrae.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/giraffe","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"How many bones are there in a giraffe's neck? Just like humans, giraffes have seven neck vertebrae.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En stjernefisk har ingen central hjerne.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"I stedet for en central hjerne har den et nervesystem med en nerve-ring om munden og radiale nerver i armene.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starfish","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Traditionally, starfish were thought to lack a centralized brain.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.visitsealife.com/blackpool/information/latest-news/7-amazing-starfish-facts/","d":"visitsealife.com","q":"They have a surprisingly unusual anatomy, with no brain or blood, yet are able to digest food outside their body.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En blækspruttes blod er blåt, fordi det indeholder kobber i stedet for jern.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Blodet indeholder kobberbaseret hæmocyanin, der giver en blå farve, når det binder ilt.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The haemocyanin is dissolved in the blood plasma instead of carried within blood cells and gives the blood a bluish colour.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.newworldencyclopedia.org/entry/Octopus","d":"newworldencyclopedia.org","q":"Octopus blood contains the copper-rich protein hemocyanin for transporting oxygen.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En flodhests hud udskiller en rødlig væske, der virker som solcreme og hæmmer bakterier.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Væsken, kaldet 'blodsved', er hverken blod eller sved, men indeholder pigmenter, der absorberer UV-lys og hæmmer bakterievækst.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hippopotamus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Their skin secretes a natural, red-coloured sunscreen substance that is sometimes referred to as \"blood sweat\" but is neither blood nor sweat.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/hippo","d":"animals.sandiegozoo.org","q":"They don’t have true sweat glands; instead, hippos secrete a thick, red substance from their pores known as \"blood sweat,\" as it looks like they are sweating blood.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ktf|{\"s\":\"En frø bruger sine øjne til at skubbe maden ned i svælget, når den sluger.\",\"t\":true,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Frøen blinker, så øjeæblerne trykkes ned over munden og hjælper med at skubbe føden ned.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"ktf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frog","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Frogs generally seize and ingest food by protruding their adhesive tongue and then swallow the item whole, often using their eyeballs and extraocular muscles to help push","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.newworldencyclopedia.org/entry/Frog","d":"newworldencyclopedia.org","q":"squash their eyeballs down to swallow their meal.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Kviksølv\",\"Jern\",\"Kobber\",\"Guld\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":12,\"e\":\"Kviksølv er det eneste metal, der er flydende ved stuetemperatur – de andre er faste metaller.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercury_(element)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"mercury is the only metallic element that is known to be liquid at standard temperature and pressure.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/kviks%C3%B8lv","d":"lex.dk","q":"Det er et sølvglinsende, flydende metal.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Brom\",\"Klor\",\"Fluor\",\"Iod\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Brom er det eneste halogen, der er flydende ved stuetemperatur – de andre er gas eller fast stof.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bromine","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"At standard conditions for temperature and pressure it is a liquid; the only other element that is liquid is mercury.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/brom","d":"lex.dk","q":"Brom, der er et ikke-metal, er en mørk rødbrun væske","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Radon\",\"Helium\",\"Neon\",\"Argon\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":13,\"e\":\"Radon er en radioaktiv ædelgas – de andre er stabile ædelgasser.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radon","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Radon is a radioactive noble gas and is colorless and odorless.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/radon","d":"lex.dk","q":"Radon, der er en af ædelgasserne, blev opdaget i 1900 af F.E. Dorn som en radioaktiv gas, der strømmer ud af radium og radiumforbindelser.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Pluto\",\"Jupiter\",\"Saturn\",\"Venus\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":12,\"e\":\"Pluto er en dværgplanet – de andre er planeter.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pluto","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Pluto is a dwarf planet in the Kuiper belt","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/Pluto","d":"lex.dk","q":"Pluto er en dværgplanet i Solsystemet.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jupiter","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Jupiter is the fifth planet from the Sun, and the largest in the Solar System.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Månen\",\"Io\",\"Europa\",\"Ganymedes\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":12,\"e\":\"Månen kredser om Jorden – de andre kredser om Jupiter.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://snl.no/M%C3%A5nen","d":"snl.no","q":"Månen er Jordens eneste naturlige satellitt.","ok":true},{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Galilean_moons","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Galilean moons are the four largest moons of Jupiter.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Diamant\",\"Guld\",\"Sølv\",\"Kobber\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":12,\"e\":\"Diamant er en form af kulstof – de andre er metaller.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diamond","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Diamond is a mineral form of the element carbon","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/diamant","d":"lex.dk","q":"Diamant er et gennemsigtigt til uigennemsigtigt mineral af carbon med en meget høj lysbrydning; formlen angives som C.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kodd|{\"o\":[\"Svovl\",\"Jern\",\"Kobber\",\"Zink\"],\"a\":0,\"age\":12,\"e\":\"Svovl er et ikke-metal – de andre er metaller.\",\"niveau\":\"ekspert\"}":{"pool":"kodd","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sulfur","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is abundant, multivalent and nonmetallic.","ok":true},{"u":"https://lex.dk/svovl","d":"lex.dk","q":"Grundstoffet er et citrongult ikke-metal, som forholdsvis let kan bringes til at smelte (smp. 119 °C) under dannelse af en gul væske.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kest|Hvor mange øjne har en bie?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.fao.org/4/t0104e/t0104e06.htm","d":"fao.org","q":"the head has five eyes","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbka.org.uk/fascinating-facts-about-honey-bees","d":"bbka.org.uk","q":"the honey bee has five eyes","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kest|Hvor mange tænder har en narhval?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.fisheries.noaa.gov/species/narwhal","d":"fisheries.noaa.gov","q":"narwhals have two teeth in the upper jaw","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/narwhal","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"these legendary animals have two teeth","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kest|Hvor mange lande samarbejder om Den Internationale Rumstation (ISS)?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.nasa.gov/international-space-station/space-station-facts-and-figures/","d":"nasa.gov","q":"an international partnership of five space agencies from 15 countries operates the international space station","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.planetary.org/space-missions/international-space-station","d":"planetary.org","q":"the space station operates thanks to the cooperation of 15 different nations","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kest|Hvor mange tænder har en voksen elefant i munden ad gangen?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elephant","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"elephants usually have 26 teeth","ok":true},{"u":"https://a-z-animals.com/animals/elephant/elephant-facts/do-elephants-have-teeth/","d":"a-z-animals.com","q":"in total both african and asian elephants have 26 teeth at any given time","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kest|Hvor mange tænder har en gris i alt?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pig","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the dental formula of adult pigs is 3 1 4 3 3 1 4 3 giving a total of 44 teeth","ok":true},{"u":"https://catalogimages.wiley.com/images/db/pdf/9781119583899.excerpt.pdf","d":"catalogimages.wiley.com","q":"the dentition consists of 44 permanent teeth","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kest|Hvor mange kilometer er Jordens omkreds ved ækvator (cirka)?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equator","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"about 21,639 nautical miles (40,075 kilometres; 24,902 miles) in circumference","ok":true},{"u":"https://education.nationalgeographic.org/resource/equator/","d":"education.nationalgeographic.org","q":"the distance around earth at the equator its circumference is 40 075 kilometers","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kest|Hvor mange tænder har en ko i alt?":{"pool":"kest","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.fsis.usda.gov/sites/default/files/media_file/2021-05/Using_Dentition-to-Age-Cattle.pdf","d":"fsis.usda.gov","q":"32 permanent teeth","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nadis.org.uk/disease-a-z/cattle/mouth-problems-in-cattle/","d":"nadis.org.uk","q":"32 permanent teeth","ok":true}],"daily":true},"kriddle|En far og en søn er i en bilulykke. Faren dør. Sønnen kommer på hospitalet, og lægen siger: 'Jeg kan ikke operere ham – han er min søn.' Hvordan kan det være?":{"pool":"kriddle","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"kriddle|En mand ser på et billede og siger: 'Brødre og søstre har jeg ingen, men manden på billedet er min fars søn.' Hvem er på billedet?":{"pool":"kriddle","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"kriddle|Hvad har fire ben om morgenen, to om middagen og tre om aftenen?":{"pool":"kriddle","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"kriddle|Hvad er det, som kan løbe, men aldrig går; har en mund, men aldrig taler; har en seng, men sover aldrig?":{"pool":"kriddle","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"kriddle|Hvad kan man holde i højre hånd, men aldrig i venstre?":{"pool":"kriddle","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"kriddle|Hvad vejer mere: et kilo jern eller et kilo fjer?":{"pool":"kriddle","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"ftl_bil|Skal nærlys (kort lys) være tændt ved kørsel uden for lygtetændingstiden?":{"pool":"ftl_bil","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"lys (kort lys) anvendes på motordrevne køretøjer.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sikkertrafik.dk/rad-og-viden/bil/bilens-udstyr/lys-det-siger-loven/","d":"sikkertrafik.dk","q":"Du skal køre med nærlys eller kørelys foran på din bil hele døgnet.","ok":true},{"u":"https://politi.dk/rigspolitiet/nyhedsliste/husk-lyset/2018/10/05","d":"politi.dk","q":"Fra solopgang til solnedgang (uden for lygtetændingstiden) skal man som bilist anvende nærlys, dog kan tågelys i kombination med positionslys eller særligt kørelys også a","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_bil|Må du overhale eller forbikøre et andet køretøj, når du nærmer dig et fodgængerfelt, hvis det andet køretøj hindrer fuldt udsyn over fodgængerfeltet?":{"pool":"ftl_bil","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"Kørende, som nærmer sig et fodgængerfelt, må ikke foretage overhaling eller forbikørsel af et andet køretøj, såfremt dette køretøj hindrer fuldt udsyn over fodgængerfelte","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sikkertrafik.dk/rad-og-viden/bil/korekort/klip-i-korekortet/hvad-far-du-klip-for/","d":"sikkertrafik.dk","q":"Når du nærmer dig et fodgængerfelt, må du ikke overhale eller køre forbi et andet køretøj, hvis det forhindrer fuldt udsyn over fodgængerfeltet","ok":true},{"u":"https://fdm.dk/guides/regler/det-her-giver-klip-koerekortet","d":"fdm.dk","q":"Overhaler ved fodgængerfelt","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_cykel|Hvad skal en cyklist have under kørslen?":{"pool":"ftl_cykel","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"Cyklist skal under kørslen have begge fødder på \npedalerne og mindst den ene hånd på styret.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.jurabibliotek.dk/faerdselsloven/paragraf/49","d":"jurabibliotek.dk","q":"Cyklist skal under kørslen have begge fødder på pedalerne og mindst den ene hånd på styret.","ok":true},{"u":"https://sikkertrafik.dk/rad-og-viden/cykel/faerdselsregler/hvad-siger-loven","d":"sikkertrafik.dk","q":"Du skal have begge fødder på pedalerne og mindst én hånd på styret","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_cykel|Skal en cykel være låst, når den henstilles?":{"pool":"ftl_cykel","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"Cykel, der henstilles, skal holdes aflåst, medmin-\ndre henstillingen er ganske kortvarig.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.jurabibliotek.dk/faerdselsloven/paragraf/49","d":"jurabibliotek.dk","q":"Cykel, der henstilles, skal holdes aflåst, medmindre henstillingen er ganske kortvarig.","ok":true},{"u":"https://frederiksborgamtsavis.sn.dk/article/6018370/danmark/ulaast-cykel-kan-udloese-boede","d":"frederiksborgamtsavis.sn.dk","q":"Cykel, der henstilles, skal holdes aflåst, medmindre henstillingen er ganske kortvarig.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_fod|En gående går på kørebanen. Hvornår må vedkommende gå i den modsatte side af den side, der normalt gælder?":{"pool":"ftl_fod","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"Den gående kan dog gå i den modsatte side, hvis den pågældende ellers ville blive udsat for fare, eller hvis særlige omstændigheder tilsiger det.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.jurabibliotek.dk/faerdselsloven/paragraf/10","d":"jurabibliotek.dk","q":"Den gående kan dog gå i den modsatte side, hvis den pågældende ellers ville blive udsat for fare, eller hvis særlige omstændigheder tilsiger det.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.denoffentlige.dk/lovgivning/der-er-flere-end-du-tror-kender-du-faerdselsreglerne-for-fodgaengere","d":"denoffentlige.dk","q":"Stk. 2. Gående, som benytter kørebanen, skal gå yderst i venstre side i færdselsretningen eller, hvis vedkommende trækker cykel eller knallert, yderst i højre side. Den g","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_fod|En bilist svinger i et vejkryds. Hvad gælder over for gående, der passerer den kørebane, bilisten skal benytte under den fortsatte kørsel?":{"pool":"ftl_fod","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"Ved svingning i vejkryds må kørende ikke være til fare for gående, der passerer den kørebane, som skal benyttes under den fortsatte kørsel.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.jurabibliotek.dk/faerdselsloven/paragraf/27","d":"jurabibliotek.dk","q":"Ved svingning i vejkryds må kørende ikke være til fare for gående, der passerer den kørebane, som skal benyttes under den fortsatte kørsel.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.teoriklar.dk/546/vigepligt","d":"teoriklar.dk","q":"Ved svingning i kryds må du ikke være til fare for gående, der passerer den vej, du svinger ind på. Det samme gælder, når du kører over eller bort fra kørebanen uden for ","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_fod|En bilist skal så vidt muligt undgå at standse køretøjet...":{"pool":"ftl_fod","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"Kørende skal så vidt muligt undgå, at køretøjet standses i fodgængerfeltet.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.jurabibliotek.dk/faerdselsloven/paragraf/27","d":"jurabibliotek.dk","q":"Kørende skal så vidt muligt undgå, at køretøjet standses i fodgængerfeltet.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.teoriklar.dk/546/vigepligt","d":"teoriklar.dk","q":"Undgå så vidt muligt at standse bilen i et fodgængerfelt.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_fod|En bilist har svinget i et kryds og skal passere et signalreguleret fodgængerfelt. Hvad skal bilisten gøre?":{"pool":"ftl_fod","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"Er et sådant fodgængerfelt beliggende ved vejkryds, skal den kørende, som efter svingning i krydset skal passere feltet, køre med passende lav hastighed og om nødvendigt ","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.jurabibliotek.dk/faerdselsloven/paragraf/27","d":"jurabibliotek.dk","q":"Er et sådant fodgængerfelt beliggende ved vejkryds, skal den kørende, som efter svingning i krydset skal passere feltet, køre med passende lav hastighed og om nødvendigt ","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.teoriklar.dk/546/vigepligt","d":"teoriklar.dk","q":"Efter et sving skal du køre med passende lav hastighed og om nødvendigt standse for gående, der befinder sig i feltet eller er på vej ud i det.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_andre|Hvordan skal en tohjulet knallert passere et fortov eller en gangsti?":{"pool":"ftl_andre","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"Tohjulet knallert skal trækkes over fortov eller gangsti. Knallert kan dog køres over fortov eller gangsti, når overkørslen sker fra en sidevej.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sikkertrafik.dk/knallert/d-placering-orientering-og-tegngivning/","d":"sikkertrafik.dk","q":"Hvis du krydser et fortov eller gangsti, skal du trække knallerten. Du må dog gerne køre over fortov eller gangsti, hvis du kører ud fra en sidevej.","ok":true},{"u":"https://politi.dk/-/media/mediefiler/landsdaekkende-dokumenter/service-og-tilladelser/boeder/bed-om-et-retsmoede/vejledende-boedetakster-ved-overtraedelse-af-faerdselsloven.pdf","d":"politi.dk","q":"FL § 51, stk. 3 Kørsel over fortov eller gangsti","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_andre|Må en knallertkører under kørslen holde fast i et andet køretøj for at blive trukket med?":{"pool":"ftl_andre","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"Knallertkører må ikke under kørslen holde fast i andet køretøj eller letbanekøretøj eller i fører af eller passager på andet køretøj eller letbanekøretøj.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sikkertrafik.dk/knallert/g-taet-trafik/","d":"sikkertrafik.dk","q":"Du må heller ikke trække en af dine kammerater, som kører på cykel, skateboard, rulleskøjter eller andet - og du må ikke selv blive trukket af en anden.","ok":true},{"u":"https://politi.dk/-/media/mediefiler/landsdaekkende-dokumenter/service-og-tilladelser/boeder/bed-om-et-retsmoede/vejledende-boedetakster-ved-overtraedelse-af-faerdselsloven.pdf","d":"politi.dk","q":"FL § 51, stk. 5 Holdt fast i andet køretøj m.v.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_andre|Må børn under 5 år befordres på en trehjulet knallert?":{"pool":"ftl_andre","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"Passagerer under 5 år må ikke befordres på trehjulet knallert, medmindre passagersiddepladsen er forsynet med sikkerhedssele.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.fstyr.dk/privat/krav-til-koeretoejer/spoergsmaal-og-svar","d":"fstyr.dk","q":"Derudover må passagerer under 5 år ikke befordres på trehjulet knallert, medmindre passagersiddepladsen er forsynet med sikkerhedssele.","ok":true},{"u":"https://politi.dk/-/media/mediefiler/landsdaekkende-dokumenter/service-og-tilladelser/boeder/bed-om-et-retsmoede/vejledende-boedetakster-ved-overtraedelse-af-faerdselsloven.pdf","d":"politi.dk","q":"FL § 51, stk. 7 Befordret passager under 5 år på trehjulet knallert uden sikkerhedssele","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_andre|Hvilket krav stiller færdselsloven til en fører af en tohjulet knallert under kørslen med hensyn til fødder og hænder?":{"pool":"ftl_andre","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"Fører af tohjulet knallert skal under kørslen have begge fødder på pedalerne eller fodhvilerne og mindst den ene hånd på styret.","ok":true},{"u":"https://politi.dk/-/media/mediefiler/landsdaekkende-dokumenter/service-og-tilladelser/boeder/bed-om-et-retsmoede/vejledende-boedetakster-ved-overtraedelse-af-faerdselsloven.pdf","d":"politi.dk","q":"FL § 51, stk. 4 Undladt at have begge fødder på pedalerne/fodhvilerne/ mindst den ene hånd på styret","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sikkertrafik.dk/rad-og-viden/cykel/faerdselsregler-for-cyklister/sadan-cykler-du-lovligt-og-sikkert/","d":"sikkertrafik.dk","q":"Du skal have begge fødder på pedalerne og mindst én hånd på styret","ok":true}],"daily":true},"num|Hvor mange millioner neuroner har en blæksprutte (Octopus vulgaris) cirka i hele kroppen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octopus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"containing over 500 million neurons, around the same as a dog.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/the-mind-of-an-octopus/","d":"scientificamerican.com","q":"A common octopus (Octopus vulgaris) has about 500 million neurons in its body.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"num|Hvor mange tænder har en hvidhaj (Carcharodon carcharias) cirka i munden på én gang?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_white_shark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"A total of around 300 teeth are arranged in rows like a conveyor belt","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/fish/facts/great-white-shark","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"While the animals possess around 300 teeth in total","ok":true}],"daily":true},"num|Hvor mange par hjerter har en regnorm (Lumbricus terrestris) cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earthworm","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In segments seven through eleven, a pair of aortic arches ring the coelom and acts as hearts","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.visualizebiology.com/tools/virtual-earthworm-dissection","d":"visualizebiology.com","q":"five pairs of hearts, called aortic arches, looped round the esophagus in segments 7 to 11","ok":true}],"daily":true},"num|Hvor mange milliarder neuroner har en menneskehjerne cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.livescience.com/29365-human-brain.html","d":"livescience.com","q":"The human brain contains about 86 billion nerve cells (neurons)","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2019/09/190906104058.htm","d":"sciencedaily.com","q":"Humans have approximately 86 billion neurons in the brain","ok":true}],"daily":true},"num|Hvor mange gange slår et menneskehjerte cirka om dagen?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://www.webmd.com/heart/features/amazing-facts-about-heart-health-and-heart-disease_","d":"webmd.com","q":"Every day, your heart beats about 100,000 times","ok":true},{"u":"https://connect.mayoclinic.org/comment/184735","d":"connect.mayoclinic.org","q":"Did you know that the average heart beats 100,000 times a day?","ok":true}],"daily":true},"num|Hvor mange tænder har en voksen hund cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dog","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They also have powerful jaws containing about 42 teeth","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.petmd.com/dog/general-health/5-interesting-facts-about-your-dogs-teeth","d":"petmd.com","q":"Adult dogs have 42 teeth.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"num|Hvor mange tænder har en voksen kat cirka?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Felidae","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"They have 30 teeth with a dental formula","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.petmd.com/cat/care/9-interesting-facts-about-cat-teeth","d":"petmd.com","q":"Adult cats have 30 permanent teeth","ok":true}],"daily":true},"tf|En flodhest sveder blod.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hippopotamus","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Their skin secretes a natural, red-coloured sunscreen substance that is sometimes referred to as 'blood sweat' but is neither blood nor sweat.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/hippopotamus","d":"nationalgeographic.com","q":"This reddish liquid is behind the myth that hippos sweat blood.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"tf|En struds har det største øje blandt alle fugle.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_ostrich","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"their eyes are the largest of any land vertebrate, 50 mm (2.0 in) in diameter","ok":true},{"u":"https://nationalzoo.si.edu/animals/ostrich","d":"nationalzoo.si.edu","q":"Ostriches have big eyes—about 2 inches (5 centimeters) wide, which is the largest of any bird","ok":true}],"daily":true},"tf|En giraf har flere halsvirvler end et menneske.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vertebral_column","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"From top to bottom, there are 7 cervical vertebrae, 12 thoracic vertebrae and 5 lumbar vertebrae.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Giraffa_camelopardalis/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"Giraffe necks contain 7 elongated vertebrae.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"tf|En ko har fire maver.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cattle","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Cattle have one large stomach with four compartments; the rumen, reticulum, omasum, and abomasum.","ok":true},{"u":"https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Bos_taurus/","d":"animaldiversity.org","q":"Cows have a four chambered stomach including a rumen, reticulum, omasum, and abomasum.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"tf|En flagermus er det eneste pattedyr, der kan flyve.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Bats (order Chiroptera) are winged mamma