har|(Svær) Danse ballet i slowmotion":{"pool":"char","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"kmove|4|Gå som en pingvin: hold armene stive, og vrik med hofterne fem skridt frem.":{"pool":"kmove","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"kmove|12|Imiter en ørn, der svæver: stræk armene ud, og drej langsomt rundt, mens du spejder.":{"pool":"kmove","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"kword|12|Nævn fem ord, der starter med bogstavet «K», og som alle kan spises – hvem finder flest?":{"pool":"kword","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"klik|5|Hvem af jer ville mest sandsynligt grine, hvis nogen sagde 'banan' meget alvorligt?":{"pool":"klik","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"klik|12|Hvem af jer ville mest sandsynligt glemme, hvad de skulle sige midt i en præsentation?":{"pool":"klik","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"krather|{\"a\":\"Kunne flyve som en fugl i haven\",\"b\":\"Kunne svømme som en fisk i badekarret\",\"age\":4}":{"pool":"krather","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"krather|{\"a\":\"Kunne læse dyrs tanker, men kun når de drømmer\",\"b\":\"Kunne tale med robotter, men kun på rim\",\"age\":12}":{"pool":"krather","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"kriddle|Hvad har en hals, men ingen mund, og kan holde vand?":{"pool":"kriddle","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"kriddle|Hvad bliver vådt, jo mere det tørrer?":{"pool":"kriddle","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"sm|{\"k\":\"flest\",\"m\":45,\"t\":\"Nævn så mange dyr som muligt, der lever i vand, på 45 sekunder.\",\"r\":\"Den, der nævner flest forskellige dyr, vinder.\"}":{"pool":"sm","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"sm|{\"k\":\"hurtigst\",\"m\":60,\"t\":\"Find tre ting i rummet, der er røde, og bring dem til Stormesteren hurtigst muligt.\",\"r\":\"Første, der har alle tre ting, vinder.\"}":{"pool":"sm","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqdal|Hold en ske med en ært på i udstrakt arm i 20 sekunder uden at tabe den.":{"pool":"sqdal","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqdil|{\"a\":\"Overleve spillet, men miste hukommelsen om alle, du mødte\",\"b\":\"Huske alle, men blive elimineret i næste runde\"}":{"pool":"sqdil","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqwho|Hvem af jer ville mest sandsynligt skjule mad i lommen i dødsspillet? Peg!":{"pool":"sqwho","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"taboo|Måne":{"pool":"taboo","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"taboo|Stjerne":{"pool":"taboo","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"julesange|Hvor mange ord indeholder José Felicianos 'Feliz Navidad' ifølge ham selv?":{"pool":"julesange","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feliz_Navidad_(song)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"19 words to it","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.grammy.com/news/jose-feliciano-50-years-feliz-navidad-new-album-behind-guitar-hitting-big-screen","d":"grammy.com","q":"has 19 words","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julesange|Hvilken julesang blev skrevet i juli 1945 i Hollywood under en hedebølge?":{"pool":"julesange","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Let_It_Snow!_Let_It_Snow!_Let_It_Snow!","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"in July 1945 in Hollywood, California, during a heatwave","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.mentalfloss.com/holidays/christmas/let-it-snow-song-facts","d":"mentalfloss.com","q":"one of the hottest days on record in Southern California in July 1945","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julesange|Hvilken julesang spillede Reginald Fessenden på violin under den første radioudsendelse juleaften 1906?":{"pool":"julesange","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reginald_Fessenden","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Fessenden playing Adolphe Adam's carol O Holy Night on the violin","ok":true},{"u":"https://home.nps.gov/people/reginaldfessenden.htm","d":"home.nps.gov","q":"a violin rendition of “O Holy Night” played by Fessenden","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julesange|Hvilken julesang gav Wham! alle royalties fra til hungersnødshjælp i Etiopien?":{"pool":"julesange","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wham!","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Wham! donated all their royalties from the single to the Ethiopian famine appeal","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/music/2017/dec/14/still-saving-us-from-tears-story-george-michael-last-christmas","d":"theguardian.com","q":"George Michael not only sang on the Band Aid single, but also donated the royalties from Last Christmas to the same cause","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julesange|Hvor gammel var Brenda Lee, da hun indspillede 'Rockin' Around the Christmas Tree' i 1958?":{"pool":"julesange","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rockin%27_Around_the_Christmas_Tree","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Lee recorded the song when she was 13 years old","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.grammy.com/news/brenda-lee-rockin-around-the-christmas-tree-interview-feature","d":"grammy.com","q":"Lee may have been only 13 years-old when she recorded the track","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julesange|Hvilken julesang havde oprindeligt de dystre linjer «It may be your last / Next year we may all be living in the past»?":{"pool":"julesange","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Have_Yourself_a_Merry_Little_Christmas","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It may be your last / Next year we may