wins * actor in a supporting role - Edmund Gwenn","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julefilm|Hvilket filmformat var White Christmas (1954) den første film til at bruge?":{"pool":"julefilm","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/White_Christmas_(film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The film was the first to be shot using Paramount's new VistaVision process, with color by Technicolor","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/holidays/christmas-ideas/g2997/white-christmas-movie-facts/","d":"goodhousekeeping.com","q":"It was the first movie to be filmed in VistaVision.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julefilm|Hvad gjorde filmselskabet for at få Jim Carrey til at holde ud at være Grinch i filmen fra 2000?":{"pool":"julefilm","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/How_the_Grinch_Stole_Christmas_(2000_film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"To help Carrey cope with the grueling makeup process, producer Brian Grazer hired former SEAL Team Six consultant officer Richard Marcinko to train him in methods for \"en","ok":true},{"u":"https://variety.com/2025/film/news/jim-carrey-quit-grinch-makeup-torture-expert-1236607568/","d":"variety.com","q":"Later on I found out that the gentleman that trained me to endure the Grinch also founded SEAL Team Six","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julefilm|Hvem komponerede jazznoderne til A Charlie Brown Christmas (1965)?":{"pool":"julefilm","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Charlie_Brown_Christmas","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The program's soundtrack was similarly unorthodox, featuring a jazz score by pianist Vince Guaraldi.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.npr.org/2022/12/06/1140893271/the-jazzy-charlie-brown-christmas-soundtrack-swings-on-after-57-years","d":"npr.org","q":"The music Guaraldi created for the soundtrack is ambiguous and more complex than most holiday music","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julefilm|Hvem sang «Walking in the Air» i den originale The Snowman fra 1982?":{"pool":"julefilm","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Snowman_(1982_film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The song \"Walking in the Air\" is sung in the film by chorister Peter Auty","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.classicfm.com/discover-music/walking-in-the-air-lyrics-solo/","d":"classicfm.com","q":"Originally sung by St. Paul's Cathedral choirboy Peter Auty at the tender age of 13","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julefilm|Hvor mange skuespillere lægger stemme til den norske udgave af Tre nøtter til Askepott?":{"pool":"julefilm","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://snl.no/Tre_n%C3%B8tter_til_Askepott","d":"snl.no","q":"Den norske versjonen er dubbet av Knut Risan, som står for alle stemmene.","ok":true},{"u":"https://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Knut_Risan","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Han var kongen i \"Reisen til julestjernen\" og ga stemme til hele rollegalleriet i \"Tre nøtter til Askepott\".","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julefilm|Hvorfor fik Donald Trump en cameo i Home Alone 2?":{"pool":"julefilm","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Home_Alone_2:_Lost_in_New_York","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"According to director Chris Columbus, Donald Trump, the owner of the Plaza Hotel at the time, allowed the crew to shoot scenes in the hotel lobby and one of its suites in","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-us-canada-67834817","d":"bbc.com","q":"Director Chris Columbus said Mr Trump insisted on appearing in the film if they used the hotel as a location.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julefilm|Hvilken gyserfilm instruerede manden bag A Christmas Story?":{"pool":"julefilm","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bob_Clark","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In the 1970s and 1980s, he was responsible for some of the most successful films in Canadian film history