ker.":{"pool":"julesjov","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"julesjov|Forklar julen for en, der aldrig har hørt om den – på 20 sekunder.":{"pool":"julesjov","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"julesjov|Fortæl, hvad du ville give i julegave til tre ting på bordet – på 20 sekunder.":{"pool":"julesjov","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"julesjov|Lav en liste med fem ting, der aldrig bør ligge i en julestrømpe – 30 sekunder.":{"pool":"julesjov","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"julesjov|Lav en reklame for grødris som et luksusprodukt – 20 sekunder.":{"pool":"julesjov","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"julesjov|Sig en julehilsen, hvor alle ord starter med samme bogstav – 15 sekunder.":{"pool":"julesjov","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"julesjov|Tæl til ti som en nisse, der er kommet for sent til julemiddagen.":{"pool":"julesjov","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"julesjov|Forklar, hvorfor du har spist al julekonfekten – uden at bruge ordet «sulten».":{"pool":"julesjov","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"julesjov|Nynn en julesang uden ord, og lad bordet gætte den – 20 sekunder.":{"pool":"julesjov","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"julesjov|Tal som en julekalender, der er kommet en dag bagud – 15 sekunder.":{"pool":"julesjov","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[],"daily":true},"julefilm|Hvor meget tjente 'Alene hjemme' verden over i biograferne?":{"pool":"julefilm","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Home_Alone","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It received mixed-to-positive reviews and grossed $476.7 million worldwide, becoming the second-highest-grossing film of 1990 .","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.the-numbers.com/movie/Home-Alone#tab=summary","d":"the-numbers.com","q":"Worldwide Box Office $476,678,838","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julefilm|Hvilken andel af 'Alene hjemme 2's omsætning fik Macaulay Culkin ud over sin gage?":{"pool":"julefilm","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Home_Alone_2:_Lost_in_New_York","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In May 1991, Macaulay Culkin was paid $4.5 million plus 5 percent of the film's gross to appear in the sequel, compared to $110,000 for the original .","ok":true},{"u":"https://collider.com/home-alone-2-macaulay-culkin-salary-revealed","d":"collider.com","q":"I think I own five percent of the net","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julefilm|Hvilken idé fik Universal Studio med, da Jim Carrey skulle se ud som Grinchen?":{"pool":"julefilm","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/How_the_Grinch_Stole_Christmas_(2000_film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"originally, \"they wanted me to paint Jim Carrey green and that was it\" but after leaking a test video of himself in Grinch makeup, the studio agreed to Baker's version in","ok":true},{"u":"https://au.variety.com/2025/film/news/jim-carrey-quit-grinch-makeup-torture-expert-31039","d":"au.variety.com","q":"told the publication that the studio originally offered to just have Carrey painted green as the Grinch","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julefilm|Hvad kostede Grinchen-filen fra 2000 at producere?":{"pool":"julefilm","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/How_the_Grinch_Stole_Christmas_(2000_film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the film received mixed reviews from critics, but was a commercial success, grossing $351 million on a budget of $123 million, becoming the highest-grossing film of 2000 ","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.the-numbers.com/movie/How-the-Grinch-Stole-Christmas-(2000)#tab=summary","d":"the-numbers.com","q":"Production Budget: $1