dia.org","q":"In-game, Carder's unnamed player character interacts with a shadowy dealer named Leshy within a cabin, where they must play a card-centric tabletop game with Leshy as gam","ok":true},{"u":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1092790/Inscryption/?l=english","d":"store.steampowered.com","q":"Inscryption is an inky black card-based odyssey that blends the deckbuilding roguelike, escape-room style puzzles, and psychological horror into a blood-laced smoothie","ok":true}],"daily":true},"gaminghistorie|Hvad solgte Nintendo, da firmaet blev grundlagt i 1889?":{"pool":"gaminghistorie","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nintendo","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The history of Nintendo began when craftsman Fusajiro Yamauchi founded the company in 1889 to produce handmade hanafuda playing cards.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.nintendo.com/us/about/","d":"nintendo.com","q":"We've forged our own path since 1889, when we began making hanafuda playing cards in Kyoto, Japan.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"gaminghistorie|Hvem var den rigtige person, som Super Marios navn kommer fra?":{"pool":"gaminghistorie","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mario","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The character was named after real estate developer Mario Segale.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/technology-46072339","d":"bbc.com","q":"Mario Segale, the man after whom video game hero Super Mario was named, has died aged 84.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"gaminghistorie|Hvorfor skiftede Pac-Man navn, da spillet kom til USA?":{"pool":"gaminghistorie","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pac-Man","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The title was changed to Pac-Man for the North American release due to fears of vandals defacing cabinets by converting the P into an F","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/games/2020/may/22/pac-man-video-game-40-years-old","d":"theguardian.com","q":"It was originally called Puck Man, but the US distributor Midway was worried that the word Puck could easily be modified by mischievous vandals into something ruder. Henc","ok":true}],"daily":true},"gaminghistorie|Hvorfor gemte Warren Robinett sit navn i et hemmeligt rum i spillet Adventure?":{"pool":"gaminghistorie","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adventure_(1980_video_game)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Robinett programmed a secret room within the game that contained his name","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/business-32079749","d":"bbc.com","q":"They had the power to keep my name off the box, but I had the power to put my name on the screen","ok":true}],"daily":true},"gaminghistorie|Hvad gjorde Atari med hundredtusindvis af usolgte spilkassetter i 1983?":{"pool":"gaminghistorie","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/E.T._the_Extra-Terrestrial_(video_game)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"unsold cartridges of E.T. were secretly buried in a landfill in Alamogordo, New Mexico, and covered with a layer of concrete.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.com/news/technology-27187609","d":"bbc.com","q":"But a three-hour dig at a landfill site turned up many Atari cartridges, including copies of the game ET: The Extra Terrestrial.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"gaminghistorie|Hvad var PlayStation oprindeligt tiltænkt at være?":{"pool":"gaminghistorie","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-20","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PlayStation_(console)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Sony began developing the PlayStation after a failed venture with Nintendo to create a CD-ROM peripheral for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System in the early 1990s.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/games/2024/dec/03/playstation-at-30-the-console-that-made-video-games-cool","d":"theguardian.com","q":"when Sony announced the PlayStation at the giant 19