"wikipedia.org","q":"This award was unique, consisting of one normal-sized, plus seven miniature Oscar statuettes.","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/featured-photo/walt-disney-and-the-snow-white-oscars","d":"d23.com","q":"a truly special “special” award consisting of one full-size Oscar along with seven “dwarf” statuettes.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvilken Disney-film var den sidste, Walt Disney personligt overvågede før sin død?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1967_in_film","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Walt Disney Studios released The Jungle Book, the final animated feature film to be produced by Walt Disney himself, who died before it reached cinemas.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.commonsensemedia.org/movie-reviews/the-jungle-book-1967","d":"commonsensemedia.org","q":"THE JUNGLE BOOK is Disney's 17th animated feature and the last film supervised by Walt himself.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvilken Mickey Mouse-tegnefilm var den første med synkroniseret lyd?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portal:Disney/Selected_article/1","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It was also the first Disney cartoon to feature synchronized sound.","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/a-to-z/steamboat-willie-film","d":"d23.com","q":"The first Mickey Mouse cartoon released, and the first cartoon with synchronized sound.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvornår åbnede Disneyland i Anaheim?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disneyland","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"opening on July 17, 1955.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/july-17/disneyland-opens","d":"history.com","q":"special invitations were sent out for the opening of Disneyland on July 17.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvad var Mickey Mouses oprindelige navn, før Walt Disneys kone Lillian fik ham til at ændre det?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mickey_Mouse","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"\"Mortimer Mouse\" had been Disney's original name for the character before his wife, Lillian, convinced him to change it.","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/a-to-z/mickey-mouse","d":"d23.com","q":"According to legend, Walt came up with the name Mortimer for his new mouse character, but his wife, Lillian, thought the name was too pretentious and suggested Mickey ins","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvad hed Pluto, før han fik sit nuværende navn?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pluto_(Disney)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"he was portrayed as Minnie's dog, and was named \"Rover\".","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/10-things-you-didnt-know-about-walt-disneys-pluto","d":"d23.com","q":"After The Chain Gang, Pluto popped up in his rightful role as household pet in The Picnic (1930)—but he was named Rover and belonged not to Mickey but to Minnie.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvad er Donald Ducks fulde navn?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Donald_Duck","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"**Donald Fauntleroy Duck** is a cartoon character created by Walt Disney and Dick Lundy.","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/a-to-z/donald-duck","d":"d23.com","q":"His middle name, shown in a wartime cartoon, was Fauntleroy.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvad hed Goofy, da han debuterede i 1932?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goofy","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Goofy debuted in animated cartoons, starting in 1932 with Mickey's Revue as Dippy Dawg","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/a-to-z/goofy","d":"d23.com","q":"This new character was first given a name, Dippy Dawg, in the newspaper comic strips.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvilket skuespillernavn skrev Walt Disney på en seddel blandt sine sidste noter i sit kontor?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://www.cbr.com/tv-legends-revealed-were-disneys-last-written-words-kurt-russell","d":"cbr.com","q":"he did write \"Kurt Russell\" (well, actually, he wrote \"Kirt Russell,\" but I think you get the idea)","ok":true},{"u":"https://mouseplanet.com/9734/Walts_Last_Words_NOT_Kurt_Russell","d":"mouseplanet.com","q":"Walt used his famous red grease pencil to make the following notes","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvad står forkortelsen EPCOT for?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Epcot","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"EPCOT (an acronym for its original concept, the Experimental Prototype Community of Tomorrow)","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/a-to-z/epcot","d":"d23.com","q":"Acronym coined by Walt Disney in 1966 meaning Experimental Prototype Community of Tomorrow.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvor mange konkurrencedygtige Oscar-statuetter vandt Walt Disney i sin karriere?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walt_Disney","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"holds the record for most Academy Awards won (22)","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.screenrant.com/oscars-walt-disney-most-wins-record","d":"screenrant.com","q":"Walt Disney holds the record for most Academy Awards in history, winning 22 competitive Academy Awards","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvorfor kaldte Walt Disney sine bedste animatorer for «de ni gamle mænd»?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disney%27s_Nine_Old_Men","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Disney was jokingly referring to the then-famous 1936 bestselling book The Nine Old Men written by Robert S. Allen and Drew Pearson about the nine justices of the Supreme","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/a-to-z/nine-old-men","d":"d23.com","q":"Walt called his key animators in the 1950s his Nine Old Men, after Franklin D. Roosevelt’s Nine Old Men on the Supreme Court.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvilken Disney-tegnefilm var den første i farver?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1932_in_animation","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Walt Disney releases the studio's first animated short in color: Flowers and Trees.","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/a-to-z/color","d":"d23.com","q":"The first Disney cartoon made in color was Flowers and Trees (1932).","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvornår døde Walt Disney?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walt_Disney","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"December 15, 1966","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/disney-history","d":"d23.com","q":"Walt Disney died December 15, 1966.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvad var Walt Disneys mellemnavn?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walt_Disney","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Walter Elias Disney was born on December 5, 1901","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/this-day/walt-disney-founds-wed-enterprises","d":"d23.com","q":"WED Enterprises derived its name from Walt’s initials—Walter Elias Disney.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"disney|Hvilken virkelig person er Buzz Lightyear fra Toy Story opkaldt efter?":{"pool":"disney","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buzz_Lightyear","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Buzz Lightyear was named in honor of Apollo 11 astronaut Buzz Aldrin, the second person to walk on the Moon.","ok":true},{"u":"https://d23.com/story-behind-toy-story","d":"d23.com","q":"It’s no coincidence that Buzz (original name: Tempus from Morph) was named for Buzz Aldrin, the NASA astronaut who piloted Apollo, the first manned craft to land on the m","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"go\",\"t\":\"Go (weiqi)\",\"origin\":\"Kina\",\"tradition\":[\"Go er et abstrakt strategispil for to spillere, hvor målet er at indhegne mere territorium end modstanderen.\",\"Spillet blev opfundet i Kina for mere end 2500 år siden og anses for at være det ældste brætspil, der stadig spilles i dag.\",\"Det standardbræt består af et gitter på 19×19 linjer med 361 skæringspunkter.\",\"Brikkerne kaldes sten og placeres på skæringspunkterne; først når de er omringet, fjernes de.\",\"Go blev regnet som en af de fire grundlæggende kunstarter for de dannede kinesiske lærde i antikken.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere skiftes til at placere en sten på brættet; den, der til sidst har indhegnet mest territorium, vinder runden og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Go_(game)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Go, weiqi, or baduk is an abstract strategy board game for two players in which the aim is to fence off more territory than the opponent.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Go_(game)","d":"web.archive.org","q":"The game was invented in China more than 2,500 years ago and is believed to be the oldest board game continuously played to the present day.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"mahjong\",\"t\":\"Mahjong\",\"origin\":\"Kina\",\"tradition\":[\"Mahjong er et flisebaseret spil for to til fire spillere.\",\"Spillet blev udviklet i Kina i 1800-tallet og har siden begyndelsen af 1900-tallet spredt sig over hele verden.\",\"Et typisk sæt består af 144 fliser baseret på kinesiske tegn og symboler.\",\"Mahjong ligner det vestlige kortspil rummy og er et spil med både dygtighed, strategi og held.\",\"Fliserne kaldes ofte for «små spurve» i det sydlige Kina.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: Appen blander 144 fliser; spillerne trækker og kasserer fliser i tur og forsøger at danne fire sæt og et par. Første spiller med en gyldig hånd vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahjong","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Mahjong is a tile-based game for two to four players.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahjong","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Mahjong was developed in the 19th century in China and has spread throughout the world since the early 20th century.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"xiangqi\",\"t\":\"Xiangqi (kinesisk skak)\",\"origin\":\"Kina\",\"tradition\":[\"Xiangqi er et strategispil for to spillere, også kendt som kinesisk skak.\",\"Spillet spilles på et bræt med ni linjer på bredden og ti på længden.\",\"Hver spiller styrer en hær på 16 brikker.\",\"En særlig regel forbyder de to generaler at stå direkte over for hinanden.\",\"Brikkerne placeres på skæringspunkterne af brættets linjer, ikke i felterne.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere skiftes til at flytte brikker; målet er at sætte modstanderens general skakmat. Første spiller, der gør det, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xiangqi","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Xiangqi is played on a board nine lines wide and ten lines long.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xiangqi","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Each player controls an army of 16 pieces.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"shogi\",\"t\":\"Shogi (japansk skak)\",\"origin\":\"Japan\",\"tradition\":[\"Shogi er et abstrakt strategispil for to spillere og er et af de mest populære brætspil i Japan.\",\"En særlig egenskab ved shogi er, at man beholder modstanderens erobrede brikker og kan sætte dem tilbage på brættet senere.\",\"Shogi var det første historiske skaklignende spil med denne mekanik.\",\"Shogi i sin nuværende form blev spillet allerede i 1400-tallet.\",\"Brættet har 9×9 felter, og hver spiller har 20 brikker.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere skiftes til at flytte brikker eller droppe erobrede brikker tilbage; den, der først sætter modstanderens konge skakmat, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shogi","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Shogi was the earliest historical chess-like game with this game mechanic.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shogi","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Shogi in its present form was played as early as the 15th century","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"hanafuda\",\"t\":\"Hanafuda (blomsterkort)\",\"origin\":\"Japan\",\"tradition\":[\"Hanafuda er en type japanske spillekort.\",\"Der er 48 kort i alt, fordelt på tolv kulører, der repræsenterer årets måneder.\",\"Hvert kulør har fire kort.\",\"Spillekort blev introduceret i Japan af portugiserne i midten af 1500-tallet.\",\"Nintendo blev grundlagt i 1889 for at producere håndlavede hanafuda-kort.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: Appen blander 48 kort; spillerne danner kombinationer af kort og scorer point. Første spiller, der når målet, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanafuda","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"There are 48 cards total, divided into twelve suits, representing months of the year.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanafuda","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Playing cards were introduced to Japan by the Portuguese in the mid-16th century.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"pachisi\",\"t\":\"Pachisi\",\"origin\":\"Indien\",\"tradition\":[\"Pachisi er et kryds-og-cirkel-brætspil, der stammer fra det gamle Indien.\",\"Spillet spilles på et bræt formet som et symmetrisk kors.\",\"En spiller flytter sine brikker rundt om brættet efter et kast med seks eller syv kaurisnegle.\",\"Spillet omtales i det gamle indiske epos Mahabharata under navnet Pasha.\",\"Navnet kommer fra det hindi ord paccīs, der betyder femogtyve.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To til fire spillere kaster kaurisnegle og flytter brikker rundt om korsbrættet; det hold, der først får alle brikker i mål, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pachisi","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is played on a board shaped like a symmetrical cross.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pachisi","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Pachisi is a cross and circle board game that originated in Ancient India.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"chaturanga\",\"t\":\"Chaturanga\",\"origin\":\"Indien\",\"tradition\":[\"Chaturanga er et gammelt indisk strategispil, der er kendt fra Indien fra omkring 600-tallet.\",\"Spillet anses for at være fælles forfader til skak, xiangqi, janggi, shogi, sittuyin, makruk og moderne indisk skak.\",\"Navnet kommer fra et slagordensbegreb i det indiske epos Mahabharata og betyder «fire arme».\",\"De fire arme er elefantry, stridsvognsrytteri, kavaleri og infanteri.\",\"Spillet spilles på et 8×8 ufelteret bræt kaldet ashtapada.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere skiftes til at flytte brikker; målet er at sætte modstanderens konge skakmat. Første spiller, der gør det, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chaturanga","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is first known from India around the seventh century CE.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chaturanga","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Chaturanga is an ancient Indian strategy board game.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"oware\",\"t\":\"Oware\",\"origin\":\"Ghana (Vestafrika)\",\"tradition\":[\"Oware er et abstrakt strategispil fra mankala-familien.\",\"Spillets oprindelse er usikker, men det antages at stamme fra ashanti-folket.\",\"Oware er måske det mest udbredte spil i mankala-familien.\",\"Spillet spilles med 48 frø og et bræt med to rækker af seks huller.\",\"Navnet betyder «han/hun gifter sig» på akan-sproget.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere sår frø i huller og fanger modstanderens frø; den, der først fanger 25 frø, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oware","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Oware is an abstract strategy game among the mancala family of board games","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oware","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Its origin is uncertain, but it is widely believed to be of Ashanti origin.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"fanorona\",\"t\":\"Fanorona\",\"origin\":\"Madagaskar\",\"tradition\":[\"Fanorona er et strategispil for to spillere, der er hjemmehørende på Madagaskar.\",\"Det mest populære bræt er Fanoron-Sivy med 9×5 felter.\",\"Hver spiller har 22 brikker, der placeres på alle punkter undtagen midten.\",\"Målet er at fange alle modstanderens brikker.\",\"En legende fortæller, at kong Ralambo valgte sin efterfølger ud fra, hvem der nåede hjem først.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere flytter brikker og fanger modstanderens brikker ved at nærme sig eller trække sig tilbage; den, der fanger alle modstanderens brikker, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fanorona","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The game is indigenous to Madagascar.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fanorona","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Fanoron-Sivy is played on a 9×5 board—Sivy being the most popular.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"royalgameofur\",\"t\":\"Kongespillet fra Ur\",\"origin\":\"Mesopotamien\",\"tradition\":[\"Kongespillet fra Ur er et strategispil for to spillere fra det gamle Mesopotamien.\",\"Spillet blev spillet i den tidlige tredje årtusinde f.Kr.\",\"Et bræt fra British Museum er dateret til ca. 2600–2400 f.Kr.\",\"Målet er at flytte alle syv brikker langs banen og ud af brættet før modstanderen.\",\"Spillet kombinerer strategi og held fra kast med fire tetraeder-terninger.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere kaster terninger og flytter brikker langs banen; den, der først får alle brikker ud, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Royal_Game_of_Ur","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The Royal Game of Ur is a two-player strategy race board game of the tables family that was first played in ancient Mesopotamia during the early third millennium BC.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Royal_Game_of_Ur","d":"web.archive.org","q":"The object of the game is for a player to move all seven of their pieces along the course and off the board before their opponent.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"makruk\",\"t\":\"Makruk (thailandsk skak)\",\"origin\":\"Thailand\",\"tradition\":[\"Makruk er et strategispil, der stammer fra det 600-tals indiske spil chaturanga.\",\"Spillet er en del af familien af skakvarianter.\",\"Brikkerne har thailandske navne som khun (herre) og met (frø).\",\"Bønderne er traditionelt lavet af kaurisnegle.\",\"Spillet har særlige tælleregler, når ingen har bønder tilbage.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere skiftes til at flytte brikker; målet er at sætte modstanderens konge skakmat. Første spiller, der gør det, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Makruk","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is part of the family of chess variants.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Makruk","d":"web.archive.org","q":"The design of the makruk pieces is distinctly different from Western chess pieces.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"janggi\",\"t\":\"Janggi (koreansk skak)\",\"origin\":\"Korea\",\"tradition\":[\"Janggi er et strategispil, der er populært på den koreanske halvø.\",\"Spillet er afledt af xiangqi (kinesisk skak).\",\"Brættet har 9×10 linjer, men ingen «flod» i midten.\",\"Brikkerne er ottekantede skiver mærket med hanja-tegn.\",\"Generalerne repræsenterer de rivaliserende stater Han og Chu.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere skiftes til at flytte brikker; målet er at sætte modstanderens general skakmat. Første spiller, der gør det, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Janggi","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The game was derived from xiangqi (Chinese chess)","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Janggi","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Janggi is played on a board nine lines wide by ten lines long.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"shatranj\",\"t\":\"Shatranj\",\"origin\":\"Persien\",\"tradition\":[\"Shatranj er en gammel form for skak, der blev spillet i det sassanidiske rige.\",\"Spillets oprindelse ligger i det indiske spil chaturanga.\",\"Moderne skak udviklede sig gradvist fra shatranj.\",\"Perserne indførte ideen om at varsle, at kongen var under angreb (skak).\",\"Spillet spredtes til Europa via det muslimske Spanien og Sicilien i 900-tallet.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere skiftes til at flytte brikker; målet er at sætte modstanderens konge skakmat. Første spiller, der gør det, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shatranj","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Its origins lie in the Indian game of chaturanga.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shatranj","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Modern chess gradually developed from this game","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"alquerque\",\"t\":\"Alquerque\",\"origin\":\"Mellemøsten\",\"tradition\":[\"Alquerque er et strategispil, der menes at stamme fra Mellemøsten.\",\"Spillet anses for at være forfader til dam (checkers) og fanorona.\",\"Spillet omtales første gang i litteraturen i slutningen af 900-tallet.\",\"Reglerne blev nedskrevet i Libro de los juegos i 1200-tallet.\",\"Hver spiller har 12 brikker på et bræt med 5×5 punkter og diagonaler.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere flytter brikker og hopper over modstanderens brikker for at fange dem; den, der eliminerer alle modstanderens brikker, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alquerque","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Alquerque (also known as al-qirkat from Arabic: القرقات) is a strategy board game that is thought to have originated in the Middle East.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alquerque","d":"web.archive.org","q":"It is considered to be the parent of draughts (US: checkers) and Fanorona","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"mehen\",\"t\":\"Mehen (slangespillet)\",\"origin\":\"Egypten\",\"tradition\":[\"Mehen er et brætspil, der blev spillet i det gamle Egypten.\",\"Spillet er opkaldt efter Mehen, en slangedeitet i den gamle egyptiske religion.\",\"Beviser for spillet findes fra omkring 3000 f.Kr. til slutningen af Det Gamle Rige.\",\"Brættet viser en sammenrullet slange, hvis krop er delt i rektangulære felter.\",\"Spillet blev sandsynligvis spillet med løveformede brikker og små kugler.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere kaster kugler og flytter brikker langs slangebanen fra hale til hoved; den, der først når hovedet, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mehen_(game)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Mehen is a board game which was played in ancient Egypt.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mehen_(game)","d":"web.archive.org","q":"The game was named in reference to Mehen, a snake deity in ancient Egyptian religion.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"sittuyin\",\"t\":\"Sittuyin (burmesisk skak)\",\"origin\":\"Myanmar\",\"tradition\":[\"Sittuyin er et strategispil, der blev skabt i Myanmar.\",\"Spillet er en direkte efterkommer af det indiske spil chaturanga.\",\"Brættet har 64 felter og to diagonale linjer kaldet generalens linjer.\",\"Brikkerne starter kun med bønder på brættet og deployeres derefter.\",\"Spillet har en særlig regel om forfremmelse af bønder til general.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere deployerer brikker og skiftes til at flytte dem; målet er at sætte modstanderens konge skakmat. Første spiller, der gør det, vinder og får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sittuyin","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"It is a direct offspring of the Indian game of chaturanga","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sittuyin","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Sittuyin, also known as Burmese chess, is a strategy board game created in Myanmar.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"cult|{\"id\":\"konane\",\"t\":\"Konane (hawaiiansk skak)\",\"origin\":\"Hawaii\",\"tradition\":[\"Konane er et strategispil for to spillere, opfundet og spillet af Hawaiis oprindelige befolkning.\",\"Spillet spilles på et rektangulært bræt, der i starten er fyldt med sorte og hvide brikker i et skakternmønster.\",\"Spillerne hopper over hinandens brikker og fanger dem; alle træk er fangsttræk.\",\"Spillet blev nedskrevet i Kumulipo og omtalt af James Cook på hans tredje rejse.\",\"Spillet spilles traditionelt med hvidt koral og sort lava på et udhugget stenbræt.\"],\"app\":\"Sådan spiller I det i appen: To spillere hopper over modstanderens brikker og fanger dem; den, der ikke kan lave et fangsttræk, taber. Vinderen får 3 point.\"}":{"pool":"cult","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C5%8Dnane","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The game is played on a rectangular board and begins with black and white counters filling the board in an alternating pattern.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C5%8Dnane","d":"web.archive.org","q":"The game is played on a rectangular board and begins with black and white counters filling the board in an alternating pattern.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"mus90|Hvad inspirerede Diane Warren til at skrive «I Don't Want to Miss a Thing» til Aerosmith?":{"pool":"mus90","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Don%27t_Want_to_Miss_a_Thing","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In 1997, Diane Warren was watching Barbara Walters interview James Brolin and Barbra Streisand. Brolin said he missed Streisand when they were asleep, and Warren wrote do","ok":true},{"u":"https://loudwire.com/aerosmith-inspiration-i-dont-want-to-miss-a-thing-barbra-streisand","d":"loudwire.com","q":"Back in 1997, the couple appeared together on 20/20 with interviewer Barbara Walters when Streisand shared the story, and Diane Warren happened to be watching the intervi","ok":true}],"daily":true},"mus90|Hvad handlede James Hetfields oprindelige tekst til «Enter Sandman» om?":{"pool":"mus90","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enter_Sandman","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Hetfield felt that \"Enter Sandman\" sounded \"catchy and kind of commercial\" and so to counterbalance the sound, he wrote lyrics about \"destroy[ing] the perfect family; a h","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.vice.com/en/article/metallicas-enter-sandman-nearly-had-a-much-more-unsettling-theme-that-couldve-cost-them-a-hit-single","d":"vice.com","q":"James Hetfield made references to dark family secrets, specifically crib death, or Sudden Infant Death Syndrome (SIDS).","ok":true}],"daily":true},"mus90|Hvilken novelle af Del James inspirerede musikvideoen til Guns N' Roses' «November Rain»?":{"pool":"mus90","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/November_Rain","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The music video for \"November Rain\", directed by British director Andy Morahan, was inspired by Del James's short story \"Without You\", for which he is credited in the lon","ok":true},{"u":"https://loudwire.com/what-guns-n-roses-november-rain-video-really-about","d":"loudwire.com","q":"As noted at the end of the video, it's based on a short story called \"Without You,\"which was written by Del James for his 1995 book The Language of Fear.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"mus90|Hvad var baggrunden for titlen på Blurs «Song 2»?":{"pool":"mus90","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Song_2","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The track was originally nicknamed \"Song 2\" as a working title which represented its slot in the tracklist, but the name stuck.","ok":true},{"u":"https://routenote.com/radar/why-is-blurs-song-2-called-song-2-the-real-woo-hoo-story","d":"routenote.com","q":"Blur's \"Song 2\" is called \"Song 2\" because that was its original working title.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"mus90|Hvorfor måtte Puff Daddy afgive alle royalties for «I'll Be Missing You» til Sting?":{"pool":"mus90","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I%27ll_Be_Missing_You","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Combs did not secure legal approval for the sample before releasing the song, and Police songwriter Sting sued, receiving 100% of the song royalties (with some reports es","ok":true},{"u":"https://consequence.net/2023/04/diddy-sting-5000-per-day-ill-be-missing-you-sample","d":"consequence.net","q":"For some reason, however, Diddy didn't bother asking permission from The Police beforehand for the song's extensive sample of 'Every Breath You Take.'","ok":true}],"daily":true},"mus90|Hvad sagde Backstreet Boys-medlemmet Kevin Richardson om teksten til «I Want It That Way»?":{"pool":"mus90","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Want_It_That_Way","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Kevin Richardson, a member of the band, explained in an interview that, \"Ultimately, the song really doesn't make much sense.\"","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.businessinsider.com/backstreet-boys-i-want-it-that-way-lyrics-explained-2018-6","d":"businessinsider.com","q":"Ultimately the song really doesn't really make much sense,\" band member Kevin Richardson admitted to LA Weekly in 2011.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"mus90|Hvad handlede Red Hot Chili Peppers' «Under the Bridge» oprindeligt om?":{"pool":"mus90","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Under_the_Bridge","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Kiedis wrote many of the lyrics during a period of depression. After struggling with heroin and cocaine addiction, he had been sober for roughly three years.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.radiox.co.uk/artists/red-hot-chili-peppers/under-the-bridge-story-lyrics-meaning","d":"radiox.co.uk","q":"Though the song sees the frontman at his lowest point, Kiedis does find some salvation in the chorus, pledging not to 'ever feel like (he) did that day'.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"mus90|Hvad handlede Green Days «Basket Case» oprindeligt om?":{"pool":"mus90","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basket_Case_(song)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"He set the song aside before eventually returning to re