//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_(film_series)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Alan Rickman as Severus Snape","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/film/2016/jan/14/alan-rickman-obituary","d":"theguardian.com","q":"Then he was, for a new generation entirely, the sinister potions master Severus Snape in the eight Harry Potter movies, for a decade from 2001.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"harry|Hvem spillede Hermione Granger i Harry Potter-filmene?":{"pool":"harry","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_(film_series)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Emma Watson and Rupert Grint were selected from thousands of auditioning children to play the roles of Hermione Granger and Ron Weasley, respectively.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/harry_potter_and_the_chamber_of_secrets","d":"rottentomatoes.com","q":"Emma Watson Hermione Granger","ok":true}],"daily":true},"harry|Hvor mange dollars indspillede 'Harry Potter og Dødsregalierne – del 2' i USA?":{"pool":"harry","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_(film_series)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"$381,409,310 (48,046,800)","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/harry_potter_and_the_deathly_hallows_part_2","d":"rottentomatoes.com","q":"Box Office (Gross USA): $381.0M","ok":true}],"daily":true},"harry|Hvor mange Harry Potter-film instruerede David Yates?":{"pool":"harry","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_(film_series)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"David Yates directed four of the films in the series","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/harry-potter-spinoff-fantastic-beasts-726580/","d":"hollywoodreporter.com","q":"Yates directed four \"Harry Potter\" movies","ok":true}],"daily":true},"harry|Hvem var den første britiske instruktør i Harry Potter-filmserien?":{"pool":"harry","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_(film_series)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Newell became the first British director of the series when he was chosen for the fourth film","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/harry_potter_and_the_goblet_of_fire","d":"rottentomatoes.com","q":"Director: Mike Newell","ok":true}],"daily":true},"serier|Hvorfor ligner TARDIS'en i 'Doctor Who' altid en britisk polititelefonboks?":{"pool":"serier","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://www.doctorwho.tv/news-and-features/what-is-the-tardis","d":"doctorwho.tv","q":"when the First Doctor landed on Earth, his chameleon circuit malfunctioned, leaving the TARDIS stuck as an old 1960s police telephone box.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/profiles/5Dp7g7b0dSVhD2TM1xNlf7c/the-tardis","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"its chameleon circuit developed a fault. Since then, except for a brief period of somewhat random metamorphoses, the TARDIS has retained the outer appearance of a British","ok":true}],"daily":true},"serier|Hvad virker den soniske skruetrækker IKKE på i 'Doctor Who'?":{"pool":"serier","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sonic_screwdriver","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"the sonic screwdriver will not work because the door is made of wood","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.doctorwho.tv/news-and-features/what-is-a-sonic-screwdriver","d":"doctorwho.tv","q":"the sonic screwdriver’s biggest weakness is that it doesn’t function on wood.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"serier|Hvad står DHARMA for i 'Lost'?":{"pool":"serier","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dharma_Initiative","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Department of Heuristics and Research on Material Applications","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.slashfilm.com/746282/what-the-dharma-initiative-was-really-trying-to-accomplish-on-lost","d":"slashfilm.com","q":"DHARMA stands for Department of Heuristics And Research on Material Applications.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"serier|Hvorfor kan Hodor i 'Game of Thrones' kun sige ét ord?":{"pool":"serier","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Door_(Game_of_Thrones)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"slurring the words together until they become 'Hodor.'","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.ign.com/articles/2016/05/23/game-of-thrones-major-hodor-reveal-came-from-george-rr-martin","d":"ign.com","q":"the younger version of Hodor -- real name Wylis -- hears the words \"hold the door\" and starts seizing.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"serier|Hvem skabte dothraki-sproget til TV-serien 'Game of Thrones'?":{"pool":"serier","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dothraki_language","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The language was developed for the TV series by the language creator David J. Peterson","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.slashfilm.com/565640/dune-languages","d":"slashfilm.com","q":"David J. Peterson , who built the Dothraki and Valyrian languages on Game of Thrones","ok":true}],"daily":true},"serier|Hvordan slutter sidste afsnit af 'The Sopranos'?":{"pool":"serier","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Sopranos","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Chase's decision to end the last episode abruptly with just a black screen was controversial.","ok":true},{"u":"https://variety.com/2024/tv/news/sopranos-ending-lorraine-bracco-hated-1236158840","d":"variety.com","q":"the show cuts to black and ends — sparking controversy ever since over its lack of closure.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"serier|Hvad står 'J' for i Homer J. Simpsons fulde navn?":{"pool":"serier","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Homer_Simpson","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"stands for \"Jay\"","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.mentalfloss.com/article/57016/surprising-origins-tv-character-names","d":"mentalfloss.com","q":"The \"J\" in Homer J. Simpson comes from The Rocky and Bullwinkle Show.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"serier|Hvor mange gange bliver Ross Geller skilt i 'Friends'?":{"pool":"serier","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ross_Geller","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"He is married three times and divorced three times.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.express.co.uk/showbiz/tv-radio/1175946/Friends-How-many-times-did-Ross-Geller-get-married-divorced-Rachel-Green","d":"express.co.uk","q":"Ross Geller, also known as Ross the Divorcer or Ross the Divorce Force was married three times in total.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"sqdil|{\"a\":\"Blive i spillet og vinde nok til at slette familiens gæld\",\"b\":\"Forlade spillet nu og leve med gælden, men være i live\"}":{"pool":"sqdil","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqdil|{\"a\":\"Ofre din bedste ven for at få et ekstra liv i spillet\",\"b\":\"Beholde din bedste ven, men spille uden ekstra liv\"}":{"pool":"sqdil","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqdil|{\"a\":\"Forråde en ven for at redde dig selv i spillet\",\"b\":\"Holde loyaliteten og risikere at dø sammen med vennen\"}":{"pool":"sqdil","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqdil|{\"a\":\"Vælge selv, hvem af dine venner der får en genvej\",\"b\":\"Lade lodtrækning afgøre, hvem der får genvejen\"}":{"pool":"sqdil","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqdil|{\"a\":\"Vinne præmien, men miste alle minder om dine venner\",\"b\":\"Beholde minderne om dine venner, men gå tomhændet hjem\"}":{"pool":"sqdil","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqdil|{\"a\":\"Få magten til at ændre én regel, men miste en ven\",\"b\":\"Beholde dine venner, men ingen magt til at ændre regler\"}":{"pool":"sqdil","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqdil|{\"a\":\"Kende den endelige præmie på forhånd, men miste håbet\",\"b\":\"Blive overrasket over præmien, men beholde håbet\"}":{"pool":"sqdil","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqdil|{\"a\":\"Ofre din stemme i spillet for at redde en anden\",\"b\":\"Beholde din stemme, men lade den anden ryge ud\"}":{"pool":"sqdil","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqdil|{\"a\":\"Dele præmien med en fremmed, der engang reddede dig\",\"b\":\"Beholde hele præmien for dig selv\"}":{"pool":"sqdil","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"sqdil|{\"a\":\"Have en allieret, du skal beskytte med livet\",\"b\":\"Spille alene uden forpligtelser over for nogen\"}":{"pool":"sqdil","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"roller|Hvem spillede Harry Potter i filmen Harry Potter og De Vises Sten (2001)?":{"pool":"roller","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_and_the_Philosopher%27s_Stone_(film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Daniel Radcliffe as Harry Potter: An 11-year-old orphan living with his unwelcoming aunt, uncle, and cousin","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_and_the_Philosopher%27s_Stone_(movie)","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Daniel Radcliffe as Harry Potter","ok":true}],"daily":true},"roller|Hvem spillede Tony Stark / Iron Man i filmen Iron Man (2008)?":{"pool":"roller","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iron_Man_(2008_film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark / Iron Man: An industrialist, genius inventor, and playboy","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iron_Man_(movie)","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man","ok":true}],"daily":true},"roller|Hvem spillede Jack Dawson i filmen Titanic (1997)?":{"pool":"roll