e.wikipedia.org","q":"Mike Myers as Shrek","ok":true}],"daily":true},"roller|Hvem spillede Batman i filmen The Dark Knight (2008)?":{"pool":"roller","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Dark_Knight_(film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Christian Bale as Bruce Wayne / Batman: A wealthy socialite who as a child was traumatized by his parents' murder.","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Dark_Knight_(movie)","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Christian Bale as Batman/Bruce Wayne","ok":true}],"daily":true},"roller|Hvem spillede Alan Grant i filmen Jurassic Park (1993)?":{"pool":"roller","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jurassic_Park_(film)","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Sam Neill as Alan Grant: A paleontologist","ok":true},{"u":"https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jurassic_Park_(movie)","d":"simple.wikipedia.org","q":"Starring Sam Neill, Laura Dern, Jeff Goldblum, and Richard Attenborough","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvem opfandt den første trykte julekalender?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://www.knauf-museum.de/sonderausstellung/archiv/sonderausstellungen/123-adventskalender-im-wandel-der-zeit-11-november-2007-06-januar-2008","d":"knauf-museum.de","q":"Der erste gedruckte Adventskalender wurde 1908 von dem Münchner Verleger Gerhard Lang aus Maulbronn auf den Markt gebracht.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/bitesize/articles/z469ywx","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"but it was in 1908 that a German printer called Gerhard Lang created what is thought to be the first commercial Advent calendar.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvornår kom den første julekalender med chokolade på markedet?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://www.knauf-museum.de/sonderausstellung/archiv/sonderausstellungen/123-adventskalender-im-wandel-der-zeit-11-november-2007-06-januar-2008","d":"knauf-museum.de","q":"1958 kam dann der erste mit Schokolade gefüllte Kalender auf den Markt.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.english-heritage.org.uk/members-area/kids/kids-rule-things-to-make-and-do/advent-calendar-craft/","d":"english-heritage.org.uk","q":"with the first chocolate advent calendar appearing in 1958","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvornår blev den første svenske tv-julekalender sendt?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advent_calendar","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The first televised show of the genre aired in 1960 in the form of the Swedish program Titteliture.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.kosmorama.org/kosmorama/artikler/dansk-tv-julekalender-til-tiden-fra-dukker-til-drama","d":"kosmorama.org","q":"Idéen til den danske tv-julekalender er et ’rent tyveri’ fra Sverige, hvor den første af slagsen ruller over skærmen allerede i 1960.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvornår havde 'Jul i Gammelby' premiere?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://www.kosmorama.org/kosmorama/artikler/dansk-tv-julekalender-til-tiden-fra-dukker-til-drama","d":"kosmorama.org","q":"Der sker bestemt noget banebrydende 1. december 1979 klokken 19.00, når Poul Thomsen pædagogisk indleder med en fortælling om genstanden bag dagens låge","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.dr.dk/ligetil/kultur/julekalenderen-fylder-50-aar","d":"dr.dk","q":"Det var men først med \"Jul i Gammelby\" fra 1979, at man for alvorlig begyndte at lave julekalendere kun med skuespillere.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvad hed Danmarks første tv-julekalender?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advent_calendar","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The first julekalender aired in Denmark was Historier fra hele verden in 1962.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.kosmorama.org/kosmorama/artikler/dansk-tv-julekalender-til-tiden-fra-dukker-til-drama","d":"kosmorama.org","q":"Historier fra hele verden består af 23 små, separate fortællinger.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvad hed den første julekalender på radio i Sverige?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advent_calendar","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The first such show aired on radio in 1957 in the form of the Swedish radio series Barnens adventskalender.","ok":true},{"u":"https://web.archive.org/web/20071210121106/http://www.sr.se/barn/jul50/bakgrund.stm","d":"web.archive.org","q":"Den kallades helt enkelt 'Barnens adventskalender'.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"julekalender|Hvor mange låger har en traditionel julekalender?":{"pool":"julekalender","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/bitesize/articles/z469ywx","d":"bbc.co.uk","q":"Traditional calendars have 24 doors, ending on Christmas Eve","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.knauf-museum.de/sonderausstellung/archiv/sonderausstellungen/123-adventskalender-im-wandel-der-zeit-11-november-2007-06-januar-2008","d":"knauf-museum.de","q":"Es bestand aus einem Bogen mit 24 Bildern zum Ausschneiden und einem Bogen mit 24 Feldern zum Aufkleben.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ordtrappe|MAD-MOD":{"pool":"ordtrappe","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"ordtrappe|VAND-VIND":{"pool":"ordtrappe","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"ordtrappe|KOLD-KULD":{"pool":"ordtrappe","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"ordtrappe|MAND-MUND":{"pool":"ordtrappe","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"ordtrappe|TAND-BAND":{"pool":"ordtrappe","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"ordtrappe|RUM-REM":{"pool":"ordtrappe","status":"ikke-faktuel","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[],"daily":true},"or