under hensyn til afstanden til o","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.denoffentlige.dk/lovgivning/der-er-flere-end-du-tror-kender-du-faerdselsreglerne-for-fodgaengere","d":"denoffentlige.dk","q":"§10. Gående skal benytte fortov, gangsti eller rabat, dog ikke midterrabat. Cykelsti eller kørebane må kun benyttes, såfremt der ikke findes fortov, gangsti eller egnet r","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_fod|En gående skal passere en kørebane, og der er hverken fodgængerfelt, fodgængerbro eller -tunnel i nærheden. Hvordan skal passagen ske?":{"pool":"ftl_fod","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"I andre tilfælde end nævnt i stk. 5 skal passagen ske lige over kørebane eller cykelsti og fortrinsvist i tilslutning til vejkryds.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.jurabibliotek.dk/faerdselsloven/paragraf/10","d":"jurabibliotek.dk","q":"I andre tilfælde end nævnt i stk. 5 skal passagen ske lige over kørebane eller cykelsti og fortrinsvist i tilslutning til vejkryds.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.denoffentlige.dk/lovgivning/der-er-flere-end-du-tror-kender-du-faerdselsreglerne-for-fodgaengere","d":"denoffentlige.dk","q":"§10. Gående skal benytte fortov, gangsti eller rabat, dog ikke midterrabat. Cykelsti eller kørebane må kun benyttes, såfremt der ikke findes fortov, gangsti eller egnet r","ok":true}],"daily":true},"ftl_fod|En gående trækker sin cykel på fortovet. Hvornår er det ikke tilladt?":{"pool":"ftl_fod","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/118/dan/pdf","d":"retsinformation.dk","q":"På fortov, gangsti, cykelsti eller rabat må gående ikke trække cykel eller knallert eller medføre omfangsrige genstande, såfremt dette vil være til væsentlig ulempe for a","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.jurabibliotek.dk/faerdselsloven/paragraf/10","d":"jurabibliotek.dk","q":"På fortov, gangsti, cykelsti eller rabat må gående ikke trække cykel eller knallert eller medføre omfangsrige genstande, såfremt dette vil være til væsentlig ulempe for a","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.denoffentlige.dk/lovgivning/der-er-flere-end-du-tror-kender-du-faerdselsreglerne-for-fodgaengere","d":"denoffentlige.dk","q":"§10. Gående skal benytte fortov, gangsti eller rabat, dog ikke midterrabat. Cykelsti eller kørebane må kun benyttes, såfremt der ikke findes fortov, gangsti eller egnet r","ok":true}],"daily":true},"num|Hvor mange lande grænser op til Kina?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borders_of_China","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The People's Republic of China (PRC) shares land borders with 14 countries","ok":true},{"u":"https://countries.world/asia/china","d":"countries.world","q":"China shares borders with fourteen countries","ok":true}],"daily":true},"num|Hvor mange lande har ingen kystlinje?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Landlocked","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"there are 44 landlocked countries, two of them doubly landlocked","ok":true},{"u":"https://playgeoglobe.com/learn/landlocked-countries","d":"playgeoglobe.com","q":"Forty-four countries on Earth never touch the sea.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"num|Hvor mange tænder har et barn (mælketænder)?":{"pool":"num","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_tooth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Humans usually have 20 primary","ok":true},{"u":"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/body/24655-teeth","d":"my.clevelandclinic.org","q":"Most children have 20 primary teeth","ok":true}],"daily":true},"tf|Krokodiller græder, når de spiser.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crocodile_tears","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Five of the seven animals were seen \"weeping\", leading to the conclusion that the story describes a real phenomenon.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2007/10/071003151131.htm","d":"sciencedaily.com","q":"He found that five of the seven animals teared up as they tore into their food, with some of their eyes even frothing and bubbling.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"tf|Mennesket bruger kun 10% af hjernen.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ten-percent-of-the-brain_myth","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"The popular notion that large parts of the brain remain unused, and could subsequently be \"activated\", rests in folklore and not science.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/do-we-really-use-only-10/","d":"scientificamerican.com","q":"Despite this detailed reconnaissance, no quiet areas awaiting new assignments have emerged.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"tf|En regnorm har præcis fem hjerter.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earthworm","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"In segments seven through eleven, a pair of aortic arches ring the coelom and acts as hearts, pumping the blood to the ventral vessel that acts as the aorta.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.sciencing.com/earthworm-closed-circulatory-system-6787995/","d":"sciencing.com","q":"Earthworms have five pairs of aortic arches that wrap around the esophagus to form the heart.","ok":true}],"daily":true},"tf|Giraffer har ingen stemmebånd.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekræftet","date":"2026-11-21","sources":[{"u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giraffe","d":"wikipedia.org","q":"Early biologists suggested giraffes were mute and unable to create enough air flow to vibrate their vocal folds.","ok":true},{"u":"https://www.pbs.org/wnet/nature/tall-blondes-silent-sentinels/2256/","d":"pbs.org","q":"For centuries, biologists believed giraffes were the mute giants of Africa's plains and forests","ok":true}],"daily":true},"tf|Østers kan skifte køn i løbet af livet.":{"pool":"tf","status":"bekr